  ('zcrm_1579374000076566008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870116', 'Paul Borchers', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to schedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-29 09:12:05', '2021-09-29 09:12:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076566003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974099', 'Nancy Spurgeon', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-29 09:07:29', '2021-09-29 09:07:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076533008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810902', 'Michelle Chavez', NULL, 'Member submitted updated Payment Update to bank account.  I put that in A123 and deleted future payments in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-29 08:42:29', '2021-09-29 08:42:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076533003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'Member contacted me via email and let me know that they will need until 10/8 to make payment due to sickness and not receiving a paycheck.  Per Rod this is ok, however I have emailed them and let them know that that is the final date that I can give them.  I will charge them late fee', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-29 08:27:14', '2021-09-29 08:27:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076525008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811028', 'Michael Massarelli', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-29 08:20:40', '2021-09-29 08:20:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076521008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068243093', 'Dan Naderer', NULL, 'Dan called regarding a potential ER visit that may result in his appendix being removed. I warm transferred Dan to Stacie at Zion for this instance. I want to make sure Dan has all of his ducks in a row so he does not have to worry about anything if this does result in emergency surgery. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-29 08:16:31', '2021-09-29 08:16:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076525003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811028', 'Michael Massarelli', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-29 08:02:49', '2021-09-29 08:02:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076521003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064027088', 'Jonathan Dulany', NULL, 'Member''s wife called regarding an injury sustained during their trip to Idaho. She fell down a river bank and would like to go to an urgent care. I explained the cash pay process and to keep all of her receipts so that she can submit her need if this goes over her $1000 IUA. I will be sending her an email on how to submit her needs to Zion as well.  -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-29 08:01:14', '2021-09-29 08:01:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454530', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076868017', 'Angela Lungati', NULL, 'Sent e-mail template #1: Ouch! Can you relate to the pain in American Healthcare?

Rec''d almost instant ''unsubscribe'' request.  Hence, CRM marked as such.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-29 03:21:58', '2021-09-29 03:28:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454470', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076868001', 'Francisco Gonzalez', NULL, 'Sent e-mail template #1: Ouch! Can you relate to the pain in American Healthcare?', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-29 03:03:18', '2021-09-29 03:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, 'John called.  He got a flu shot @ wk today and wondered if he could get reimbursed.  We went over how Planstin works.  He realized they don''t think they ever received the hard copy card from Planstin.  So, he had me request digital &amp; hard copies of both the Planstin &amp; Zion cards, w/digital versions going to his e-mail: freemanwrestler@gmail.com  on Slack.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-28 16:44:24', '2021-09-28 16:44:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076469011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, '9-28-21 Her price just increased by aging up but I can''t beat the price with Zion''s DIRECT membership. So, I will leave her be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-28 16:09:47', '2021-09-28 16:09:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076497011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, '09.28.21:  Megan called.  They reviewed the website and video.  Answered her questions. Said her daughter takes Budesonide for Spring & Summer allergies and Megan thinks it''s expensive. Told her I would have the Concierge research pricing and let her know.  Megan scheduled enrollment with me tomorrow at 1:15 p.m tomorrow EST.  I emailed her that with a coupon, Budesonide ranges between $33.86 and $94.60. - much lower than she thought.
Emailed Ryan & Megan re:  proof of 1099 or EIN to qualify for Secure.
Ryan replied saying he is self-employed as a farmer and asked if he has eligibility with a 1040 Schedule F Profit & Loss form.  I asked Rod and he said that form is acceptable, which I relayed to Ryan.  I told him he can submit it after he enrolls and gets an email with instructions on how to submit the form.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-09-28 16:06:05', '2021-09-29 11:25:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076497003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, '09.27.21:  Called Ryan - left message to c/b.  Ryan returned call to schedule call at 5 p.m.  
Spoke w/Ryan.  Was in Natl. Guard - now inactive (retired from Guard).  Now a farmer.  While in the Guard Reserves was paying for Tri-Care - $190 -$230 for a family.  Now must pay $1160/mo.  Has an HSA plan and wants to keep it.  Non-smoker, he, wife, Megan (phone #:  309-319-0767) and 5 children are healthy. Interested in SECURE.  Explained the SECURE plan and emailed him my link to click funnel.  Said he would look at it with his wife and she would get back to me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-09-28 15:51:30', '2021-09-28 15:52:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, 'Jennifer called thinking she had preventative care.  We went over no MEC, however mammograms and colonoscopies are listed in the Sedera Access+ Memb Guidelines.  Sent her curr copy of those guidelines so she''ll have all the info &amp; let her know to lookup Routine Care for more on the preventative side.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-28 15:16:00', '2021-09-28 15:16:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076460018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810902', 'Michelle Chavez', NULL, 'Member requested Payment update form I emailed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 14:49:42', '2021-09-28 14:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076460013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, 'Kelly called in because she had been double billed for August &amp; September.  Her billing hadn''t been cancelled in FTNI I refunded her out of FTNI and cancelled pmts', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 14:44:09', '2021-09-28 14:44:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951309', 'Kaitlyn Laney', NULL, 'Kaitlyn somehow got cut-off from Zion.  Transferred her again &amp; gave her the number in case it''s somehow the transfer that caused the issue.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-28 13:37:29', '2021-09-28 13:37:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951309', 'Kaitlyn Laney', NULL, 'Kaitlyn called and wanted to know if fertility treatment is a covered service, I transferred her to Zion. I also sent her a Zion needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-28 13:32:13', '2021-09-28 13:32:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076460008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076458029', 'Stacy Scott', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 13:06:45', '2021-09-28 13:06:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, 'Jessica called for help in understanding how to set up her annual physical- I sent her both preventative care templates.  I also reminded Jessica that her membership doesn''t start until Oct 1 and that she will need to wait for her Planstin card for the appointment- I let her know when she should be receiving her cards- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-28 12:41:23', '2021-09-28 13:02:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002105', 'Tonya Allen', NULL, 'tt Tonya, she has a tattoo she thinks is infected &amp; wanted to know how to proceed.  She''s downloading CirrusMD and we went over her 1k IUA, self-pay, etc.  She will likely call back per her.   

As a note:  she''s going through a "high conflict" divorce.   - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-28 12:17:21', '2021-09-28 12:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076469003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, '9-28-21 Old ski racing connection! Gordy is 46, super healthy, fit, no tobacco, takes super cheap alopurenol. He''s self-employed and moving from Jackson, WY to Aspen to be with Tess Weaver now. He''s a journalist for many health/fitness mags like Outside Mag, Men''s Journal, Bloomberg Bus, SKI, etc. He wants SECURE and asks why everyone isn''t using this type of membership! $1000/$275. Doesn''t have an HSA but open to it.  Appt set to enroll next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-28 11:57:38', '2021-09-28 11:57:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076460003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054977001', 'Samuel Taylor', NULL, 'member submitted cancellation request I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 11:38:15', '2021-09-28 11:38:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076454003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Megan called for help in getting into the MAP portal, I guided her through and gave her their direct number as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-28 11:26:16', '2021-09-28 11:26:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076439003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'ILM for Heather Neideffer.  After sending her the DOS, she said Melissa had nothing for the 4/15/21 (& March/April 2021) DOS.  However, Melissa sent copies of one RCI item that was paid, one that was declined by RCI, & the hosp bill, so since Heather said they had nothing I approached Heather again & have not heard back.    - CA

tt Juan at Sedera Memb Srvc.  He conf they show a $500 IUA (which is what I confirmed w/Melissa.  Metzli Sanchez is Melissa''s ''Need Coordinator'' & her e-mail is MSanchez@sedera.com.  Juan is going to reach out to Melissa.  He doesn''t see the 2 receipts she thinks she sent, but they will walk her through the process to make sure those are submitted.  He will also setup a one-on-one between Melissa & Metzli.  I sent e-mail(s) to Melissa with the above info too.    - CA

Also, Melissa sent in all the MD & hospital bills, RCI pymt/declinations.  They are attached to her CRM file below for reference.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-28 11:06:49', '2021-09-28 11:40:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076384041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064873042', 'Matthew Shostek', NULL, 'Spoke with Matt and he told me that he had never received our Welcome Packet and asked if we could resend.  I told him that we could and I asked Kelly to get that out to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 10:21:38', '2021-09-28 10:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076384036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074270029', 'Adam Baser', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-28 09:56:30', '2021-09-28 09:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076399008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246064', 'Matthew Ayres', NULL, '9-28-21 HI Wendy,

