720-841-5489', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-28 09:45:08', '2021-09-28 09:45:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076384031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396471', 'Chris Skavnak', NULL, 'Spoke to Chris and he told me that the bank covered the overdraft however they were just trying to get things re-established after their move.  I sent him the Change form to update their address.  He said to keep things the way they were for the moment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 09:36:39', '2021-09-28 09:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076384026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075571098', 'Garrick Dorn', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of October 1, 2021. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-28 09:33:42', '2021-09-28 09:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076384018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396471', 'Chris Skavnak', NULL, 'Member called in approx 9/20 and told me that her pmt would decline as they would be Closing on a new house and had no  money.  I told her that I had to wait until her pmt declined then I could re-run.  Well pmt never declined so I reached out to member and asked waht she wanted me to do with new pmt info.  Left VM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 09:24:07', '2021-09-28 09:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076399003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906167', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, '9-28-21 Court called bc his price went from $425 to $770! He''s on a fixed income of about $60K in 2021 and similar in 2022. He can''t manage the crazy price increase. He get cortison shots in knee and back, so not a good candidate to switch. Maybe leave his wife on membership and he moves to regular ins or put his wife onto SECURE if she''s self-employed. He gets a huge APTC of $1190 in 2021but outside of open enrollment now. We will revisit in Nov. to look at options for 2022. He wants to change his IUA at least to $2500 which will drop cost to $701 or $5000 to $559.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-28 08:30:42', '2021-09-28 08:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076380008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480158', 'Margaret Weaver', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 08:05:30', '2021-09-28 08:05:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076380003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906167', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, 'Member called in and was wondering why his payment went up.  I explained the situation to him and let him know that he was notified via email.  He wanted to know about other options.  I directed him to be in contact with Wendy and gave him her contact #.  He didn''t know who she was.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-28 08:01:02', '2021-09-28 08:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076345018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', NULL, 'Brandi called the concierge line, but when I answered she hung-up.  I called her back &amp; LM to see if I could offer assistance.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-27 17:27:16', '2021-09-27 17:27:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076345013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, 'Luther called the concierge line on Fri 9/24/21 asking lots of questions about his membership.  He was willing to take "your Welcome Call once your membership starts will go through all of this" on everything except: Can CirrusMD order lab tests?  tt Kelly Anne on Mon 9/27/21 & she said no, he''ll need to see a PCP for that. 

I called his advisor Michael Montes & LM since we shouldn''t be the ones passing this info along, (w/agreement from Kelly Anne).   Sent follow-up e-mail to Mike that  Luther wants a call back on 10/4/21  @ 321-544-7435  & asked Mike to reply w/confirmation he will do that (sent from this account so we have a copy).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-27 16:31:08', '2021-09-27 16:31:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076345008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010815094', 'Lisa Hudson', NULL, 'Lisa called looking for a Member ID #.  Turns out she needed to see the Sedera Member Guidelines.  Took her to her mpb.health site and showed her how to access their Guidelines.  She seems to be looking for a MEC Plan, but does not have one attached.  She will tt her advisor Darius  to see if he has anything he can offer to help with that.  She seemed grateful for the guidance.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-27 16:05:52', '2021-09-27 16:05:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076347005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010815094', 'Lisa Hudson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 986 
Question : Can you provide me with my Member ID?  Thanks', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-09-27 15:34:10', '2021-09-27 15:34:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076345003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480158', 'Margaret Weaver', NULL, 'Margaret called.  She realized she hadn''t completed the pymt update form.  I helped her find it &amp; she took care of it -- hopefully, prior to any missing pymts.  Her orig acct was compromised and she had to update all her ACH accounts.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-27 15:09:00', '2021-09-27 15:09:00'),
