  ('zcrm_1579374000076057013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, 'Spoke to member. I rescheduled his welcome call for October, 4, 2021 at 11:00 a.m. EST. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-23 09:11:48', '2021-09-23 09:11:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076067013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043830088', 'Randal Warwick', 'My Response to below letter', 'Randy,
      Over the last couple of months we have been transitioning to a new billing system.  In looking over the accounts we realized that there were a number of me that were being undercharged.  Most of these were due to members that transitioned from one age band to another.  However that is not the case with you.  What I think happened is that when you cancelled your original plan and re-enrolled you were set up with the wrong price.  The $834 is the correct price for your age & plan level.  
       In looking over your account, I notice that you are going to be turning 60 next year.  At that time the price go up a significant amount.  We do have other lower priced options available now.  I suggest that you be in contact with your Healthcare Advisor Jeff Kanter ahead of that in anticipation of that big price jump.  Please feel free to contact me with any further questions that you may have.




 Patti Baron  
 
 
Copied to Jeff to f/u with member to possibly re-enroll w/Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-23 09:10:38', '2021-09-23 09:10:38'),
