  ('zcrm_1579374000076046003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974147', 'Mailys MM Nasrallah', NULL, 'sent email asking to reschedule welcome call for sometime after the 1st. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-23 07:12:04', '2021-09-23 07:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076030008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659919', 'Rachel Denning', NULL, 'tt Rachel, her pediatrician is willing to give the whole family their flu shots ($50/person x 5 = $250).  She thought maybe they are covered since some of the kids'' vaccinations have been.  Told her I didn''t think it includes flu shots, but I''m new and would dbl ck.  Sent Kelly Anne question &amp; one of us will get back to Rachel tomorrow via e-mail or LM on her ph (both verified &amp; match CRM file).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-22 16:50:41', '2021-09-22 16:50:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076030003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Sent Heather Neideffer @ RCI an e-mail last night before I left - she replied asking for a DOS.  Melissa told me the colonoscopy was on 4/15/21, but the PCP required a pre-colonoscopy visit in March (& she''s cking on that date) will send me that tomorrow).  Sending Heather this info tonight & updating Kelly Anne.  Melissa Lagassie sent a copy of the ''Prospect Manchester Hospital'' invoice & i''ve attached it below.  She''s gathering the other invoices & will send those for our reference as well.  She says she started a need last week w/Sedera (she''s so confused, I''m not sure I trust this), but I told her once we have the pieces and know more, she will need to be the one to submit to Sedera IF that''s the next step.  She seemed ok w/that & got off the phone thanking me over and over.     CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-22 15:35:44', '2021-09-22 15:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075977099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, 'Had a long discussion with Yolanda re: the cancellation process I advised we like to get them prior to the 20th, however she spoke to Sedera who gave her other information.  Bottom line she will be cancelling because her employer now offers HI.  I will send out cancellation Link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-22 14:08:11', '2021-09-23 12:35:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076020018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, 'Yolanda called in requesting to cancel her membership. I explained to her that she has been charged for the month of October, but once she submits her cancelation request on or before Oct. 20th, she will no longer be charged her premium. She then stated that when she called Sedera she was told she had until the end of the month of September to cancel without a charge. I explained that unfortunately we do not accept cancelations after the 20th of the month, she then argued that whoever she spoke with last time she called the concierge team told her she had until the end of the month. That person she spoke with was me and I DID NOT tell her she had until the end of the month because I know cancelations have to be submitted before or on the 20th in order for it to be effective. She backtracked and stated that she never talked to me, which she has on several occasions. I transferred her to Patti for further explanation. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-22 13:52:52', '2021-09-22 13:53:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075977094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-22 12:55:39', '2021-09-22 12:55:39'),
