  ('zcrm_1579374000076020013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297480', 'Kimberly Honeycutt', NULL, 'Kimberly called for support with her screening mammography bill she received. She states she was told that it would be a covered expense, but was told by Planstin that it is not because she does not have a MEC on their end. Upon further investigation, and with the help of the magical John Kach, it appears that Kimberly was switched over to the Care Plus - Zion Worksite DPC on 3/29/2021 which has no MEC. This did not update in the CRM so when the concierge looked at Kimberly''s account, she did give her the correct information based on her plan in the CRM. Upon speaking with Kimberly and giving her this news, she is reaching out to her advisor to discuss plan options since she wanted to go with the Secure plan originally. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-22 12:46:20', '2021-09-22 12:46:20'),
