  ('zcrm_1579374000075927023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Melissa called back.  She''s sooo confused.  She says she''s called multiple times just to sit on hold for hours, but when I ask her the # she called, it''s not ours.  She gives names of people that are not ours as well.  This is still the issue from our conversation 9/16/21 & Kelly Anne has tried to call her.  She consistently says we sent her a bill for $6000 on a colonoscopy, we should be able to see all her bills, that Megan, or (?) are the people she''s talked to at our office.  I think she''s not sure if she''s talking to MPB, RCI, the hospital, or Sedera.  I sent Kelly Anne a Teams chat requesting she call Melissa again at: 860-999-1771.  I''ve assured Melissa we just need to sort through this and it''ll be fine, but she keeps saying "it''s a colonoscopy and should be covered 100%" as preventative (she does not hear me when we discuss it moved to diagnostic with polyp removal).   I don''t know how to help her as she''s not hearing the explanations or how to fix things.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-21 19:04:00', '2021-09-21 19:04:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075927018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712116', 'Dorcas Mella', NULL, 'Dorcas called.  She saw a dentist today thinking she''s having a dental issue.  There is an infection in her mouth and I sent her a coupon for Amox 500mg #21 from GoodRX which she did receive.  She''s been referred for a CT Scan of her mouth because they are concerned the bone may be cracked (or something).  We discussed that sometimes a situation can move from dental to medical, so to keep all her receipts in case that should occur (& if it looks like the need will be > her 1k IUA & medical) she must submit receipts before the 6 mos mark start a need.  I tried to see if I could find anything for her on fair pricing, .for CT Scan Mouth, but didn''t see anything.  In case I''m just not seeing it, I cc''d Jennifer on my reply to Dorcas since sometimes I''m challenged at finding things in HCBB.  Dorcas says her e-mail has a ''dot'' in it, but those kick back & she confirmed she rec''d the e-mail without: dorcasmella@gmail.com  = seems to be the correct address.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-21 18:53:32', '2021-09-21 18:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075927013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, 'Adam called -- he thinks he got dbl chg''d this month.  He says he called yesterday after hours and left Patti a VM, but didn''t hear back from her.  I put him into her VM again and he''ll call me tomorrow if he still hasn''t heard from her.  He must have dialed her extension yesterday if he truly LM after hours, because I don''t remember transferring anyone.  He says this happened last year too, where one month he got dbl billed -- he jokingly asked if this was an annual thing.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-21 17:33:56', '2021-09-21 17:33:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075927008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Terese e-mailed to confirm we had her 1st name spelling incorrectly = corrected to Terese (ending in an ''e'' instead of an a) in the CRM too.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-21 16:29:03', '2021-09-21 16:29:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075927003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656075', 'Erin Sortino', NULL, 'Erin called regarding the monthly charge of $324 (she thought it should be $315).  She is using a cc for pymt, but didn''t want to change to EFT because she''s not always sure the money will be in that account.  She asked if she could talk to someone who could go over why the fees for a cc are so high (assuming that''s the pricing difference).  It''s after hours, so I put her into Patti''s VM for tomorrow.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-21 15:38:01', '2021-09-21 15:38:01'),
