  ('zcrm_1579374000075861011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049815023', 'Andrew Vick', NULL, 'Andrew called curious how he could utilize the Virtual Healthcare on his plan re: a bee sting.  In an old e-mail it says "Think of Redirect Health as your "Virtual Primary Care Physician". For any medical services you need, call one number: 888 407-7928."  So I gave him that # &amp; he''s going to try them right now.  IF he needs further help he''ll call us back.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-20 16:56:03', '2021-09-20 16:56:03'),
