  ('zcrm_1579374000075858003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', NULL, 'Brandi is interested in CARE+ now. They don''t do any annual wellness visits. They are mostly healthy. Daughter has asthma but she will look at the last time she''s been treated or had a prescription. Brandi takes Synthroid for her thyroid  which was removed 2018 and found to be cancerous but completely removed. She''s had nothing since. Kids 15 and 18. I met Brandi through Five Rings Financial a bunch of years ago.  She''s also interested in vision and I''ll send her VSP. She is familiar with HMA and does underwriting for them and works with Elliot who I''m not familiar with. She''ll do that on her own.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-20 14:17:18', '2021-09-20 14:57:25'),
