  ('zcrm_1579374000075659018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, 'Lester called in stating that he is at a Walgreen''s trying to set up his PCP (that he verified is in the PHCS network) there and when the receptionist called the 866 number listed on Lester''s card she was told he was inactive. I see that Lester is current in the CRM. I gave him Planstin''s number and advised that the receptionist call Planstin. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-16 12:31:14', '2021-09-16 12:31:14'),
