  ('zcrm_1579374000075660003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, 'Charles was having difficulty signing into CirrusMD- I explained that his email is already registered, that he just needs to choose the "forgot password" link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-16 09:10:58', '2021-09-16 09:10:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075659003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924017', 'Rodger Paxton', NULL, 'Member called stating he did not receive the payment update email from Patti on Monday. I tried to resend the email to the member but he did not receive my email either (I made sure he checked his SPAM and Trash folders while on the phone with the member). I then read him the URL address over the phone and he was successfully taken to the payment update form. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-16 08:04:23', '2021-09-16 08:04:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075633003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348024', 'David Kellers', NULL, '9-15-21 Left vm for Dave about his price change and possible other options to bring down cost. Told him my dates out but if desperate to let me know and I''ll find a way to help him. Possibly move to SECURE to bring cost back down.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-15 16:54:33', '2021-09-15 16:54:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075628011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553277', 'Christine Campbell', NULL, '9-15-21 Talked with Susan Clark bc CrisMarie is out on a family emergency. I explained everything to Susan now as well. She needs to talk with CM because there''s a lot to think about with the 3 options. DPC is probably best or CARE+. They are paying $1700 now for Pacific Source with an HSA. Insane. She had a shoulder injury 18 months ago and it''s all healed and doing well! She also did PT on her knee to strengthen them since she''s a skier. This was due to overly tight calves. She will let me know today or next few days if they want to enroll for Oct. 1st start date. Otherwise they will wait until Nov. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-15 14:33:09', '2021-09-15 14:33:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075586056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, 'member submitted ticket asking about Annual Physical.  Apparently his provider is not in network and he will need a prescription refilled.  I told him that in order to the visit to be shared, provider must be in network and all charges must be coded as preventative.  He asked if a new provider could write him a refill for Alprazolam, I told him that would be up to the provider.  I tried to call member however the number is blocked.  I tried office phone & cell phone.  So I ended up sending all this information via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-15 14:05:38', '2021-09-15 14:05:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075628003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309004', 'James Skurski', NULL, '9-15-21 Jim is still not prepared. It''s hard to get his wife to follow through to watch video. He''ll work on it again. She''s actually a former oncologist and possibly looking to renew her license but not certain with everything that''s going on in the world now. She will need to go to CARE+ for now. Jim never got Darius'' email and he''ll call him to get that. He just had a clean colonoscopy today! He won''t need a scope for another 5 years. But, in my opinion he still has too many health issues going on for this to be a good solution. Reg insurance is best, in spite of his opinion that he''s not worried about his current health issues. We will meet again Oct. 6th and hopefully with wife educated by then.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-15 13:20:37', '2021-09-15 13:20:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075586051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881495', 'Dennis Larratt', NULL, 'I called and left a VM with member to remind him that he needs to submit cancellation for as he will be turning 65 10/21.  I resent link to form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-15 12:44:12', '2021-09-15 12:44:12'),
