  ('zcrm_1579374000075623003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474377', 'Lynette (Lynn) Arena', NULL, 'Lynn called in and said that she has not been able to have a new Welcome Call yet when switching from Sedera over to Zion and she had a few questions and what everything was. I let her know that we will send her out a Welcome Call scheduler to set that up and I went over all the names of who the new carriers are so far and that everything else will be talked about and gone over on the Welcome Call. She needs to set up a Yearly Physical and Blood work along with a Mammogram. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-09-15 11:38:48', '2021-09-15 11:38:48'),
