  ('zcrm_1579374000075541008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841134', 'David Mason', NULL, '9-14-21 Mary is working to get Auggie''s membership approved by CU again this year. She also wanted to better understand their membership. I explained it all again and she feels better. I also sent all of the supporting docs to submit to CU such as the newest Guidelines showing psychiatric care, illness care, pharmacy benefit, ACA compliant wellness, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-14 13:22:16', '2021-09-14 13:22:16'),
