  ('zcrm_1579374000075485003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521660', 'Teresa Robertson', NULL, 'This member is COMPLETELY confused about her plan and had a severe meltdown on the phone with me. She has absolutely no idea how to use it and when trying to explain it to her she interrupts, swears at you, and refuses to listen. I finally was able to explain a few things to her before she completely cut me off regarding a test from her naturopath. I did transfer her to Zion for the guidelines regarding this Genova test. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-14 09:36:52', '2021-09-14 09:39:47'),
