  ('zcrm_1579374000075424008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, 'Robert called for help in understanding his Planstin EOB- I explained that the MEC only covers a vitamin D panel and lipid panel.  It sounded like his $45.00 charge was for the extra blood work that wasn''t covered. He was ok, in just paying it, and thanked me for the explanation.   I also explained that he must make sure that all providers are currently participating in the PHCS network for his upcoming colonoscopy.', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-13 13:23:28', '2021-09-13 13:23:28'),
