  ('zcrm_1579374000075361037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '9-10-21 Granville is helping to solve Nan''s problems. C4 Rep who newly worked on acct was trying to blame Me/Agent and Anthem bc Nan''s relaying of information confused the woman who called her, I believe. Either way, Granville is working to update the APTC to the correct amount of $609.28 which got wiped out on Aug. 25th. He will have to elevate this again. They closed old ticket. New TKT # is 210910 - 000681   for Aug. 1st back date. Can''t go back further than that. Probably send me or Nan a note when they are sending it to Anthem to process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-10 17:06:02', '2021-09-10 17:25:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075363003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881495', 'Dennis Larratt', NULL, 'tt Marie @ Mercy Reg Hosp:  She wanted to know who to send a claim to.  Explained he has healthsharing.  It''s part of a hospital stay per Marie.  Let her know that pt must open a need with Zion.  Gave her their name, address, &amp; ph # so she can all and talk directly with Zion.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-10 15:31:02', '2021-09-10 15:31:02'),
