  ('zcrm_1579374000075361027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811189', 'Bryan Droznes', NULL, '9-10-21 Bryan, wife and 2 kids all super healthy, no meds, no pre-x, no tobacco. They just relocated back to US from Argentina for many years. They aren''t thrilled about their company UHC. He''s a small part owner of Bleeker with David Peck. Bleeker has about 20 employees now and they are offering 3 plans through UHC. $250 ded is $715 every 15 days, or $450 every 15 days with $3500 ded, or HSA compatible $1750 for $625 every 15 days. They are all nearly 2x or more expensive than SECURE at $685/$1000.  They do their annual wellness visits and typically have 2-3 Dr visits per kid, per year. Many of these can be handled virtually which was hard for him to wrap his head around. But, once he heard the price he became far more excited. Will share video with his wife and I will send overview now. He knows of the 15th deadline for Oct. 1st start. He also wasn''t familiar with an HSA. This will help for the up front costs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-10 14:03:01', '2021-09-10 14:03:01'),
