  ('zcrm_1579374000075339023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521312', 'Cheryl Schack', NULL, 'Cheryl will be aging into Medicare after I sent her a email letting her know I received her cancellation.  I will notify Zion and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-10 13:32:21', '2021-09-10 13:32:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075361008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268015', 'Catherine Watson', NULL, '9-10-21 Cathy Watson and Earl Henderson are married and had two separate membership simply because it made more sense per the price. They are thrilled to have CARE+ as an option now and their membership will be altogether now. No pre-x, no wellness, no meds, no vax, no issues. Super healthy! Choosing CARE+ $1000/$395. Never used Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-10 13:26:35', '2021-09-10 13:27:04'),
