  ('zcrm_1579374000075288003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075766007', 'Charles Petno', NULL, '9/9 spoke to Charles - business partner has insurance for him and self - they are the only two full-time employees; the rest are PT ; shared with him that they don''t have to contribute but can offer the program to employees who may not have insurance - requested info to be emailed to him - sent him video and brochure - follow up next week', 'Traci McCoid', 'Traci McCoid', '2021-09-09 21:25:03', '2021-09-09 21:25:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075282008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'Jillian called.  She had a colonoscopy done.  She understood since they removed a polyp it had moved from preventative to diagnostic. However, when she submitted it to Zion, they denied the need saying it was pre-existing.  According to her, there''s nothing in her background to make it pre-x.  So, we decided she''s going to ask Zion directly why they are considering it pre-x.  We talked about it could be something they are pulling from her Dr''s records, or the way it was coded?  After she talks w/Zion, then she knows she may need to discuss with the Dr.  

She also asked why she keeps getting bills from a hospital on her son''s need.  When she talks to Zion, she''s going to ask if this has been submitted yet.  She agreed an awful lot of invoices/bills come in and maybe this had been missed.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-09 15:54:04', '2021-09-09 15:54:04'),
