  ('zcrm_1579374000075240018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056599123', 'Elizabeth Baker', NULL, 'Advisor contacted me and wanted to know how member could remove children as they were going off to college.  I sent him all of the forms to do everything and asked if member was a good candidate for a flip to Zion.  Advisor said that he would contact her.  I told him if she wanted to move forward how to proceed.  I received Cancellation and when asked what she would change she replied that she could remove dependents without re-enrolling.  I contacted advisor and asked if she understood why she had to re-enroll.  Advisor to f/u with her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-09 12:49:06', '2021-09-09 12:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075240013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001194015', 'Debra Hensen', NULL, 'Member emailed me and advised that she had gone onto Medicare eff 9/1/21and need to cancel HES.  I sent her the cancellation request and will cancel &amp; Refund her for Sept.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-09 12:37:14', '2021-09-09 12:37:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075258003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401086', 'Andrew Brinkmeyer', NULL, 'Andrew called inquiring about his preventative care benefits- I went over them and sent him the preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-09 11:32:18', '2021-09-09 11:32:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075240008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790025', 'Rosalynde smith', NULL, 'Member emailed me and is under the impression that after removing Sereko tha ther plan changed when in reality it changed when she converted to Zion 8/20.  I tried to contact Andrea to contact her however Andrea out until 9/15.  I left a VM for member to try to explain to her that nothing changed at this time.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-09 11:02:42', '2021-09-09 11:02:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075240003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921278', 'Timothy Dilley', NULL, 'Member called in and left me a VM asking if he could pay rest of year Lump sum out of his HSA.  I told him that he could not pay for his Share amount with HSA funds, however talk with advisor Leslie Jablonski or tax professional for advice.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-09 10:50:16', '2021-09-09 10:50:16'),
