  ('zcrm_1579374000075178008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061132', 'David Pool', NULL, 'David called regarding a prescription quote form request so I sent him a quote form via email. Received it back at 12:58 PM and searched the prescription sites for the lowest cost which was 831.00 so I reached out to Reid. Reid emailed back after 5 PM with a great price so I will be contacting the member today. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-09 06:59:42', '2021-09-09 06:59:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075131018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, 'Dhai called requesting covid testing, I explained that this is something that is not currently on the ACA list of preventative services so this is something that is not covered. I suggested that she call her local health department about free covid testing. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-08 13:35:08', '2021-09-08 13:35:08'),
