  ('zcrm_1579374000075131013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, 'Lisa called to give us William Jr.''s ss #, added to admin123 and the CRM. She was also inquiring about her IUA and if her sons well visit appointments will count towards the same IUA as her maternity. I explained that I would transfer her to Zion for this question. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-08 11:42:51', '2021-09-08 11:42:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075179003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Heard back from both Teresa &amp; Reid &amp; we think we have a better comparison.  Sent over the pricing comparison (=&lt; 1/2 price) to Teresa for her review.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-08 11:33:14', '2021-09-08 11:33:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075178003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082312', 'Kelly Panton', NULL, '9-8-21 Kelly is choosing to remain on PSDHC partially bc she has the desire to see an ENT for nasal congestion issues but has never addressed this or seen doctor about it. She also prefers to keep her IUA as low as possible bc she tends to get injured in her activities and doesn''t want to be responsible for $1000 IUA to only save $20 a month in her age bracket. I agree with her. She will stay put.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-08 11:13:04', '2021-09-08 11:13:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075131008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255207', 'Rachel Martin', NULL, 'Rachel called regarding her sons well child check up and a bill she received from the doctor that she verified was in network. She is very upset that she received a bill and wanted to know why. I explained that I would have to transfer her to Planstin for this answer. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-08 10:58:36', '2021-09-08 10:58:36'),
