  ('zcrm_1579374000075067022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471284', 'Michelle Caldwell', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 967 
Question : I recently received a bill for several labs that were deemed not covered by MPB.  I  had discussed the wellness visit and correlating labs with an MPB rep before going in for my appointment. It was my understanding that much of the work was to e covered under wellness benefits. However, with the exception of a mammography which was billed separately,  all the labs were deemed not covered. I am working long hours right now and could not reach anyone when I called over the weekend.  How do I appeal this?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-09-07 19:33:35', '2021-09-07 19:33:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075113008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Reid got back to me with pricing.  But, he thinks we may not be understanding their label because his pricing is quite a bit more expensive &amp; he feels like theirs is too cheap for what it says.  I''m getting with Teresa again and we can go from there.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-07 18:14:31', '2021-09-07 18:14:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075088059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '9-7-21 Initially started talking to Charity for a minute and then got disconnected. Then connected with Nicholas who discovered Nan''s account was changed by the system without prompting from the client or agent back to an old plan and old APTC amount. She should be getting the $609.28 APTC and the plan described above. He has also included that she had a medical need to address. He''s put in the system to backdate it to the original change date which should be Aug. 1st, 2021. He said for her to seek service and pay and file for reimbursement or hold off on paying if possible.  He had no timeline and said sometimes it takes up to a month to resolve. Entirely looks like weird system error. No fault of Customer Service, Agent or Client. TKT # is 210 907-000 878.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-07 17:52:17', '2021-09-07 17:52:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075113003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410489', 'Michael DePaso', NULL, 'Michael called.  He wanted a list of dermatologists in his area. & wondered if we have agreements with offices for discounts or how it works with his health share.  I sent him a list off HCBB with the dermatologists out to 30-miles from his zip code for his reference.  He''s had pre-cancerous cells on his skin (& nose) and has been going through a watchful period with a dermatologist at least the last 6 mos (?).  It doesn''t sound like this was discussed when he signed up, so I suggested for clarification on pre-x items, he talk with his advisor since he just signed up 5/1/2021.  He didn''t have Wendy Scipione''s phone number so I provided her work line for him.  See e-mail if questions.     CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-07 17:19:55', '2021-09-07 17:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075088048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039657162', 'Bob Borden', NULL, '9-7-21 Bob and Maria are healthy, except Bob used his membership for internal intestine problem. He did a CT scan, ultrasound and blood test and they found nothing wrong. I suggested he gets a written clean bill of health from his doctor which he agree to do. He believes it won''t be a problem. They also have a 21 year old son who is healthy, no issues. Their rate was going from $900+ to $1410 for PDHC! By moving to SECURE they can reduce monthly fee to $685/$1000.  They said they never used Redirect since they didn''t remember about that part. No loss.  Completed cancellation form for PDHC as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-07 16:40:30', '2021-09-07 16:51:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075088043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'Justin called because he needs to take his daughter to the pediatrician, she isn''t feeling well.  She has a pediatrician already, so I explained the self-pay process with him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-07 14:41:50', '2021-09-07 14:41:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075107013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, 'Karen called in regarding mental health benefits for her daughter. I explained the MAP program and emailed Karen the information. Karen is VERY clueless about her plan and its benefits. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-07 14:34:14', '2021-09-07 14:34:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075107008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065985001', 'Denise Uhlig', NULL, 'Denise called in with many questions regarding her plan since she was moved to her own plan in April. I answered her questions regarding labs, how to present herself as a cash pay patient, a list of ACA preventative services, and a welcome call scheduler. After answering Denise''s questions she verified that she has not had a welcome call so I did suggest for her to schedule one so that she can go into more details about her plan. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-07 14:22:28', '2021-09-07 14:22:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000075088038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, '8-30-21 Tried calling Jeffery but it just went say vm hasn''t been set up yet. I can''t leave a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-07 14:05:01', '2021-09-07 14:05:01'),
