  ('zcrm_1579374000075088033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Melinda called because she had thought that a dermatologist visit would be a covered expense with her Planstin card, I explained why it is not.  Melinda understood and will just pay the bill with her HSA card. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-07 13:54:11', '2021-09-07 13:54:11'),
