  ('zcrm_1579374000075088018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553277', 'Christine Campbell', NULL, '9-7-21 CrisMarie is interested in joining again but couldn''t concentrate on options bc they are leaving for vacation tomorrow. We started with SECURE but the network is super limited in Whitefish and Kalispell, MT. Then talked about DIRECT and I found 2 in Whitefish and 2 in Kalispell which I just sent to her. If that''s not appealing I mentioned CARE+ for no wellness and cheapest option. She will review the network and DPC choices.  Bluebird is cheapest at $65 a month in Kalispell. Then Big Mountain DPC in Whitefish is $75 month. She will review and we will talk on Wednesday, next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-07 11:27:37', '2021-09-07 11:27:37'),
