  ('zcrm_1579374000074936023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059881267', 'Anita Lee', NULL, 'tt Anita.  Her husband got a job &amp; no longer needs to be on her plan.  She says she went online &amp; filled out a change form, but the monthly draw was still for 2 people. So, I sent her Patti''s chg template.  As we spoke she was completing the form.  To make sure Patti receives it, she''s leaving a message on Patti''s line for Tues.  That way, if Patti doesn''t see the form for some reason,  Patti will know to touch base with Anita.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-03 16:18:25', '2021-09-03 16:18:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074946043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066645001', 'Frank Magourilos', NULL, 'Members spouse called in and told me that she had started Medicare eff 9/1.  I will send the link for the Change form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-03 14:47:05', '2021-09-03 14:47:05'),
