  ('zcrm_1579374000074950003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650127', 'Karen Guptil', 'Cancellation Notice', 'In doing an audit for Wiley Long, we researched and realized that we did not have on file a Cancellation Form from this member.

An Cancellation Form was sent.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-09-03 11:12:37', '2021-09-03 11:12:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074945010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032064118', 'Catherine Broad', NULL, '9-3-21 Cathy called in bc she just discovered that her rate increased dramatically from $230 to about $402 per month due to Sedera''s age banding. She had PRP knee injections 18 months ago in both knees and had a major reaction to the injections. Got a staff infection ie. an aversion of serum sickness. Supposedly super rare. Also had put her on steroids and infection possibly due to weakened state from steroids.  Saw rheumatologist to help with it all. Bad 60th B-Day present ;-( Could have gotten wrong person''s blood in process. Everything seems to have gone wrong. They don''t do it a lot and it''s a bit experimental.  Either way she''s 100% good now at 18 months later. DIRECT $1000/$245.  She''s with Cloud Medical. She SUPER appreciative to have my help and access to DIRECT to bring her cost back down to a place she can afford plus the $119 with Cloud Medical. She enrolled and also cancelled her membership MPB Direct with Sedera.  All set for Oct. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-03 11:03:09', '2021-09-03 11:10:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074946003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075077302', 'Sharon Duclos', NULL, 'I will email member letting her know that i will need Cancellation form filled out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-03 10:02:14', '2021-09-03 10:02:14'),
