  ('zcrm_1579374000074785003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889025', 'Laurie Testa', NULL, 'Laurie called back disappointed that the MAP program could not find her any help in her area- I transferred her to Sedera so she could speak to them about whether or not substance abuse treatment would be a covered expense, she was insistant that it would be a covered expense, I told her that I didn''t know for sure, but that mental health wasn''t a covered expense. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-02 08:40:19', '2021-09-02 08:40:19'),
