  ('zcrm_1579374000074748016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, 'Kelly C forwarded me request from member asking for copy of RCI card.  I sent PDF to member and ordered hard cards', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-02 07:25:24', '2021-09-02 07:25:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074752026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821700', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, '9-1-21 Judi is LIKE-MINDED. She''s spent 27 years in the healthcare industry and knows what happens behind the scenes. She has diverticulitis and treats it with coloidal silver which gets rid of it in 24 hours, unlike what they''d have her do with antibiotics and endless meds. She''s referring Kathy Smith who is working to get a medical exemption now for work. I haven''t heard back from Kathy yet. Judi''s also sending me some valuable information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-01 17:34:25', '2021-09-01 17:34:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074752021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024892055', 'Elizabeth Neumann', NULL, '9-1-21 Libby is currently unemployed. Her rate went from $368-$540 due to missed aged increase in Jan. 2021. She wants to keep her cost down but she has 2 issues she dealing with. She''s had appointments for possible arthritis and another one this Friday. Maybe from age. She also had bleeding and cramping Feb.-June 2021. She had an ultrasound then went to urologist then to a gastroenterologist. They didn''t find anything. She will ask gastro to give her a clean bill of health if he''s willing to do so. She will also wait to see what''s up with possible arthritis and get back to me if/when these are cleared up and not an issue with pre-x clause for new membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-01 16:57:37', '2021-09-01 16:57:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074752016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, '9-1-21 Kyle is enrolling in SECURE for him and kids $1000/$495. Jennifer is going to remain with Sedera throughout her need. They desperately wanted the wellness back for the kids. Now will have MEC again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-01 16:04:43', '2021-09-01 16:04:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074757003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755417', 'Troy Aubrey', NULL, 'Member called in and said that he had emailed &amp; supposedly submitted a Cancellation form to cancel.  I will send him link to submit cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-01 14:10:16', '2021-09-01 14:10:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074737013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755417', 'Troy Aubrey', NULL, 'Troy called in to cancel today and stated that he has sent several emails to info@mympb.com asking to have his plan cancelled. I transferred him to Patti since today is the 1st of the month to see if he is still able to cancel his plan or not. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-01 14:06:09', '2021-09-01 14:06:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074704041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063057002', 'Donald Hess', NULL, 'member called in and told me that he now has a job w/benefits so need to cancel.  I will send him cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-01 12:28:04', '2021-09-01 12:28:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074731009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165365', 'Wendy Scipione', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Julia', 'Visit ID : 954 
Question : Hi! I''d love some help with this.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-09-01 12:24:37', '2021-09-01 12:24:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074737008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Tatiana called in with a friend so that the friend could sit in while I explained her plan to her. Tatiana does not have any idea how her plan works and does not seem interested in learning how to use her plan on her own. I explained everything about her Partially Self Directed plan to her and her friend and answered any questions they had. I also provided Tatiana with the following emails: How to Submit Bills to Sedera, Address Update Form, How to search the PHCS Network, prescription quote form, and how to present her MEC. I did suggest to this member that she reach out to her advisor to see if there is an easier plan for her to work with since this one seems too confusing. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-01 12:04:03', '2021-09-01 12:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074715033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887142', 'Jacob Ramsden', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-01 11:45:47', '2021-09-01 11:45:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074748011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577049', 'Justin Feldman', NULL, 'Justin called in because he has not had to use his plan yet and is on his way to the doctor for his yearly physical. I told him that with his plan CARE+ he does not have any sort of Preventative care so that will be out of pocket. I explained to him what type of things are covered after he has met his $1,000 IUA with Zion. He totally understood and asked if what his doctor is most likely going to recommend which is some sort of ultrasound for a blood clot and I let him know that yes that type of procedure would be covered AFTER the IUA is met and to call Zion and let them know ahead of time. Also to keep ALL records and receipts just in case and for his own personal record. He is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-09-01 11:27:16', '2021-09-01 11:27:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074715028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887142', 'Jacob Ramsden', NULL, 'No response. Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-01 11:03:48', '2021-09-01 11:03:48'),
