  ('zcrm_1579374000074704006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000168005', 'Juan Soler', NULL, 'I returned Juan''s call and got the correct acct to charge his share amt.  He also told me that he needed to update his address I will send Change form.  I also spoke to him about the price increase because he will be turning 50 he ok with that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-01 07:35:23', '2021-09-01 07:35:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074632027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935161', 'Jill St. Aubin King', NULL, 'Jill e-mailed thru Wendy Scipione.  She was thinking we ordered her a new Planstin card and hadn''t seen anything.  I went ahead and ordered both PDF &amp; hard copies for her via slack then e-mailed her back to let her know.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-31 17:27:01', '2021-08-31 17:27:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074632022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005542023', 'Constance Trincali', NULL, 'Constance called -- she rec''d an e-mail saying her cc card was expired, but the e-mail address it came from left her questioning its validity (I think she said:  sender@service.com?).  We were able to confirm her Liberty health share and she sees it says to e-mail accounting@mympb.com.  But, she is going to call before 5pm eastern and talk to accounting tomorrow since this didn''t quite feel right.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-31 16:10:10', '2021-08-31 16:10:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074632008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064227232', 'Levi Bowen', NULL, 'Levi called.  He says his pymt didn''t go through this mo, but I don''t see any notes regarding that. He would like us to rerun it now &amp; it will clear.  I sent Patti a chat to rerun and let Levi know at levi@levibowen.com once she''s all set, or if she needs anything further.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-31 15:18:06', '2021-08-31 15:55:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074640018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062877001', 'Kyle Butler', NULL, 'Kyle called regarding complications he is having with a recent vasectomy. I did transfer Kyle over to Zion so that they could go over their guidelines with him regarding this situation. I also sent Kyle a welcome call scheduler because I noticed he has yet to have a welcome call. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-31 14:48:46', '2021-08-31 14:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074640013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297131', 'Linda Bergstrom', NULL, 'member called to cancel her membership- I explained that the cancellation deadline is the 20th of the month, but if she fills out the cancellation form that I sent her she would not be charged again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-31 14:40:42', '2021-08-31 14:40:42'),
