  ('zcrm_1579374000074555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, 'Lisa called to ask how to add her newborn baby to the plan, I told her the best thing to do would be to call her rep, she has his phone number and will give him a call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-31 07:47:29', '2021-08-31 07:47:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074540003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366095', 'Tim Dye', NULL, 'Pmt reran with new CC info submitted by member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-31 07:08:18', '2021-08-31 07:08:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074505053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050370005', 'Arian Shirakhoon', NULL, '8-30-21 Spent another hour on phone with her and Cigna to submit her proof of Life Change for job ending. C4 will communicate that with Cigna. She uploaded the docs into C4 twice. Ron from Cigna called her to get the documentation with no easy way to submit it and from a 3rd party number. She didn''t feel comfortable and couldn''t reach him by calling back. We reached Deborah through Broker Support and she gave Arian the time lines. She has 30 days to make payment from Aug. 25th. But, she made payment today anyhow. Her payment made through C4 will be credited to her account for Oct. supposedly. She still has to set up ongoing payments bc she only had a cc not debit card for future payments. This will give her time to see the other payment credited to Oct. also. Case ID # is CP27P0.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-30 17:00:49', '2021-08-30 17:00:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074505048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082312', 'Kelly Panton', NULL, '8-30-21 Kelly is aging up to 30-39 and price going from $269-$296 for $500 IUA. So, I explained SECURE to her. She is self-employed and understands HSA. Only problem she had was a broken wrist in Nov. last year. That is healed and no issues. She wants to do her wellness visits but wasn''t sure what is included. I sent her the video to watch even though I explained it all. I also sent her the overview. We will reconnect next Wed. at 11:00 to convert if she chooses. It will save her a little per month with a higher IUA. But, even if she stayed the $1000 IUA with Sedera is most than with Zion. Plus she used Teladoc for the mental health benefit and paid a visit fee a few times. Life Care will help on save money on that front as well. SECURE $275/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-30 16:55:15', '2021-08-30 16:55:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074505043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Maurine called.  The list I sent her for labs has been challenging.  It doesn''t specify which labs do blood work & she keeps running into places that cannot do her test.  We tried re-running with phlebotomist and nothing comes up, which seems off.  While we were working together, she found one that actually lists accepting Planstin, so she''s going to try them & will get back to us if she needs further help.  She seems as happy as could be when we got off the phone, however I really understand her frustration and will ask Kelly Anne to guide me tomorrow for future member questions.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-30 16:47:21', '2021-08-30 16:47:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074505023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, 'the member called to ask why she received a bill from Anthem (insurance) I told her that if she did it had nothing to do with the plan that she had, she will be calling Anthem directly. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-30 14:06:48', '2021-08-30 14:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074520013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, 'Member emailed me letting me know that he also had a DPC Membership and wanted to pay  for DPC from I advise that he would be paying double and that he could not [ay for a DPC out of an HSA.  I told him to consult with a Tax Professional', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-30 14:06:43', '2021-08-30 14:06:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074505018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752138', 'Michelle Nault', NULL, 'Michelle called because she wanted to know how to upload her medical bills to Zion Health- I sent her the needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-30 14:03:33', '2021-08-30 14:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074520008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074523001', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-30 13:57:05', '2021-08-30 13:57:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074520003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075077302', 'Sharon Duclos', NULL, 'Member called in and was wondering why her plan had jumped about $200.  I advised since she had turned 60 2+ yrs ago and was never charged.  This was the correct rate.  I advised her to be in touch with Jan to discuss other options.  Good flip candidate.  No needs or Pre-Ex', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-30 12:45:32', '2021-08-30 12:45:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074505013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820032', 'Ottis Fausett', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-30 12:41:04', '2021-08-30 12:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074519003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055592032', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, 'Needed to start a chat with CirrusMD, I walked them through how to sign in and all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-08-30 11:58:22', '2021-08-30 11:58:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074518003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050370005', 'Arian Shirakhoon', NULL, '8-30-21 Arian called bc she doesn''t have proof of insurance through Cigna yet. Cigna called her to verify proof of unemployment. She will get a letter from her employer. I told her to make sure her payment went through as well. She will call Cigna to set up ongoing payment as well. I also told her to talk with her accountant about her severance and the timing of it which is $14K given Aug. 15th. I''m not sure if and how that impacts her APTC for Sept onward. She will verify. She will also submit a letter showing just end date of working for company since not sure if severance impacts subsidy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-30 11:34:22', '2021-08-30 11:34:22'),
