  ('zcrm_1579374000074481013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964449', 'Nazaria Molina', NULL, 'I will cancel this plan eff 8/31 as dependent submitted in his own name (he was dependent).  On the cancellation form he noted that wife &amp; child would be continuing on plan.  It wasn''t specified that this was an employer plan wife was being offered.  I responded with what was done on 6/21 and received no response until 8/26.  I will refund September that was collected and we have not paid out as yet.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-30 08:52:14', '2021-08-30 08:52:14'),
