  ('zcrm_1579374000074481008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'Member emailed me asking why her pmt went up.  I emailed back and explained age banding and the fact we had not raised the price since she turned 50 in June of 2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-30 07:56:52', '2021-08-30 07:56:52'),
