  ('zcrm_1579374000074411023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819433', 'Kaimey Ela', NULL, '8-27-21 According to Patti this member is joining Sedera now via her employer group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-27 17:08:12', '2021-08-27 17:08:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074424023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Maurine needed PHCS Network Labs in her area.  Sent her both the search template and a list I was able to bring up for her.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-27 16:49:56', '2021-08-27 16:49:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074424013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366095', 'Tim Dye', NULL, 'Tim called (I used the ph # to find the file, because it comes in as Timothy Durant, not Dye).  He wanted to make a payment with Patti, but, it''s already 5:50 in FL.  Transferred him to her VM so she can call &amp; take pymt next week.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-27 15:51:03', '2021-08-27 15:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074368023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071646064', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Amy called because she never received her post welcome call email- I emailed them again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-27 14:47:20', '2021-08-27 14:47:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074411013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '8-27-21 Talked with Robert about his wife''s preventative mammogram. They went to the place they''ve been to in the past that was independently and used to charge $164 for the mammogram. They didn''t realize it was bought by a hospital group and now they charged $866. They got the mammogram and paid. But, I''m going to recommend they try to have Redirect negotiate or he tries to negotiate that price back down. That''s a crime to charge that much. It was not diagnostic and it was not 3-D or anything special.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-27 14:16:14', '2021-08-27 14:16:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074368018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034221050', 'Lily Williams', NULL, 'Lily called for help with her prescription medications, I sent her a script quote request form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-27 13:51:03', '2021-08-27 13:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074387089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819433', 'Kaimey Ela', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I have cancelled RCI &amp; Sedera.  I will refund September.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-27 13:38:52', '2021-08-27 13:38:52'),
