  ('zcrm_1579374000074387074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790025', 'Rosalynde smith', NULL, 'Member requested to remove dependent Sereko Carroll from membership. Her payment had declined so I changed  and notified Zion. and she said that monies were there. I re-ran.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-27 12:16:24', '2021-08-27 12:16:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074368008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290213', 'Amy Bloom', NULL, 'Mitchell called with detailed Covid questions because he and his family are out of town and have been exposed to Covid.  I told him that I wasn''t a medical professional, but that he could reach out to CIrrus MD.  I reached out to CirrusMD and asked that they send him an invite right away. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-27 11:30:58', '2021-08-27 11:30:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074387066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072020002', 'Jacob Bonnema', NULL, 'Member''s 9/21 payment declined 1st notice sent - 8/27 member called in and transferred money into account I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-27 11:26:24', '2021-08-27 11:58:40'),
