  ('zcrm_1579374000074411003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423001', 'Nicholas Palmer', NULL, 'Spoke to member scheduled his welcome call for Tuesday, August 31, 2021 at 10:00 a.m. MST. / 12:00 noon EST. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-27 09:28:10', '2021-08-27 09:28:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074406003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'Julius called with many questions regarding a recent urgent care visit for his son and an ENT visit today that stems from his sons urgent care visit. I explained to him the cash pay process and also explained to him that he needs to collect his superbills so that if this does go over his $1000 IUA he will need to upload those bills to Zion for payment. He seems VERY confused about his plan and has had a mini welcome call with Kelly Anne but refuses to schedule a full welcome call. He seems to think that ALL medical needs for his family fall into ONE need. I explained that it is not the case, that each person''s needs are separate. I did send him another welcome call scheduler and how to submit his needs to Zion. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-27 09:22:49', '2021-08-27 09:24:18'),
