  ('zcrm_1579374000074174003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034221050', 'Lily Williams', NULL, 'Lily called per Charles Fromans instructions to have us take care of her billing needs for her recent Covid diagnosis. I explained to Lily that we are unable to help with any billing inquiries but that I would be happy to transfer her to Sedera so that she can speak with a representative about this matter. She was too weak and insisted on waiting to talk to Sedera when she is out of the hospital. I explained to her that she needs to collect those superbills so that she has them for her needs upload. She does not seem very confident in her services. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-25 07:43:19', '2021-08-25 07:43:19'),
