  ('zcrm_1579374000074158031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, '8-24-21 Drew is looking to add his 2 17 year old kids. It looks like his x-wife might be able to get a cheaper plan through work since work will pay for part of it. But, he doesn''t want to support the beast of traditional insurance. He likes his membership and the freedoms it provides! We were going to try to switch him to SECURE until he revealed he''s had knee pain recently and he''s using Redirect for some minor knee pain and getting an x-ray. So, we can''t move him now. His kids play football and wrestle but healthy.  Adding kids total cost in age category 50-59 is $1500/$610.   Looks like best plan with x-wife work is approx $554.40 their cost. Cheapest plan is $66 per week and $750 Individual/$2250 Family Ded. $3000 Indiv MOP / $9000 family. This seems like the best plan but he though it was the basic plan. He was having a hard time reading the information. But, he really would rather support his membership and not traditional insurance.
He also lived in Orlando for 18 months and suggested I go to Winter Park to visit, Kennedy Space Center or find a way to go on St. John''s River that runs North!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-24 16:20:41', '2021-08-24 16:20:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074155016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248151', 'Ray Skelton', NULL, 'tt Ray.  He wanted to know what his plan # was for his RX.  We went over his plan and I looked on GoodRx.  His prescription for Lisinopril 10mg, 1qd, #90=90 day supply is only $10 @ Walmart, no coupon needed.  He''s going to pursue that.  Will let us know if he needs more help.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-24 15:50:07', '2021-08-24 15:50:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074155008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, 'Drew called.  Wants to price adding his twins to his plan (cking pricing, they are currently on their mother''s plan, but this might be better).  He''s going to call his advisor: Wendy Scipione to get help.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-24 15:23:55', '2021-08-24 15:24:06'),
