  ('zcrm_1579374000074158013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, '8-24-21  Tyna Pearson wants to join for Sept. 1st through Boulder Integrative / Carrie Ballas. No new pre-x since applied. She''s still healthy and all good. Michele is looking into if we need anything else to add her to the membership. She applied previously and have all of her information. Hoping to simply reinstate her and update the List Bill to Carrie for September. Michele will message me via Teams.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-24 14:53:44', '2021-08-24 14:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074158008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014057', 'Tyna Pearson', NULL, '8-24-21 Tyna wants to join for Sept. 1st through Boulder Integrative / Carrie Ballas. No new pre-x since applied. She''s still healthy and all good. Michele is looking into if we need anything else to add her to the membership. She applied previously and have all of her information. Hoping to simply reinstate her and update the List Bill to Carrie for September. Michele will message me via Teams.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-24 14:53:10', '2021-08-24 14:53:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074126028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064025010', 'Marie Kassouf', NULL, 'Sent Marie another welcome call scheduler because she did not have her welcome call and she knows absolutely nothing about her plan. I did explain how to present her Planstin card at her Well Woman''s visit. She also requested a list of doctors in her area in the PHCS network so I provided her with that also. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-24 14:50:41', '2021-08-24 14:50:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074105013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, 'Nelson called because he suspects he has a UTI and has an apt with a doctor tomorrow, I went over the self pay process with him and send him instructions on how to submit his bills to Sedera for sharing if needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-24 14:23:37', '2021-08-24 14:23:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074126023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, 'Carrie called in asking how to add her employee to her plan. I transferred her to Patti for this information. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-24 14:06:30', '2021-08-24 14:06:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674173', 'Ellen Tresnak', NULL, 'Received an email from Ellen that her payment reverted back to her old account.  In the transition to Admin 123 wrong banking info got pulled.  I updated with new information.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 13:13:21', '2021-08-24 13:13:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887226', 'Dennis Barela', NULL, 'in the transition from FTNI to Admin 123 member was charged for this membership in error.  I refunded.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 12:53:17', '2021-08-24 12:53:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031476065', 'Michelle Sangster', NULL, 'I updated payment method in Admin 123 as the wrong bank account was taken from FTNI (ex husbands acct). Michell had also been charged out of FTNI so I just refunded erroneous charge and input correct acct for future pmts. I will also cancel all pmts in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 12:38:14', '2021-08-24 12:38:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322438', 'Surya Yalamanchili', NULL, 'Member was charged the $125 in error in the transition from FTNI. I have refunded.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 12:16:10', '2021-08-24 12:16:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074126018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083478001', 'Kimberly McClure', NULL, 'Member called regarding her husbands ER bills from a recent visit. They were over $5000 so I transferred Kimberly to Sedera for their guidance on this ER bill. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-24 11:50:30', '2021-08-24 11:50:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074126013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070161036', 'Bigembe Rugomoka', NULL, 'Bigembe called regarding his "insurance" and that he does not have an "insurance" card to present to his doctor''s office. I kindly explained the difference between a traditional insurance plan and his cost sharing plan. He wanted nothing to do with what I was telling him when I was explaining the procedure to present himself as a cash pay patient. He said never mind, I have another number to call, and hung up. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-24 11:44:01', '2021-08-24 11:44:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024892055', 'Elizabeth Neumann', NULL, 'I finally connected with Libby and gave her an explanation about her price increase.  She was one of the members that had aged up that had not been being charged.  I told her to be in touch with Wendy for other options available.  She ok.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 11:20:03', '2021-08-24 11:20:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'This member had cancelled eff 5/1/2021 but was charged in error when we transitioned to Admin 123. I will refund her the charge.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 11:10:04', '2021-08-24 11:10:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029348121', 'Kristen Stephen', NULL, 'In the transition from FTNI this members payment was not cancelled so she was billed twice. I will refund the charge out of FTNI and cancel any further pmts.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 11:06:59', '2021-08-24 11:06:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959250', 'Brigitte Fleeman', NULL, 'In the transition from FTNI the wrong bank account was charged for this member. I updated it.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 10:49:04', '2021-08-24 10:49:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322368', 'Gretchen Wilson', NULL, 'In the transition from FTNI member was charged $125 in error.  I will refund out of Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 10:26:24', '2021-08-24 10:26:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516085', 'Harold Workman', NULL, 'Member called in and wondered why his payment had gone up.  We had charged him the $125 by mistake.  I refunded.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 10:21:53', '2021-08-24 10:21:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074126008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024892055', 'Elizabeth Neumann', NULL, 'Libby (member) called regarding a $75 increase in her premium and is questioning as to why she received this increase. I transferred her to Patti''s vm since Patti was on her line. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-24 10:16:33', '2021-08-24 10:16:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082617', 'Melinda Kadinger', NULL, 'Member emailed in asking why she was charged twice.  Member''s old FTNI pmts were not deleted in the Transition to Admin 123.  I refunded &amp; will let member know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 10:00:41', '2021-08-24 10:00:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074126003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082312', 'Kelly Panton', NULL, 'Kelly called regarding free Covid testing. I explained to her that currently Covid testing is not a shareable expense unless the test is positive and she incurs bills from Covid-19 that reach above her IUA. I also suggested to Kelly to call her local health department to see if they are offering free Covid testing sites. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-24 08:50:32', '2021-08-24 08:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046719031', 'Nisha Kotecha', 'Redirect Term', 'Tracking #12023352

Sent by Patti Baron on 8/24/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 08:36:05', '2021-08-24 08:36:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046719031', 'Nisha Kotecha', NULL, 'Per Michele this member will be canceling I will notify Sedera &amp; Redirect.  Accounting to cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 08:33:31', '2021-08-24 08:33:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074120003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071380029', 'Trevor Berry', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-24 08:13:58', '2021-08-24 08:13:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054820050', 'Michael Brisbane', NULL, 'Member submitted Pmt Change Form I will update in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 08:09:04', '2021-08-24 08:09:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074105008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054820050', 'Michael Brisbane', NULL, 'Michael couldn''t figure out how to update his payment information in his admin123 portal so he is going to fill out the payment information update form that Misty Berryman sent him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-24 07:46:09', '2021-08-24 07:46:09');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893285', 'Gina Hodgson', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add daughter Scarlett .  I will let Planstin know.  No change in price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 07:37:16', '2021-08-24 07:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074105003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054820050', 'Michael Brisbane', NULL, 'Michael called for some direction in changing his payment information, I helped him get into his MPB.Health portal. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-24 07:35:22', '2021-08-24 07:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel w/Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; cancel &amp; refund billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 07:26:47', '2021-08-24 07:26:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074092003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467245', 'Jamie Talluto', NULL, 'Member emailed in wanting to cancel.  I will send out cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-24 07:00:44', '2021-08-24 07:00:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074039023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271176', 'Ted Williams', NULL, 'Ted called.  He has an MRI tomorrow &amp; needs a CATscan at Rcky Mtn Treatment Cntr, but they won''t schedule anything until he proves he can pay.  His Sedera ''Need'' Advisor Alicia is sched to tt him tomorrow at 10:00am, so we are hopeful they can work everything out then.  He''s going to ask her about an app for his phone too, because Juan orig told him that was the easiest way to submit things.  He''ll let us know if he needs anything.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-23 17:43:02', '2021-08-23 17:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074039018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366134', 'Janell Vennard', NULL, 'Janell called, she needs to update her pymt info.  I sent her Patti''s pymt chg template.  Needs to submit a need  to Zion , so I also sent her the template on how to ''Submit a Need to Zion''.   She mentioned her advisor gave her inaccurate info on pregnancy, so she is going to try to get them to reconsider.  I told her it can''t hurt.  Worst case scenario, she''s in the same place, but at least she''s tried.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-23 17:04:39', '2021-08-23 17:04:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074039013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, 'Eric called.   His daughter is going to have bills he needs to submit.   We went over his $1500 IUA and I sent him the template for submitting needs to Sedera.   At this point, the information he''s received from the doctor, etc., has no pricing, so he''ll wait for those invoices to submit anything, but may get the need started.  He was quite upset that he''d need to ''learn'' how to do this.  He''s just not up to watching a video or learning anything right now.   I let him know the instructions are written out and the video is not very long.  It sounded like that might have helped.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-23 15:19:27', '2021-08-23 15:19:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, 'Member submitted new pmt info I updated in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 14:23:16', '2021-08-23 14:23:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024130', 'Julie Meko', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she has spent most of the time during the pandemic in Costa Rica and that she hasn''t used her plan since converting.  She told me that she needs a letter stating that she has Injury/illness coverage and also wanted to know how bills would be handled internationally.  I told her to ask Zion when she calls in for letter.  She is also wanted to know if she could "suspend" her plan.  I told her no that she would have to re-enroll.  I went over the requirement for the Secure plan and told her to call Wendy for more info about Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 13:11:25', '2021-08-23 13:11:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611086', 'Lucas Zielasko', NULL, 'Member called in and asked what CC we were using.  I gave him the info and he told me that that CC had been stolen about 5-6 mos ago and was cancelled.  He did not want to use Cognito to update so I directed him to Member Portal I will monitor to see if it was updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 12:52:39', '2021-08-23 12:52:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611086', 'Lucas Zielasko', NULL, 'Member''s 9/21 pmt declined 1st notice sent - 8/23 8/27- reran pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 12:50:47', '2021-08-27 10:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, 'Finally received cancellation request from this member.  I refunded 9/1 pmt &amp; cancelled in Admon 123 &amp; notified Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 12:31:01', '2021-08-23 12:31:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066645001', 'Frank Magourilos', NULL, 'member''s 9/21 pmt declined 1st notice sent - 8/23  8/24-member called in and said that her CC was stolen so she needs to update her info.  I resent letter so she can get link to update.  I finally got the form I will update &amp; retry the pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 11:22:04', '2021-08-24 12:56:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366134', 'Janell Vennard', NULL, 'Member''s 9/21 pmt declined 1st notice sent - 8/23  8/24 -member updated pmt info I will retry', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 11:17:19', '2021-08-24 07:56:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366095', 'Tim Dye', NULL, 'Member''s 9/21 pmt declined - 1st notice sent 8/23 2nd notice sent -8/27', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 11:12:44', '2021-08-27 10:53:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705055', 'Douglas Whitney', NULL, 'Member''s 9/21 pmt declined - 1st notice sent - 8/23  8/24 - member submitted new pmt info I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 11:01:04', '2021-08-24 07:48:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074056008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Sarah called with questions for Redirect regarding her colonoscopy that is coming up. I transferred her to Redirect so that she can get the appropriate guidance for her payment for her colonoscopy. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-23 10:57:35', '2021-08-23 10:57:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074043100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656055', 'Ronald Ivanick', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book welcome call after his start date of September 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-23 10:33:37', '2021-08-23 10:33:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, 'Member''s 9/21 pmt declined - 1st notice sent 8/23 8/24 - member submitted new pmt info I will update &amp; rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 10:32:51', '2021-08-24 08:02:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068311', 'Jessica Bates', NULL, 'Response from Kyle asked if he could update his email.  I will update in CRM &amp; Admin 123 &amp; Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 10:18:33', '2021-08-23 10:18:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074056003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060856035', 'Maia Toll', NULL, 'Maia called regarding an ENT visit. I explained to her that she needs to present herself as a cash pay patient, ask for the best cash discount pricing, and collect her superbills in case this goes above her $1000 IUA. Maia was initially confused because she had called Zion to ask her questions and was told by a Zion rep that she had to have Zion negotiate her price before going to the ENT. I confirmed with Kelly Anne that this is not correct and that the only time Zion should negotiate pricing is if it is a high cost surgery/procedure. Maia was very pleased with the answers she received and will give us another call if she has any further questions. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-23 10:10:14', '2021-08-23 10:10:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074043045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366069', 'Natasha Pledger', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule her welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-23 09:03:55', '2021-08-23 09:03:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072553023', 'Eldon LiaBraaten', NULL, 'After the Initial pmt went through, the 1st pmt declined 1st notice sent 8/23.  Member submitted new pmt info retried pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 08:34:21', '2021-08-23 14:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228151', 'Jennifer Wright', NULL, 'Member''s 9/21 payment declined 1st notice sent - 8/23 8/24-member emailed me to retry pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 08:29:14', '2021-08-24 12:51:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074049003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, 'Member''s 9/21 pmt declined 1st notice sent - 8/23 Member submitted updated CC info. I will retry.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 08:24:33', '2021-08-23 14:36:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074043003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071646064', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Amy. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-23 07:51:43', '2021-08-23 07:51:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074039008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002142', 'Leonard Ott', NULL, 'sent an email asking to reschedule welcome call on or after Sept 1. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-23 07:35:44', '2021-08-23 07:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074039003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887119', 'Shefali Bhimani', NULL, 'sent email asking to reschedule their Welcome Call on or after their membership start date. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-23 07:26:56', '2021-08-23 07:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074037003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068311', 'Jessica Bates', NULL, 'Received VM from Kyle that they had been double billed in the 9/21 billing.  I looked into it and they were billed twice for the Zion portion of their plan.  I refunded and will explain via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-23 07:20:31', '2021-08-23 07:20:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074033003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, '08.23.21:  Karl called.  Said he didn''t receive the link to the cancellation form yet but he did find the one that was sent to him previously.  I told him he is past the deadline to cancel but to fill it out, send it to Patti and I''ll see if she can refund him.  I called Patti - she said she received his cancellation form and will refund him.  I emailed Karl to let him know that.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-08-23 07:14:08', '2021-08-23 07:14:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074005048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061283', 'Diane Beltran', NULL, 'Diane called.  Has a COVID (?) cough and wanted to know how to handle things.  We went over all sorts of things:  sent her the setup a Welcome Call template.  Sent her an invitation to CirrusMD.  Sent her the PHCS Network template.  She''s going to try calling CirrusMD first and go from there.  Knows how to handle ''cash-pay'',  Will call if she needs to learn how to submit to Zion for needs > her $2500 IUA.  May look at changing IUA to 1k in the future.  She will be moving to OH & will let us know once they have a new address & banking info.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-20 18:20:54', '2021-08-20 18:22:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074005043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271176', 'Ted Williams', NULL, 'Ted called w/Wendy [303-430-2703] from Rcky Mtn Treatment Cntr (a Lakewood, CO cancer cntr) on the line.  She''s the center''s/doctor''s financial counselor.  She had questions on his ''insurance''.  So, we went over Ted''s ''need'' and Sedera.  She seemed to understand, but needs to go to her supervisors to see how they handle this situation.  I let her know he sb considered a ''cash pay'' pt w/invoices sent to him.  He then submits them to Sedera, who will pay him, and he pays them.  I let her know he has an appt next week w/his Sedera ''Need'' Advisor and at that point, he''ll know more about what he still needs to go through (ie: possibly a 2nd opinion?).

Ted''s Sedera Need #: 28004 = this issue.  He mentioned so far he''s at ~94k+ and he has already paid his 2500 IUA.  (in about the last 7 weeks).    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-20 16:48:57', '2021-08-20 16:48:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000074005038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'Jim called.  He had questions on his knee issues, but it sounds like a pre-existing condition!  I sent him some of the guidelines on pre-x from Zion''s Memb Guidelines and he''s going to touch base with Wendy Scipione since she''s his advisor.  [Note: it sounds like Jim was maybe bouncing around in the phone system?   He said it rang 25 times on his end and I answered on the 3rd ring here.  He was nice about it, but did want us to know. ]   CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-20 16:13:26', '2021-08-20 16:13:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073998027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '8-20-21 Jim called bc he just talked to Cari about a knee issue. He''s been on a medication off and on for past year or so. He believes he mentioned it to me or to someone, but I have no record of it in my handwritten notes or here. He didn''t include it on his application either. He thinks perhaps it was within the 2 weeks that it was feeling good and also assumed since he was off the meds at that time, he was all set. But, it is pre-x very clearly. He can''t get onto Fed Exchange now either.  He can for Jan. 1st. I told him he can still get meds priced through Concierge and diagnostic care at best price by calling Concierge for local pricing on MRI''s, CT Scans, etc. He has no idea what he''ll need for the knee. Maybe it won''t need surgery, but it''s been bothering him more consistently now and thinks it might be meniscus tear.  I told him we could pre-negotiate that rate and he pay a bundled fee like my client where the Reference based price was $24K and brought down to $9000.  He''s bummed but realizes it''s still wise to keep his membership in case anything else happens.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-20 16:04:19', '2021-08-20 16:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073977033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820044', 'Kathryn Schneider', NULL, 'Kathryn called for help getting into her portal to upload her self- employment information.  I stayed on the line with her until she was clear on what she needed to do. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-20 15:06:31', '2021-08-20 15:06:31'),
