  ('zcrm_1579374000074005018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893122', 'Phillip Haddad', NULL, 'Philip called.  He called Planstin asking about preventative for his vision &amp; was told it''s something he can add to his coverage at $14/mo for $150 towards an eye exam &amp; $150 towards contacts, but that he''d have to go thru MPB.  I told him I''ll check on that &amp; get back to him.  He''s also going to touch base with Charles (his advisor) upon my suggestion because he may have a good option for him.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-20 14:33:27', '2021-08-20 14:33:27'),
