  ('zcrm_1579374000073998019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, '8-20-21 Kyle wants to split family off of Sedera to Zion to get back their annual wellness visits. Rod gave me permission to do so. Patti realized we will need to move Jennifer to be the primary member. If possible then we can move forward with Klye and kids joining SECURE. He''s self-employed. He really wants access to the annual wellness visits again for the kids.  He''s not at the age of needing colonoscopy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-20 13:21:58', '2021-08-20 13:22:26'),
