  ('zcrm_1579374000073921003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, '08.19,21  Called Karl.  He is turning 65 in September, needs to terminate membership.  Had tests done for cardiovascular issues around July 24, 2021.  Paid his $1000 IUA.  Submitted his Need to Zion around July 25th.  Waiting to hear from Zion in terms of all bills paid.  Said he didn''t see the  Cancellation link that Patti sent him.  Told him I would have her send it again to him and he needs to complete it and submit it for proper cancellation process.  Said he would do so.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-08-19 10:57:30', '2021-08-19 10:57:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073889008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, 'Joan spoke to member about filling out the cancellation form, he did not remember receiving it.  He asked to have it resent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-19 10:54:07', '2021-08-19 10:54:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073911008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887142', 'Jacob Ramsden', NULL, '8-19-21 Jacob 42, lives between Aspen, CO, WA and CA. Residency was in WA last year due to rental properties but will likely be on CO most often this year. He will not claim residency in CA. He does W2, 1099 work and has rental properties. He''s healthy, no tobacco, no meds, no wellness, not familiar with HSA. But, interested in upgrading to SECURE at some point. CARE+ is best for now since he doesn''t do his annual wellness visits. CARE+ $1000/$275 and wants Sept 1st start date. We will connect at 1:00 to have him enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-19 10:09:45', '2021-08-19 13:35:28'),
