  ('zcrm_1579374000073854022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820131', 'Danielle Lynn', NULL, '8-18-21 Danielle just enrolled for her and 2 kids EC $1000/$390 CARE+. Will pay for wellness on own and understands that will not be reimbursed, ie. it''s their expense. She''s choosing to pay for one full year with checks (1 check from kids father for 60% and 1 check from her for 40%) paid for Sept. 1st 2021-Aug. 31st 2022. John will create a List Bill from Admin123 and email it to her to make payment of $4680.  She knows the $125 will be charged immediately via her ACH bank draft. She chose to forego the HMA for now. Not interested.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-18 11:47:30', '2021-08-18 11:47:30'),
