  ('zcrm_1579374000073854008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, '8-18-21 Fell asleep on the couch about 10 days ago and woke up with crazy pain in his neck which is now moving down to his leg.  He''s freaking out a bit and needs to have it looked at. He understands he''s responsible for the first $2500 and will go in as self-pay. He''s going to Steadman''s asap.  I called him back and asked if he had the covid injection and he said yes. He got the 2nd one on Aug. 24th. He had thought maybe this had to do with the shot but a retired dr. friend told him no. His Dr. friend said it could be a bulging disc or something unrelated to the shot. He didn''t want the shot and only took it bc everyone pressure him to do so. He didn''t want it. He''s calling Steadman''s now. He''s NEVER had an issue, never used this membership and just needed a little coaching as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-18 10:08:29', '2021-08-18 10:21:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073854003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, '8-18-21 Melissa called bc she got a bill for her wellness visit bc Planstin says it''s out of network but she chose the doctor purely bc it was in network. I told her to call Planstin directly. She also wants helps with submitting her new for some pre-x. She''s in the Bridge plan with immediate pre-x up to $25K. I will reach out to Concierge to send her instructions to complete the Need. All communications via vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-18 09:48:32', '2021-08-18 09:48:32'),
