  ('zcrm_1579374000073792091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271176', 'Ted Williams', NULL, 'Ted called.  He finally rec''d a diagnosis today (I think he said a form of melanoma inside his chest/lung?)!  He wants to get his bills submitted and wondered if there''s a way to do it manually (mail the info in).  I went to watch the video link in our ''Submitting a need to Sedera'' template & the link is no longer viable. I let Kelly Anne know and included the new link from Sedera''s site.  I don''t see a manual option, so I also asked her about that.  Ted will call me Thursday or Friday to see what I''ve learned.  Sent him the new instructional video link in case he can figure out how to submit via computer.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-17 17:25:00', '2021-08-17 17:33:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073802003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, '8-17-21 Hi Wendy-

