  ('zcrm_1579374000073772108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068229', 'Sharon Heiney', NULL, 'Sharon called regarding telemed and I explained that she has CirrusMD. I sent Sharon the CirrusMD invitation, explained how CirrusMD works, and explained to her how to download the app. Sharon was a happy camper! -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-17 14:59:47', '2021-08-17 14:59:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073772103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, 'Ilan called in regarding 2 car accidents he had in 2018 that were not of his doing. He has proceeded with lawyers in the cases for the accidents and was wondering what the guidelines say about getting Zion to pay for the continuous therapy he needs until the cases are settled. I explained to Ilan that he would have to speak with Zion to get his answer. I transferred Ilan to Zion. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-17 14:48:42', '2021-08-17 14:48:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073772098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071572039', 'Mara Simoneau', NULL, 'missed welcome call- left a detailed vm and sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-17 14:42:42', '2021-08-17 14:42:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073772093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656095', 'Stacey Roosevelt', NULL, 'Stacey called because she had received and email from us stating that she needed to give proof of self employment- but she is not self employed.  I told her that she might want to consider speaking to Misty about the Care Plus plan.  She told me that she has Misty''s phone number and will call her right away.  I will let Patti know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-17 14:32:51', '2021-08-17 14:32:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073772088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'Brittney called in regarding needing to find a dermatologist and ENT specialist in her 33133 zip code. I emailed Brittney with both lists and explained the cash paying customer procedure in the email. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-17 13:49:04', '2021-08-17 13:49:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073791044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, 'I contacted Leslie at the request of Redirect.  She had already received a call from Sedera.  She was a bit unclear on a yearly visit to monitor a Pre-Ex Condition.  She considers that Preventative, I told her that this would not be Preventative as she was monitoring a existing condition.  I told her that there are certain things that the Preventative would cover and noting else.  We agreed to disagree.  She also asked about whether Redirect would cover the Meningitis vaccine, I told her that that would be a question for Redirect.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-17 13:24:13', '2021-08-17 13:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073791039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'Michelle emailed me and told me that her and her daughters experienced a traumatic event and were in need of some counseling.  I contacted her and stepped her through getting on the  MSAEP site.  Let her know that there was alot of good materials there and to call for assistance.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-17 12:30:06', '2021-08-17 12:30:06'),
