  ('zcrm_1579374000073722003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '8-16-21 "As an FYI, I still have zero pre-existing conditions and am on no medication other than an occasional Advil/Aspirin.  The one gray area is my ER visit in February 2021 for stomach bleeding.  I went through a course of Prilosec for 30 days and have had zero recurring problems.  It really makes no sense to me whatsoever as this is the only similar issue I have experienced in my life.

