Talking with him on Wed. Likely can''t convert bc of stomach issues until it''s been past 24 months.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-16 14:40:11', '2021-08-16 14:40:11'),
