  ('zcrm_1579374000073642013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547361', 'Micah Goldbaum', NULL, 'MIcah called for help with his bowel prep prescription- it turns out that the coupon could only save him about $7- he declined the coupon.  He said that he is unsure whether this will be a screening or a diagnostic colonoscopy but that if it turns out to be screening he will submit the bowel prep script for reimbursement. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-16 09:11:15', '2021-08-16 09:11:15'),
