  ('zcrm_1579374000073600033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '8-13-21 Email gdh25@comcast.net Phone 3034420511 Account # 3800308650 Plan Name Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 2000 Plan ID 76680CO0220025-01.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-13 14:14:08', '2021-08-13 14:14:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073556036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816206', 'Josephine Guarneros', NULL, 'Per Kelly F I have requested of Zion to resend members Zion cards to her.  Received response that they will send over right away.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-13 13:30:20', '2021-08-13 13:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073600025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, '8-13-21 Yolanda is not aging into Medicare per the notes above. She had a brain bleed last Aug. and Sedera is calling it a pre-x. Something was discovered 5 years ago and she was advised to take aspirin for it I believe. So, considering it pre-x. But, her doctor is willing to write a letter stating it was not pre-x. If they stick to their guns that''s it''s pre-x she wants to get on traditional insurance. I just remembered open enrollment is done this weekend! I will call her back. She wants to know if she removes herself from Sedera and if can move Joe to the primary member. He CAN''T re-enroll bc Sedera no longer operates in WA. He also has some open need now too it sounds like.  Also, if she switches it will be through her company''s open enrollment and possibly for Oct. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-13 13:04:44', '2021-08-13 13:12:43'),
