  ('zcrm_1579374000073571003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033577031', 'Margaret Thoreson', 'Member can not get in touch with RCI', 'Member called to find out how to have RCI pay her annual and mammogram visits.  She had repeatedly attempted to call the 800 and no one has answered.  She attempted to email them to find out who was in network and got no response.  She now has her preventative bill that she paid for as well as her mammogram that needs to be paid.

