  ('zcrm_1579374000073556008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033577031', 'Margaret Thoreson', NULL, 'Member called in with issues that Michele is addressing.  Member said that she does not have an RCI card.  I will email her copy and order her a new card.  I sent out PDF copy via email and ordered hard cards.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-13 08:32:13', '2021-08-13 08:39:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073556003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072869001', 'Julie Basque', NULL, 'After being on vacation member contacted me with son Devon''s SS#.  I added to Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-13 07:56:33', '2021-08-13 07:56:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073541018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, 'Rob called.  He''s trying to get his colonoscopy done and struggling to find places in his area.  He''s pretty remote, but I sent him a list that includes some nearer him as well as those on the Front Range (he''s on the Wstrn Slope of CO) because of the drastic price differences.  He''s going to look at the options.  We also went over screening vs diagnostic on his plan and how that could change billing and get into his 1k IUA.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-12 17:26:00', '2021-08-12 17:26:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073524041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555128', 'Raphael Joly', NULL, '8-12-21 Nathalie called to enroll her son. She completed app for SECURE and will make payment via ACH bank draft. I gave her $100 savings since it''s same family. She was having a fit that he hadn''t enrolled yet. ;-)  She was happy to complete the process and pay for it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-12 16:51:36', '2021-08-12 16:51:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073524036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '8-12-21 Jennifer realized her capital gains from a property sale is $282K according to her accountant. So, they do NOT qualify for a subsidy in 2021. That changes the equation. They might stay put until open enrollment. They were thinking of keeping daughter Ella on Kaiser and removing rest of family to get Anthem to access Anschutz to deal with memory problems for husband. Ella gets most of her care done with Anthem through CU and rest done through Kaiser. So, she''s relunctant to remove any of their current coverages for daughter Ella. They may wait until Open Enrollment to make any changes now knowing full cost of Anthem will be $2K plus cost of Ella as single member of Kaiser. She''ll let me know.

Notes from her email - "okay.

I have a feeling we are not going to be in a lower bracket tax this year.

As I took over financial aspects, i got a financial planner. They suggested selling stock to reinvest to diversify. We sold $282.680.15. That is capital gains. We reinvested the money, except what I am paying in quarterly taxes - still shows up as income i think.

Gregg’s pension is $32,987.88.

I fired the financial planner, and have a new one. We will have no capital gains in 2022. Just gregg’s pension.

Let me know what you think when you get off the phone.

Jennifer"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-12 16:49:47', '2021-08-12 16:53:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073541013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007902007', 'Natalie Wood', NULL, 'Natalie sent an e-mail that Wendy then fwd''d the request to me.  She wanted to know how to submit her bills to Zion.  Initially, i just sent the template on how to submit a need to Zion.  Then got to thinking, I wasn''t sure if the bills were for a need, preventative, or?  So I sent her a follow-up e-mail asking just that.  I also let her know if it is for a need through Zion that will go over her IUA, she does have the correct information in my previous e-mail.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-12 16:04:12', '2021-08-12 16:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073541008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480088', 'Sheila Finch-Manzagol', NULL, 'Sheila called.  She needs to change her payment info.  Sent her the template with the Cognito form link in it.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-12 15:54:20', '2021-08-12 15:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073524023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '8-12-21 Jennifer is turning 60 in Oct and Gregg turning 64 in Aug. Family of 4. But, son and daughter both on CU plan with Anthem. Husband is having memory issues. They are both retired. Pension is about $32K yr. They''ve been on Kaiser and they want better care and to be able to go to CU Anschutz in Denver and see Dr. Brice McConnell. Anthem is the only one that shows up in the network. BUT, when I add medications it then says Dr. McConnell is not in the network. I told her to call them and make 100% certain that they will accept the C4 HMO and also make sure their Boulder zip code doesn''t preclude them from remaining in-network. She will call them and figure out how to log into her C4 account and let me know when she''s ready to proceed this afternoon. Also husband takes Donepezil and Sertraline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-12 14:48:50', '2021-08-12 14:53:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073541003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366121', 'Brian Trebus', NULL, 'Brian called.  He was curious about what his HSA account would cover (would it help with his dental bill).  I sent him the HSA site template.  Together we looked it up &amp; it states ''Dental Treatment'' is qualified.  He may call his advisor Jill to discuss or may just pay the bill.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-12 14:48:04', '2021-08-12 14:48:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073498013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073495039', 'Michelle McCullough', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-12 12:57:14', '2021-08-12 12:57:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073524018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, 'Melisa called in regarding her QR life code. She had no idea what is was so I explained this to her, she also had some questions for Planstin and asked for me to transfer her, which I did. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-12 12:29:46', '2021-08-12 12:29:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073498008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406092', 'Pratik Patil', NULL, 'Member called to ask some questions about billing.  He has a new job that offers Health Insurance .  He asked if he wants to return later could he re-enroll.  I advised he could but we do not offer the same plan that he now has and that he would have to be an Ind Contractor to be eligible for Preventative.  I will send him out Cancellation Link and he was advised of the deadline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-12 12:24:58', '2021-08-12 12:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073524013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406092', 'Pratik Patil', NULL, 'Pratik called to get his payment information, which I do not have access to. He was also insistent that he has access to a member portal to access specific information, which I tried to explain that there is not any pertinent information in the member portal (which he does NOT have access to). He asked for his payment information again and I transferred him to Patti for this information. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-12 12:18:51', '2021-08-12 12:18:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073522008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992022', 'Diana Russ', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-12 09:37:38', '2021-08-12 09:37:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073524003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779416', 'Christine Heinritz', NULL, 'Christine called regarding whether she should go to an urgent care or ER. I explained that if she went to either one she would present herself as a cash pay patient and to collect the superbills in case this goes over her $2500 IUA. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-12 09:16:45', '2021-08-12 09:16:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073522003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073109042', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule her welcome call after her start date of September 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-12 08:26:24', '2021-08-12 08:26:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073498003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066507053', 'Christian Knapp', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Zion &amp; billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-12 06:56:53', '2021-08-12 06:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073471029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '8-11-21 Sam called a bit nervous because he had an ER visit and was told he doesn''t have any benefits. I left an vm explaining that he is protected and needs to ask for self-pay/cash pay discount and pay his portion of $1000 only and then call Concierge for assistance. He can call me tomorrow too, if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-11 17:12:54', '2021-08-11 17:12:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073471024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '8-11-21 Figge paid for 10 sessions of PT up front to get discount for his wrist and back PT split at 4 for wrist and 6 for back. But, he''s trying to figure out how to submit it to Sedera. He''s working with Maddie. I told him she will need to help him with that since it''s a unique scenario and may need to be done manually due to how their system functions. He will do so and is feeling better. He was nervous since he paid already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-11 17:08:20', '2021-08-11 17:08:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073471019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073472001', 'Madeleine Blanchard Cupolo', NULL, 'See rest of notes from other account.

