  ('zcrm_1579374000073471014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049242001', 'Madeleine Blanchard Cupolo', NULL, '8-11-21 We had Karen with Bright Health help us to get her enrollment through successfully for Silver $0 Direct for $208.92 and made sure Children''s Hospital was in-network. Karen confirmed but I also told Sondra to double check with Children''s Hospital that the doctors they want to see accept Bright Health. I believe it should be fine. They need to use neurology and possibly psychiatric care.  She was still nice even though getting frustrated. We both laughed it off at the end. She''ll let me know if she runs into any problems. Paid with cc and set up auto pay for future.  This is for daughter Madeleine.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-11 16:51:40', '2021-08-11 16:51:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073449018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066173', 'Sherry Gaskins', NULL, 'Sherry called.  She received Jennifer''s e-mail on submitting a need, but couldn''t find her member #.  She has a Planstin Card(?), but no MEC (maybe they just sent the wrong card)?  I got her in touch with Zion since they were still open and could give her the number immediately.  She''s also going to request they send her Zion card so she''ll have her member # in the future.  I told her if she has any problems with either to let me know, but I didn''t hear back so I think she''s all set.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-11 16:50:02', '2021-08-11 16:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073471003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, '8-11-21 We had Karen with Bright Health help us to get her enrollment through successfully for Silver $0 Direct for $208.92 and made sure Children''s Hospital was in-network. Karen confirmed but I also told Sondra to double check with Children''s Hospital that the doctors they want to see accept Bright Health. I believe it should be fine. They need to use neurology and possibly psychiatric care.  She was still nice even though getting frustrated. We both laughed it off at the end. She''ll let me know if she runs into any problems. Paid with cc and set up auto pay for future.  This is for daughter Madeleine.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-11 16:50:01', '2021-08-11 16:51:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073458043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066507053', 'Christian Knapp', 'Cancellation Request', 'Member has job that will be paying for benefits.  Member was emailed cancellation form to be returned by the 20th.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-08-11 13:58:07', '2021-08-11 13:58:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073458038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330254', 'Debra Rice', 'Colonoscopy Information', 'Member called to find out if the Dr she wanted to see was in Network.  We both looked in the PHCS network for Planstin and could not find a Gastro Dr in her area.  Member was transferred to Planstin to obtain further information.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-08-11 13:43:20', '2021-08-11 13:43:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073458033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070506001', 'Jacqueline Haig', 'Cancellation Request', 'Member wants to cancel since she has paid benefits through employer.  Member was emailed Cancellation form.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-08-11 13:12:42', '2021-08-11 13:12:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073435036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212091', 'Michelle Schusterman', NULL, 'Left 2nd VM for SS#', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-11 12:51:34', '2021-08-11 12:51:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073458017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, 'MSEAP called to verify that Daniel was listed as a member.  Date of Birth was confirmed as well as spouse status.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-08-11 12:15:44', '2021-08-11 12:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073449013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070161036', 'Bigembe Rugomoka', NULL, 'Bigembe called and said he wanted to set up a Dentist appointment. Both me and Michele let him know that is not a covered expense at this time and to reach out to Jane his Advisor about the new dental plan we will soon be providing to members. But as of right now it will be a full out of pocket expense. Provided him with Jane''s phone number to discuss further. All set. -KF/MR', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-08-11 12:03:17', '2021-08-11 12:03:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073449008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816206', 'Josephine Guarneros', NULL, 'Josephine called in and stated that CirrusMD has suggested for her to find a Dermatologist in her area. I told her I would be more than happy to pull up a list for her in her area. I let her know that I will do that and as well look up 3 providers from that list and look up their Healthgrades profile so she can become a little more comfortable with brand-new provider. She was thrilled that I would do that to her. I explained to her the process about how it is out of pocket up to her IUA of $1000 and anything more than that submit to Zion. I let her know I would send her an email as well that explains how to submit bills to Zion if needed with their contact info. She was very appreciative for all the help. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-08-11 12:01:37', '2021-08-11 12:01:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073458012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070161036', 'Bigembe Rugomoka', 'Would like a dentist', 'Wanted to know if there was a dentist on his plan.  I told him this plan does not have a dental plan.  I recommended he call Jane, his advisor, to see if she could help him out with this.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-08-11 11:53:41', '2021-08-11 11:53:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073429008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370117', 'James Batch', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly F for another QR Life code card for his wife she threw in garbage by accident. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-11 11:23:13', '2021-08-11 11:23:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073435031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755321', 'Gerald Satava', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Zion &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-11 10:06:15', '2021-08-11 10:06:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073435023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442408', 'Jacquelynn Mariest', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel billing &amp; Zion.  Member received free insurance thru gvt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-11 09:59:25', '2021-08-11 10:03:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073449003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921229', 'Jared Allomong', NULL, 'Jared called and said that he had his annual wellness visit and made sure the provider was in Planstin''s network and handed them his Planstin card and he just got the full bill in the mail and asked what to do. I told him that he did everything correctly and to just give Planstin a call and let them know his provider billed him by accident and that Planstin will most likely just have him scan his bill over to them and they will take care of it. He is calling Planstin now. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-08-11 09:51:14', '2021-08-11 09:51:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073431008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755321', 'Gerald Satava', NULL, 'Member called to cancel, sent cancelation link email to Gerald. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-11 09:33:18', '2021-08-11 09:33:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073435018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073437039', 'Karyn Griffin', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-11 09:12:51', '2021-08-11 09:12:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073435013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073437027', 'Terry Fuller', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-11 09:04:27', '2021-08-11 09:04:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073435008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659139', 'Terry Fuller', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; billing.  Member re-enrolling in the Secure plan', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-11 08:49:39', '2021-08-11 08:49:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073435003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781071', 'Dante Ali', NULL, 'I followed up w/Zion prior to calling member.  He is not cancelled, they were unable to tell me why he was told that.  Member also has procedure &amp; Colonoscopy that are outstanding.  From what he told me Colonoscopy was most likely coded as diagnostic due to provider ordering it.  I advised in that case it would be considered a need and he would be responsible for his IUA.  I directed him back to Zion for further direction.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-11 08:42:42', '2021-08-11 08:42:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073431003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781071', 'Dante Ali', NULL, 'Member called stating that he had a procedure done and just received the outstanding bill. When he spoke with CC from Zion Health she told him that his membership had started and ended on the same day. I transferred him to Patti so that she could look into this for him. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-11 08:04:37', '2021-08-11 08:04:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073429003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072038140', 'Barbara Adkins', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-11 07:53:47', '2021-08-11 07:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073409008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'Josh  (& his Dad doing the driving on the call), called.  Josh is having some weird symptoms, so they are going to start by calling CirrusMD for Josh.  Josh was downloading the CirrusMD app and going to try signing in, registering, or requesting an invite.  Originally, Dad was asking about network of doctors, etc., but as we were working on CirrusMD, it was as if they couldn''t get off the phone fast enough (sounded like they were so focused on getting that setup they couldn''t do anything more).  They''ll call back if they need further assistance.    CA

They called back.  No computer, trying to do everything on the phone & couldn''t see everything.  I helped them get their account setup so they could contact CirrusMD.  He was on w/them as we got off.  tt Dad re: no network, cash pay, & instructions if goes over 1k.  Again, they couldn''t get off the phone quickly enough.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-10 17:06:47', '2021-08-10 17:24:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073409003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675217', 'Andrea Davis', NULL, 'Andrea called.  She hadn''t received Jennifer''s e-mails, so I cut &amp; pasted the originals and sent them from my Outlook (those she''s receiving).  I also sent the PHCS Search template for her convenience, but we went over details on how best to utilize the Planstin Card, confirming the doctor/facility is in PHCS Network, etc.     CA

It looks like the e-mail I sent from this system bounced even though using the same e-mail address, she''s receiving them from Outlook.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-10 16:32:45', '2021-08-10 17:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073381013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '8-10-21 To Patti to cancel, "Hi

I want to cancel my Sedera membership w/ my last day being. Aug. 31st, 2021.

I have not been happy w/ my coverage (or rather lack thereof) which is why I am canceling. Also, to not cover pre-existing conditions is to me to not care for the well-being of each other.

Please let me know what needs to happen from here and that this was received.

Thank you."

I left Merryl a vm to see if I can resolve her frustrations or find a new option for her. Although she''s out until Aug. 17th which is after the deadline for traditional insurance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-10 16:05:45', '2021-08-10 16:05:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073381008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044105', 'Michael Marmor', NULL, '8-10-21 "Thanks, Wendy. My employer pays the full cost of coverage, which is hard to beat!

I just completed the cancellation form. Please let me know if there are any other steps needed to cancel and ensure I will not be billed in the next billing cycle.

Thanks,

Michael"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-10 14:45:29', '2021-08-10 14:45:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073374013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', 'Questions about Prescription Plan', 'An email was sent asking if we had changed our prescription plan.  Member picked up medication for her daughter from the pharmacy and they told her that the daughter was in a National Data Base with a prescription plan and that it would cost quite a bit lower than what she was paying.

Member was informed that we had not changed our plans and was recommended to reach out to the pharmacy to get additional details.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-08-10 14:31:38', '2021-08-10 14:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073381003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '8-10-21 Stephanie has a hysterectomy scheduled very soon due to issues from the past few years. So, they are NOT in a position to make a change at this time.  Plus they dropped their son so their price isn''t terrible. They will stay put until they are 100% confident Stephanie and free and clear of any possible future problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-10 14:16:41', '2021-08-10 14:16:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073374008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024193035', 'Justin Brogdon', NULL, 'After an Commission Audit request from Wiley Long''s office, we needed to notate that Justin Brogdon left Wiley Long''s association in November 2020.  Any new business after this date will be paid directly to and not Wiley Long.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-08-10 13:56:14', '2021-08-10 13:56:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073374003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045454012', 'Laura Hanssen', NULL, '8-10-21 Even if earn $180K they will still receive a $728 APTC. She ok paying the difference back if they wind up making that much when they pay their taxes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-10 13:55:58', '2021-08-10 13:55:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073360003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370104', 'Douglas Dester', NULL, 'Denise called in with issues logging into HCBB again. I walker her through the login process and she is good to go. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-10 13:31:28', '2021-08-10 13:31:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073331013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071780031', 'Kora Gilbert', NULL, 'Drew called regarding marriage counseling and if it is a shareable need. I explained to him that this is not a shareable need and would be an out of pocket expense. I also sent Kora and Drew a new welcome call scheduler. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-10 12:27:12', '2021-08-10 12:27:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073300023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044105', 'Michael Marmor', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will submit to Sedera &amp; cancel billing.  Member deleted in Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-10 11:47:50', '2021-08-10 11:56:36');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000073351003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820131', 'Danielle Lynn', NULL, '8-10-21 Danielle is 35, single mom with 2 kids ages 4 and 6 but both having Birthdays soon.  She was previously on Medicaid but thinks she will earn about $80K unexpectedly this year as self employed. They are all healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds.  She does annual wellness for kids and not so often for herself. She''s happy to pay cash for their wellness visits. She was with LHS long ago and then One Share but never used either of them. We discussed CARE+ $1000/$390 for Sept. 1st start date. Also interested in HMA for dental and other medical if needed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-10 11:13:17', '2021-08-10 11:13:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073300018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel with Zion &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-10 09:19:45', '2021-08-10 09:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073331008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070912052', 'Anna Edwards', NULL, 'Sent Anna another welcome call scheduler via email per her request. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-10 09:10:19', '2021-08-10 09:10:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073300013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, 'Member called in and requested cancellation.  I will send her the link to the form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-10 09:06:25', '2021-08-10 09:06:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073331003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, 'Member called to cancel, transferred her to Patti since she had already sent in her cancelation notice but her account is still active. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-10 09:04:07', '2021-08-10 09:04:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073300008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047612029', 'Marla Jacobsen-Horn', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-10 07:41:33', '2021-08-10 07:41:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073300003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353075', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will process &amp; cancel in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-10 07:27:32', '2021-08-10 07:27:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030509001', 'Mark Murphy', NULL, '8-9-21 Wendy,

What is the status of Regional Care, Inc. as a provider of ACA-required benefits for my plan? I had a screening colonoscopy last fall and was able to contact them at the time to obtain coverage for most of the costs of the procedure, however they denied coverage for the anesthesia. I contacted them again in early March and was able to talk to a person who acknowledged the anesthesia should be covered and said the claim would be reviewed again and I should receive an adjusted EOB in 14-21 days. A month went by with no adjusted EOB, so I contacted them again. I was told they were running behind on processing claims and that my claim adjustment was still in process. Another month went by with no adjusted EOB so in mid-May I tried calling in again, 3 different times. Each time a message said no reps were available so each time I left a message but I have never received a callback or an adjusted EOB. Are they still in business?

Mark Murphy
ID #MPWRBEN000266-01

Hi Mark,

Thanks for sharing this with me. I just learned that our contact Jennifer Chasteen left RCI in mid-July. That might be why you haven''t received proper responses. Our new contact is Heather Neideffer who is a Claims Specialist and helps with billing issues. Her contact information is 800-795-7772 ext. 470 / heather.neideffer@regionalcare.com.

Give Heather a call and hopefully she can help you once and for all!  Please let me know if you need further assistance.

Thanks,', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-09 15:48:13', '2021-08-09 15:48:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049242001', 'Madeleine Blanchard Cupolo', NULL, '8-9-21 We tried to buy the $0 Deductible Silver Bright Health but Madeleine was already in the Bright Health system. So, I had to call them. Then Jeff made sure her old account was under my name as Agent. Now we will wait 24-48 to be able to Add Coverage under the Available Actions that I can see when I click on her Old plan details from 2/2019.  Under Available Actions it will say Add Coverage and we can proceed that way. We have until the 15th. 
I will check the account on Wednesday to see if we can proceed. If so, I''ll email it to her to finish. She will email me when complete or call me if has questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-09 15:31:08', '2021-08-09 15:31:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, '8-9-21 We tried to buy the $0 Deductible Silver Bright Health but Madeleine was already in the Bright Health system. So, I had to call them. Then Jeff made sure her old account was under my name as Agent. Now we will wait 24-48 to be able to Add Coverage under the Available Actions that I can see when I click on her Old plan details from 2/2019.  Under Available Actions it will say Add Coverage and we can proceed that way. We have until the 15th. 
I will check the account on Wednesday to see if we can proceed. If so, I''ll email it to her to finish. She will email me when complete or call me if has questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-09 15:26:43', '2021-08-09 15:30:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007887007', 'Cristina Conklin', NULL, '8-9-21 Left vm for Cristina to make her payment ASAP so she doesn''t lose her coverage. Forwarded note from Cigna.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-09 14:28:49', '2021-08-09 14:28:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073214043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, 'I determined that cancellation date entered above is most likely her HES cancellation date that was not removed.  I will remove.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-09 13:36:33', '2021-08-09 13:36:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073214038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045806150', 'Dwain Rosse', NULL, 'Member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-09 13:18:54', '2021-08-09 13:18:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073214033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212119', 'Veronica Betteo-Amdall', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-09 13:14:36', '2021-08-09 13:14:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069438001', 'Beth Blacker', NULL, '8-9-21 I left vm for her to get her payment sorted out with Cigna ASAP bc it''s past due. I forwarded the email as well from Cigna.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-09 12:24:20', '2021-08-09 12:24:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353075', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '8-9-21 Hi Wendy,
I need to cancel our membership with Zion & Planstin MEC.
My husband went direct with Medtronic starting 7/26/21.  I just got their benefits package this week and it''s great, so I signed up with them.  
Coverage with them apparently starts on the 1st date of employment.  So, I guess we really didn''t need to be covered with Zion for August.  If we cancel now, are we reimbursed for the days we are not on it?
Please let me know the process of what I need to do to cancel.
I''m sure you will hear back from me again in about 2 years.  As that''s when Derek says he is going to retire!
Thanks for your help,
Michele', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-09 12:15:44', '2021-08-09 12:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, '8-9-21 Susan injured both knees this past year or so. Therefore, she will stay with Sedera. She''s fine with the increased monthly rate of $322. No need to put her at risk with pre-x clause.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-09 12:06:50', '2021-08-09 12:06:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, 'Luther called to speak with Patti B. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-09 12:03:46', '2021-08-09 12:03:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073214028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212091', 'Michelle Schusterman', NULL, 'I called member and left VM to ask about the following items 1) no input of SS# 2) came in under Sales platform, no advisor.  I also want to make sure that she has a good understanding of the plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-09 11:50:21', '2021-08-09 11:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073214023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212091', 'Michelle Schusterman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-09 11:45:10', '2021-08-09 11:45:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '8-9-21 Figge called bc he now has his 2nd Need from breaking his arm biking on Betasso. It doesn''t need surgery fortunately. He''s working with Maddy (?) as his needs coordinator if I remember her name correctly. His last Need was for a back issue. He desperately wants mental health benefits and he was surprised by the 2 month break between sessions of 4. He didn''t get an answer as to why from Terry that he spoke with at Mazetti and Sullivan. She didn''t let him know that it''s to intergrate the teachings from the first 4 sessions. She didn''t make it as clear as necessary that he can pay for sessions during the break. That''s a financial strain on him but he will sort it out. He likes somatic therapy that he''s been doing. There was only one therapist in Boulder so far. So, Terry is researching more to work with or he will open up to choose one virtually.  He also wants to know he a vasectomy is included in his membership as preventative at no cost. I don''t believe so, but I''m double checking. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-09 11:40:12', '2021-08-09 11:40:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073247033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-09 11:20:26', '2021-08-09 11:20:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073247028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-09 10:45:06', '2021-08-09 10:45:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058400001', 'Teresa Walker', NULL, 'Teresa called regarding an ultrasound she needs to have done after her mammogram. This is a diagnostic test, per Teresa, and I informed her that it will not be covered under her preventative services. Teresa was not happy with this information and asked "why do I have insurance if it isn''t going to cover anything" and I explained to Teresa that medical cost sharing is not like traditional insurance. I tried to explain how medical cost sharing is different than insurance and Teresa was not interested. She stated that she will continue to pay out of pocket for her services that are needed and she hung up. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-09 10:43:44', '2021-08-09 10:43:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073214018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227013', 'Marc Hitchcox', NULL, 'Updated address shared with me by Sedera.  Street address was the only item that changed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-09 10:37:26', '2021-08-09 10:37:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073214013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-09 10:31:24', '2021-08-09 10:31:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'Tanika called in for a list of pediatricians in her area that are in-network. She stated that the last list she received did not help her because none of the providers were in her area. I sent her a list of pediatricians and also provided her with instructions on how to present her Planstin card. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-09 10:17:40', '2021-08-09 10:17:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073247023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096022', 'Aleesha Nichols', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-09 10:17:21', '2021-08-09 10:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, 'Dhai called in requesting a list of Neurologists and Internists in her area. I sent her both via email along with instructions on how to search the PHCS network. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-09 10:08:38', '2021-08-09 10:08:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073247018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212027', 'Kristen Henry', NULL, 'Left a detailed message to reschedule her welcome call after her start date of September 1, 2021. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-09 09:56:15', '2021-08-09 09:56:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073247013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-09 09:49:06', '2021-08-09 09:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073253003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Carlos called back.  Wanted clarification on cash payment.  Reinforced what Jennifer had already told him.  I also asked if he had spoked to CirrusMD to see if they are the ones that had suggested him being seen immediately.  He said that he had and that he was grateful to have that service on hand this weekend.

Also, did a warm transfer to Zion so that he could give them a heads up on the possible NEEDS he may encounter in the event the Ophthalmologist need s to treat him immediately.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-08-09 09:31:39', '2021-08-09 09:31:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073247008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072179023', 'Veronica Rose', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-09 09:28:27', '2021-08-09 09:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073211011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Carlos called with a question regarding an ophthalmologist visit his doctor is requesting due to an eye injury. I informed Carlos to present himself as a cash pay patient, ask for the best possible cash price, and to collect the superbills in case this turns into a need that goes above his $1000 IUA. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-09 09:16:26', '2021-08-09 09:16:26'),
