  ('zcrm_1579374000073157046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073159135', 'Lawrence Shammo', 'Wendy''s Note:', '8-6-21 Lawrence says still no other pre-x except for his high blood pressure that is well managed via meds and working with his DPC on that. Cost was going from $245 to $425 with Sedera bc turning 60. But, with DIRECT we can keep price at $245/$1000. No reason not to switch, so he completed application for DIRECT with Zion and cancelled current MPB Direct with Sedera. All set!', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-06 14:21:08', '2021-08-06 14:21:08'),
