  ('zcrm_1579374000073144013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070112023', 'Johanna Parsano', NULL, 'Johanna called regarding her CirrusMD account and not being able to access it. She finally received an email from CirrusMD support stating that she no longer had benefits and that she needed to reach out to John Kache. I reached out to John on her behalf and he has resolved the issue. Johanna should be able to access her CirrusMD account by Monday 8/9/2021. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-06 13:40:15', '2021-08-06 13:40:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073157031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810615', 'Don Ford', NULL, 'Member contacted me 8/5 after hours letting me know that he now had the money.  I returned his call and was able to get him reinstated.  I let member know and re ran pmt &amp; charged hi $50 reinstatement fee.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-06 13:36:49', '2021-08-06 13:36:49'),
