  ('zcrm_1579374000073144008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096022', 'Aleesha Nichols', NULL, 'Aleesha called stating that she needed instructions on how to use the dental benefits included in her plan. I informed Aleesha that, as far as I know, there are no dental or vision benefits with her plan. She is going to reach out to her agent to ask her for more details. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-06 11:40:29', '2021-08-06 11:40:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073144003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380465', 'Kelly Green', NULL, 'Kelly called in regarding a bill she received for her wellness visit, I explained that she would need to speak with Planstin regarding this bill. I transferred Kelly over to Planstin per my suggestion. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-06 11:32:18', '2021-08-06 11:32:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073122018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540138', 'Leslie Frazier', NULL, 'Leslie called for help accessing the MAP site- I told her the password was:MAP , I also transferred her to them so that she could set up a therapy appointment. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-06 10:55:15', '2021-08-06 10:55:15'),
