  ('zcrm_1579374000073089011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072038127', 'Tamara Granada', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-08-06 10:22:00', '2021-08-06 10:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073110018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202060', 'Kristen Henry', NULL, 'I spoke to member to let her know that I would need a cancellation form to cancel old Sedera plan.  she told me that Analisa told her to set up a meeting to find out whether MPB wouls automatically her plan.  I advised her that we would need a record of her cancelling her plan .  I will email her link to fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-06 10:09:20', '2021-08-06 10:09:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073110013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073109042', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-06 10:00:31', '2021-08-06 10:00:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073110008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073109042', 'Kimberly Scully', 'Wendy''s note:', '8-5-21 Kim and Greg don''t have any pre-x from past 24 months. One kid is in England and the other is set for now.  She''s pleased to move to SECURE for $1000/$500 rather than PSDHC which just went up to $680/$500 due to age banding.  She totally appreciated me reaching out since when she got the email about the price increase she was going to start looking at other options bc it was too expensive for super healthy people that never use it. She''s happy!', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-06 10:00:11', '2021-08-06 10:00:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073122008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Elizabeth called for help getting into her MAP portal and Tivity portal...I also reached out to CirrusMD and asked them to send her an invite.  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-06 09:59:02', '2021-08-06 09:59:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073123003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, 'Amber called regarding instructions on how to find providers in the PHCS network. I emailed instructions to Amber. Amber called back stating that the link in the email did not work (it does because I tried it myself) so I looked for a provider for her.  -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-06 09:32:48', '2021-08-06 09:49:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073122003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480158', 'Margaret Weaver', NULL, 'Margaret called to update her payment information, I sent her an online payment form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-06 09:31:14', '2021-08-06 09:31:14'),
