  ('zcrm_1579374000073110003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359199', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request to cancel Sedera since price went up due to age.  Member has re-enrolled in the Secure option.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-06 08:37:06', '2021-08-06 08:37:06'),
