  ('zcrm_1579374000073070009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712271', 'Carey Dubois', NULL, 'Both Delia and Carey are showing as registered with CirrusMD- updated the CRM to reflect this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-06 07:43:00', '2021-08-06 07:43:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073070003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370104', 'Douglas Dester', NULL, 'Cari told me that these members had a hard time logging into HCBB- I was able to login just fine with their last name and either DOB- I sent them both a link and instructions along with the DOB''s that we have on file.  I explained that if either of their DOB''s are wrong to let me know so that I can update their account...that would be the only reason why they wouldn''t have been able to access HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-06 07:18:42', '2021-08-06 07:20:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073011021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271176', 'Ted Williams', NULL, 'tt Ted to make sure he rec''d e-mail &amp; he had.  His last test was inconclusive, so they are doing a more invasive process tomorrow.  He said if he has questions on starting/submitting the need w/to Sedera, he''ll call next week.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-05 17:35:51', '2021-08-05 17:35:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073011013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370104', 'Douglas Dester', NULL, 'Denise called.  Douglas is having hip pain &amp; wants to see an orthopedic surgeon (he thinks it could be related to the knee replacement(s) he had ~10yrs ago?).  I walked Denise through her post WC e-mail and highlighted the sections she may need.  We couldn''t get her into HCBB, so I sent her a list of the surg in her area including the rating on a Dr their friend suggested.  Then asked Kelly Anne to request they get the Desters access.     CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-05 17:09:18', '2021-08-05 17:14:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073043034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173170', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, '8-5-21 Melissa figured out the correct card and finally found a provider to schedule with for her wellness visit. It took her all day to get through to a provider to answer her questions but she''s all set and was very nice. Sounds like she had Richard help her with it as well. So, she''s good for now. :-)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-05 15:32:46', '2021-08-05 15:32:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073043026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359199', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, '8-5-21 Kim and Greg don''t have any pre-x from past 24 months. One kid is in England and the other is set for now.  She''s pleased to move to SECURE for $1000/$500 rather than PSDHC which just went up to $680/$500 due to age banding.  She totally appreciated me reaching out since when she got the email about the price increase she was going to start looking at other options bc it was too expensive for super healthy people that never use it. She''s happy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-05 15:17:58', '2021-08-05 15:24:09'),
