  ('zcrm_1579374000073043021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002142', 'Leonard Ott', NULL, '8-5-21 Stopher enrolled in SECURE $1000/$500. They spend half of their time in CA, so they can do their annual wellness visits there.  All set to go. Put Leonard Ott as primary because he''s 4-5 years younger and this won''t disrupt his membership when Stopher ages out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-05 13:45:52', '2021-08-05 13:45:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073043016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002105', 'Tonya Allen', NULL, '8-5-21 Tonya enrolled in CARE+ $215/$1000 just now. If she gets her own company LLC up and running she will move to SECURE to have wellness and HSA compliance. She has a tooth that needs the implant and wants to use HSA for that. I also educated her on HMA which she will hold off on. Also sent her VSP plans to review. She will ponder that next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-05 13:28:30', '2021-08-05 13:28:30'),
