  ('zcrm_1579374000073043003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173170', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, '8-5-21 Talked with Melissa about how to access her annual wellness visit. I can''t tell which card she should use MPB.Health. Talking with KC for help on this. I sent her the instructions for the annual wellness visit and the provider search tool.  I ran a search and 34 ob/gyns came up. This sounded overwhelming to her. But, she had an important call come in that she needed to grab. I''m asking her to send me a copy of the two cards to help determine which card to use.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-05 11:41:42', '2021-08-05 11:41:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000073029008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676311', 'Karissa Nava', NULL, 'Karissa called to get a refund because she said that she already cancelled, I explained that she may have cancelled with Liberty, but she needs to do the same with us, I sent her an online cancellation form and told her to fill it out and submit it so that she is not charged again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-05 11:19:18', '2021-08-05 11:19:18'),
