  ('zcrm_1579374000072888149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361787', 'Cammy Dwyer-Abbey', NULL, '8-3-21 Talked with Cammy and she''s thrilled with her membership! She has an unexpected rare autoimmune disease that would have cost her tens of thousands of dollars she believes with traditional insurance but it''s only cost her $1000. She even paid one bill of $100K on her credit card and got 2% cash back or points that paid for the $1000 and more. She is ok with the significant price increase from $333 to $534. Sedera and MPB has treated her very well! She keeps trying to refer people but there aren''t many takers she says. She''s a huge fan of her membership!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-03 10:36:20', '2021-08-03 10:36:20'),
