  ('zcrm_1579374000072884026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, 'Melisa called.  She has a Welcome Call sched tomorrow, 8/3/21,  at 11am Pacific time &amp; needs to see if she can resched for 12pm Pacific instead.  I sent a chat to Kelly Anne &amp; Vanessa asking for them to reach out tomorrow &amp; let her know her options.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-02 17:37:58', '2021-08-02 17:37:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072884018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919695', 'Erinn Magin', NULL, 'Erinn Magin called.  She has pap smear &amp; colposcopy bills she wasn''t sure what to do with.    We went over deadlines to go towards a need if she thinks it''ll go over her 1k IUA, talking to the doctor''s office re: coding, and self-pay info.  She knows she''s going to have to hurry to start a need if necessary because of timeline.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-02 17:17:01', '2021-08-02 17:27:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072884013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070730039', 'Lee Brewer', NULL, 'Lee called.  Had lots of questions.  She''s got a cyst on her finger.  We went over self-pay and that she could start with CirrusMD since there''s no expense there.  We also discussed her 1k IUA, detailed invoices, etc.  She had questions on Planstin re: a gynecologist.  I let her know I''m new &amp; need to get the answer.  She''s fine if I give her details tomorrow since she doesn''t need to go for her annual for another 6 mos.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-02 17:11:54', '2021-08-02 17:11:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072888003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007902007', 'Natalie Wood', NULL, '8-2-21 Natalie worked with Robin on Medicare bc in CA. But, she chose Kaiser which doesn''t pay agents. So, Robin wasted her time. :-( But, got information about a juicer when they connected. ;-)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-08-02 16:40:22', '2021-08-02 16:40:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072884008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816099', 'Thomas Frisbie', NULL, 'Tom called.  He does need to see a regular doctor for an MRI, or other test, but did not receive either e-mail I sent on Friday.  I resent both from a my Outlook account.  He had received the first one, so hopefully the 2nd was received as well.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-02 15:42:12', '2021-08-02 15:42:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072884003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540021', 'Paulena Shapiro', NULL, 'Paulena called back to confirm the pdf of her Planstin card had been req''d since she hadn''t seen it arrive yet.  I let her know I can see the request.  Her appt is at 1pm Georgia time tomorrow.  I sent her the template with instructions on presenting her card as well.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-08-02 15:21:28', '2021-08-02 15:21:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072857008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491094', 'Adam Kobler', NULL, 'member called to update his address as well as his billing information, I sent both online forms. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-02 14:55:37', '2021-08-02 14:55:37'),
