  ('zcrm_1579374000072868003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712116', 'Dorcas Mella', NULL, 'On 7/13 M. Montes emailed me saying that this member had chosen a 8/1 start date in error and asked me to change it.  It was changed in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-02 14:36:08', '2021-08-02 14:36:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072857003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'Tanika called to understand her preventative care benefits, I went over them and sent both preventative care emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-02 14:05:58', '2021-08-02 14:05:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072817023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992009', 'Jason Cooper', NULL, 'Martha called regarding her CirrusMD account. Jason ended up using her main email account to sign up for his CirrusMD account, so Martha gave an alternative email to use for her account. I updated Admin123 and she should be set to sign up tomorrow. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-02 13:38:36', '2021-08-02 13:38:36'),
