  ('zcrm_1579374000072817018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066173', 'Sherry Gaskins', NULL, 'Sherry called inquiring about a potential bowel obstruction. I informed her that she is just going to present herself as a cash pay patient, ask for the best cash price, collect the bills for submission if this need goes over her $1000 IUA. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-02 12:56:12', '2021-08-02 12:56:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072819008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072820022', 'Erik Horton', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-02 12:54:03', '2021-08-02 12:54:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072816013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816155', 'Stephen Longo', NULL, 'member called to update address, I updated the CRM and filled out a member update form on their behalf and submitted it.  I also requested member ID cards from Zion Health on behalf of this member. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-02 12:18:00', '2021-08-02 12:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072816008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052500143', 'Andrea Henderson', NULL, 'Andrea called to ask if her children''s preventative care exams would be a covered expense.  I explained that she did not have preventative care coverage- I explained her IUA with Sedera.  I explained that preventative care benefits are not sharable with the plan that she has, I offered to do a healthgrades.com search for her, but she will do it herself so that she can find pediatricians in her area. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-02 11:21:03', '2021-08-02 11:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072817013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070112023', 'Johanna Parsano', NULL, 'Johanna called regarding her CirrusMD account, she states that she has not been able to log in to her CirrusMD account and is receiving no help from CirrusMD when she contacts them. Upon looking into her profile, I found that her DOB was incorrect, along with her email address and phone number. I made necessary changes in Admin123 and in the CRM. I will call Johanna to let her know that she should be all set to sign up for her CirrusMD account tomorrow morning. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-02 11:10:32', '2021-08-02 11:10:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072817008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049815023', 'Andrew Vick', NULL, 'Andrew emailed regarding how to submit his recent Wellness visit bill. I explained that he is a member of Redirect, gave him Redirects phone number and also gave him the link to download the Redirect app. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-02 10:07:03', '2021-08-02 10:07:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072817003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351098', 'Teresa Brachle', NULL, 'Teresa and her husband are going out of town, leaving their children with her parents. Teresa called asking what procedures, if any, would her parents have to go through in case her parents have to take their children to the ER. I explained that they need to present themselves as self-pay patients, ask for the best possible cash price, and collect the super bill in case the need goes above the $1000 IUA.- JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-02 09:44:56', '2021-08-02 09:44:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072816003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162382', 'Juan Rosas', NULL, 'Juan called, and put Celeste on the phone, he injured himself playing soccer and they wanted to get pre-approval that the injuries would be a covered expense with Sedera, I told them that I couldn''t give pre-approval, that Sedera would need to. I explained that they are his medical cost share community.  I gave her the number and transferred the line.  I also sent instructions on how to upload a bill to Sedera as well as other preventative care templates because she also had questions about that. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-08-02 09:44:22', '2021-08-02 09:44:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072789003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529495', 'Keith Purcell', NULL, 'Susan emailed in regarding a COVID-19 antibody test. I shared with Susan Sedera''s COVID-19 testing guidelines and explained that this will be an out of pocket expense at first, but Sedera will reimburse her partially for this test. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-08-02 08:26:03', '2021-08-02 08:26:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072772016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779506', 'Susan Weiner', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-02 07:32:21', '2021-08-02 07:32:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072772008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048544005', 'Daniel Soleja', NULL, 'Member emailed in and let me know the he would be getting benefits through a job.  I sent him the cancellation link and advised him to submit prior to the 20th.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-02 07:18:20', '2021-08-02 07:18:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072772003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370083', 'Earl Thibault', NULL, 'Member emailed in letting me know that he hadn''t seen his Aug pmt come out of his checking acct as yet.  I looked and the next pmt date was set wrong from when I changed it.  Corrected it and ran pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-08-02 07:12:08', '2021-08-02 07:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072705044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271176', 'Ted Williams', NULL, 'Ted called.  He''s having expensive health issues with his lung and needed guidance.  He''d remembered to tell the first provider he was self-pay &amp; they had reduced his exp from 30k to 13k.  But he''s going in for another test tomorrow.  We went over starting a need with Sedera (I sent him the template for guidance) and I dbl ck''d how Sedera pays and put that in the e-mail too.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-30 17:32:57', '2021-07-30 17:32:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072705039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816099', 'Thomas Frisbie', NULL, 'Tom called.  He hurt his shoulder &amp; needed help with CirrusMD &amp; how to select a new family medicine doc.  Got him started on CirrusMD, then sent Fam Med docs &amp; new 30-min visit avg exp from HCBB, as well as how to submit a need to Zion in case the shoulder issue goes over his 1k IUA.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-30 17:16:35', '2021-07-30 17:16:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072735006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603082', 'Sean Lionello', NULL, '7-30-21 They have a new Need from an ER visit that was $1200 and cash price down to $960. Not a good time to switch bc of price increase.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-30 17:04:41', '2021-07-30 17:07:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072705034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Member (Kimi?) called looking for her Zion memb # for a need she is submitting.  She was able to find it on her Zion card.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-30 15:57:21', '2021-07-30 15:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072723013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069918014', 'Mark Sommers', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-30 14:21:51', '2021-07-30 14:21:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072705029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072708018', 'Lara Forsyth', NULL, 'Additional Members: Asher Forsyth 5/28/2002, Silas Vazquez 9/8/2004, Archer Vazquez 10/29/2006', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-30 13:09:31', '2021-07-30 13:09:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072723008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'I emailed Eben some information from HCBB- they told me that they cannot negotiate down medications, but they did have another option for him to try. I sent him that information. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-30 12:14:07', '2021-07-30 12:14:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072705024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165317', 'Melody Fairchild', NULL, 'Melody''s $25 set up fee has declined I will email her and Wendy for alternate Payment info', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-30 12:04:58', '2021-07-30 12:04:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072705016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165296', 'Lara Vazquez', NULL, '01/01/2015 - Original Start date with HES.  Member discovered HES was not mandatory.  Wanted all of the money paid to us back.  She settled for a 2 year family membership to the Care Product plus MSEAP', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2021-07-30 11:24:39', '2021-07-30 11:24:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072704011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Member called regarding vision services for his child. I explained to Marc that under his MEC, vision services are not available. He then stated that I needed to look into the legalities of a MEC not covering vision services and also stated that because we would not go against Planstins decision that they gave him, that we are unwilling to assist him. I assured him that was not the issue, that Planstin has the final say in their decisions. Marc continued to argue with me and saying that John would make sure that his child gets vision services and I explained that John is no longer on the concierge team. After Marc was trying to argue with me several times I reached out the Kelly Anne to see if she would also speak with Marc. She relayed the same information to Marc that I did. She is reaching out to Eric Nigera at Planstin to have him call Marc and explain the MEC services to him. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-30 10:35:27', '2021-07-30 10:35:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072712008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878165', 'Donavin Roberts', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-30 10:25:21', '2021-07-30 10:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072723003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069918014', 'Mark Sommers', NULL, 'Sent Mark, his wife and son a CirrusMD invite in prep for Welcome call scheduled later today and updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-30 09:38:29', '2021-07-30 09:38:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072712003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096022', 'Aleesha Nichols', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of August 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-30 09:23:01', '2021-07-30 09:23:01');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000072705008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update.  I will update in Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-30 08:26:22', '2021-07-30 08:30:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072705003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034713014', 'Joseph Sands', NULL, 'Member emailed me asking about his spouse.  I suggested Short Term HI as spouse will be eligible for Medicare in less than 6 mos.  I told hi to be in contact with HCA for options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-30 07:50:23', '2021-07-30 07:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072704003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, 'Called member back to answer any questions about her mammogram bill. It went straight to vm so I left one stating that she can give us a call and we would be happy to answer any questions she may have about her bill. - JTS

**Update** Jacqueline states that she was told by a concierge that her mammogram would be covered. I did not find a note in the CRM regarding this conversation and tried to explain that the plan that she has does not cover a screening colonoscopy or mammogram. She is FURIOUS and states that we sold her "doo doo in a bag" and her husband will be calling the concierge team. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-30 07:29:27', '2021-07-30 07:38:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072673163', 'Joshua Fisher', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 14:27:50', '2021-07-29 14:27:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072673150', 'Micayla Matson', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 14:22:13', '2021-07-29 14:22:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 14:19:14', '2021-07-29 14:19:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466180', 'Sarah Pyper', NULL, 'Member called in very surprised in her price increase.  I explained age banding and the thinking behind it and she asked exactly when the price would be going up.  I explained the timing to her.  She said that she would be shopping and I told her to be in contact with Jane for other options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 14:02:07', '2021-07-29 14:02:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare I will notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 13:44:51', '2021-07-29 13:44:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335060', 'Charles Jones', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare I will notify member &amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 13:39:45', '2021-07-29 13:39:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034713014', 'Joseph Sands', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare I will email member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 13:31:16', '2021-07-29 13:31:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072678003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002105', 'Tonya Allen', NULL, '7-29-21 Tonya is 51 and just completed 2 year divorce process and just found out her health coverage will be ending. X owns a medical practice so she had great coverage all these years. She sees Carrie Ballas ND for preventive care to get IV supplements. She also gets a lot of massage and acupuncture to stay healthy. Just learning she''s pre-menopausal, but super healthy! She hasn''t worked in 20 years, so CARE+ is best option for her. She''s not interested in doing a colonoscopy and ok with paying for her chosen wellness solutions on her own. She will read more and she watched the video. She''s pleased with this option and we are meeting next week for Sept. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-29 13:26:29', '2021-07-29 13:26:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466180', 'Sarah Pyper', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 60-64 age band.  I will notify member &amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 13:21:18', '2021-07-29 13:21:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010377059', 'Teri Mock', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50-59 age band.  I will notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 13:09:36', '2021-07-29 13:09:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025959066', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, 'Member will be aging into 50-59 age band.  I will notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 13:03:33', '2021-07-29 13:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025959066', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50-59 age band.  I will notify member &amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 13:01:04', '2021-07-29 13:01:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044105', 'Michael Marmor', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50-59 age band.  I will notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 12:54:09', '2021-07-29 12:54:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013154', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50-59 age band.  I will email member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 12:44:39', '2021-07-29 12:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058400001', 'Teresa Walker', NULL, 'Teresa called to request her Planstin cards.  I told her that I would reach out to Planstin on her behalf and order them.  I told her that she could expect her PDF within the next 24 hours and the hard copies in 3 weeks.  I also sent her the preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 12:28:24', '2021-07-29 12:28:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'Eben called to ask if an injectable medication called Xolair would be something that could be negotiated by HCBB....each injection runs about $1000, and he will need them every month for the foreseeable future.  I told him I didn''t know but I would reach out to HCBB and ask them if it is something that they can do.  I told him that it might take 24 hours for a response but that I would call him back to let him know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 12:26:26', '2021-07-29 12:26:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072617034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'David called regarding the Endoscopy Center he is wanting to use for his screening colonoscopy. He stated that when he checked, Ridgeview Endoscopy Center was in-network. When the facility calls to verify services, they are told that they are not in the network when they give their NPI number to Planstin. He was not very happy with this information because he thought he did his due diligence. I suggested that he should speak with Planstin regarding this issue with his Endoscopy facility and transferred him. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-29 12:18:11', '2021-07-29 12:20:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50-59 age band.  I will email member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 11:58:18', '2021-07-29 11:58:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072617029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058400001', 'Teresa Walker', NULL, 'Teresa called in regarding her screening mammogram and colonoscopy. Teresa has never used her services before and did not call the concierge team first for the proper steps. She had presented the incorrect card at the time of service and was told that she had to pay cash, and she did without hesitation. I let her know that she will have to speak to Planstin about the payment for the mammogram. I also gave her the instructions on how to present her Planstin card at her screening colonoscopy and to verify PRIOR to her procedure that they are, in fact, in the PHCS network. She seems very confused regarding her plan. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-29 11:58:00', '2021-07-29 11:58:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659223', 'James Julian', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50-59 age band I have changed billing and will email member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 11:41:18', '2021-07-29 11:55:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072628008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626120', 'Russell Finsterwald', NULL, 'Member will be aging into 30-39 age band.  I will email informing him and change billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-29 11:25:24', '2021-07-29 11:25:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', NULL, 'sent CirrusMD invite and updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 10:16:05', '2021-07-29 10:16:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248151', 'Ray Skelton', NULL, 'sent CirrusMD invite and updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 09:46:00', '2021-07-29 09:46:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070294005', 'Kelly Alvarez', NULL, 'sent CirrusMD invite and updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 09:44:36', '2021-07-29 09:44:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370104', 'Douglas Dester', NULL, 'Sent CirrusMD invite, and updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 09:43:04', '2021-07-29 09:43:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070569025', 'Robert Pederson', NULL, 'sent CirrusMD invite and updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 09:41:00', '2021-07-29 09:41:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070730039', 'Lee Brewer', NULL, 'CirrusMD is showing that this member is already registered.  Updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 09:38:57', '2021-07-29 09:38:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070912052', 'Anna Edwards', NULL, 'sent CirrusMD invitation and updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 09:37:37', '2021-07-29 09:37:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, 'sent CirrusMD invitations to both Paul and Karen ahead of Welcome call scheduled later today. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 08:23:26', '2021-07-29 08:23:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072660003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045806225', 'Mark Johnson', NULL, 'Mark called because his son is having ACL surgery today and he didn''t know if it would be a covered expense or not.  I told him that he needed to speak to Sedera asap about this and transferred him over to speak to them, I also sent him instructions on how to upload a need and Sedera''s phone number because he was driving. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-29 07:53:56', '2021-07-29 07:53:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072634049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Iris called needing her Zion member # for a ''need'' form she is completing.  She asked me to req new cards (pdf &amp; hard copies) so I did thru slack.  But, she also called during Zion''s hours, so I transferred her there.  She''ll call back if she needs further help.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-28 16:47:01', '2021-07-28 16:47:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072634044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485435', 'Curtiss Newell', NULL, 'I called Tracy back.  We were doing so many things I forgot to offer to help with the CirrusMD (more than just resending the instructions from June).  I LM that if she''d like help I can do that &amp; I''m here another 2 hours This evening.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-28 16:04:03', '2021-07-28 16:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072634039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485435', 'Curtiss Newell', NULL, 'Tracy called.  She needed quite a few things:  She thought she had chiropractic.  We discussed how that works and went over it being attached to a qualified need over her 1k IUA.  Her e-mails were not arriving at her secondary e-mail.  Her name was misspelled, so I corrected the secondary e-mail & her name.  Then when I tried to send her e-mails afterwards they continue to kick back with that old address.  I sent a chat to Kelly Anne for tomorrow to learn how to fix this, but also let Tracy know it may take overnight to correct.  She was fine with that.  I sent 3 e-mails:  1)  I resent what Kelly Anne sent on 6/16/21: Summary of Care...  2) She wondered if she had dental & vision.  Let her know about the discount program & sent template:  WholeHealth Living Choices  3)  She said she signed up so long ago, she''d like her advisor''s contact info.  Sent her e-mail & ph (e-mail contains the name, realized I didn''t spell that out in the e-mail, but did in our conversation.  She seemed happy when we got off the phone.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-28 15:54:43', '2021-07-28 15:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072653003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423014', 'Asya Bangiyeva', NULL, 'I have had multiple appointments with this couple explaining the program. Before, during, and after the sale. Always clarifying how it works.  Since she commutes for work between AZ and the East coast, there were no other plans/programs that would work for her.

Currently she is upset that she has to pay her $1000 IUA in full before ZION will pay the balance. She wants to work out a payment plan with the hospital and says it''s none of Zion''s business how she pays her portion. (up front or in payments). She wants to see the language where it says Zion won''t pay until she pays her part.  I suspect she is wanting to negotiate her portion with the hospital?

I  called Wendy to get her advice.
I am emailing the Zion Guidelines to member and highlighting the portion that deals with IUA.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2021-07-28 15:08:12', '2021-07-28 15:08:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072634034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885083', 'Susan Best', NULL, 'Wendy requested a copy of this members 1095 be sent to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-28 13:00:46', '2021-07-28 13:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072634026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', 'Redirect Change of email', 'Tracking #11902085
