  ('zcrm_1579374000072617024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Member called regarding whether or not she still has an active plan with MPB.Health. I explained that she does. She also asked a question regarding billing for her recent ER visit, I explained to her that unfortunately we do not handle any billing. She asked to be transferred to Planstin because she had specific questions for them. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-28 11:47:45', '2021-07-28 11:47:45'),
