  ('zcrm_1579374000072617003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, 'Lynn called in regarding a bill for her daughter''s ER visit in Oct. 2020, I explained that if the bill is over 6 months old Zion may not pay it. Lynn seems VERY confused about her plan and has not idea what she is doing. I am also sending her the Zion Needs Submission link email. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-28 10:21:35', '2021-07-28 10:21:35'),
