  ('zcrm_1579374000072541018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, 'this member called because he thought that his annual urology visit would be a covered expense by his Planstin card.  I explained why it was not.  I sent him a list of services that ARE included with his membership, I went over the self pay process for all services beyond preventative care, and I sent him a welcome call schedule as well. He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-27 13:09:47', '2021-07-27 13:09:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072513013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821781', 'Leeanne Whittaker', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will let Sedera Know and cancel billing &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-27 13:07:39', '2021-07-27 13:07:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072541013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165335', 'Glen Delman', NULL, '7-27-21 Melody and Glen chose to move from HES/LHS to SECURE at $685/$1000. They were paying $725 with LHS with $2500 AUA. It took them 1 year from date of service and 10 months from bill submission to get refunded from LHS for $4800 for ER visit. ER visit turned out to be nothing with a free and clear bill of health. She went in due to chest pain which was result of tooth work. She had $32K worth of dental work over recent time bc she avoided seeing dentist for way too long. She need x-rays, many cavities filled, 2 teeth need to be pulled and implanted with new tooth and  root canal done. It''s all complete and looks good now. She went to Alpine Dental and used Dr. Smith who moved to OR. She was happy with them but Glen was skeptical of them. She has a clean bill of health from the dentist and from ER visit. Dakota will need major dental work when he reaches his 20''s. Discussed HSA and HMA for dental and other medical expenses. They will research HMA account next. Enrolled in SECURE for Sept. 1st start date and cancelled HES and sending email to LHS to cancel for Sept. 1st. All set and will do Welcome Calle.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-27 13:02:49', '2021-07-27 13:02:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072540013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066049', 'Malinda Van Dyke', NULL, 'Malinda called to cancel, I sent her a cancellation form and BCC''d Steve Ramona. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-27 12:44:16', '2021-07-27 12:44:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072513008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246087', 'Ann Wiley', NULL, 'JC got in contact with me after I left her a VM to be in contact with this member re: her decline.  She had spoken to spouse of the member who gave he the same card that declined.  I reran I will monitor to see if I get back.  I also told JC to advise member that both emails were returned to me, to let the member know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-27 12:14:49', '2021-07-27 12:14:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072541008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821781', 'Leeanne Whittaker', NULL, '7-27-21 Hey Wendy, 

I wanted to let you know that I actually got a new job that will provide me with health insurance and that will be beginning the 1st of August. Can you tell me what steps I need to take to end my arrangements with you? 

Thank you! 

Respectfully, 

Leeanne Whittaker', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-27 11:35:05', '2021-07-27 11:35:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072540008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630231', 'Cynthia Wankmuller', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent online cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-27 11:07:22', '2021-07-27 11:07:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072537013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called regarding how to use the PHCS network search. I went through step by step with him and he was successful! He was very satisfied with his service. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-27 10:49:26', '2021-07-27 10:49:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072541003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331067', 'Tessa Manton', NULL, '7-27-21 Called Tessa bc she had confusion about her membership. Patti received an email from Sedera saying she contacted them to access her membership. She told me she was just trying to find out how to access t elemedicine and determined she no longer had it. I told her she actually has a better telemedicine through CirrusMD. I just sent her the instructions to register. She''ll look for it and complete the process. She was appreciative. I also told her Zion is the MCS company now, not Sedera.  She wasn''t concerned about that part.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-27 10:34:54', '2021-07-27 10:34:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072540003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838059', 'John Huie', NULL, 'John called to request his membership cards from Zion/Planstin- I reached out to Zion''s management team and requested his card. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-27 10:33:00', '2021-07-27 10:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072537008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, 'David called regarding his colonoscopy that he states we scheduled. I explained to him that he spoke to Redirect regarding this issue and transferred him directly to Redirect. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-27 10:23:22', '2021-07-27 10:23:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072537003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091646', 'Carol Lovejoy', NULL, 'Carol called regarding a follow-up mammogram from her screening mammogram. She knew that she would have to pay out of pocket for her follow-up but had questions about submitting a need in case this turns into something that goes over her $1,000 IUA. I sent Carol the Zion Needs Submission link. Carol was ecstatic that she gets a real person every time she calls. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-27 10:18:02', '2021-07-27 10:18:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072513003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893285', 'Gina Hodgson', NULL, 'Member''s business New Wave Chiropractic has been sold so member re-enrolled as an Individual.  I have cancelled her old plan and it has been noted in Admin 123.  I also emailed Melissa @ Planstin to let her know of this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-27 07:31:02', '2021-07-27 07:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072465023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361667', 'Deborah Caulfield', NULL, 'Deborah called to find out whether or not her needs submission would be sharable or not, she also asked about 2ndMD.  I transferred her to Sedera for both of those questions and resent an email on how to submit medical needs to Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-26 14:05:41', '2021-07-26 14:05:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072467041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176035', 'Renae Einspahr', NULL, 'Renae called in regarding her ER trip for her lacerations and submitting a need for this instance. I explained the needs submission process to Renae, only for her to say that she did not receive any bills from the hospital during her visit. I explained that she would need to have a superbill in order to open a need with Zion Health. She then explained that she is starting on Medicare next week and I made it clear that she needs to get the bill(s) and submit them to Zion ASAP. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-26 13:33:17', '2021-07-26 13:33:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072461065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716932', 'LouLou Piscatore', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-26 12:41:25', '2021-07-26 12:41:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072461060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069620083', 'Patrick Gahman', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update I will update &amp; send verification', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-26 12:38:05', '2021-07-26 12:38:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072461055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471089', 'Anita Fisher', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-26 12:36:01', '2021-07-26 12:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072478003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176035', 'Renae Einspahr', NULL, '7-26-21 Renae had to go to ER for stitches for laceration on Sat. She couldn''t reach anyone since it was over the weekend. So, she went to the ER to get it dealt with ASAP. Her membership ends Aug. 1 bc aging into Medicare. She wants to make sure costs are shared since she''s still  a member. I instructed her to create the new Need immediately and upload all supporting documents  and gave her KC''s contact information to create Need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-26 11:39:52', '2021-07-26 11:39:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072465018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Kristine called for her free mental health therapy sessions.  I gave her MAP''s phone number, transferred her there.  I sent her more information about MAP as well as an address update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-26 11:33:06', '2021-07-26 11:33:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072467036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604272', 'Hal Feldman', NULL, 'Hal called regarding chiropractic services and if they are a shareable need, I explained to Hal that if his doctor suggests that he needs to see a chiropractor it would need to be approved by Zion for it to be a shareable need. Hal then asked to speak with Zion regarding their guidelines for chiropractic visits so I transferred him. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-26 11:31:28', '2021-07-26 11:31:28'),
