  ('zcrm_1579374000072461035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246087', 'Ann Wiley', NULL, 'Because I received both emails about her decline back from this member I reached out to her.  We had a bad connection however when I told her what I was call about she hung up on me .  I then reached out to advisor JC Clark to get her help with this.  If I don''t hear I will f/u tomorrow 7/27.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-26 10:19:37', '2021-07-26 10:19:37'),
