  ('zcrm_1579374000072457008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072425023', 'Lior Moshe', NULL, '07.26.21:  Patti changed Adria''s plan to SECURE with Lior as the primary member and referred them to me as their Advisor.  I emailed them to introduce myself and give them my contact information.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-07-26 09:49:27', '2021-07-26 09:49:27'),
