  ('zcrm_1579374000072457003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522143', 'Steve Remmel', NULL, '07.22.21:  Steve emailed me requesting a form of verification of health care coverage for his college-bound son.  Emailed him that both Zion and Planstin have Certificates of Membership they offer to draft for the member when the member contacts them directly with this request.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-07-24 11:34:21', '2021-07-24 11:34:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072450013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294135', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'Met virtually with Josh &amp; Ashley.  Sent Zion''s curr Maternity &amp; Memb Guidelines for their review.  They think they''d like to move forward, but need to discuss further.  Not ready to start 8/1/21, so they know soonest date would be 9/1/21 &amp; we''d need to make the chg prior to the 20th of August.  Also, sent a bit of info on HSAs per Josh''s request.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-23 17:34:17', '2021-07-23 17:34:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072450008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066223013', 'Ashley Gillispie', NULL, 'Ashley called,  She just tested positive for COVID &amp; wondered how her membership worked.  We went over using CirrusMD &amp; I resent the  e-mail verification to her e-mail.  She also now realizes how to be a cash-pay pt, her IUA is 1k, and to get detailed receipts should she need to go to the Dr, ER, Hosp, etc.  (in case it does go over the  IUA).  Let her know about 6 mo mark for making sure those are turned in to count towards a need.  She''s going in right now to finish the CirrusMD setup.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-23 16:39:24', '2021-07-23 16:39:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072449003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, '7-23-21 Lynn called bc daughter went to ER and she just got 2nd bill. She doesn''t sound like she has any idea what to do judging from vm. She thinks she should maybe show card with PHCS now. I left her a vm explaining what she should do and to also call Concierge for assistance with uploading the Need ASAP for the process to begin for payment to hospital and her $1000 responsibility. Told her to call me if she has any troubles.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-23 16:09:53', '2021-07-23 16:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072426013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072425023', 'Lior Moshe', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-23 13:36:01', '2021-07-23 13:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072426008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072425023', 'Lior Moshe', NULL, 'This member was previously enrolled in the Conversion plans under spouse Adria Moshe.  Re- enrolled in the Secure plan because lost Preventative through employment .  Member w/Sedera from 7/1/2018 until conversion to Zion in 8/1/2020.  Cancelled eff 8/1/2021', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-23 13:35:43', '2021-07-23 13:35:43'),
