  ('zcrm_1579374000072396013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790025', 'Rosalynde smith', NULL, 'Member''s 8/21 payment declined 1st notice sent - 7/23  7/26-I retried pmt at members direction.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-23 12:22:35', '2021-07-26 07:47:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072396008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, 'I have received a couple of emails from Sedera documenting this member calling in and adding a newborn to the membership.  I reached out to the member who has not gotten back to me yet.  I asked Sedera to direct any of our member back to us when making any changes.  I have left 2 VM''s for this member who will probably not get back to us now that they think the process is completed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-23 12:08:23', '2021-07-23 12:08:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072396003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072394001', 'Susan Hoffman-Pletter', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-23 11:48:16', '2021-07-23 11:48:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072384003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064401013', 'Sarah Nolan', NULL, '7-23-21 I was trying to get paid for Jan. 2021. But, I think Sarah worked with some other agent for 1 month and hated him. She didn''t know I did regular insurance as well. So, she sent in a BOR for Feb onward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-23 11:34:45', '2021-07-23 11:34:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072343018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065203137', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, 'Spoke to husband Bob. I emailed him the link  to the form for Permission to discuss plan with him since he is in charge of his wife''s plan.', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-23 09:56:45', '2021-07-23 09:56:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072347008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141080', 'James Ashford', NULL, 'James called to go over his preventative care benefits, I looked up a few providers in network for him, but told him that it is his responsibility to confirm with the provider that they are currently participating in the PHCS network.  I also sent him the preventative care emails as a refresher. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-23 09:50:33', '2021-07-23 09:50:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072343013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065203137', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-23 09:38:21', '2021-07-23 09:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072343008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712208', 'Earl Walker', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule his welcome call after his start date of August 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-23 08:33:40', '2021-07-23 08:33:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072347003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071780031', 'Kora Gilbert', NULL, 'Kora called upset because she just found out that you need to be self-employed to be on the Secure plan....I told her that Richard Willard should''ve explained this to her.  It sounds as though these members need to be cancelled and refunded.  I transferred Kora to Patti''s vm, and sent Patti a message on Teams asking her to follow up. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-23 08:16:40', '2021-07-23 08:16:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072343003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069994449', 'Leah Houston', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-23 07:56:50', '2021-07-23 07:56:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072330008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068311055', 'Lynne Sandstrom', NULL, 'This member sent in a cancellation request because provider was not in the network.  this should have been a part of the sales process.  I will cancel Zion &amp; billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-23 07:31:17', '2021-07-23 07:31:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072330003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451131', 'Adria Moshe', NULL, 'Adria to re-enroll in the Secure plan I sent her the link to enroll and advised her to also send in a cancellation form.  Deadline today', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-23 07:18:43', '2021-07-23 07:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072290018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068311055', 'Lynne Sandstrom', NULL, 'Steve called to cancel, sent cancellation form.  Left a message to let him know that Patti told me that she would refund him for August. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-22 14:56:16', '2021-07-22 15:02:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072284008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077374092', 'Dave Owens', NULL, '7-22-21 I wrote Dave''s email address wrong. I put it as gmail.com and it should have been yahoo.com. It''s correct in my notes. He has to send it to Blair - soon to be x to make sure it''s sufficient for court orders for divorce. We will revisit tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-22 14:23:40', '2021-07-22 14:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072298008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116123', 'Ronald Levis', NULL, 'Ronald called inquiring about which card he should show at his annual physical and if he gets an annual physical free of charge. I explained to Ronald that he does get an annual physical and that he should present his RCI card at the time of service. He also asked me to verify that his doctor was in the PHCS network, and he is. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-22 13:01:07', '2021-07-22 13:01:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072290013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048347128', 'T. Michele Armstrong', NULL, 'Michele called to ask if counseling services were available, I told her that they are not yet, but there may be some coming in the future (MAP) and when that happens we will let her know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-22 12:46:36', '2021-07-22 12:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072290008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'I reached out to Eric from Planstin to call Rita, but he had Desiree call her instead.  Rita emailed me to thank me, because she had received a call from Desiree and she found the call very helpful. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-22 12:12:06', '2021-07-22 12:12:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072298003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677171', 'Zachary Karle', NULL, 'Zachary needed to get an STI (STD) test done, which he does every 3 months for prevention, and asked if it is a covered expense. I explained to him that he would need to pay out of pocket for this testing. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-22 12:09:01', '2021-07-22 12:09:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072297013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update I will change', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-22 12:03:16', '2021-07-22 12:03:16'),
