  ('zcrm_1579374000072284003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165335', 'Glen Delman', NULL, '7-22-21 Glen and Melody finally got reimbursed from LHS 10 months after submitting their bill, 1 year after date of service. They are ready to move to SECURE. Melody is in OR right now without service. She might have service Sunday night. They might be able to enroll on Monday or Tuesday. They are ok with Aug or Sept. 1st start date. He''ll let me know if she''s able to look at it sooner. No pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. They are paying $725 for LHS now. So, this will save them $40 a month with more benefits at $1000/$685.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-22 10:57:17', '2021-07-22 10:57:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072213066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163178', 'Jasmine Firchau', NULL, 'Member was very displeased as she went on to the Zion website and saw that the was different there.  I went through all the extra benefits that she has and she told me that she does not need any of them.  I directed her back to Steve Cox and she said that she did not want to speak to him and wanted an explaination as to why the price was higher.  Though this was a racket', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-22 09:50:52', '2021-07-22 09:50:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072267003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924100', 'Brandy Hinman', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-22 09:47:24', '2021-07-22 09:47:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072260003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583361', 'Renee Rowe', NULL, 'Renee called to request fair pricing at labs in her area for an Estridol blood test, she also re-requested a prescription quote for Tamoxifen 20 mg. tablets. I sent Renee the fair pricing and a list of labs in her area along with a coupon for both a 30 day and 90 day supply of Tamoxifen tablets per her request. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-22 09:42:33', '2021-07-22 09:42:33'),
