  ('zcrm_1579374000072230008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita called because a few months ago I had Eric from Planstin reach out to her to explain her preventative care benefits to her and she accidentally erased the message.  I told Rita that I would reach out to Eric and ask him to give her a call.   - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-22 08:16:08', '2021-07-22 08:16:08'),
