  ('zcrm_1579374000072213013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366001', 'Gwendolyn Archbell', NULL, 'Member called into the concierge letting us know that she now has benefits through her job.  wanted to be cancelled eff 7/1/21.  Told her that was not possible I could cancel her eff 8/1 &amp; refund her the Aug share Amount.  I sent cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-22 07:40:21', '2021-07-22 07:40:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072213008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411051', 'James Sullivan', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Planstin and cancel billing &amp; refund payment already drafted', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-22 07:15:09', '2021-07-22 07:15:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072213003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update for I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-22 07:09:25', '2021-07-22 07:09:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, '7-21-21 Dayna needed help using her membership. She''s been using Redirect with the Spruce app with success. But, I''m not sure if that''s the newest app or not. Told her to call tomorrow. Also, she wanted to understand how to use Sedera. Told her to ask for Concierge about how to submit a new Need. She has cardiology, sleep apnea and pulmonologist visits all related to one health issue that is now resolved! She''s happy but overwhelmed with process but feeling much better now. Super nice! Her fiance lives in Steamboat and she''s in Aspen. Might want to add him and kids to her membership soon. He''s used to his employer benefits which he won''t have anymore.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 17:19:39', '2021-07-21 17:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072190008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, 'Dayna called.  I walked her to the Cognito Form to update her pymt info.  She also asked for Wendy''s contact information. which I provided.  She''ll call back if she has other questions.     CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-21 17:05:18', '2021-07-21 17:05:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459043', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '7-21-21 Laura ended her job and has insurance elsewhere as of end of June. She was happy with our membership. Her new one has prescription coverage that she thinks is better. Who knows. Cancelling as of Aug. 1, 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 16:34:55', '2021-07-21 16:34:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077374092', 'Dave Owens', NULL, '7-21-21 Dave is 43 and son is 16 months. He''s getting divorced from his wife and needs to supply insurance for him and son in divorce decree. Earns about $100K with his own moving company. Broke his tibia and fibia last year and wound up paying $40K! This was down from the retail price of $125K. He learned the value of self-pay. They wouldn''t even tell him the cost of an overnight visit in the hospital though. He is healed 100% now and understands any problems with broken leg fall within the pre-x clause. His soon to be x wife''s mom is a naturopath. So, son will get most of his wellness visits done through her. He doesn''t plan to fund an HSA or so any wellness visits. So, CARE+ is best option and he will likely go with $1000/$390.  He was also impressed by the mental health benefit. He mentioned naturopaths are promoting a new immunization solution using pellets that they are working to make sure will be approved through the schools instead of needing shots!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 16:16:29', '2021-07-21 16:16:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072172060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674173', 'Ellen Tresnak', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update I have processed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-21 14:55:32', '2021-07-21 14:55:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072165028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, 'Kallie contacted me today to let me know that Don is planning on having knee surgery sometime this fall for an injury he received during a ski accident this past winter.  I reached out to HCBB with Don''s doctor and contact information so that they can negotiate down the surgery for him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-21 14:25:22', '2021-07-21 14:25:22'),
