  ('zcrm_1579374000072165018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041459005', 'Amy Nielsen', NULL, 'helped Amy with finding fair price information for Spinal MRI off of HCBB- she wound up finding an even better price! $499!!!!  I told her that she is doing a great job at being a responsible self-pay patient! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-21 13:23:09', '2021-07-21 13:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411051', 'James Sullivan', NULL, '7-21-21 I called Donn Kellogg bc he was charged for Aug. for James Sullivan who no longer works for Donnelly Sports. Donn forgot to respond when he asked me how to cancel. He apologized since he realized it was his fault he was charged for Aug., not my fault or MPB. He was completing the form now to cancel James. He''s been paying for James as his employee. James got a new job and has new insurance, so he doesn''t want to keep it. All set. Patti received cancellation form and will refund Aug. fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 12:53:56', '2021-07-21 12:53:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072165013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070506070', 'Alicia Swalley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-21 12:45:07', '2021-07-21 12:45:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411061', 'Donn Kellogg', NULL, '7-21-21 Patti received cancellation form and will refund $ for Aug. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 12:41:36', '2021-07-21 12:41:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072170008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, 'Karen called in requesting reimbursement for her daughter''s mental health therapy appointments. I explained to Karen that there is no reimbursement for mental health therapy and that she has access to the MAP program which would benefit her daughter for therapy. I also explained to Karen that she could nominate her daughter''s therapist for the MAP program but she stated that the therapist is not interested in joining a network. Karen also expressed how disappointed she is that there is no reimbursement policy in place for situations such as this, the requested the MAP information be sent to her via email. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-21 12:38:04', '2021-07-21 12:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072172040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063057002', 'Donald Hess', NULL, 'Member submitted Pmt update form to update CC I processed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-21 12:32:17', '2021-07-21 12:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411061', 'Donn Kellogg', NULL, '7-21-21 I called Donn bc he was charged for Aug. for James Sullivan who no longer works for Donnelly Sports. Donn forgot to respond when he asked me how to cancel. He apologized since he realized it was his fault he was charged for Aug., not my fault or MPB. He was completing the form now to cancel James. He''s been paying for James as his employee. James got a new job and has new insurance, so he doesn''t want to keep it. I will call Patti now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 12:29:50', '2021-07-21 12:29:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '7-21-21 Karen called back and gave me Solina''s DOB 3/10/97 and SS# which I gave to Patti. Patti will refund Karen''s fee and then charge the full fee for Aug. 1st start date for EC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 12:06:18', '2021-07-21 12:06:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '7-21-21 Karen confirmed she will add Solina to her own membership and already completed the Cognito form. I am confirming with Patti since Patti didn''t know who Solina Kennedy was attached to.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 11:39:24', '2021-07-21 11:39:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072178013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165296', 'Lara Vazquez', NULL, '7-21-21 Left vm again re- to see if she wants the CirrusMD/MPB.Health Virtual Healthcare and Life Care for free for 2 years starting Aug. 1st.  I told her I need to know ASAP bc now past deadline. If she wants it they have to send the information to the proper entities to give her access in time for Aug. 1st start.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-21 11:34:36', '2021-07-21 11:34:36'),
