  ('zcrm_1579374000072170003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, 'Transferred Catherine to Zion for help with her needs submission. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-21 10:25:58', '2021-07-21 10:25:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072165008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'David called to understand how a screening colonoscopy is covered at %100, I told him that it needs to be in the PHCS network (he has already confirmed with his providers that they are currently participating)  , and that this needs to be coded as a screening colonoscopy.  I reassured him that he was doing everything right so far and he thanked me for my time! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-21 10:21:38', '2021-07-21 10:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072165003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, 'Tanya called because she had a questions about her preventative bill, I told her that she needed to speak to Planstin about her bill, she told me that she already had.  I told her that whoever she spoke to gave her wrong information, I placed her on hold and warm transferred her to Melissa at Planstin who told me that she would be more than happy to assist Tanya...she told me that they had no call history of Tanya ever calling. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-21 09:48:12', '2021-07-21 09:48:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072161008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297454', 'Kristen Featsent', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-21 09:45:03', '2021-07-21 09:45:03'),
