  ('zcrm_1579374000072063063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132148', 'Rhoda Goff', NULL, 'Herb called to update his billing information, I sent him a payment update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-21 07:55:24', '2021-07-21 07:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'I sent Maurine a list of providers that are showing in network for a screening mammogram per Cari, I also sent the two preventative care benefit templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-21 07:14:31', '2021-07-21 07:14:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072103036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Maurine called to see if a mammography center she was referred to is in her Planstin PHCS Network.  I can see Kelly Anne sent her a facility back in 9/2020, but she says she hasn''t had one in forever (maybe COVID interfered?)  She was doing something in the background and really hard to hear at times.  I sent her the once facility I could find within a 50 mile radius but cc''d Kelly Anne ''cuz it just felt like I might be doing something wrong.  I let Maurine know I''m new and would have Kelly Anne dbl ck my work...  She was super nice and thankful for my efforts.     CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-20 18:42:46', '2021-07-20 18:42:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072117003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078546002', 'Alix Tingle', 'Commissions Paid', 'After further research, I was able to determine Feb-July 2021 we have commission statements that were sent out to Wendy with payment of $15 being paid for each month.  John ensured me that Wendy was paid for this member for all previous months prior to Feb 2021.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-07-20 15:03:17', '2021-07-20 15:03:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248001', 'Thelma Goucher', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-20 14:43:16', '2021-07-20 14:43:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043541115', 'Monica Andersen', NULL, 'Member was in contact with Kelly C letting her know that he had never received RCI Cards.  He gave us a new address.  I spoke to him and told him I owuld send him out link to update address.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 13:43:01', '2021-07-20 13:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540021', 'Paulena Shapiro', NULL, 'Due to error this member had not been charged after she had started.  We charged her for 6/21.  Then I spoke to her and asked when I could draft other payments.  Spouse Gary said that he wanted to update pmt info and I could draft the 2 pmts.  I will send the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 13:41:13', '2021-07-20 13:41:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497007', 'Misti Wilson', NULL, 'Andrea emailed asking about this member.  Misti will be getting employer coverage and she wants to retain spouse &amp; children w/Zion.  I called and talked to Andrea and explained to her that member would cancel Conversion plan &amp; then have spouse re-enroll in the Care+ plan. I would then notify Zion that they are continuing members.  I advised Andrea of the extended deadline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 13:31:05', '2021-07-20 13:31:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035379141', 'Christopher Jackson', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure + Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 12:53:29', '2021-07-20 12:53:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035379141', 'Christopher Jackson', NULL, 'Previous Sedera SD member frm 6/1/19 to 3/1/20', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 12:53:02', '2021-07-20 12:53:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881333', 'Kaleb Kurz', NULL, 'Member called in and asked about getting his 2 other children on the plan.  I sent him out the Plan Change Form to fill out and submit.  He also asked about the TeleDoc service.  I will ask John if Sedera members were put on Cirrus.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 12:45:07', '2021-07-20 12:45:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067740001', 'Jessica Ramey', NULL, 'Jessica called in again, with questions revolving preventative care labs.  I told her that only a lipid and vitamin D screening are covered by her preventative care plan, and explained the definition of MEC to her.  I told her that she should take any wellness lab order to an in network lab....the line items coded as preventative will be a covered expense and the rest will be billed to her at a discounted rate.  Jessica was then concerned that she would then be hit with a very large bill, I told her if she wanted to make it completely safe, she will ask her doctor for just a lipid and vitamin D panel coded as preventative.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-20 11:34:21', '2021-07-20 11:34:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091429', 'Morgan Swartzentruber', 'New Plan eff 8/1/2021', 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 10:50:19', '2021-07-20 10:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071380029', 'Trevor Berry', NULL, 'Melissa called because she said she missed a welcome call yesterday- I explained to her that we do not do welcome calls for people who are not members yet.  She wanted me to help her set up CirrusMD- I told her I couldn''t because her plan didn''t start yet.  I told her to reschedule her welcome call for sometime after Aug 1st, and told her that she should expect her CirrusMD invites during the first week of membership. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-20 10:49:45', '2021-07-20 10:49:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058906061', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'Patrick called with general questions about his preventative care, I told him that he was doing everything correctly so far but sent the preventative care templates to fill in any gaps that he might be missing. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-20 10:20:56', '2021-07-20 10:20:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072107003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, 'Member called in frantic that her MPowering Benefits card is not longer active and that she needed SOMETHING to present to the pediatrician today. I explained to Joy that she does not want to present her MPowering Benefits card anyway, that she should present her Planstin Card at the time of the visit. Joy then stated that she didn''t have a Planstin card and I told her not to worry that I could request a PDF copy and hard copy for her today and that she could present the PDF copy at the time of the visit. While on the phone with Joy, she found her Planstin card and asked if I could tell her whether it was active or not and I explained that I could transfer her to Planstin and they would be more than happy to help her. She then said that she was done doing any work to take her children to the pediatrician and that someone else is going to have to do the work in order to find out if her Planstin card is still legitimate. I explained to her that it is active but to put her mind at ease I would transfer her to Planstin, she still refused, then hung up. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-20 10:01:47', '2021-07-20 10:01:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072038140', 'Barbara Adkins', NULL, 'Was notified by Kelly that she received an email from this member saying that she is not an Ind Contractor and was never told that she needed to be.  I contacted Misty to f/u with this member and to let me know status.  I have put on hold until I hear.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 09:46:17', '2021-07-20 09:46:17'),
