  ('zcrm_1579374000072097021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 08:10:29', '2021-07-20 08:10:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067740001', 'Jessica Ramey', NULL, 'Jessica called to ask if a pap smear was a covered expense with her Planstin card, I told her that it was.  She also told me that she confirmed with her doctor''s office that they would bill Planstin directly. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-20 08:04:14', '2021-07-20 08:04:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071994063', 'Diana Kline', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as she does not qualify for the Secure plan and needs Preventative.  I will cancel as if she did not enroll', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 07:52:03', '2021-07-20 07:52:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096022', 'Aleesha Nichols', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 07:48:30', '2021-07-20 07:48:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072097003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022032', 'Emily Clark', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Planstin &amp; Admin 123.  Member canceling prior to 60 days no commissions paid', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-20 07:01:51', '2021-07-20 07:02:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072086003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049242001', 'Madeleine Blanchard Cupolo', NULL, '7-19-21 Sondra is super nice and cheerful even though she''s seeing how terrible the insurance system is with her daughter. They need to see a neurologist at Children''s Hospital CU Anschutz. She doesn''t have a doctor yet but looked up Dr. Jennifer Armstrong and Dr. Seema Bansal. They are in Bright Health which also has a Bronze $0 Ded EPO plan for $196.43. She will call Children''s to make sure they accept Bright Health plans for Individuals. They are willing to pay for both Oscar and Bright Health totaling about $400 to keep her in-network for all doctors. Other doctors Dr. Jill Kamon and Dr. Jane Bida are in Oscar and not Bright Health or Anthem. Only Oscar and Bright Health have the $0 Ded. options. I need to verify it''s ok for her to have two plans. Cigna included most doctors but still not all. Plus she''d then have a large deductible if chooses Cigna. Bright Health looks best option to add.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-19 15:08:18', '2021-07-19 15:19:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042932035', 'Arthur Cline', NULL, 'Arthur called to update his billing info- I sent him an online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-19 14:36:04', '2021-07-19 14:36:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072077013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, 'No response. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-19 14:25:36', '2021-07-19 14:25:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072077008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068994062', 'Sean Herrin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-19 14:23:31', '2021-07-19 14:23:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064530083', 'Jake Smithknecht', NULL, 'Jake called because he would like to see a back pain specialist and did not know how to utilize his services.  I went over the self pay process with him and sent him a Zion Needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-19 13:46:23', '2021-07-19 13:46:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072068018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, 'Member called inquiring about how to refill a prescription with his doctor. I explained that he would have to pay out of pocket for the office visit and also explained how to present himself as a cash pay patient. I also asked Scott if he had a welcome call as of yet and he stated that he forgot. I informed him of the benefits of completing a welcome call and sent him a new welcome call scheduler via email. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-19 13:29:18', '2021-07-19 13:29:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072077003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', 'Reconciliation Item', 'When reconciling with Planstin''s Invoice for July 2021, we found that the following:
-Vendor cost is $290 should be $335 up to age 49 (expires 2/2022) 
-Member Cost is $361 should be $509 up to age 49 (expires 2/2022)

Will Advise Wendy and Patti (MR)', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2021-07-19 13:00:26', '2021-07-19 13:00:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451131', 'Adria Moshe', NULL, 'Received answer back from Tim Hirsch letting me know that re-enrollment in the Secure plan would not effect any Open Needs that the member has.  I called and left VM to let Adria know that she has to enroll in the Secure.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 12:54:41', '2021-07-19 12:54:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072038140', 'Barbara Adkins', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 12:38:01', '2021-07-19 12:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072038127', 'Tamara Granada', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 12:32:03', '2021-07-19 12:32:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451131', 'Adria Moshe', NULL, 'Adria called in and told me that she would be loosing her Preventative coverage and would like to add that to her existing Zion Coverage.  I told her that she would have to re-enroll in the Secure plan.  Husband owns his own business so that would not be a problem, however se has an open need.  I have question in to Zion to see if they could carry this over to new plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 12:25:26', '2021-07-19 12:25:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072020002', 'Jacob Bonnema', NULL, 'Member called in with some question if his documentation was ok.  He submitted IRS letter &amp; 1099, I told him that was fine.  While I had him on the phone I asked him for Daughter Tate''s SS # and it turned the DOB was wrong as well.  I updated all of this information.  I gave him a timeline of what to expect &amp; when.  Also gave him a quick overview of the plan and how it worked.  I stressed to him to schedule his welcome call and how important that was.  Member happy.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 11:54:24', '2021-07-19 11:54:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610622', 'Leif Anderson', NULL, 'Natalie called because she is sick and in need of a covid test- I tried to find free covid testing in her area but was unable to.  I went over the self pay process with her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-19 11:09:35', '2021-07-19 11:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125098', 'Vaughn Stevens', NULL, 'Member left VM saying he wanted to update his CC.  I sent out link and advised him to get it in ASAP as billing would be run overnight', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 11:03:54', '2021-07-19 11:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030251', 'Matthew Jorgensen', NULL, 'Member called in and said that he had to update his CC.  I sent him out the link to update w/us.  Then I advised him that he would have to update w/Liberty separately.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 10:57:46', '2021-07-19 10:57:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072068013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125098', 'Vaughn Stevens', NULL, 'Vaughn called to change his payment method, I transferred him to Patti. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-19 10:55:43', '2021-07-19 10:55:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091551', 'Allison Stevens', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel with Zion &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 10:46:25', '2021-07-19 10:46:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289539', 'Peter Earsman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel with Zion &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 10:40:10', '2021-07-19 10:40:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072068008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, 'Joy called regarding her screening mammogram that she had done in February but just received a bill in the mail for it today. I explained that if the doctor coded something as diagnostic, then it would not be covered by Planstin. Joy was very upset and I explained that I would transfer her to Planstin so that they could go into detail regarding the billing with her. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-19 10:18:16', '2021-07-19 10:18:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063270012', 'Caroline Eller', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 10:13:29', '2021-07-19 10:13:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091551', 'Allison Stevens', NULL, 'called to cancel- sent online form and bcc''d Patti and Robin. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-19 10:12:42', '2021-07-19 10:12:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071994063', 'Diana Kline', NULL, 'This member called in and told me that she had found us online and went in and enrolled in the Secure plan and was not a business owner.  She said that she was only interested in the Preventative.  I let her know that the Care + did not include Preventative which was a deal breaker for her.  She asked to cancel.  I will send out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 10:09:56', '2021-07-19 10:09:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072068003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289539', 'Peter Earsman', NULL, 'Peter called to cancel his plan. I sent the cancellation email to member and advised him to submit it ASAP due to billing tomorrow. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-19 10:09:55', '2021-07-19 10:09:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361667', 'Deborah Caulfield', NULL, 'Deborah''s knee is bothering her and she called because she needed to be reminded of the process of getting care.  I went over the self pay process with her and sent her instructions on how to submit bills to Sedera if needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-19 10:02:05', '2021-07-19 10:02:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072063003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, 'David called to schedule a doctor''s appointment.  I reminded him that he has Redirect,   noted the number, he has it on his MPB.Health card. I transferred him to Redirect and sent him information about the new Redirect app. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-19 09:06:31', '2021-07-19 09:06:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071994063', 'Diana Kline', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch  $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 08:51:42', '2021-07-19 08:51:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072041003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072020002', 'Jacob Bonnema', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 08:45:00', '2021-07-19 08:45:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071965043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-19 07:38:36', '2021-07-19 07:38:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072026008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, 'Kallie requested Zion''s needs submission link via email, and I sent it to her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-19 07:10:24', '2021-07-19 07:10:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072026003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063270012', 'Caroline Eller', NULL, 'this member requested to cancel via email- I sent a cancellation form and told her to fill it out and submit it by the 20th so that she is not charged again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-19 07:06:42', '2021-07-19 07:06:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072023008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294135', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'Josh &amp; Ashley want to go over their options.  He said in the next few weeks.  I e-mailed back times I have available &amp; mentioned we need to consider his desired change date should they move fwd.  He knows we''ll want to talk very soon if they want a new plan eff 8/1/21, rather than it hitting 9/1/21.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-16 17:30:59', '2021-07-16 17:30:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072023003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, 'Sherry called.  She''s having an issue with an eye infection.  She  started at her primary care physician and he sent her immediately to an optometrist.  I let her know I wasn''t sure how they would look at this: medical or vision, but she had me send her the template for submitting needs to Zion will submit the detailed receipts, including her primary care physician''s, knowing they may say it''s a non-elig vision claim.  I apologized &amp; let her know I''m really new...', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-16 17:05:16', '2021-07-16 17:05:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072017008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '7-16-21 Karen completed application for adding her daughter Solina Kennedy to her membership but is asking about cheaper options bc daughter isn''t earning much. Her guess is $30K per year but only working part time right now. She can get a $189 APTC and plans start at $89 a month. Bright Health $0 ded is $108 with a $6800 MOP. She will look over plans to determine what''s best and knows of Tuesday 20th  deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-16 15:38:56', '2021-07-21 11:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072017003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, '7-16-21 Ben and Ali still have $4200 they are waiting for reimbursement from LHS. Sounds like latest bill is from Oct. 2020, so not super old fortunately.  Ben just enrolled with him as the primary member for Aug. 1st SECURE $685/$1000. I explained differences between SECURE and LHS. He''s happy to hear about the mental health component. Dr. Karrin Mezarina Ped is in PHCS network. She works through Avista at Cornerstone. daughter has her 1 year annual check up Aug. 20th. Told him to let me now if they don''t have the card in time for the visit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-16 14:10:45', '2021-07-16 14:10:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071965038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039567010', 'Adam Pollock', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel with Sedera and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-16 14:04:59', '2021-07-16 14:04:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072012008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067740001', 'Jessica Ramey', NULL, 'Prescription quote for Femring and Progesterone for Jessica finished on 7/16/2021. Cari confirmed with Jessica that the Femring Jessica will be using is for HRT and not as a contraceptive. The price of the Femring is quite high and unfortunately Reid is unable to get this script outside of the U.S. I sent Jessica a discount coupon for Kroger for both of her scripts. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-16 13:26:22', '2021-07-16 13:26:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000072012003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066645001', 'Frank Magourilos', NULL, 'Marie called inquiring about her hard copy cards and questions about how to present herself if anything happens on her road trip. I explained that she will present herself as a cash pay patient, ask for the best cash price, collect the super bill, and submit her needs to Zion. I am requesting the hard copy of her Planstin card via Slack. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-16 13:14:10', '2021-07-16 13:14:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071965033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034584049', 'Lisa Moran', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-16 12:01:17', '2021-07-16 12:01:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071965028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030252076', 'Darryl Claunch', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera, RCI &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-16 11:50:45', '2021-07-16 11:50:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071965023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039421004', 'Robert Steele', NULL, 'Member has been informed that he will be termed eff 7/31.  I will cancel w/Zion.  Member not paying', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-16 11:43:03', '2021-07-16 11:43:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071965018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-16 10:50:06', '2021-07-16 10:50:06'),
