  ('zcrm_1579374000071940007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 941 
Question : I am a member.  I have two requests:

1) I was unable to log into my Member Portal, using ID # MPWRBEN000220-01.  Need your help.


2) how do I request an exemption to change to my plan outside my anniversary date.  My two son''s are now insured elsewhere, and my wife and I only need a plan, with higher limits.

336-420-3777 stevenvhase@gmail.com', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-07-15 18:43:10', '2021-07-15 18:43:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071925013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067740001', 'Jessica Ramey', NULL, 'Called &amp; let Jessica know answers on her colonoscopy/mammogram.  No wait, with Planstin, &amp; timewise, if becomes diagnostic she''ll need to submit detailed invoice to Zion (since diagnostic, need &amp; no wait there either).  She had me send her the template for submitting needs to Zion just in case.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-15 18:08:43', '2021-07-15 18:08:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071866023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054188', 'Chris Larson', NULL, 'member called to update her address, sent her a member update form. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-15 13:29:56', '2021-07-15 13:29:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071876036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870116', 'Paul Borchers', NULL, '7-15-21 Spoke with Sally and Paul is waiting to make a decision. He''s working with his HR department for possibly going onto to C4. He''s also thinking of waiting out the 2 months to decide if they want Cobra or not. Plus he''s considering doing some contract work which will qualify him for SECURE. He needs his 5 year colonoscopy but that''s not due until Oct, so he can''t do it now like they wanted to. Sally will keep me posted as they make decisions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-15 13:11:19', '2021-07-15 13:11:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013453097', 'Jose j De La Cerda', NULL, 'Spoke with his Wife Emma regarding their plan. I explained that because she has the CareZ worksite plan without a MEC their is no preventative care. She went to the doctor because she was not feeling well and the office did tests on her hormones and thyroid. Also explained that any bills exceeding her IUA need to be submitted as a need to Zion.', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', '2021-07-15 12:54:50', '2021-07-15 12:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071866018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809171', 'Joseph Ayers', NULL, 'Lisa called to cancel, I sent her a cancellation form and told her to fill it out and submit it before the 20th of the month so that she is not charged again.  I also BCC''d Kevin Michael''s. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-15 12:40:41', '2021-07-15 12:40:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071930008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031476065', 'Michelle Sangster', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change her name on her membership and address due to divorce.  I have submitted to RCI &amp; Sedera and I will change in FTNI.  Formerly Michelle Fuller.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-15 12:27:31', '2021-07-15 12:28:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071930003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006886022', 'Norma Matherly', NULL, 'Member has declined 2 mos in a row will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-15 11:58:10', '2021-07-15 11:58:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071925003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039419008', 'Dean Sawyer', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-15 11:26:56', '2021-07-15 11:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071876031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070112023', 'Johanna Parsano', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-15 11:24:01', '2021-07-15 11:24:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071868008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Deb called regarding labs that are covered under her plan. I informed Deb that she has a Vitamin D and Lipid panel that is included at no cost to her, but that all other labs would be out of pocket. She was also calling to inquire about HCBB and her login information. I let Deb know that she was misinformed and that her plan does not include HCBB (but the concierge team would be MORE than happy to look up any fair pricing she may need). - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-15 10:59:28', '2021-07-15 10:59:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071866013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291686', 'Craig Frithsen', NULL, 'Craig called because he was confused about what card to present for his dermatology visit coming up.  I explained his Planstin card and MPB.Health card and told him what they are used for and then I went over the self pay process with him.  I sent him the Zion needs submission form because he was curious of where to send the bills that exceed his IUA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-15 09:58:09', '2021-07-15 09:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071876026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255151', 'Blake Satterlee', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-15 09:56:12', '2021-07-15 09:56:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071876021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061648213', 'Christina Bailey', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-15 09:53:34', '2021-07-15 09:53:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071876013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380355', 'Andrea Holder', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail.Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-15 09:50:13', '2021-07-15 09:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071876008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477509', 'Stephanie Cwirn', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-15 09:25:17', '2021-07-15 09:25:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071876003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878165', 'Donavin Roberts', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-15 09:17:16', '2021-07-15 09:17:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071868003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716875', 'Cynthia Hunt', NULL, 'Member called to cancel, sent the cancellation link email and informed member to submit it before the 20th of the month so that she does not get charged for August 2021. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-15 08:57:13', '2021-07-15 08:57:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071866003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893072', 'Elaine Roth', NULL, 'Elaine''s husband called for help with getting Elaine and Isabel set up with CirrusMD.  I found that Elaine was already registered with the main email address on this account- I explained to him how she could sign back in and reset password if necessary.  I also got Isabel''s email address and sent her an invite as well.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-15 08:50:13', '2021-07-15 08:50:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071839018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069341714', 'Mark Read', NULL, 'Mark called.  He didn''t receive all the e-mails Kelly Anne sent, so I resent: Summary of Care w/Zion & Planstin MEC.  He had questions about finding a Dr and we went over HCBB (he tried to sign in & it  said he wasn''t found yet.  He''s going to try again and give it the 2-3weeks expected time for him to be in the system).  In the meantime, we were able to determine a doctor for his normal care was not available at the UCHealth Bldg next to him here in Longmont.  Those services are up in Loveland, Greeley, & Windsor facilities.  He needed to run, but will call us back if he has more questions.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-14 16:58:39', '2021-07-14 16:58:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071839013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Deb called.  She needed to see what was covered as far as screening on the ACA/preventative site.  I sent her the preventative template again.  Also, I told her I would call with some answers re: HCBB tomorrow and she was fine with that.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-14 16:26:31', '2021-07-14 16:26:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071839008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067740001', 'Jessica Ramey', NULL, 'Jessica called.  Sent her the preventative &amp; wellness e-mails.  Also sent her the prescription quote request form for her items: Progesterone &amp; (femmring?).  We went over a lot.  Trying to help her separate the different items, but she seems to be getting it.  Tomorrow, I need to follow-up with some answers I need to get from Kelly Anne on colonoscopies &amp; mammograms.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-14 16:14:31', '2021-07-14 16:14:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071783048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019014', 'Caroline Kava', NULL, 'Received Cancellation from this member I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-14 13:56:34', '2021-07-14 14:02:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071783043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085163', 'Teresa Baker', NULL, 'Received cancellation from member.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-14 13:50:34', '2021-07-14 13:50:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071846003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019014', 'Caroline Kava', NULL, '7-14-21 Hates to cancel but she''s getting insurance now through her partner''s employer instead for Aug. 1st, 2021. She was completely happy with her membership with us.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-14 13:46:14', '2021-07-14 13:46:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071808028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019014', 'Caroline Kava', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent online cancellation form and bcc''d Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-14 13:41:11', '2021-07-14 13:41:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071808023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-14 13:29:18', '2021-07-14 13:29:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071816013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544245', 'Bethany Schaap', NULL, 'Bethany called in regarding her screening colonoscopy, mammogram, and complimentary wellness visit. She had her complimentary wellness visit and mammogram back in April and has not received any information indicating that it has been paid by Zion. Bethany reached out to Zion and they told her that she would need to speak with the MPB.Health concierge team for any small claims issues. I explained to Bethany that we do not handle any of the billing on our end and asked if she had submitted the need to Zion or if she presented her Zion card at the time of service. Bethany was adamant that she did NOT need to collect or submit any bills because that is something we should already have in our possession after her visits. I explained that she should have collected the super bills for a needs submission if she did not pay at the time of service, she was not satisfied with my answer.  She then asked if she needed to find an in-network doctor for her screening colonoscopy, which I answered no, and she stated that the Zion concierge team told her that she was required to have an in-network doctor for her screening colonoscopy (which is incorrect). I did ask Dr. Jeff Lee to have someone from Zion reach out to Bethany for further explanation of her preventative services. - JTS
**UPDATE** Tim Hirsch confirmed that a member from their team was able to reach out to Bethany and explain her screening colonoscopy plan to her. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-14 13:20:56', '2021-07-15 11:52:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071816008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058247082', 'Anne-Marie Marron', NULL, 'Anne-Marie called in regarding several questions about her screening colonoscopy, screening mammogram, complimentary office visit (up to $250), and her CirrusMD account. I explained everything regarding her screening colonoscopy and mammogram, and also explained how to use CirrusMD. She also inquired about using alternative medicine and the pre-approval process. I explained to Anne-Marie that she could use the Zion Needs Submission link that I sent her via email to also request a pre-approval for her alternative medicine needs. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-14 13:10:05', '2021-07-14 13:10:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071783038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', 'New plan eff 8/1/21', 'Member Only $2500 IUA MPB Care Z Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-14 13:01:16', '2021-07-14 13:01:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071783033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'Margie submitted change form to remove spouse.  I will let Zion know and change billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-14 12:59:20', '2021-07-14 12:59:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071808018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442023', 'Ann Johnson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-14 12:51:33', '2021-07-14 12:51:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071783028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that husband was going on Medicare eff 8/1 2021.  I will send her out the Change form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-14 12:39:55', '2021-07-14 12:39:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071808013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, 'Michael is having issues setting up his CirrusMD account, so I reached out to Brody and the rest of the CirrusMD team and asked them to contact him asap so that they can help him trouble shoot the app and get started talking to a doctor.  The problem that he is having is that he keeps entering the medical information but it isn''t saving. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-14 11:49:16', '2021-07-14 11:49:16'),
