  ('zcrm_1579374000071761013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, 'Linda called.  Her husband went for his physical & they found blood in his urine.  He needs to have a catscan.  I e-mailed a list of facilities in their area for abdominal/pelvis CTs (she isn''t sure exactly what type of catscan he needs, so they''ll call back if they find out it''s a different category). We went over how to handle this as self-pay, detailed receipt, & to submit to Zion the receipts if this need exceeds their 1k IUA.  He is also having the lens replaced in his eye(s) & they wondered if that would be covered.  I explained that they do not have vision coverage in this plan, however to call if it''s being considered medically necessary (she didn''t think so).    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-13 18:18:04', '2021-07-13 18:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071761008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480088', 'Sheila Finch-Manzagol', NULL, 'Sheila called for help getting into her HMA site.  I let her know she''d need to speak directly to her advisor for that since it''s not a part of her MPowering Benefits Plan.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-13 16:41:54', '2021-07-13 16:41:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071755013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555128', 'Raphael Joly', NULL, '7-13-21 Today is Raphael''s Birthday at 30! He''s working at Mirabelle Restaurant now for Nathalie Joly (his mom). She will pay for it through the Mirabelle Restaurant. He lost his ins at the beginning of the month.  Since he might not work here long-term, I will keep it as auto-pay instead of List Bill. Also her membership is PDHC.  He''s healthy, no tobacco, takes Adderall for ADHD on occasion and soma (sp?) for back spasms to help him sleep when he works too much in the medical world. He tries to make sure he does his annual wellness visit every year and he''s familiar with HSA''s. So, he wants SECURE $1000/$275.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-13 16:36:32', '2021-07-13 16:36:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071761003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048143018', 'AJ Chamberlin', NULL, 'Neither AJ or Wendy received my e-mail from yesterday.  So I copied it (including sent info from yesterday for their knowledge) and sent it from directly from my Outlook acct this time.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-13 15:57:19', '2021-07-13 15:57:19'),
