  ('zcrm_1579374000071686013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725199', 'Susan McCormick-Davis', NULL, 'I was able to have a password reset email sent over to Susan finally after all the times she tried it kept saying to call the 800 # for assistance. But I was able to get it to work on my own. I emailed Susan to let her know this and to keep an eye out for the email to reset and create a new password for her Member Portal. Ticket is Closed and Susan is all set! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-07-13 07:23:53', '2021-07-13 07:23:53'),
