  ('zcrm_1579374000071677026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712208', 'Earl Walker', NULL, '7-12-21 Earl joined SECURE $1000/$500 for ES. He said Gretchen is the best referral source since he and Barb would have been very skeptical otherwise. But, as his accountant he trusts her and he will refer two people he works with as well, Ned and Katie Kelly Cunningham. He''ll send them via email like Gretchen did. I sent them the copy of Zion''s Financial Stats as well. They are all set for an Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-12 17:13:09', '2021-07-12 17:13:09'),
