  ('zcrm_1579374000071649053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438206', 'Brandon Pearce', NULL, 'Brandon called for the "script" on how to present your MEC card- I told him that I would send him the script as well as send him other preventative care information.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-12 13:45:27', '2021-07-12 13:45:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071677021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, '7-12-21 John will complete the cancellation form when he gets back to the office in a little bit and will let me know. Then I can ask Sedera to move AJ into John''s roll as the primary member with the 2 kids. They will keep the kids original start date of Feb. 1st 2020. Membership is MPB Secure with Redirect Health at $610/$1500 down from $938/$1500 bc AJ is turning 55 and John is turning 65 both in Aug.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-12 13:31:59', '2021-07-12 13:31:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071677016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048143018', 'AJ Chamberlin', NULL, '7-12-21 AJ is basically swapping into John Chamberlin''s enrollment and taking over the kids because John is aging out into Medicare. Sedera is allowing them to do this and they will keep the kids original start date and AJ will have her own new start date for Aug. 1st, 2021. Kids both have Lyme Disease so we don''t want to move them to Zion. AJ is 10 years younger than John, so price is decreasing from $938 to $610.  AJ just enrolled on MPB Secure with Redirect for Aug. 1st start. I will make sure John cancels his membership now and Sedera move AJ to be with the kids on their current membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-12 13:24:18', '2021-07-12 13:24:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071649048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044279010', 'Helena Hofer', NULL, 'Helena emailed me and requested to cancel, I emailed her a cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-12 13:14:04', '2021-07-12 13:14:04'),
