  ('zcrm_1579374000071679003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048544005', 'Daniel Soleja', NULL, 'Daniel called in regarding COVID testing for his wife. I explained to Daniel that COVID testing is not a shareable need and the best option is to go to his local health department for little to no cost testing. Daniel also requested a list of in-network labs in case he needs to take his wife in to have labs done. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-12 12:14:15', '2021-07-12 12:14:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071677011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '7-12-21 Signed up for HMA (I think $40 a month) for future root canal and SECURE $1000/$275. All set. Also gave him $100 fee waived for joining as ASHI member. I forgot to have him enroll via the ASHI link. Ooops!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-12 11:33:50', '2021-07-12 11:33:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071677003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '7-12-21 Read the Guidelines to him one more time since he has two of the pre-x exemptions.

Exceptions for High Blood Pressure, High Cholesterol, and Diabetes
High blood pressure, high cholesterol, and diabetes (types 1 and 2) will not be considered pre-existing conditions as long as the member has not been hospitalized for the condition in the past 12 months and is able to control it through medication and/or diet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-12 11:17:05', '2021-07-12 11:19:26'),
