  ('zcrm_1579374000071611031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '7-9-21 Talked with Nan and she definitely wanted to put her income back down since it''s all unknown. It was showing at $26K already but ded should have been at $3K not $5500. Either way, we dropped it to $24K which brought down the Ded to $1000 which is tolerable for her. Her new pmt amount is $163.34 and APTC is $609.28. Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5500 HMO/Silver. She''s happy again and wants to make sure she doesn''t go to ER this month with the high ded.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-09 16:40:43', '2021-07-09 16:40:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071611023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '7-9-21 Nan called bc her account is still messed up and now her ded went up to $5500 not $750. She''s not ok with this and we need to change it back. Her income did not increase. It''s only a guess and looks like we put it back to $26K. On hold with C4 now with Atray (?) who''s looking into the account.... She says we can''t put it back bc of the new calculations with ARP. The only way to change it is with an income change. But, of course it will be adjusted accordingly once she files her taxes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-09 16:00:11', '2021-07-09 16:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071611018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712208', 'Earl Walker', NULL, '7-9-21  Earl is 57 and Barb is 59 and turning 60 soon. Barb is retiring soon and they will lose their health ins. Looked into C4 and it will be $1500! Cobra is slightly less but they just want to protect their assets and realize they might need to earn less to get health insurance. Haha! They are both healthy, no tobacco. Earl takes Allopurinol for gout for past 15-17 years. Takes 300 mg for 90 days and is currently paying $60 but on GoodRX it''s only $16 for 90 day supply. Might be even better with WorldMeds. Realizes this is pre-x. Barb takes occasional sleeping meds which he''s hoping she won''t need once she''s retired. Live in Salida, 81201 and Dr. Matthew Burkley is showing up in PHCS network, so hoping Dr. Dan Lombardo is in the network as well. I told him to make sure before they visit. They do their annual wellness visits and somewhat familiar with HSA but never funded one before.  Earl runs his own LLC and hasn''t quite earned enough to move to S-Corp yet.  Possibly want Aug. 1st start date with SECURE $1000/$500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-09 15:13:11', '2021-07-09 15:13:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071584081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514334', 'Jordan Lubin', NULL, 'Per Kelly''s request I tried to call this member and was unable to get through to them as they were having some power issues.  I will get back with him on Monday after talking with G.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-09 14:39:57', '2021-07-09 14:39:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442023', 'Ann Johnson', NULL, 'missed welcome call, left detailed message and sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 14:36:41', '2021-07-09 14:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071584076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514334', 'Jordan Lubin', NULL, 'For some reason G cancelled this member when he was a flip from Sedera to Zion.  I will advise Kelly that he is active and follow up with G on Monday', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-09 14:30:15', '2021-07-09 14:30:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069918001', 'Joseph Hatch', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 14:20:48', '2021-07-09 14:20:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, 'So Deanna called and had a very long issue going on with a bill she got for a self pay appointment she went to back in March. This was for a Diagnostic Mammogram and an Ultrasound. She fully understood all of that was self pay, etc. So when she went and after having the Diag Mammogram the nurse or whomever came back in and said "It looks like you do NOT need to have the Ultrasound done." That''s great BUT her issue is since everything was paid for beforehand they are not giving her the money back for the Ultrasound she did NOT have done. Deanna said she has called them 3 times and spoken to 3 different people and they are just giving her the run around. One of the times someone said "Well you just owe us $20 and we will call it even." Which is just insane and doesn''t make sense. Deanna just wanted some advice on what she should do or say to get this money back. I gave her the best advice I could and we actually figured it out on what to say properly. I let her know that if for some reason they still push back and refuse to give the money back for her to call her bank and dispute it that way. I told her the bank will do everything for her after she explains the situation and start and investigation. Her last comment was that we here are the best and so wonderful to be able to call. She has called a few times and each time we have helped her greatly and she LOVES us. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-07-09 14:12:11', '2021-07-09 14:12:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514334', 'Jordan Lubin', NULL, 'Jordan called inquiring about his Zion cards...but his account shows as cancelled I tried to transfer him to Patti for clarification but she was unavailable, I told Jordan that I would reach out to Patti about this and ask her to give him a phone call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 14:00:22', '2021-07-09 14:00:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071611008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '7-9-21 Tania is frustrated since her long time gyn of 25 years is not in the network, Dr. Gail King. She paid for the $375 wellness visit on her own. She also paid for part of her mammogram visit but part was paid for. She had to go back for a 2nd visit which she paid in full as well. I told her that is likely a diagnostic visit that is no longer included in wellness no matter what insurance plan she''s using. So, she''s trying to decide if it''s worth keeping the MEC for $60 a month or not. She really wants the HSA compliance. So, she''s going to run the numbers and decide whether or not to keep it. She''ll let me know by the 20th. I also told her to call Planstin about the mammogram radiology portion of the bill that is showing as In network via the search tool for Aspen Valley Hospital Radiology. She will call them and see what she can learn or if she can get paid for that part of the bill. The doctor who read the mammogram is in the network and that part was paid for by Planstin.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-09 13:30:49', '2021-07-09 13:30:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855001', 'Tim Whitney', NULL, 'sent Dona a link to Zion Needs submission page via email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 13:14:22', '2021-07-09 13:14:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125098', 'Vaughn Stevens', NULL, 'Vaughn called in and asked if he could get his login info for his HMA account. I let him know that that is something he needs to get in touch with the actual bank that he signed up with when opening that account. We don''t have access to that for him as it is his personal bank account he set up. He is going to call that bank then. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-07-09 12:52:03', '2021-07-09 12:52:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, 'David wanted to set up his free therapy services through MAP- I transferred him to them and emailed him more information. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 12:18:39', '2021-07-09 12:18:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, 'had a missed call from Daniel Muniz while I was on lunch- I called him back and left a message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 12:12:29', '2021-07-09 12:12:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071608013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063621002', 'Laurie Banz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-09 11:20:11', '2021-07-09 11:20:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062875001', 'Forrest Messenger', NULL, 'Forrest called because he has concerns about Washington taxing him for not having traditional insurance.  I explained that the plan that he has SHOULD exclude him from any penalties, but if he believes something has changed and he is concerned he should reach out to Misty.  He asked for her phone number and I gave it to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 11:19:43', '2021-07-09 11:19:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071608008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-09 10:47:45', '2021-07-09 10:47:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071611003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683010', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '7-9-21 Friday Bronze HSA X therefore it is HSA compliant. Just had to check.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-09 10:47:39', '2021-07-09 10:47:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004339007', 'Phil Guinouard', NULL, 'Phil called for information about his preventative care benefits- I went over the preventative care emails verbally and sent them to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 10:34:19', '2021-07-09 10:34:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630241', 'Tina Rutherford', NULL, 'Tina called to ask what diagnostic lab tests were covered, I told her that only very limited preventative lab tests are covered- but diagnostic labs will be an out of pocket expense.  I went over the self pay process with her and sent her information on how she can submit her bills to Sedera for sharing. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 10:05:27', '2021-07-09 10:05:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071608003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370104', 'Douglas Dester', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-09 09:59:33', '2021-07-09 09:59:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125098', 'Vaughn Stevens', NULL, 'Vaughn called to ask when he should expect his debit card that goes along with his HMA account, I told him that he would need to speak with Jeff about that. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 09:53:25', '2021-07-09 09:53:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071584069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, 'Hillary (spouse) was transferred to me by Kelly F she had questions surrounding HSA/HMA information that was sent to her by Wendy.  I explained differences to her and she said that she didn''t want or need the HMA and that it was the HSA that she wanted.  She said that she had alot of medical bills that needed to be paid.  I advised since she is not on the plan that she should not pay any of her medical bills out of the HSA and that she should clarify this with her accountant.  She will be enrolling online w/HSA Bank.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-09 09:48:22', '2021-07-09 09:48:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071600003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', 'Check released', 'Check #1205 from Academy of Health Excellence account in  the amount of $65 was mailed out today. (MR)', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2021-07-09 08:34:48', '2021-07-09 08:34:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442023', 'Ann Johnson', NULL, 'sent CirrusMD invite and updated CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 07:22:12', '2021-07-09 07:22:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069918001', 'Joseph Hatch', NULL, 'sent CirrusMD invites to both Joseph and Annie, in prep for their welcome call scheduled for later today and updated the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-09 07:21:22', '2021-07-09 07:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071592008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, 'Chuck called wanting to see if we could help find less expensive places for his free &amp; total testosterone tests.  I sent him an e-mail listing the ''Fair Price'' facilities near him.  He also had questions on his annual physical w/Planstin.  So I sent him the Wellness &amp; Prev Network templates too.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-08 17:17:45', '2021-07-08 17:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071592003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called.  He needs to change his plan and add another member.  I told him that''s best to do through his advisor so they are aware of the change.  It''s past 5pm and I sent a chat to Joan for confirmation, but she''s not available right now .  If she says this should be handled in another manner, I will reach out to John again.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-08 15:56:25', '2021-07-08 15:56:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071573031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '7-8-21 Talked with Emily and told her about Telehealth with CirrusMD and Life Care. She said her mom just passed away 3 months ago and that would have been really helpful. But, she has other aging family members that could be helpful to use this. I didn''t even get a chance to explain the 12 free mental health counseling visits. She will look for my email in the next few days explaining all of the benefits and believes she will keep her HES membership for those 2 things alone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-08 15:12:50', '2021-07-08 15:12:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071573023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '7-8-21 Robert called me back. He was given terrible information all the way around starting from our Concierge Team and perpetuating through Redirect. He was told by Redirect his membership was cancelled by his employer which wasn''t true. Told to send his receipts via email to them even though they are all specialist visits now. Spoke with a Dr. Johnson with Redirect and Sabrina with Redirect. Sabrina disparaged MPB saying he hasn''t had a membership for 8 months and he should try to get his money back, even though she mentioned he''s also a member of Sedera! I have a call into Mike Bechtol to straighten this out. He simply needed to connect with Sedera for the Need, not Redirect since it''s far beyong PCP.  They are looking to set up surgery in Aug. 20th-Oct 26th. I also called him back to let him know about 2nd MD through Sedera and to ask about that process. He will.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-08 14:05:32', '2021-07-08 14:09:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071573018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048143018', 'AJ Chamberlin', NULL, '7-8-21 AJ needs to take over the membership for the kids since John Chamberlin is aging into Medicare. AJ doesn''t have any membership at this time. She thought she had applied but never did. DOB 8/21/1966. Daughter is 20 and son 16, both dealing with Lyme disease. Best to keep them with Sedera is at all possible. AJ has a thumb issue and just meds for menopause. Takes progesterone, estrogen, lunesta and thyroid meds. John is on PDHC which will be ideal if we can keep them there bc of pre-x for kids! At $1500 IUA John''s paying $938/$1500 and it should drop to $610/$1500 since AJ is turning 55 in Aug.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-08 13:34:54', '2021-07-08 13:34:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071536128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838117', 'Allan Tidwell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-08 13:16:34', '2021-07-08 13:16:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071573013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870116', 'Paul Borchers', NULL, '7-8-21 Sally works at Children''s Hospital in CO and is planning to retire by the end of July. Paul is her husband and will need a solution since he''s 62 and works for a small construction company. They might help pay for his healthcare plan, but they will sort that out. He''s a W2 employee and no longer has his own firewood biz. He''s moving towards retiring as well. So, CARE+ is the option for him and Sally is going to try to have him do his colonoscopy by July 30th so that he''s set on that front until Medicare age. She says they''re willing to pay for his annual wellness visit cash since those are minimal for men. He just was put on blood pressure meds 2 months ago and going back to have it checked in 2 weeks. They are also wanting an option for dental and hearing and less concerned about vision. But, can use HMA for all of that.  Wants a Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-08 12:30:13', '2021-07-08 12:30:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071549028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071572039', 'Mara Simoneau', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-08 10:42:35', '2021-07-08 10:42:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071573008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '7-8-21 Rod has approved a $65 refund for Emily''s MeMD telemedicine visit that was supposed to be for free to her. Michele had been tasked to send her the refund check via mail.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-08 10:42:08', '2021-07-08 10:42:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071573003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '7-8-21 I called and left another vm today to help with membership. Looks like Concierge squared away his account as active again. But, Mike Bechtol called bc they don''t offer their services in British Virgin Islands. Robert should know that, but I''ll explain again. They spend part of the year in the states and can use it while here. Sedera can be used anywhere. So, membership is still good for them, except the price. If they don''t have any pre-x, I will discuss moving them to new membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-08 10:40:27', '2021-07-08 10:40:27'),
