  ('zcrm_1579374000071536003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838117', 'Allan Tidwell', NULL, 'sent invite to CirrusMD in prep for this member''s welcome call scheduled later today. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-08 07:57:48', '2021-07-08 07:57:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071489024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '7-7-21 I talked with Emily and she''s been paying for HES since 2017 and finally needed to use the telemedicine portion of her membership and nobody could help her. She was told is was cancelled and then they made her pay $65 to use it. Nobody with our Concierge Team that she spoke with was able to tell her what the $50 includes for HES anymore. She was told someone would call her back about how to handle her emergency telemedicine need and nobody did. So, she was ready to cancel altogether. She likes LHS and wants to keep them. She has no desire to switch even if it''s cheaper. I suggested CARE+ bc they don''t do wellness visits. They do mostly holistic care or urgent care, not wellness. The telemedicine is important to her!  She wants an overview of what''s provided with the HES membership since nobody she asked could answer the question. I told her I will do so!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-07 17:35:06', '2021-07-07 17:37:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071487008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Jayne called.  Her daughter Alexa talked to CirrusMD and told her to see a dermatologist regarding a rash on her face.  She''s going to go as a cash pay patient and will keep the detailed receipts in case it is an eligible need that goes above their 1k IUA.  She had me send her the template for how to submit a need to Zion and dermatologists in her daughter''s area.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-07 17:22:09', '2021-07-07 17:22:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071489008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165296', 'Lara Vazquez', NULL, '7-7-21 I sent her a very long and detailed email showing proof of communications regarding LHS and Academy of Health Excellence/HES separation and explanation of benefits. Patti, Rod and I discussed refunding her 3 months of her membership and offer for future telemedicine and Life Care benefits for 2 years at no cost. Letter attached. She didn''t respond and her account was never cancelled. Now she''s IRATE and threatening to sue again and wants all money back. Patti refunded her the original $150, plus the newest payment for $50 today. Somehow the credit card on file is from 2019 but seems to have gone through for July. Her payment last month did not work but did this month. It''s very bizarre! I will reach out to her on Friday to make sure she sees the refund of two separate transactions of $150 and $50. I will see if she still wants the 2 years of services at no cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-07 16:11:43', '2021-07-07 16:17:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071489003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045454012', 'Laura Hanssen', NULL, '7-7-21 Laura and I just updated her account for 2021 income at $153K for an $924.79 APTC! She''s thrilled. Their new payment will be $818.12 for same Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 7000 for HSA. All set for rest of 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-07 16:00:37', '2021-07-07 16:00:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071487003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'Julius called again. He asked about the network again. I let him know the list of facilities just shows ''fair price'' locations, they are not a required network for non-preventative services.  His wife Eileen is a doctor and was also on the line.  She''s telling us this is not a pre-existing condition. even though the first test was on 6/30/21.  I let her know Zion would be the ones reviewing this and they have people and doctors on staff that go by far more than the dates of the procedure(s), so I gave them Zion''s # and also transferred them directly so they can discuss with Zion Directly.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-07 15:59:40', '2021-07-07 15:59:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071468008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070112023', 'Johanna Parsano', NULL, 'Johanna called.  Her husband''s e-mail address was on file, but he''s aged out to Medicare and no longer on the plan so we changed it to hers.  I also removed his e-mail address from his old file.  If they continue to receive items she''ll find out where the e-mails are coming from (ie: advisor, Planstin, etc.)   CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-07 14:36:20', '2021-07-07 14:36:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071425033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370083', 'Earl Thibault', NULL, 'I sent Earl a CirrusMD invite just so that he has it available. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-07 14:02:47', '2021-07-07 14:02:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071425028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370083', 'Earl Thibault', NULL, 'Earl called to ask if CirrusMD could script him out some muscle relaxers- I told him that CirrusMD would not be able to because muscle relaxers are a controlled medication.  I went over the self pay process with him, he is out of town and I suggested that he go to an urgent care. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-07 14:01:20', '2021-07-07 14:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071436073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427074', 'Fox Marie Magdovitz', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to change her name from Jennifer Magdovitz to Fox Magdovitz.  I will let Sedera know and change in RCI portal.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-07 13:59:11', '2021-07-07 13:59:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071425023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162017', 'Lucas Klinkhammer', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent cancellation form and told him to fill it out before the 20th so that he is not charged again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-07 12:42:49', '2021-07-07 12:42:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071468003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779416', 'Christine Heinritz', NULL, '"Chris"tine called.  Her son just graduated and got a job in Manhattan, she wondered at what point he has to go on his own plan.  Kelly Anne verified for me with Patti &amp; I let Chris know:  when her son turns 26, he must go on his own plan with Zion, but that''s pretty easy.   (he''s only 23 right now per Chris).    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-07 12:26:52', '2021-07-07 12:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071467003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689077', 'Andre Simoneau', NULL, '7-7-21 Mara is removing herself from the membership as she and Andre are divorcing.  Andre may need a hernia surgery within the next 6 months so he will remain on this membership.  Mara is joining her own membership now with Keenan CARE+ $2500/$315. They will be transient until Oct and then living in Mexico for a bit and who knows from there. But, home base still same address as on file.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-07 11:22:41', '2021-07-07 11:32:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071436068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689077', 'Andre Simoneau', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation to remove spouse due to divorce.  I sent to Wendy as well so she could be in touch with Mara.  I will remove her from the Sedera option.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-07 11:14:38', '2021-07-07 11:14:38'),
