  ('zcrm_1579374000071436023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'Mitchell called me after hours with some questions about his plan.  first being about "insurance" cards that his daughters pediatrician is requesting.  Also about updating his address.  Proactively I have emailed him the member change link and left VM for him to contact me with any further questions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-07 09:41:57', '2021-07-07 09:41:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071425013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062151025', 'Diana Lim', NULL, 'Diana called to get more information about her preventative care benefits- I sent her the 2 preventative care emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-07 09:34:10', '2021-07-07 09:34:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071436018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069727014', 'Nathanael ORTIZ', NULL, 'Spoke to Briseida will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-07 09:33:04', '2021-07-07 09:33:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071428013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, '07.07.21:  Recvd. email from Bart.  Said he would like any information about the plans when we''re ready.
Emailed him back to let him know that I will contact him when we launch these plans.  I also told him I will be assisting him as his Advisor and to call on me with any questions or the Concierge.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-07-07 09:18:15', '2021-07-07 09:18:15'),
