  ('zcrm_1579374000071428008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, '07.06.21:  Vanessa called me to refer him as Micheal is no longer w/MPB.  I spoke w/Rod about this.  He told me to take over this acct. and call Diane Border re: plans.  Diane is no longer appointed w/Aflack but Rod is going to sign agreement w/Aflack as a broker so we can offer their plans.  I emailed Bart and told him we''re going to launch these plans  in the near future.  I told him Michael is no longer w/MPB and I would take over his acct. if he likes.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-07-07 08:58:43', '2021-07-07 08:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071428003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, '07.05.21:  Bart had a Welcome call with Vanessa.  He asked if we offer Dental &amp; Vision plans.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-07-07 08:56:29', '2021-07-07 08:56:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071425008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, 'Patti reached out to Redirect Health asking them why Robert was told that he was cancelled with them.  They told her that it was a mistake on their end and that he is an active member, I emailed Robert to let him know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-07 08:49:47', '2021-07-07 08:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071425003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'Julius had questions about getting lab work done- he seemed to think that he needed to go in the PHCS network- I tried to explain that he only needed to do that for his preventative care bld wrk.  This member seems really confused, and not a good candidate for the plan, as it seems as though his wife just picked up a pre-x condition at the end of last month.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-07 07:58:05', '2021-07-07 07:58:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071404036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, 'Robert called again.  I think he misunderstood & called Redirect after talking w/Kelly Anne earlier.  He''s frustrated because they told him his ''employer'' cancelled him and he''s retired.  He doesn''t have an employer.  Maybe it''s Sedera he should have called (if I''m understanding KC''s note)?  So, I sent her an e-mail to call him during her shift tomorrow for her expertise.  He''s feeling like he''s spending >1k a month and being told he doesn''t have coverage.   I think he''s just confused.  Still.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-06 19:10:35', '2021-07-06 19:10:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071404031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'Julius called.  Had questions about a follow-up to a cardiology appointment on 6/30/21 (=day before his plan began).  He did not seem to understand pre-x items, so he''s going to find out more about the new procedure.  (I sent him HCBB facilities for the 3 types of treatment he thought it might be, two are <1k and the other fair price is >8k.)  I told him Kelly Anne would call tomorrow to gather the information because it''s possibly the higher priced one. He''ll find out for sure prior to that so they can discuss.  I also mentioned he might want to discuss the pre-x with his advisor.  He''s going to go in and schedule his Welcome Call too.     CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-06 17:09:45', '2021-07-06 17:09:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071404026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246185', 'Matthew Johnson', NULL, 'Matt called with questions regarding his cancellation.  He said he never sent the cancellation form, so I went ahead and sent the link so at least we can have his formal request on file.  That template includes Patti''s contact info &amp; he will follow-up with her tomorrow regarding his cancellation questions.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-06 15:22:41', '2021-07-06 15:22:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071373033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471284', 'Michelle Caldwell', NULL, 'spoke to Michelle,  sent her PHCS network lists and updated her email address. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-06 14:53:31', '2021-07-06 14:53:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071373028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471284', 'Michelle Caldwell', NULL, 'I called Michelle back- she was a missed call while I was on a welcome call and Cari was away on lunch.  I left a message telling her that we would love to help her and to give us a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-06 14:42:36', '2021-07-06 14:42:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071373023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'I did a "mini" welcome call with Julius- spent 15 minutes on the phone answering his questions.  I guided him to the welcome call scheduler and sent him a script quote form as well as Zion''s needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-06 14:38:19', '2021-07-06 14:38:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071373018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069994428', 'Kelly Snider', NULL, 'Welcome Call Complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-06 14:20:32', '2021-07-06 14:20:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071404021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'Brian called.  I helped him get himself and wife registered w/CirrusMD.  He''ll call back if they have any issues.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-06 13:01:31', '2021-07-06 13:01:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071373013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, 'Robert called because he had received an email from "us" on the 1st that prompted members to call us first if they have any non emergent surgeries over $5000 so that we can put them in touch with HCBB''s Care Connect team- I told Robert that it sounded like he received the email in error because he does not have those services.  I told him to continue following the instructions of his Sedera needs'' coordinator. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-06 13:01:00', '2021-07-06 13:01:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071361051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 12:53:19', '2021-07-06 12:53:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071361046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled I have gone in and changed information to current enrollment.  I will monitor closely.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 12:52:58', '2021-07-06 12:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071361041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042738276', 'Joshua Latham', NULL, 'I took a call from Cari with this member.  He is looking for a Group number since his daughter is going to college and needs this for her paperwork.  He alluded that he was transferred to Liberty who didn''t know who he was.  Thought he was getting the "runaround".  I told him that he would have a member number and could get it from Sedera.  I also advised him that we have had limited success with colleges because they are looking for insurance and typically don''t accept medical cost sharing as  valid coverage.  I also explained to him the concept behind a need & the IUA.  At the end of the conversation he wanted Wendy''s number & Sedera''s number which I gave him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 12:36:31', '2021-07-06 12:36:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071404016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042738276', 'Joshua Latham', NULL, 'Josh called looking for a certificate of membership for his child going off to college.  Did warm transfer to Kaleen at Liberty after verifying she is in the correct department to help him (see his other file, it says his 1 child is covered, so I thought that was the accurate file.)   He called back and I realized he''s in the CRM twice (''Josh'' & ''Joshua'' Latham).  Talked w/Patti and she took his call to help him since he''s actually with Sedera and she says a lot of colleges will not accept health sharing.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-06 12:28:03', '2021-07-06 12:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071373008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070723001', 'Catherine Matuella', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-06 12:21:51', '2021-07-06 12:21:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071361036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162322', 'Esther Turner', NULL, 'Member submitted update Payment info I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 12:07:26', '2021-07-06 12:07:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071361028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, 'Wendy asked me over the 7/4 weekend to give this member until 7/6 2pm our time to submit alternate pmt info.  He submitted same banking info as we were using for payment previous.  Member just didn''t have the money at the time of billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 11:56:43', '2021-07-06 12:05:20'),
