  ('zcrm_1579374000071369003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', 'Needs to Open a Need', 'Member called in and said that he was in a bike accident yesterday and went to the ER.  Member was confirmed that he was still with Sedera.  Member was transferred to a Sedera Needs Coordinator.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-07-06 08:58:46', '2021-07-06 08:58:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071367003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070912052', 'Anna Edwards', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-06 08:58:31', '2021-07-06 08:58:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071361008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001245029', 'Daniel Carney', NULL, 'Member emailed in asking how to cancel his HES membership as they cancelled Liberty last month.  I sent link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 08:55:43', '2021-07-06 08:55:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071361003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005915163', 'Robin Hewes', NULL, 'Member emailed into accounting wanting to cancel.  I sent cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 08:51:21', '2021-07-06 08:51:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071342013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521590', 'Sherrie Lynne Vantongeren', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  I will notify Zion &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 08:23:09', '2021-07-06 08:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071342008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521590', 'Sherrie Lynne Vantongeren', NULL, 'Member emailed in and asked how she could cancel her membership.  I sent her back the cancellation link and advised she could cancel eff 8/1.  She advises money is tight and can''t see paying for nothing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 08:19:53', '2021-07-06 08:19:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071342003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Member Payment updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-06 07:07:58', '2021-07-06 07:07:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071340003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, 'This member requested to cancel via an email to info@- I sent her a cancellation form and BCC''d Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-06 07:04:41', '2021-07-06 07:04:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071328003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061648159', 'Patrick Johns', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-05 10:59:24', '2021-07-05 10:59:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071299008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-05 08:05:30', '2021-07-05 08:05:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071299003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-05 07:34:10', '2021-07-05 07:34:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071289003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, 'I let Wendy know about this member and she has been trying to get in touch with him.  I told her that I would give him until 7/6 am to come up with alternate pmt info or I would cancel him,', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-03 07:00:01', '2021-07-03 07:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071276008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022032', 'Emily Clark', NULL, 'Emily called trying to get Doug into a CirrusMD session.  She was able to get him signed up on their site..  She thinks her 21 yr old daughter Amanda just used her account when she called (daughter confirmed since she was right there), so they are going to make sure Amanda gets setup on her own CirrusMD account just like what we did for Doug.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-02 15:33:59', '2021-07-02 15:33:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071282003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869342', 'Theresa Lewak', NULL, 'member mailed in a note that she''s on medicare', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2021-07-02 14:18:29', '2021-07-02 14:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071260016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080024', 'Jennifer Vasquez', NULL, 'Jennifer called asking if she could change her PCP on her OPD card to her employer, Dr. Jakob. I informed Jennifer that we would have to research this information because this is new territory and I did not have an exact answer. Joan will be speaking with Rod and John regarding this situation. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-02 12:33:42', '2021-07-02 12:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071260008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516085', 'Harold Workman', NULL, 'Doctor''s office called to verify that the member''s wife is "covered" to get the Hepatitis B vaccine. I explained that she is part of a medical cost sharing community, she does have a mec and that the Hep B vaccine is included in the list of preventative items covered on the ACA list. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-02 12:11:22', '2021-07-02 12:12:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071260003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366134', 'Janell Vennard', NULL, 'Janell called because her advisor, Jonathan Masters, told her that we could help with changing Zion Health''s decision when it comes to her recent pregnancy. I explained to Janell that unfortunately we cannot go against Zion''s decision to not share in her pregnancy due to the fact that she conceived within the first 60 days of her membership. She then stated that she was told by Zion that she could appeal the decision and I advised her that if Zion gave her that advice, she could appeal the decision. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-02 11:56:55', '2021-07-02 11:56:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071199033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-02 11:21:38', '2021-07-02 11:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071199028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'No response. Not able to leave message. Mailbox full. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-02 11:03:09', '2021-07-02 11:03:09'),
