  ('zcrm_1579374000071199013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380068', 'Elizabeth Hernandez', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-02 09:45:26', '2021-07-02 09:45:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071234003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042343089', 'Carrie Stephens', NULL, 'Carrie called with questions about the QR code and submitting bills to Sedera. I explained the process of registering for the QR code and also explained that she would need to reach out to Sedera with her uploading issues for her needs submissions. I transferred Carrie to Sedera. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-02 09:22:56', '2021-07-02 09:22:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071216013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'Robin called confused that she didn''t have a hard copy of her ZIon card- as Zion told her to use the Zion card- not the Planstin card for a Covid test that Stanley will need for his upcoming surgery.  I convinced Robin that printing out the Zion card and using that will work just fine. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-02 09:14:03', '2021-07-02 09:14:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071199008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246108', 'Matt Williams', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-02 09:10:30', '2021-07-02 09:10:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071209024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654119', 'ANDREA LEWIS', NULL, 'I received Cancellation request for 8/1 I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-02 09:09:33', '2021-07-02 09:09:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071216008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'Jillian called to ask if she could be reimbursed for a pap smear that she had done out of network.  I told her that it would be an out of pocket expense, that she must see in network providers for her preventative care for it to be covered.  She also has an appointment with a  gastro dr today and wanted to know what insurance card she should present.  I told her to present herself as a self pay patient and went over that process.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-02 09:05:34', '2021-07-02 09:05:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071209016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650569', 'Connie Giles', 'Redirect Term', 'Tracking #11791913
Sent by Patti Baron on 7/2/2021', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-02 09:01:59', '2021-07-02 09:04:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071209011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650569', 'Connie Giles', NULL, 'I received cancellation for this member I will notify Sedera &amp; Redirect &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-02 08:58:51', '2021-07-02 08:58:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071216003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063771010', 'Katherine Pettit', NULL, 'Katherine called because she was unsure if she needed to call us before taking her daughter to the pediatrician for "bites" that she received while visiting the beach.  I told Katherine that she didn''t need to call us for this and went over the self pay patient process, as well as told her that she only needs to call us if she has a non emergent sx that is estimated over $5000. She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-02 08:31:11', '2021-07-02 08:31:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071209006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630086', 'Rhonda Wood', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as she will be aging into Medicare.  I will process cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-02 08:27:04', '2021-07-02 08:27:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071199003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677086', 'William Kollar', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-02 08:18:24', '2021-07-02 08:18:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071191008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176035', 'Renae Einspahr', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare eff 8/1.  She submitted cancellation.  I will process.  Member''s email bounced when I sent her the cancellation verification.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-02 08:13:04', '2021-07-02 08:24:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071191003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057887024', 'Roy Simmons', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare 8/1.  I received cancellation from member I will process cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-02 07:45:37', '2021-07-02 07:45:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071169018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '7-1-21 Talked with Julie and she''s super frustrated with the whole process with Zion bc they lose bills, invoices, signed docs, etc. They don''t have a good tracking system set up yet. She also just did her annual wellness visits including mammogram but paid cash price and didn''t remember she was supposed to use the Planstin card. We need better education around this!  She''s going to call Zion back since they told her they''d submit the wellness visit to Planstin. But, I don''t trust that.  She also did her daughters wellness visit as cash and didn''t show card. All of the costs were about $600 at the cash rate. Told her to let me know how it turns out. I will also encourage Zion to create a much better tracking system with all the frustrations happening on this front. She likes Sedera and their process better. She didn''t remember needing to show  a card for the wellness part with Sedera. I told her it was the same. She thinks the onboarding was better then.  She thinks because they had to switch quickly maybe that''s part of the problem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-01 15:10:01', '2021-07-01 15:10:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071169013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '7-1-21 Hi Wendy, 
I have been trying to get a need paid that has been approved and shared with Zion. It has now been 7 months and I have been sent to collections. I called two weeks with this concern since I continued to get bills and thought that they were paying this directly.
This is not what I signed up for and I do not want my credit affected. I have 10 days until that happens. 
I have sent an email to member needs at zion but if I do not get this resolved, who do I reach out to?
Thank you,,
Julie Perington

I received a quick response from their CEO as to the process thus far. It sounds like there are many moving parts contributing to forward movement with these additional bills.

"Her DOS started in October last year. We have paid several of the bills. The one I am think she is referring to is a larger one from Jan as part of the need. We received this bill in mid April. We did need to request MR and we have been in constant contact with the provider. We have sent the EOS''s and as early as this morning followed up with them to make payments and could not reach anyone in their office. We have a ton of communication back and forth with Julie since we started receiving bills in April. There was confusion on the members part in which she thought she needed to be reimbursed as she had in the past with her other healthshare. She did not realize that we pay providers directly. There was also a delay in the HIPPA signature on the members part as her daughter is 18 and needed to sign for herself. We are currently in the process of also reimbursing the member for a small amount she overpaid on her IUA as we received her signed ACH form yesterday.

It does look like it''s been a little slow to process since we received everything mid april, but the provider has not been very responsive and there were a few delays on the members end as well. It looks like we will have it paid within that 10 days."

I hope this helps give you some peace of mind.

Let me know if you need anything else.

Thanks,

Wendy Scipione', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-01 15:05:56', '2021-07-01 15:05:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071163018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069341714', 'Mark Read', NULL, 'member called and wanted to know about more information about the plan- I helped him set up his CirrusMD account and directed him to where the welcome call scheduler is. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-01 14:59:35', '2021-07-01 14:59:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071151013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-01 13:28:54', '2021-07-01 13:28:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071169008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '7-1-21 Jim Fuson found me via ASHI and is self-employed as home inspector. He watched the video already. His short-term health ins ended back in Feb. Looking at SECURE and Dr. Megan Settle is in the network. Jim takes metformin and lisinopril for mildly high blood pressure and is slightly pre-diabetic. I read him the exemptions straight from the guidelines. He says his weight varies by 10-15 lbs but nothing more than that ever. He''s very interested in this as a long term solution. He arrived to job site and had to go. I''m sending him rest of information now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-01 13:07:30', '2021-07-01 13:07:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071167013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, 'Sent member a script quote on the following: Estradiol 2 mg, Progesterone 200 mg, Bisoprolol/HCTZ, and Meloxicam. Janet should be all set. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-01 12:57:30', '2021-07-01 12:57:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071167008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044265014', 'Rebecca Rechtman', NULL, 'Rebecca called regarding an AMH blood test pricing, but due to her living in NY we could not find a discount lab in her area. She was also inquiring about pregnancy and if it is a shareable expense, I transferred her to Sedera so that they can provide her with that information and their guidelines. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-01 12:39:14', '2021-07-01 12:39:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071163013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656209', 'Bonnie Kleinhans', NULL, 'Bonnie wanted to know about the Care Connect plan- I explained to her that it is for non-emergent surgeries over $5000, and that she couldn''t have gone through the program because she needed an emergency surgery.  She asked if she could get the IUA discount because she has done a lot of work negotiating on her own, I told her that she may and that she just needed to email Zion to request a discount, she is going to request this from her needs coordinator. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-01 12:24:14', '2021-07-01 12:24:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071169003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, '7-1-21 Kia is willing to use a Dr. in the Glenwood Springs instead of Jackson WY, since no ob/gyns showed up in the network. She also wants the HSA. Plus talking about pregnancy perhaps in a year or so. It will be good to have SECURE for baby visits. Showing 1 ped in Jackson. Enrolling now as EO $1000/$275 Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-01 12:18:22', '2021-07-01 12:18:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071167003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063894027', 'Kristine Nicoletti', NULL, 'Kristine called in regarding her labs from her Wellness visit in April. She states that she was never told to find a lab that was in-network and assumed because her doctor was in-network that the lab was as well. I also explained that if the labs were not coded as preventative, that it may also be the issue. I transferred the member to Planstin because she wanted to ask their concierge team some questions. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-07-01 11:38:51', '2021-07-01 11:38:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071163008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961149', 'Michael Balser', NULL, 'Michael called for help in getting into his MPB.Portal- I sent him his password.  He wanted more information about his plan- I told him that he got all of the information that we have available during his welcome call.  I asked if he would like me to resend the post welcome email information to him and he said that he would appreciate that.  No questions at this time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-01 11:33:50', '2021-07-01 11:33:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071163003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881016', 'Michael Grace', NULL, 'Michael called to ask if a screening colonoscopy is covered by his plan, I told him that it was and told him that he was over 6 months into the plan and can use that benefit.  I also told him that he could submit the gastro exam bill for reimbursement as well because an office visit is another covered expense.  I told him that he could either pay for the colonoscopy in full and then submit it to ZIon for reimbursement or he could have the provider call Zion for the payment.  He is going to upload his gastro exam bill- he already knows this process well as he has already dealt with a needs case with Zion.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-01 11:21:22', '2021-07-01 11:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071151008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'I left a voice for Jackie letting her know that Anthony will no longer be eligible to be on their coverage as he will be turning 26 I also let her know that I had notified Analisa of this back in May.  I requested that a cancellation be sent in for Anthony.  I will send out an email with link in it.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-01 11:10:52', '2021-07-01 11:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071151003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'I spoke to Misty because this member''s 7/21 payment declined again after he gave me new pmt info.  He submitted new pmt info with corrected acct info.  We''ll see if it goes through.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-07-01 10:45:03', '2021-07-01 10:45:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071148003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294135', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'Josh let me know they haven''t had time to look at the comparison yet.  But, says they''ll let me know when they are ready.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-07-01 10:33:36', '2021-07-01 10:33:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071100018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'called to update his payment information, I sent him a payment update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-01 10:29:01', '2021-07-01 10:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071100013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516085', 'Harold Workman', NULL, 'Debra called and wanted to know if CVS or Walgreens were in the PHCS network.  I told her that they were not....but sent her a list of Urgent Care''s that are showing in network where she can try to call and see if they offer Hepatitis B shots. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-01 09:31:32', '2021-07-01 09:31:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071113018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062151025', 'Diana Lim', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-07-01 09:12:33', '2021-07-01 09:12:33'),
