  ('zcrm_1579374000071100008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002647007', 'Benjamin Pieper', NULL, 'Trying to explain to Benjamin''s wife Jamie how this plan works...it seems that he is not interested in figuring it out and that she has taken on the role of being the one to understand how this plan works, however, she is not on this plan.  This may not be the plan for this family. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-01 07:39:43', '2021-07-01 07:39:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071100003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071028046', 'Jacob Martin', NULL, 'sent the member a detailed email telling them that they need to reschedule their welcome call until after their plan starts. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-07-01 07:35:22', '2021-07-01 07:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071054036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294135', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'Sent a follow-up e-mail to Joshua.  Let him know there''s a new app that''s helping people with his curr plan.  Told him I''d love to answer any questions.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-06-30 17:05:47', '2021-06-30 17:05:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071061033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919914', 'Tracy Sutton', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I have cancelled Zion &amp; Billing &amp; refunded 7/21 pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-30 15:02:05', '2021-06-30 15:02:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071054023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068229', 'Sharon Heiney', NULL, 'Sharon called because she had mistakenly given her ASI card to the mammogram facility for her preventative care mammogram, I told her to call the provider back and give them her Planstin information so that they can bill them instead. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-30 14:58:50', '2021-06-30 14:58:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071061028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'I spoke to Michael when he called in he said that his daughter would be leaving her job and going back to school.  I asked how old she was and he said that she would be 26 in 2/22.  He also told me that she would not be starting school until 1/22.  I told him that she could not go on his plan as she would only be on for a month. We discussed she getting her own coverage. I told him that there were some changes coming to Sedera and that I did not have alot of info but he needed to get in touch with Wiley to discuss and that he would advise him what to do.  He will not be putting daughter on plan at this time.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-30 14:47:45', '2021-06-30 14:47:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071061023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071028173', 'Gaosheng Wu', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-30 14:39:56', '2021-06-30 14:39:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071061018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071028120', 'Patricia Huang-Mo', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-30 14:04:07', '2021-06-30 14:04:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071054018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004367112', 'Noah Spencer', NULL, 'I spoke with Noah- he wanted to know if dermatology was a covered expense.  I told him no.  He then asked if any of our plans covered dermatology- even the preventative care plans.  I explained to him why none of our plans cover it and view it as an out of pocket expense.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-30 14:00:37', '2021-06-30 14:00:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071061013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071028107', 'Lijun Chen', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-30 13:38:21', '2021-06-30 13:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071061008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'Member called inquiring about a COVID test being shareable. I explained that COVID testing is not on the ACA list and that it is not a shareable expense. I did let the member know that she could check with her local health department or department of health and human services as those entities usually have free COVID testing. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-30 13:38:00', '2021-06-30 13:38:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071054013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480020', 'Marian Salley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-30 13:23:57', '2021-06-30 13:23:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071079003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '6-30-21 Lori received an email about a rate increase for her age change but she''s already being charged the higher rate of $530. She didn''t realize there would be  an extra charge for using a cc, so she will update her banking for next month so keep the price at $530.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-30 13:00:41', '2021-06-30 13:00:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071054008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540021', 'Paulena Shapiro', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-30 12:52:30', '2021-06-30 12:52:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071073003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153667', 'Margaret Petersen', NULL, 'No response. Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-30 12:36:29', '2021-06-30 12:36:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071061003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071028046', 'Jacob Martin', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-30 12:07:15', '2021-06-30 12:07:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071054003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705055', 'Douglas Whitney', NULL, 'Douglas called for a list of preventative care doctors in his area- I sent him 2 PHCS network lists along with the Wellness Visit Instructions template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-30 11:36:18', '2021-06-30 11:36:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070973028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'I was notified by Sedera that spouse Ann was in contact with them to add her daughter to the plan.  I let Thomas at Sedera know that all changes etc. go through us.  I then called the number on the account which was Michael and asked to have Ann call me to do this the right way.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-30 10:36:19', '2021-06-30 10:36:19'),
