  ('zcrm_1579374000070971063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459022', 'Liat Lieberman Tabachnik', NULL, '6-29-21 Stephen is helping Liat to submit 2 year old lab bill from Quest that she just received.  She''s already been working with Jennifer Chasteen and needs to send the bill directly to Jennifer. Sounds like Quest sent the bill to the wrong place forever ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-29 16:53:33', '2021-06-29 16:53:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '6-29-21 Sandra decided to keep her Friday Bronze X plan for $0 now! She thinks she will just have some labs and colposcopy for the rest of the year. Already has some labs counting towards ded and mop. She''s happy to have $0 premium!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-29 16:44:43', '2021-06-29 16:44:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071007003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, 'Linda twisted her knee and wanted to confirm how the self-pay worked.  We went over those details and that an Urgent Care is an option.  She also had me send her a list of Family Medicine docs in her area via e-mail.  She thought getting to know someone local for something like this could be helpful.    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-06-29 15:50:40', '2021-06-29 15:50:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104168', 'Elizabeth Dempsey', NULL, 'Member emailed me requesting to change the email on her account.  I will email her the member change form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-29 14:15:15', '2021-06-29 14:15:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070976050', 'Colleen Glenn-Wilson', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-29 13:34:48', '2021-06-29 13:34:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070976050', 'Colleen Glenn-Wilson', NULL, '6-29-21 Connected with Lester Pardoe via neighborhood network. She''s never met him. She really wanted the HSA compliance and is choosing SECURE and has own biz. I believe choosing $1000/$275. Husband earns way too much for income, so no APTC. Son plays professional basketball but she''ll put him on Medicaid for now before he''s earning much money.  Using ACH bank draft.  All set for Aug. 1st start date. Nice and thankful.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-29 13:24:01', '2021-06-29 13:30:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904355', 'Linnea Peterson', NULL, 'Advisor called in and advised that member was still being billed for plan after she had cancelled.  I looked and found out that she had put in her cancellation under Linnea Peterson so it had been missed.  I advised her that I could refund her the July pmt only as others had already been paid.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-29 13:11:37', '2021-06-29 13:11:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070962046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974125', 'Gerard McHugh', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-29 11:12:28', '2021-06-29 11:12:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070962041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002647007', 'Benjamin Pieper', NULL, 'helping this member via email understand their benefits. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-29 11:02:17', '2021-06-29 11:02:17'),
