  ('zcrm_1579374000070973008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, 'Lester called in requesting a refresher on how to use his plan. I sent Lester a list of providers in his area that are in the PHCS network and instructed him on when to present his Planstin card. I also sent Lester emailed instructions regarding his upcoming wellness visit. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-29 09:41:32', '2021-06-29 09:41:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '6-29-21 Dear Wendy,

Thank you so much for your detailed and timely response.  We''ve decided to drop me from MPower.  Eric, Eli and Tigist will remain on the plan.  Please let me know if there are forms to be completed.  

And thank you for letting us know about the new plan for self-employed workers.  Eric will be in touch with you to discuss.

Again, we have been very happy with the plan and have found the representatives extremely helpful.

Kind regards,
Jill

970.379.6882
jill.s.cohen@outlook.com', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-29 09:36:29', '2021-06-29 09:36:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010760035', 'Amanda McCracken', NULL, '6-29-21 Talking with Sherita with C4 and fixing Amanda''s plan to put Moorea onto CHP+ and Amanda onto same plan KP CO Silver 5000/25 for $23.91 her cost.  TKT #210629-000099. Effective July 1st. Will take 7-14 days to get new cards. Will be contacted by CHP+ as well. She can call them at 1-800-359-1991.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-29 09:35:02', '2021-06-29 10:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068311068', 'Edwin Maddison', NULL, 'Per Michele &amp; employer member has been reinstated eff 7/1/2021', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-29 09:31:51', '2021-06-29 09:31:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070962026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577036', 'John Malloy', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-29 09:22:21', '2021-06-29 09:22:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070971006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439070', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in asking for information at Jane''s direction.  I advised her that we were not adding anyone to any Sedera due to upcoming changes to the plans.  Jane did not share this with her. I also advised her that if she was added monthly share amount would be $1110.  She asked about &gt;65 eligibility and I told her that neither of the options that we offered were open to 65+ members.   I told her that Jane would go over options with her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-29 09:04:39', '2021-06-29 09:10:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070962021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008628057', 'Anthony Belisle', NULL, 'Tony called to let us know that he was going to the urologist today.  I reminded him of the self pay process, and he thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-29 09:02:30', '2021-06-29 09:02:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070962013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476126', 'Robin Korosec', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-29 08:54:31', '2021-06-29 08:54:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070973003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439070', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Wife would like to be added to David''s plan. She was removed from David''s plan effective 1/1/2021 and was advised by Jane to call the concierge team for pricing. Unfortunately, the concierge team is not able to disclose that information so I transferred the member''s wife to Patti. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-29 08:52:27', '2021-06-29 08:52:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070962008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. 1 hour on the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-29 08:22:41', '2021-06-29 08:58:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070962003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601016', 'Meggan Kramer', NULL, 'sent this member preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-29 07:21:39', '2021-06-29 07:21:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070920034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012051083', 'Nancy Gentry', NULL, '6-28-21 Nancy called to find out if birth control is covered. I told her it should be through Planstin. Then she revealed she''s really asking about an IUD for her daughter. I told her that will definitely be done through Planstin and she will call them to be 100% certain.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-28 16:30:42', '2021-06-28 16:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070920026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, '6-28-21 Kia is pronounced as Kaya! Living in Jackson Hole, WY and Anthem is ONLY option at $750 for a 30 year old!!! She has a $2000 ded and HSA. She will use this mktplace plan for 1 month until she can switch to MCS for Aug. 1st. She has FT W2 job but also does freelance graphic design work on the side. She earns too much to qualify for APTC. She does have an achilles/tendonitis issue that she''s resolving still. Her Obgny is Dr. Lofaro from Gros Ventre. Thinking about SECURE which she was stunned by the great price. But, if Dr. not in network then CARE+ is an option. I can''t find either doctor in the network. I tried calling Gros Ventre and then called the Billing Dept. 1-800-338-5378 x 16 but no luck.  UPDATE reached Jamie in Billing and they do NOT accept the PHCS network. She should just call to find out the cost of an annual wellness visit which is probably cheaper than $720 anyhow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-28 16:13:44', '2021-06-28 16:24:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070920008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, '6-28-21 Called bc he will be having a procedure in Aug. 16th and wanted to know if he had to get it pre-approved or do anything up front other than getting the cash price and Super Bill. I told him her understands it well and that he should still just double check with Sedera to confirm. Gave him their number and he will call. He doesn''t want to deal with Redirect bc they haven''t been helpful. He already priced out Dr. visit possibly about $300, MRI $300 and procedure $13,000 as cash patient. He''s waiting to do it until after he competes in his bike race in Leadville. He also asked about getting prescriptions. One is  compounded so that one he can''t get a discount. But, he will ask about the others and get the prescription from his doctor.  He was happy to have my help and feels confident.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-28 14:43:26', '2021-06-28 14:43:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070906036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064172023', 'Brandon Orellana', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-28 14:26:10', '2021-06-28 14:26:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070906028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380465', 'Kelly Green', NULL, 'Kelly called in regarding using her Planstin card at her wellness visit. I explained that she did present her card correctly and to verify that the physician is coding everything that needs to be coded preventative correctly. Kelly is still a little confused about her plan, but she is asking all of the right questions regarding what she needs to do to make her plan work for her. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-28 14:09:55', '2021-06-28 14:16:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070936003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712271', 'Carey Dubois', NULL, '06.28.21:  Carey called.  Interested in SECURE.  Has an HSA and wants to continue with it.  They''re now with Alira/Trinity.  Was part of MultiPlan w/them but as of 7/1 they are discontinuing it.  He thinks they are having issues.  He found MPB is highly rated.  He and his wife are both in excellent health, no medication other than for cholesterol - rarely see a provider other than for wellness visits.  Explained SECURE, sent link for click funnel and atttached  Zion guidelines.  Told him to contact me to schedule an enrollment session if he wants the plan.  Carey said they are researching plans.  He''ll let me know his decision after his research.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-06-28 13:59:41', '2021-06-28 14:04:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070906023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Mary called in regards to some bills that she needs to upload to Sedera. She also wanted to know how much her portion of her bills were going to be and I directed her to ask Sedera if they could answer that question for her. I transferred Mary to Sedera and also sent her the instructions on how to upload her bills to Sedera. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-28 13:52:03', '2021-06-28 13:52:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070906018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061283', 'Diane Beltran', NULL, 'Diane called because she would like to go to an urgent care and didn''t know how the process worked.  I went over the self pay process with her, she thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-28 13:47:06', '2021-06-28 13:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070906013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038052', 'Brian Walsh', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-28 13:12:17', '2021-06-28 13:12:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070906008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067291073', 'Jeanna (Gina) French', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  member is concerned that she does not know how to submit online bills if needed.  I told member that this is the members responsibility and sent her a Zion needs submission form so that she can view the process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-28 12:54:21', '2021-06-28 12:54:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070920003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, '6-28-21 I just talked with him now about his frustrations with his one wellness visit. When he did it a few years ago with his Sedera membership it was no problem. I let him know that it would be no different with Sedera vs Zion since it''s still the MEC/ insurance component that causes these challenges. The MEC we used for our Sedera memberships have the exact PHCS network. So, the problem is with how insurance functions and how the doctor codes the bill. He will talk with his doctor to ask him to re-code the bill and go from there. But, he switched doctors per recommendations from friends since his annual a few years ago that went smoothly. Now seeing Dr. Gisselson (?) with Roaring Fork Family Practice and showed up in the PHCS network. Dr. then did some basic blood work which was sent to Valley View Hospital which is no longer in network.  Jason got a $400 bill which he gave up on and paid himself out of his HSA. BUT, he just got another bill for $750 for the blood work, some of which he had no idea the doctor was even running, such as AIDS test, etc. He just went in for annual wellness. He thought they were only running PSA and hemoglobin tests, not 10 other things. 
 He also talked with Planstin and they will reach out to Valley View about negotiating the bill. Apparently Planstin covered about 60% of the bill.  He understands the challenges better now and will do his part to try to rectify the problem by talking w/ doctor and possibly Valley View if necessary. He''s also willing to find a doctor in Boulder to use in the future, so he doesn''t run into these problems. It''s worth it to save $1100 for an annual visit!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-28 11:10:56', '2021-06-28 11:10:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070914013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070912052', 'Anna Edwards', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-28 11:03:28', '2021-06-28 11:03:28'),
