  ('zcrm_1579374000070909003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206164', 'Dena Traxler', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-28 09:33:57', '2021-06-28 09:33:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070906003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, 'Jason called in regarding issues he is having with Planstin regarding his wellness visit. He states that he was told it would be 100% covered but has received EOB''s from Planstin stating that he owes a balance. I explained to Jason that I am unfortunately not able to do anything regarding his billing and that he would have to speak with Planstin regarding his billing issues. He also asked if he could be put back on the Sedera plan and I let him know that I would have Wendy reach out to him to discuss his plan options. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-28 09:25:26', '2021-06-28 09:25:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070854003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206164', 'Dena Traxler', NULL, 'Already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-28 06:48:16', '2021-06-28 06:48:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070749019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439070', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Wife Amy wants to be added to David''s plan; needs plan information.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2021-06-25 20:23:55', '2021-06-25 20:23:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, 'John was able to get Lynn and her family their Planstin PDF cards early before July 1 and Lynn is thrilled! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 16:42:04', '2021-06-25 16:42:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070812003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290213', 'Amy Bloom', NULL, 'Mitch called to get information on colonoscopies.  I let him know there is a 6 month waiting period.  Then went over screenings vs diagnostic &amp; sent him the Zion link.  (see e-mail)    CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-06-25 15:56:55', '2021-06-25 15:56:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070778013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006886022', 'Norma Matherly', NULL, '6-25-21 Left vm for Norma about her payment and also let her know I may have some new options that are possibly more affordable for her. Hopefully she''ll call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-25 15:04:01', '2021-06-25 15:04:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059474061', 'James Pendleton', NULL, 'James called because CirrusMD told him to go to the ER- I went over the self pay process and sent him a Zion needs submission form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 14:57:29', '2021-06-25 14:57:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919617', 'Heather Davies', NULL, 'called with a question about her preventative care benefits and transferred her to Planstin and gave her the number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 13:24:26', '2021-06-25 13:24:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476126', 'Robin Korosec', NULL, 'missed welcome call - left detailed message and sent scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 13:13:17', '2021-06-25 13:13:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'Spoke to Sara, helped confirm her understanding of preventative care benefit protocol. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 13:00:27', '2021-06-25 13:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070778008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '6-25-21 Martin and wife are both 28 living in Carbondale. They both work as W2 employees but his wife did start a small biz last year that isn''t really active, but is an option if they want SECURE. Martin has RMHP now for $300+ a month. Wife pays just under $300 a month through her employer separately. They could join CARE+ for $395/$1000 and be better off. BUT, Martin had back surgery 8 years ago. Then had 2 issues while working in the past 24 months. Both were covered by worker''s comp. One had something to do with accident while working on roof and other was due to picking up child while ski instructing. He knows this is pre-x and wouldn''t be shared if related to these injuries. I told him to ask for  his record from his doctor to make sure there''s nothing that makes him nervous. Also wife was diagnosed with sleep apnea, doesn''t use c-pap, uses thing to put in her mouth when sleeping. No meds, no tobacco and otherwise healthy. For his back he just had to do PT each time and he''s done.  They didn''t get any benefit for their health ins plan last year at all. They didn''t do their annual wellness visits either. So, CARE+ may be best for them while they are young. BUT, they are considering having a baby. I explained the 60 day waiting period and SECURE would be better for them once baby is born due to all of the wellness visits a baby needs.  He will discuss with his wife. They are in no rush. Possible Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-25 12:43:13', '2021-06-25 12:43:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070740021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070730039', 'Lee Brewer', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-25 12:36:45', '2021-06-25 12:36:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'I spoke to Eileen, she wanted to know if she needed a card to schedule a cardiologist appointment.  I told her no, she didn''t and went over the self pay process, I told her when to expect her welcome email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 12:22:00', '2021-06-25 12:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091034', 'Darryl Hadfield', NULL, 'sent Beth shoulder MRI info from HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 11:24:32', '2021-06-25 11:24:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921634', 'Joanna Lyons', NULL, 'I called Andrea about this member and told her that this member was calling both Jennifer and I and cursing at us, calling us dumb and stupid.  Andrea apologized, she is sending this member a cancellation form and a quote for regular insurance. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 10:52:32', '2021-06-25 10:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070770013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921634', 'Joanna Lyons', NULL, 'This member called because her credit card declined, also she is very upset that her obgyn is not it network.  I told her that I could send her a nomination link so that she could nominate the doctor but I told her that in my experience she shouldn''t count on it working.   She said that someone told her that MPB.Health could help get the doctor in the network.  I told her that MPB.Health has no power in what doctors are in network.  She told me that she is calling her providers office now, and if she cannot get this resolved in a half an hour she is going to call back to cancel.  This member has called back twice more to Jennifer and I asking questions about the PHCS network- we try to help her but she keeps getting frustrated and hanging up. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-25 10:38:25', '2021-06-25 10:38:25'),
