  ('zcrm_1579374000070666008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788094', 'Daniel Webb', NULL, 'Dan called.  He cancelled his health sharing membership in May (when he went onto Medicare), but they pulled his membership fee again this month.  I sent Patti (&amp; cc''d him) an e-mail, letting Dan know that since it''s already past 6pm EST, she''s gone for the day.  He understood, but would like the money put back into his acct.  I let him know I wasn''t sure how that worked, but Patti would have the answers.  (CRM show cancellation date as 5/31/21.)  CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-06-24 16:26:32', '2021-06-24 16:31:07'),
