  ('zcrm_1579374000070619008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068311068', 'Edwin Maddison', NULL, 'Lorette called to ask if she had any benefits through the plan. I told her that she did not and that she needed to call her employer. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-23 11:08:33', '2021-06-23 11:08:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070619003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, 'HCBB reached out to let me know that 24 hours was not enough time for them to negotiate down the bill.  Thomas called and spoke with Jennifer that relayed this message.  He is just going to present himself as a self pay patient and negotiate the best fair price on his own as he does not was to reschedule his appointment. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-23 10:39:53', '2021-06-23 10:39:53');
