  ('zcrm_1579374000070596008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578403', 'Jill Mehlhaf', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-23 09:14:34', '2021-06-23 09:14:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070589008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'Member (Brad) called regarding Certificate of Membership for both of his daughters. I advised Brad to give Zion a call and they will be able to provide him with that information. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-23 09:07:13', '2021-06-23 09:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070582016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049898077', 'Debbie Thibault', NULL, 'Member refunded 7/21 pmt of $970 cancelling &amp; re-enrolling in Zion eff 7/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-23 09:06:26', '2021-06-23 09:06:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070596003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163125', 'Sharon Linnebur', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-23 09:01:24', '2021-06-23 09:01:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070589003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Member called but hung up before my greeting was over. I did return Lori''s call but left a vm. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-23 08:35:33', '2021-06-23 08:35:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070582008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755066', 'John Poole', NULL, 'Per the employer this employee is not longer a part of the company will cancel eff 7/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-23 08:28:23', '2021-06-23 08:28:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070582003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255524', 'Ana Leighton', NULL, 'I received email from Ana wondering why she had not been cancelled.  She told me she replied to the receipt.  I advised her that she needed to fill out the Cancellation request.  I emailed link to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-23 08:23:03', '2021-06-23 08:23:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070575008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Member''s 7/21 payment declined with CC that I update yesterday.  6/23 - 1st notice sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-23 07:54:50', '2021-06-23 07:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070575003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070569025', 'Robert Pederson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-23 07:46:43', '2021-06-23 07:46:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070540008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, 'Thomas needs a cardiac angiogram and has an apt scheduled for Thursday morning.  He is just calling us now about it.  I took down all of his doctor and provider details and sent them to the HCBB team, I told Thomas that HOPEFULLY 1 day is enough for them to negotiate down his procedure. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-22 16:42:06', '2021-06-22 16:42:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070508028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, '6-22-21 Tom called because he wanted help with next steps. He saw 3 cardiologists and 1 primary care doctor who ALL recommends that he gets an angiogram. Started this process in LA but trusts his drs. in TX better. The 4th cardiologist he saw was at Methodist Hospital in TX and he likes that cardiologist the best. He finally believes he needs to get an angiogram which he now wants to know if he should call Zion first. I told him to call Concierge Team for help with this. They can let him know if he needs to call Zion and if they can help him get the highest quality care at the best price for this. He also saw an MD VIP doctor in all of this process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-22 16:15:31', '2021-06-22 16:15:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070508023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808067', 'Elisa Gustafson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-22 14:29:27', '2021-06-22 14:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070508018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808067', 'Elisa Gustafson', NULL, '6-22-21 Rodney enrolled now for SECURE and put Elsa as primary bc she''s younger. Rodney chose $1000/$500. They will leave LHS bc of terrible time delay with friend getting reimbursed. Psyched to make the change for July 1st, 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-22 14:23:15', '2021-06-22 16:27:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070508013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838033', 'James Truett III', NULL, 'Per Misty member is requesting a 8/1/21 start date.  I will not be refunding will just apply 1st payment to the 8/1 start scheduled next pmt for 8/20.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-22 12:26:58', '2021-06-22 12:26:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070542003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604272', 'Hal Feldman', NULL, 'Hal called regarding recent labs and a yearly physical. He decided to stick with his provider, who is out of network, and he paid out of pocket for his visit. Hal then went to have labs done, presented his Planstin card to the lab and they told him that they do not participate with Planstin. Instead of calling the concierge team to find an in network lab, Hal decided that he was going to have the labs done at that facility and reach out to the concierge team later. I informed Hal that the specific lab he chose is not in network and that it would be an out of pocket expense to him, which he was not happy about. I let Hal know that any time he has a question regarding providers/labs being in network, that he should call the concierge team and we will be happy to help him find in network facilities. I also emailed Hal a current list of in network labs in his area. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-22 11:57:50', '2021-06-22 11:57:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070540003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, 'Lynn Called, her daughter decided not to listen to me when I told her to schedule her preventative care appointment after the first 7 days of membership because she needed to wait for her Planstin card to arrive.  She asked if someone could make an exception and send the cards out to them asap so that they could have them by the 2nd of the month.  I told her that I would ask Planstin''s management team and email her what their response is- but that I couldn''t make any promises. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-22 11:40:12', '2021-06-22 11:40:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070536028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779355', 'Sandy Randolph', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-22 11:11:41', '2021-06-22 11:11:41'),
