  ('zcrm_1579374000070466022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-22 08:14:34', '2021-06-22 08:14:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070466008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705055', 'Douglas Whitney', NULL, 'Member left VM after hours saying that his payment information had changed and was reminded of it when receiving our receipt.  I will send him the payment update form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-22 07:25:23', '2021-06-22 07:25:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070466003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659570', 'Jane Pulliam', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel billing &amp; RCI &amp; Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-22 07:21:19', '2021-06-22 07:21:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070450013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Kirk Bennett called &amp; asked me to give Michele this message:  Jayne is having issues w/her EFT and needs help resolving the problems with her checking acct.  Sent Teams mess to Michele''s personal &amp; accounting chats.  CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-06-21 18:04:24', '2021-06-21 18:04:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070454013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, 'sent this member a payment update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-21 17:59:59', '2021-06-21 17:59:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070454008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '6-21-21 Matt with C4 called me and left vm saying Kim''s account is functioning properly now after removing Case. Any changes needed in the future will work no problem. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-21 17:14:58', '2021-06-21 17:14:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070454003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808067', 'Elisa Gustafson', NULL, '6-21-21 Rodney heard from his friend who''s also on LHS that she''s been waiting for a Very Long Time to get reimbursed from  a major knee surgery and this has been sitting in the back of his mind.  He''s about ready to make the switch. I told him he has until tomorrow to decide if he wants to switch for a July 1st start date and told him how to cancel with LHS. He''s 62 and wife is 60. He rides his bike to keep in shape, no pre-x. Wife isn''t big on exercises but cooks well. Rodney had a double knee replacement in 2008 and no issues since. They are both self-employed. He runs CASE Commercial Real Estate and his wife owns and operates Biscotti Hounds which is top of Google search now. SECURE $500/$1000 is best to give them wellness and he''s interested in opening HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-21 17:10:50', '2021-06-21 17:10:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070450008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, 'Kenneth called confused on how to get Planstin to pay for his preventative physical.  We went over making sure the In Network MD billed them.  He says he doesn''t need further instructions, he''s all set.  CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-06-21 16:47:34', '2021-06-21 16:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070450003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, 'Tamra called.  Still having issues with CirrusMD, so taking son to see a doctor.  Went over self-pay patient info &amp; sent her the Zion submit a need e-mail.  CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-06-21 15:58:28', '2021-06-21 15:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070399018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070976050', 'Colleen Glenn-Wilson', NULL, '6-21-21 Colleen lives in Stone Canyon in Lyons, CO and her husband will be kicked off their insurance Aug or Sept 1st. He''s 74 and on Medicare. She was looking at C4 and found her cost was going to be $760-$900! She''s healthy and only takes hormone meds and nothing else. She''s a health coach and her focus is on wellness and preventative measures with acupuncture, etc.  Doesn''t do mammograms or even pap screenings. But, is thrilled for the HSA compliance! Looked at LHS and Medishare and wasn''t thrilled about either of them. She is self-employed and really likes the sound of this!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-21 14:53:34', '2021-06-21 14:53:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070426022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445042', 'Pamela Parsons', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel ahead of billing on the 22nd.  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI as well', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-21 14:35:16', '2021-06-21 14:35:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070426011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049898077', 'Debbie Thibault', 'Redirect Term', 'Tracking #11738885
Sent by Patti Baron on 6/21/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-21 14:23:14', '2021-06-21 14:23:26'),
