  ('zcrm_1579374000070350003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003748040', 'Natalie Lampert', NULL, 'Natalie emailed me and told me that she had no funds in her back account to cover the Monthly Cost Share and could we stop her payment.  I emailed her back and told her that this is an automatic billing and if she had wanted to stop it I would have had to know this on Friday (6/18).  Advised her that I would be in touch with her when I received pmt back.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-21 07:49:05', '2021-06-21 07:49:05'),
