  ('zcrm_1579374000070262014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353091', 'Tammy Cranford', NULL, '06.19.21:  Brad called me.  Asked me to add his wife, Tammy, for a July 1 start date.  I told him to email Patti with the information about his wife and I would call her on Monday to get Tammy added to his plan.
Emailed Patti.  She told me to have Brad fill out the "Change of Membership" form and send it today.  Called Brad, sent him the link to the "Change of Membership" form, asked him to complete it and submit it.  Patti would then, process it in time for a 7/1 start date.  Brad complied.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-06-19 14:01:18', '2021-06-24 13:46:40'),
