  ('zcrm_1579374000070249063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, 'Kelley called to ask if a diagnostic procedure that she needs done after receiving an abnormal pap smear are a covered expense.  I told her that it wasn''t and went over the self pay process, I sent her a link to Zion''s needs submission form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-18 15:43:05', '2021-06-18 15:43:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070288016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '6-18-21 Sandra wants to keep Dr. Grodberg and Dr. Priebe. They are ONLY in Friday and Anthem. Anthem''s plans are more expensive with less coverage. She will likely change from Friday Bronze to Friday Silver X for $115.55.  She''s thinking about it and will let me know. She thinks she will need 3 specialist visits, labs and a possible colposcopy again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-18 14:12:44', '2021-06-18 14:12:44'),
