  ('zcrm_1579374000070249033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, 'William called for explanation as to why there was a high deductible with his Planstin card- I explained that it was for him to be able to fund an HSA.  He also wanted to know how to submit his bills to Zion for sharing.  I sent him the needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-18 13:03:17', '2021-06-18 13:03:17'),
