  ('zcrm_1579374000070288008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', NULL, '6-18-21 John is healthy, 61, no pre-x. Only cut his finger and goes to dr. for annual wellness visits. He watched the video. Lives in Jefferson County, Littleton, CO. He''s a realtor and life partner with Jill Bryant. They live in Costa Rica part of the year and CO the rest. He understands he needs to do wellness while in US not Costa Rica. Used to get health ins from builder he worked for selling their homes. Then he got divorced so now using C4 and full cost of Kaiser plan is $1000. He was penalized $9K a few years ago with C4 bc received an inheritance from mom passing away. With his income increasing to $80-$100K this year he will only get about a $200 APTC with ARP leaving him at $800 his cost. He doesn''t want to get penalized again and the SECURE membership is way better for him now. SECURE $275/$1000. All set!
He''s leaving soon to go to Mexico where is daughter is right now and will be gone until July 29th. He''ll probably do his Welcome Call on July 30th he said. He won''t be doing his annual wellness visit any time soon so he can wait for his cards upon his return.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-18 12:22:04', '2021-06-18 12:26:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070249018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067616030', 'Robert Jason', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-18 12:14:30', '2021-06-18 12:14:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070249013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, 'I followed up with Jan about this member to remind her that I needed her cancellation, however I have not received.  I will cancel member eff 6/30 as she will be aging into Medicare', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-18 11:51:25', '2021-06-18 11:51:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070288003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, '6-18-21 Deborah moved from CO to Pelican Rapids, MN which is about 1 hr from Fargo, ND. We can''t find a DPC near her. The one that is straight west of Fargo is no longer offering DPC. She can continue to use her current CO DPC which she may do for now bc she really likes her and she''s getting the care she needs virtually right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-18 11:27:01', '2021-06-18 11:27:01'),
