  ('zcrm_1579374000070249008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, 'sent this member a list of orthopedic surgeons in her area from healtgrades.com and a fair price graph for a visit from HCBB.   I transferred the line to Wendy because Deborah nor myself were able to find any DPC''s in Deborah''s new area and this may effect what plan Deborah can stay on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-18 11:21:54', '2021-06-18 11:21:54'),
