  ('zcrm_1579374000070249003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248001', 'Thelma Goucher', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-18 07:44:24', '2021-06-18 07:44:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070156011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, 'I am still waiting on information regarding what this member can provide to her daughter''s college stating she is with a medical cost sharing plan. Please email the member''s wife, Christie, once we have this information. - JTS
**UPDATE** Zion Health informed us that they do have a general Certificate of Membership that they can provide for members'' children for college. The member must call Zion''s Member Care Team in order to request this document. I emailed Christie with this information and provided her Zion Health''s Member Care Teams phone number. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-17 12:51:11', '2021-06-18 08:47:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070216003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530137', 'Sarah Pak', NULL, '6-17-21 Dr. Stefano Lee and Sarah are exploring Life Ins with Living Benefits. They are in no rush. They want $3M and I showed him Standard, Select and Preferred. Parents are in their 80''s and still playing tennis, so great family history! They want a 15 year Term. Dr. Lee lost 12 lbs since pandemic and he wasn''t overweight when I met him. No tobacco, no meds. Only real debt is mortgage at $4160 and living expenses $2500 = $6660. Plus they have a $85K Mutual America Life Ins Flexible Annuity. Dr. Lee doesn''t want to retire ever. DOB 9/20/1970.  His # is 202-306-2425. He will talk with Sarah about the Annuity that he didn''t even know they had. He also said she might get a new job in Aug. which will give them possibility of insurance and disability. She''s in S. Korea now and will delve into this when she gets back. He will read about how they qualify Terminal, Critical, Chronic Illness and Injury. Explained value of LB. Price of Standard was higher than others he''s looking at. But, the Select and Preferred are in alignment. Sounds like he would be rated above Standard anyhow judging from our conversations. Super receptive and open to my thoughts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-17 12:42:56', '2021-06-17 12:49:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070163026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070161036', 'Bigembe Rugomoka', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-17 12:32:05', '2021-06-17 12:32:05'),
