  ('zcrm_1579374000070058021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '6-15-21 Andrew and Devon Evans are both healthy, no pre-x, just do their annual wellness visits. Devon turned 60 and did her colonoscopy recently. They split their time between Naples, Fl and Steamboat Springs, CO. They like their doctor in SS. But, understand they should do their annual wellness visit in Naples and can still see dr in SS for anything else. They do have a real estate biz as small biz owner for SECURE. They want an Oct. 1st start date and we have a time set for 2:00 Aug. 24th to enroll in SECURE  $1000/$500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-15 16:33:48', '2021-06-15 16:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070056013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, 'Steve, this members husband called in because he wanted to know about the different membership cards, and because he said his wife is confused by her preventative care benefits.  I went over the membership cards, requested hard copies from Planstin''s management team, and sent preventative care templates to both email addresses on the account so that Steve can assist Elizabeth in understanding the instructions.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-15 16:30:24', '2021-06-15 16:30:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070058011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050370005', 'Arian Shirakhoon', NULL, '6-15-21 Planning to cancel for July 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-15 16:08:04', '2021-06-15 16:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070056008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763142', 'Leanne Wagner', NULL, 'Leanne''s provider office called to get Planstin''s claim information.  It doesn''t seem as though she presented them with the right card.  She is going to take a picture of the card that she presented to me so that I can take a look at it and help her figure out her card situation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-15 15:26:48', '2021-06-15 15:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069991073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, 'Jeffery called regarding his plan, I could not find him in the CRM and tried to get information to find him in the system a different way. Jeffery then demanded that I transfer him to Zion so that he could ask them some questions. I then transferred Jeffery to Zion. I tried to reach back out to Jeffery via phone but he did not answer nor did he have a voicemail box set up. I did send him an email with an apology for not being able to find him in the CRM, that I did locate his account, and to please reach out if he needs any other assistance. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-15 14:23:47', '2021-06-15 14:23:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070058003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, '6-15-21 Kimberly called me on 6/9/21 and I called her back but couldn''t leave a vm. I sent a text which I don''t think she got. I just called her again now and was able to leave a vm this time. Told her I had tried before and I''m still here to help. Looks like she reached Concierge team instead. Vm gives another # which I added to CRM for her biz Experience Salon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-15 14:22:03', '2021-06-15 14:22:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070057003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, 'Member called wanting to know about her membership because she wants to make an appointment with a physician.  She is still covered by Sedera until membership goes into affect on July 1st. with Zion. I told her she does have coverage with Sedera.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-06-15 13:56:55', '2021-06-15 14:01:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069991068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091646', 'Carol Lovejoy', NULL, 'Member called regarding her upcoming visit for her physical. I explained to her that she needs to present her Planstin card at the time of the visit. She then informed me that she cannot find her physical card or the PDF version that was emailed to her. I have requested both for her in Slack. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-15 13:38:55', '2021-06-15 13:38:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000070056003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', NULL, 'Isabel called to get help with presenting her preventative care benefits over the phone.  I went over preventative care benefits protocol.  And how to confirm that the provider is still participating in the PHCS network.  I told Isabel that she has time to schedule preventative care appointments through RCI through the end of the month....and if she cannot get an appointment until after the 1st of the month she should wait for her Planstin card until she schedules for anytime after July 1. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-15 13:30:25', '2021-06-15 13:30:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069991063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763142', 'Leanne Wagner', NULL, 'Leanne called in regarding which card to use for her preventative services and an ultrasound to coincide with her screening mammogram. I informed her to use the Planstin card for her preventative services and to have the lab/doctor code the ultrasound as preventative so that she will not be billed. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-15 12:58:34', '2021-06-15 12:58:34'),
