  ('zcrm_1579374000069935068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, 'completed a script quote request for Christine. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 17:41:03', '2021-06-14 17:41:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069941018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055057166', 'Karen Sherry', NULL, '6-14-21 Karen Sherry fell while walking the dogs this morning and one knocked her down on the gravel road. Her leg ankle got bent backwards strangely and she broke both bones in her lower left leg! Ugh, she needed surgery today and just had rods, pins, screws and a plate put in. She may be in the hospital until tomorrow and I suggested he ask for the Super Bill upon discharge. Ken Trombley''s already paid a $200 deposit which they required. He understands he will have to pay the next $800 which he will do. He also called Zion to gain their help with the Needs process. The person he spoke with Opened the Needs Request form and started the process on their end. Ken Trombley wanted to keep me in the loop in case they need further help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-14 17:22:30', '2021-06-14 17:24:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788057', 'Jean Thompson', NULL, 'Jean called because she was having difficulty finding facilities to get a mammogram done at.  Sent a list of imaging centers in her area off of the PHCS network and went over preventative care protocol. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 17:03:03', '2021-06-14 17:03:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069941013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '6-14-21 Talked with Kaylee at C4 and she fixed Kim''s account to remove Casey who''s 28 or 29 now. Jacob will turn 26 in Oct. We could explore MCS in Oct., but the mercury thing has me concerned. We updated Kim''s account for ARP and her APTC was $481.80 and it''s now $581.04 with her new premium at $257.63. Kept her plan as is and put her income at $58K. She talked with a different accountant Maryanne Schoenberger that her dad''s friend worked with for 30 years and now her dad worked with for 15 or so years. This woman told her the exact tax lines to quantify her income for C4. Must use her K-1 Business tax form page 5 on line 1 shows gross income and W2 personal income.  Add those together and for her it was only $37K but she feels better keeping it higher so she never gets penalized.  TKT # for removing Casey via Kaylee w/ C4 is TKT 210614-000678.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-14 16:53:12', '2021-06-14 16:53:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, 'Christine called to ask if the QR codes were for specific people.  I told her that she can assign the codes however she''d like.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 16:40:57', '2021-06-14 16:40:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069941008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079653027', 'Danielle Brossart', NULL, '6-14-12 Danielle is choosing Cigna Bronze or Silver and moving away from Anthem. Sounds more comfortable with traditional insurance right now and son just went to urgent care yesterday. Somehow Anthem wasn''t in the network for the urgent care visit but their Ped is in the network at Children''s Hospital. She wants a Cigna Bronze or Silver Plan and she selected me as her agent now. Earns too much for APTC as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-14 14:45:55', '2021-06-14 14:45:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476059', 'Luke Stoten', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 14:43:43', '2021-06-14 14:43:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659919', 'Rachel Denning', NULL, 'Member called asking about the MAP program, I explained it to Rachel and she opted to be sent the email instead of being transferred directly to the program. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-14 14:35:48', '2021-06-14 14:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844213', 'Jeffrey Jackson', NULL, 'Lori Jackson called in regarding her husbands recent physical. He did not present his Planstin card and paid the cash price for his visit. I explained to Lori that her husband should have presented his Planstin card and he should not have been charged for this visit. I transferred Lori to Planstin so that she should speak with them about getting reimbursed for this office visit fee. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-14 14:08:03', '2021-06-14 14:08:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630086', 'Rhonda Wood', NULL, 'Rhonda has a friend who is interested in our plans- I gave her Wendy''s direct line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 14:05:23', '2021-06-14 14:05:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069941003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '6-14-21 Talking with another accountant about income bc she uses her personal taxes, not her Business S-Corp taxes for C4. One accountant telling her she needs to use her Biz income. Apparently she''s used her personal income taxes all these years. If used biz income it would be way too expensive for her. 
She''s horrified by friend trying to get their 14 year old to take vaccine. She was astonished her own son got the vaccine when he''s normally a rebel. She''s seen all of the VAERS/CDC information herself and is shocked by the herd/sheep mentality happening now. She also shared she''s being seen by a functional medicine doctor in F.C. to treat mercury from teeth with chelation therapy until she has $20K to fork over to remove the mercury from her teeth. UGH!  No traditional doctor recognizes any problem of any kind.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-14 13:41:34', '2021-06-14 13:41:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862186', 'Suzanne Nadeau', NULL, 'called to cancel.  sent cancellation form and BCC''d Jan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 13:19:28', '2021-06-14 13:19:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068311068', 'Edwin Maddison', NULL, 'welcome call complete!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 12:59:53', '2021-06-14 12:59:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, 'Kevin called to complain that Zion Health was making him pay for bills and then submitting them for reimbursement.  He called because he had thought that he was only responsible for $1000 and wouldn''t have to pay any more money.  I told him that he needed to follow Zion''s instructions on getting his medical need processed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 12:31:10', '2021-06-14 12:31:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069919018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006871163', 'Deborah Pettit', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation in response to my letter about aging out.  I will cancel Apex &amp; Sedera &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-14 12:31:03', '2021-06-14 12:31:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066943043', 'Linda Miner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 12:21:25', '2021-06-14 12:21:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069912039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289695', 'Ghislaine Nadeau', NULL, 'Email verification sent for registration with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-14 11:17:02', '2021-06-14 11:17:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069935008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', NULL, 'Jeff called wondering how to submit his medical bills to Zion Health.  I sent him Zion''s Needs submission form as well as reminded him on how his IUA works. He was unaware that it was per medical incident. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-14 11:08:24', '2021-06-14 11:08:24'),
