  ('zcrm_1579374000069912003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878165', 'Donavin Roberts', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-14 08:27:48', '2021-06-14 08:27:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069830085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677099', 'Marcelee Cognito', NULL, 'Marcelee cannot access her MPB portal- I tried logging in myself and cannot.  I have opened up a ticket for John to fix this.  I have also reached out to Patti to ask if there is a work around for Marcelee to be able to submit her business license to us without access to her portal. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-11 17:44:15', '2021-06-11 17:44:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069850008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689077', 'Andre Simoneau', NULL, '6-11-21 Mara and Andre interested in possibly splitting membership. Maybe keep Andre on SDHC if he choose to have hernia surgery. Trying to manage it naturally first. Mara seeks out all alternative, natural care. She wants colonics, network chiropractic care, thermogram and naturopathic and holistic care. Considering HMA for her and Andre at HMA $7500 for $113.50 a month. Also considering CARE+ at possibly $2500 IUA to bring cost down but to protect them in case of catastrophic scenario. Also has Living Benefits to protect them if something bad happens.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-11 16:00:46', '2021-06-11 16:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069793026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063771010', 'Katherine Pettit', NULL, 'Member''s husband, Ronald, called in regarding his plan. I suggested a welcome call so that he gets familiar with the in''s and out''s of his plan. He was also inquiring about PA''s that will prescribe Psyche Meds in his area. I suggested that either I could do a search for him and send it via email or that he could go to healthgrades.com and do a search himself. He chose to do the search himself. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-11 15:11:51', '2021-06-11 15:11:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069855003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712271', 'Carey Dubois', NULL, '06.11.21:  Recvd. quote request from Carey -non-smoker, interested in Secure w/$5000 IUA, for himself and his wife.  He had originally sent a Q.R. on 6.7.21.  Left a phone message and followed up w/an email to call me directly.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-06-11 14:19:26', '2021-06-11 14:19:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069830080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, 'I spoke to Mariah, I filled out an extrahelp form on her behalf because she says that she spoke to Redirect 2 weeks ago for reimbursement- was told that she would get a call back- and still hasn''t heard anything.  I also sent her the Redirect Health app video.  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-11 14:15:49', '2021-06-11 14:15:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069793021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'Kimberly called in again regarding her doctor''s visit and labs. I explained the self pay patient process again to her and she is worried about her out of pocket expenses. I transferred her to Zion so that she can discuss this with them further. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-11 13:34:31', '2021-06-11 13:34:31'),
