  ('zcrm_1579374000069849013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-11 10:35:09', '2021-06-11 10:35:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069849008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'This member enrolled twice in the $1000 IUA &amp; the $2500 IUA options.  I was advised by Misty that they were interested in the $2500 option .  I cancelled the $1000 membership.  She also asked me to refund Enrollment fee that was charged.  I refunded full Enrollment fee on the erroneous enrollment and refunded $100 on correct enrollment.  Member was former Zion direct member but wanted to join MPB for added services.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-11 10:34:50', '2021-06-11 10:34:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069850003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '6-11-21 Matt and Kate were surprised by the changes in Sedera''s maternity IUA''s! However, they are focused on the price of a home birth. BUT, Kate had a miscarriage 11/22/19. She had significant blood loss and they don''t really know why. She was low in iron, ie. potential anemia but no diagnosis. No knowledge of why this happened. Tested for a bunch of issues all of which turned out as normal and fine. Matt had persistent cough in Oct. 2019. Doesn''t believe there''s any more potential for further complications. Matt is 1099. I will reach out to Dr. Jeff Lee with synopsis of miscarriage for him to assess if too risky to move to SECURE or not.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-11 10:32:57', '2021-06-11 10:32:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069849003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838033', 'James Truett III', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-11 10:20:29', '2021-06-11 10:20:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069842023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068780009', 'Scott Swain', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so.  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-11 10:13:20', '2021-06-11 10:13:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069842018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289695', 'Ghislaine Nadeau', NULL, 'No response. Recording message came on  saying member not accepting calls at this time. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-11 10:07:00', '2021-06-11 10:07:00'),
