  ('zcrm_1579374000069822033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, 'spent over a half an hour with this member going over MAP information, and prescriptions. I transferred him to the MAP number at the end of the call, got him a list of doctors off of healthgrades.com. And sent a few script coupons as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-10 17:26:55', '2021-06-10 17:26:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069822028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177182', 'Anna Thexton', NULL, 'sent this member preventative care templates and ran a few doctors searches per her partner who is also an MPB.Health member Charles Christian Figge''s instructions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-10 17:25:04', '2021-06-10 17:25:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069822023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Jayne called to ask why she was charged at her screening colonoscopy consult, even when she had found the gastro Dr. in network.  I told Jayne that she shouldn''t have paid anything out of pocket.  That the provider should''ve billed Planstin directly and that nothing should''ve come out of her pocket.  She is going to call the provider to try to get them to reverse the charges and charge Planstin instead.  I told her that this was a good idea, and told her that the provider''s office should call Planstin with any questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-10 16:37:32', '2021-06-10 16:37:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069822018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477526', 'Richard Bausch', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-10 14:14:17', '2021-06-10 14:14:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069772223', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415080', 'Kristine Ferguson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Zion and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-10 13:47:00', '2021-06-10 13:47:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069772218', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057051028', 'Donald Fain', NULL, 'Sally called in and told me that this member wants to add the MEC to his plan.  I told her to have him email me a request along with a document that has his EIN number prior to the 20th and I can get him in for 7/1 start.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-10 13:31:24', '2021-06-10 13:31:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069822013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233260', 'Brandy Echery', NULL, 'see ticket!  and requested membership cards from Zion Health/Planstin for this member. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-10 13:25:44', '2021-06-10 13:25:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069822008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366082', 'Irene Mendyuk', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-10 12:52:36', '2021-06-10 12:52:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069793013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, 'Emily called requesting information on why she is being charged for a service that is no longer available to her (telemed service) due to her being a Liberty member. When she tried to use the Telemed services she was told by Telemed that Empowering Benefits is no long associated with their program. Because I do not know much about the Liberty program, she asked to be transferred to someone in billing for more information on her charges. I transferred her to Patti. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-10 12:52:26', '2021-06-10 12:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069793008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Member called regarding her CirrusMD registration issues. When she tried to register it told her incorrect information, I then had Melinda sign in to CirrusMD by resetting her password. Once she was able to sign in, she informed me that her first name in the CirrusMD system was listed and Megan. I have reached out to CirrusMD to make this correction to her account. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-10 12:27:07', '2021-06-10 12:27:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069822003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878139', 'Jennifer MacDonald', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Great new member understands all of the plan because she is in the medical field. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-10 12:23:45', '2021-06-10 12:23:45'),
