  ('zcrm_1579374000069777013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'Member called regarding a visit she is having tomorrow with her doctor. I explained that she is a self pay patient and to ask for the best possible cash price. She is inquiring about potential labs as well and once she has the names of the labs she may be having, she wants to call and speak about whether those will be out of pocket. I explained that she does have to meet the $1000 IUA before the need is eligible for cost sharing. Kimberly also stated that she lost her card so I have requested both a PDF and hard copy be sent to her. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-10 08:47:19', '2021-06-10 08:50:58'),
