  ('zcrm_1579374000069688118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, 'Mary Ann called to be reminded on how to get her mammogram,  through the connected plan.  I reminded her.  She also wanted to know how to go about getting a bone density test so I went over the self pay process.  I also requested membership cards from Zion Health on her behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-09 11:33:22', '2021-06-09 11:33:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069741003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165296', 'Lara Vazquez', NULL, '6-9-21 Lara is mad that''s she''s been paying for HES bc LHS told her it''s not required and she''s not getting anything from it. They told her is hasn''t been required since 2017. She wants all of her money back since that time. I explained she is still receiving all of the services included since the beginning ''til now. She doesn''t know what those services are and doesn''t want it. 
I asked KC to see if she''s registered in CirrusMD and she has Not. Rod asked me to send the request to him and Michele to discuss next steps. She said she recorded our call and has lawyers in her family but won''t go down that path if she gets her money back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-09 11:31:24', '2021-06-09 11:31:24'),
