  ('zcrm_1579374000069550028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330254', 'Debra Rice', NULL, '6-7-21 Deb called to figure out how to present herself at her annual wellness visit tomorrow. Also asked about thermography which isn''t included in ACA. She knows she''ll have to pay if she chooses that. Wants a colonoscopy sometime soon too, so I sent her the instructions to search for a provider. She already checked on her Doctor for tomorrow and said he/she''s in network. 
She called America''s Frontline Doctors to get hydroxycholoroquine and was prescribed ivermectin instead which she hadn''t heard of. I told her my knowledge of both and that ivermectin is good at any point in virus vs hydroxy best in early stages, BUT I''m NOT a doctor. Told her this is just my research and to take it with grain of salt. She was appreciative. The doctor she spoke with only gave her 3 minutes and would barely answer her questions. So felt uneasy. But, felt much better after we talked.  She was told to take ivermectin 4 weeks, 5 tablets and it would last 6 weeks of protection or take it if/when you have symptoms. She will probably just keep on hand if she has symptoms and take it then.

She also shared  her experience with her teeth. She had 9 infected teeth from root canals which would have caused MAJOR problems down the road had she not seen this dentist now. https://sharondickersondds.com/meet-dr-popp/  Dr. Corbin Popp is a biological dentist and has saved her health and mouth! She still has another year of restoration. But, he explained that dental issues can cause heart attacks, dementia, auto immune diseases, etc. Even wisdom teeth taken out or gum disease can cause major health issues.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-07 16:27:59', '2021-06-07 16:27:59'),
