  ('zcrm_1579374000069550013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, '6-7-21 Hi Kelly,

Our data team took a look at the procedure code 61343 for a Chiari Decompression surgery and did their best to give some pricing reference.  We don''t have too many instances of claims where that code is included as it seems to be a fairly uncommon procedure

The way they evaluated pricing was essentially to ask "In cases of spinal surgery where this procedure code is present, what are the prices an insurance company can expect to pay?"  Those prices can change dramatically depending on the case because of how many codes are included, length of stay in the hospital, etc.  However, what they found is about half the cases with that code included ended up around a fair price for a spinal fusion.  In this case, that would be around $47k. 
 

However, because this procedure is fairly rare and half the cases included other considerations pushing the price significantly upward, our team thinks something around $55-$60k for a self pay patient would be a pretty reasonable, if not good, as a starting point.  They could see prices as high as $70-$80k being at least in consideration, though not great, depending on the case if it''s pretty complicated.  Certain cases did go as high as $90k-$120k, and at that point we''re likely talking about an overpriced surgery barring an extensive amount of work being done.  


I know this isn''t necessarily super helpful, but unfortunately without knowing more about what exactly the physician will be doing and the codes/length of stay necessary, it will be tough to give a more exact number.  The bottom line right now, without more info and assuming a fairly straightforward case, is we''d hope around $55k-$60k being reasonable.

I hope that helps, and if you need any clarification or additional information please let us know!

I hope you have a great holiday weekend!

Best,

Charles Henderson

Member Concierge

Healthcare Bluebook', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-07 11:05:11', '2021-06-07 11:05:11'),
