  ('zcrm_1579374000069396008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '6-3-21 Richard had forgotten everything we talked about. We started to enroll in CARE+ but then he wanted the wellness visits for his daughter. So, we changed to SECURE. I''m sending him the doctor list to make sure they remain in the network for her and are again exploring for them. He was thinking he wanted to stay with Sedera and remove Redirect. Once I explained the value of Redirect and how better to access them via the Spruce app, he is interested in staying. I suggested he try to get his $500 worth of chiro visits covered on the back end. They may or may not honor it. But, his visits were $90 which is within the realm that they pay for. I''m asking the Concierge to help him with using the app. He removed his daughter from their current membership. He will review SECURE more closely now that he understands it''s a different sharing organization. Rhyan doesn''t have any pre-x, so moving was fine. Wife takes synthroid and that''s it. He had tweaked back 6 months ago from skiing (or some other similar activity. I forget what he said.) It''s all fine. But, he didn''t realize Redirect gives him free chiro! So, it''s worth trying to get some or all of it reimbursed. He will contact me next week to decide what he wants to do moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-03 10:50:34', '2021-06-03 10:50:34'),
