  ('zcrm_1579374000069281019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, 'Michelle called in as she was charged the extra $25 1 month early as payment was out of sequence.  I fixed in Admin 123, hopefully this will fix.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-02 08:21:32', '2021-06-02 08:21:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069281014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584056', 'Lynda Wright', NULL, 'Spoke with Jeff he will be in contact with member to talk about conversion to Zion due to price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-02 08:09:52', '2021-06-02 08:09:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069281006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'Found members address had not been updated in FTNI.  Most likely she saw old address on Receipt (generated out of FTNI).  I updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-02 07:39:44', '2021-06-02 07:39:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069196055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877100', 'Thomas Bagwell', NULL, '6-1-21 Removed me as his Agent on C4! I emailed him just now to save him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-01 20:31:58', '2021-06-01 20:31:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069196050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064873001', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, '6-1-21 Sherry lost job in 2021 so now she qualifies for $0 option through C4. Sent her an email to help her but suspect she''s already chosen plan on her own. We will see.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-01 17:26:47', '2021-06-01 17:26:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069196042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '6-1-21 We updated Nan''s address and income. But, we tried to remove her son from the account on the Family Overview page. Apparently that breaks the account which I had no idea, nor had I ever seen the button to remove a family member. Nicholas with C4 says we have to show he''s not dependent and not filing on his taxes. He says there''s no way to fix the account and put me on hold for 2-3 minutes.  Nicholas said her account will remain as is was before, but that could mean at the $172 amount or the $277 amount with the $35K income. She will keep an eye out on her account. We will fix it as soon as she received the email from C4 that it''s fixed. We will make sure son is removed and change income from $35K to $26K. Wants to keep price around the $177 and hard to know what her income will be since still working on 2020.  Looks like TKT # is 210-601-001212. They will notify customer via email when resolved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-01 17:16:58', '2021-10-08 11:12:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069214037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737100', 'Colette Kirkendall', NULL, 'this member reached out on SalesIQ and asked how to cancel.  I sent a cancellation form and BCC''d Analisa. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-01 15:41:54', '2021-06-01 15:41:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069192234', 'Nathan Love', NULL, 'Member Family  $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 14:56:19', '2021-06-01 14:56:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069214032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881027', 'John Dooley', NULL, 'John called to complain that he has been trying to get a hold of Redirect Health 6 times now, and is getting the "run around" about an annual exam bill.  I told him that I would reach out to their management team on his behalf- I also told him that I would let Wendy know so that she could advocate on his behalf as well.  John thanked me for the support. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-01 14:31:18', '2021-06-01 14:31:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069192221', 'Leslie Alexander', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 14:15:51', '2021-06-01 14:15:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893072', 'Elaine Roth', NULL, 'Member called in and needs to update Pmt information.  I will send out Link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 13:59:03', '2021-06-01 13:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415080', 'Kristine Ferguson', NULL, 'Member emailed me letting me know she wants to cancel I will send her out the Cancellation Link and copy Wendy', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 13:48:49', '2021-06-01 13:48:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069196037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451131', 'Adria Moshe', NULL, 'Member called regarding submitting bills to Zion, I sent her the submission link via email. She was also inquiring whether or not her pelvic PT will be covered by Zion considering this is a pre-x issue from after her daughter''s birth a year ago. I explained that it would be something that she would have to discuss with Zion. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-01 13:43:25', '2021-06-01 13:43:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069192208', 'Stacey Rivera', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 13:41:32', '2021-06-01 13:41:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080090', 'Socorro Muniz', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 13:29:15', '2021-06-01 13:29:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069214027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920115', 'Peter Jonas', NULL, 'this member''s mother (Deborah) called to ask about her son''s plan- I went over the self pay process, as well as how the IUA works.  Deborah told me that she was not aware that the $5000 was per medical incident.  She also wasn''t aware that her son would be paying out of pocket for everything up to $5000.  She asked me about the cancellation process, I told her that the deadline for cancellation is the 20th of the month and if she would like to cancel, to fill out a form before then.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-01 13:28:06', '2021-06-01 13:28:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080079', 'Michell Miners', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 13:27:30', '2021-06-01 13:27:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080068', 'Max Pickard', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 13:24:13', '2021-06-01 13:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080057', 'Cara Jakob', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 13:22:30', '2021-06-01 13:22:30');
