  ('zcrm_1579374000069214019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752344', 'Judith Anderson (Knizewski)', NULL, '06.01.21:  Emailed Eric/Planstin to confirm our agreement re:  Judith''s membership date and payment of  her wellness visit fees (see 6/1/21 attachment).  Asked if he will direct Zion to bill us the August share fee.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-06-01 12:32:26', '2021-06-01 12:32:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069214008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752344', 'Judith Anderson (Knizewski)', NULL, '05.28.21:  See Attachment below (6/1/21) regarding resolution of Membership start date.  Per Eric of Planstin, they will roll back this member''s start date from September 1, 2020 to August 1, 2020 and pay her wellness visit bill  and Lab Corp. bill.  Since member paid MPB this fee for August, MPB will pay Zion the required amount.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-06-01 11:55:31', '2021-06-01 12:32:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069176013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391137', 'Justin VanKirk', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-01 11:15:12', '2021-06-01 11:15:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069176008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022032', 'Emily Clark', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-01 11:13:40', '2021-06-01 11:13:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069214003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, 'member called to ask if she could submit her colonoscopy bill to Zion Health if it goes over her IUA amount.  I told her that she could and sent her the Zion''s needs submission form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-06-01 11:10:40', '2021-06-01 11:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069196029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, '6-1-21 Emma Simoneau called to find out if wellness and vaccines are included. They chose to stay with Sedera bc of a pre-x. So, MEC is gone. However, they do have the high cost wellness such as mammo and colonoscopy, plus childhood immunizations included ages 0-18.  Emma is 19 and only wants regular wellness check and immunizations. So, this isn''t helping her. I told her to have Alisha call if she wants to make a change to the membership if Emma''s head injury is resolved. Sounds like some other entity is covering the problem, so maybe they could switch. I''m not sure!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-01 11:00:57', '2021-06-01 11:06:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584056', 'Lynda Wright', 'New plan eff 7/1/2021', 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA 60-64 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 10:51:00', '2021-06-01 10:51:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584056', 'Lynda Wright', NULL, 'Member will be aging up into 60-64 age band I will email member &amp; Jeff &amp; adjust pricing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 10:50:10', '2021-06-01 10:50:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064873001', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Zion &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 10:32:33', '2021-06-01 10:32:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069196021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069192234', 'Nathan Love', NULL, '6-1-21 Enrolling now in SECURE $1000/$685 EF. Gave him WWSRA $100 discount. I forgot to have him enroll on the WWSRA enrollment page but used my own. No different but just won''t show as such in Admin123. Erin is looking for SS#''s for kids and Nate filling in health history. Erin is on some medications for depression and Adderall. Explained Life Care and mental health benefits again and she was very pleased. Also already pays for meds on her own. Psyched and happy with my help. Explained how to cancel LHS as well. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-06-01 10:31:35', '2021-06-01 10:45:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069196016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, 'Called member back to explain that I misinformed her regarding a preventative colonoscopy. She understood and was very nice about me still training. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-01 10:31:16', '2021-06-01 10:31:16'),
