  ('zcrm_1579374000069183028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593044', 'Jonathan Blaylock', NULL, 'Member will age into the 40-49 age band.  I will email member &amp; Jane then change pricing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 09:30:32', '2021-06-01 09:30:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069196003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, 'Member called in regarding her preventative colonoscopy. I explained to her that as long as it stays preventative, it will be eligible for cost sharing but if there is something, such as a polyp, that is found it is considered diagnostic. Member was all set and understood. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-06-01 09:16:50', '2021-06-01 09:16:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087106', 'Jennifer Mangin', 'New Plan eff 7/1/21', 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA 40-49 Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 09:14:07', '2021-06-01 09:14:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087106', 'Jennifer Mangin', NULL, 'Member will be aging up into 40-49 age band, I will email member &amp; Wendy and adjust pricing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 09:12:44', '2021-06-01 09:12:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029949150', 'James Purvis', 'New Plan eff 7/1/21', 'Member Only $2500 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 09:09:21', '2021-06-01 09:09:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029949150', 'James Purvis', NULL, 'Member will be aging into 30-39 age band.  I sent email to him &amp; MBerryman @HSA for America as JBrogdon not with HSA anymore.  I will cahnge pricing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 09:05:48', '2021-06-01 09:05:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069183003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064873001', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that since she lost her job that she was now eligible for free Health Insurance.  Wanted to cancel I told her that I would cancel &amp; refund.  Sent out Cancellation request', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-06-01 08:42:27', '2021-06-01 08:42:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069176003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461501', 'Lisa Reis', NULL, 'Already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-06-01 08:30:05', '2021-06-01 08:30:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069168003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, 'Matt called wanting places in his zip code for the wife, mamogram facilities, gynocologist, and pedio-care primary care for the daughter.  I researched and sent all to his e-mail.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-06-01 07:44:00', '2021-06-01 07:44:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069100008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165438', 'Gladys Diaz-Jourdain', NULL, '5-28-21 Called Gladys back. She''s turning 65 and has questions. I''m seeing if Denny is licensed in Fl for Medicare...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-28 16:17:04', '2021-05-28 16:17:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069114011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, 'Spoke with Ryan regarding the steps he needs to take to have an MRI. He was very patient and understanding when told that I was training. Resent the post welcome call email so that he can read it because he did not want to search for it in his emails. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-28 13:40:47', '2021-05-28 13:40:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069114003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705055', 'Douglas Whitney', NULL, 'Douglas called inquiring about his member number. I gave Douglas Planstin/Zions phone numbers and he will be calling them for his member number. He also stated that his address change was incorrect. He stated it should be PO box 5856, not PO box 5846. I made the necessary change but it was incorrect on his address change form as well. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-28 12:16:26', '2021-05-28 12:25:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069103003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342056', 'Fred Blum', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to add his son to plan to show proof of coverage for a camp.  I told him that we have had mixed results with camps &amp; colleges lots don''t take it.  I told him that we were not making any changes to the Association plans because of changes happening soon.  I told him to be in contact with Charlie and that he would explain changes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-28 11:51:37', '2021-05-28 11:51:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069081008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342056', 'Fred Blum', NULL, 'Fred called in and said that he needs to add his son to his plan ASAP!!! The reason being is b/c he needs him on and info from us for his son''s camp application. Sent him over to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-28 11:45:32', '2021-05-28 11:45:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069100003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '5-28-21 We are looking at 2 Bright Health plans her cost $103.59 - $3700 ded vs $147.23 - $0 ded. She just had some appointments and we decided to wait to see results first before making a final decision. If they come out normal and great they maybe go with cheaper monthly cost. But, if might need more labs, she''ll go with $0 ded to get lab co-pays. Focusing on July 1st change date now instead. She''s feeling relieved to have time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-28 11:34:55', '2021-05-28 11:34:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069081003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Machelle called in and said she needed to find a specific type of doctor and if they are covered. I asked her first off what type of appointment is this for. She said it would be a cardiologist to have her heart looked at because of a few things. 1. I believe she said a few years ago she went and have her arteries looked at and mentioned carotid arteries but they were fine. 2. She said she is just getting this done to be "Preventative". 3. It runs in her family for this type of issue and heart problems. So it seems in her mind since this appointment is just to be Preventative in her mind it will be covered only because it is a "Preventative" test. I suggested to her since this could turn out to be a really big issue, to call Zion and explain everything she told me and they will be able to let her know what she is going to need to do and do a search in their PHCS network for a cardiologist. If she needs any further help I told her to call. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-28 09:18:28', '2021-05-28 09:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069064003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', 'New Plan eff 6/21', 'Member Only $1000IUA  Conn Worksite', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-28 07:41:20', '2021-05-28 07:41:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069063003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, 'I got word from Zion that Madonna can remove her spouse eff 6/21.  We just have to send in file.  I will change in Admin 123 and refund difference of $247 to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-28 07:37:08', '2021-05-28 07:37:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069044043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083146', 'Paul Goin', NULL, 'Paul called for another update to see if his enrollment with Zion was correct.  I told him that it wasn''t yet and apologized.   - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-27 16:49:44', '2021-05-27 16:49:44'),
