  ('zcrm_1579374000069034029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069438001', 'Beth Blacker', NULL, '5-27-21 Looking at Bright Health Plans possibly $0 deductible plan or HSA plans or others. She''s going to review it with her brother tonight and make a decision by tomorrow. She will call me if she has questions, otherwise she will just enroll by tomorrow. She''s also going to see a hematologist tomorrow to check if/why she has an iron deficiency. Only concerned bc she has issues within her family. Also, using genetic counseling to make sure she''s healthy. Gross income is $125K-$130K but after expenses putting in $51,740 (or close to that).', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-27 15:25:37', '2021-05-27 15:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069044028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058247082', 'Anne-Marie Marron', NULL, 'reached out to Anne-Marie with the answer to her colonoscopy question via email as I had promised earlier on her Welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-27 15:17:11', '2021-05-27 15:17:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000069044023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, 'sent Julia a link for a lab discount site called ultalabtests.com. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-27 14:58:28', '2021-05-27 14:58:28'),
