  ('zcrm_1579374000068932018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608589', 'Genifer Murray', NULL, 'Genifer called regarding cancellation. I sent her the cancellation link via email and transferred her to Patti regarding whether or not she will be charged for June 2021. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-27 09:49:02', '2021-05-27 09:49:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068975003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, 'Madonna''s husband just passed away on Friday and she wants to know what she needs to do now in regards to him being on the plan and not now anymore, etc.. I put her back to Patti as I know she has dealt with this sort of thing in the past and is part of billing anyway. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-27 09:01:16', '2021-05-27 09:01:16'),
