  ('zcrm_1579374000068968003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063804100', 'Roger Gaudreau', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-27 07:47:21', '2021-05-27 07:47:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068898041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020121', 'Amy Bloom', NULL, '5-26-21 Amy and Mitch decided to move to DIRECT to combine accounts and save $100 a month. They will also likely just keep their daughter with Dr. Lee and use his services remotely or when at home. Put in cancellations for both Sedera accounts as well. So, all set. Asking Patti is she will do a June 1st start date or July 1st to avoid possible future pre-x if anything happens in June.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-26 17:20:21', '2021-05-26 17:20:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068904023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869315', 'Desiree Domo', NULL, 'Desiree called to ask if a special Covid blood test would be covered- I told her it would be an out of pocket expense.  I told her that if it turns out to be positive and turns into a medical incident that exceeds her $1000 IUA then she could submit the bill to Zion for sharing.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-26 16:57:06', '2021-05-26 16:57:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068898036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001107434', 'Lauren Peterson', NULL, '5-26-21 Lauren called and we changed her income from $17,679 to $19000 to keep her out of Medicaid. She wants to be able to keep her doctors and not be limited. She APTC went from $560.83 to $639.75 with a new premium of $0!!! She was thrilled as she''s still trying to recover from covid lockdown with her biz.  Kept Friday Silver X HMO and Anthem Dental Plan for $9.85 (realizes it''s crappy but will chose another option next year or nothing). She still had to pay $140 for her x-rays at her checkup. Super nice, humorous and appreciative of my help!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-26 16:34:17', '2021-05-26 16:34:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068904018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083146', 'Paul Goin', NULL, 'Paul called in to get a status of his membership with Zion Health.......I told him that they had just informed me that they were still working him into their system and that they would let us know once he was imported.  Paul requested that they call him after they have him imported in their system. I requested that on Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-26 15:41:55', '2021-05-26 15:41:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068904013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132196', 'Laura Lee Pier', NULL, 'I spent 40 minutes with this member-her primary care office will not let her pay cash for her ear wax removal because they had already had her Planstin card on file.  I reached out to Planstin''s management team and asked them to give her a phone call.  She had lot''s of questions about her IUA- I don''t think she was aware of all of the out of pocket expenses she would have.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-26 15:40:06', '2021-05-26 15:40:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068932013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752344', 'Judith Anderson (Knizewski)', NULL, 'Judith was returning her call to Debbie due to a disconnection. Judith is having issues with her plan start date, she had ASI but was converted to Planstin as of August 1, 2020. She has been told that she did not start her plan with Planstin until September 1, 2020 and is very upset that she received a labcorp bill from August 2020 when she clearly had Planstin. Judith also states that Empowering Benefits MUST pay this Labcorp bill. Debbie is doing some research for Judith and will be calling her back in the morning. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-26 15:14:46', '2021-05-26 15:14:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068898028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, '5-26-21 Melissa has a defect in the shape of her brain which was diagnosed when she was 14. They re-evaluated in 2000 and they did not do surgery or anything. It''s been dormant since, except she has lifelong headaches and numbness. Since ongoing symptoms always it will likely be pre-x which she believes. Now it''s been exacerbated in Nov. 2020 until now with debilitating headaches and other pains. Income is about $120K, so not APTC qualifying. She will likely need Chiari Decompression surgery from neurosurgeon at CO Chiari Institute. She''s willing to get traditional health insurance to be safe and wants to know what''s primary and what''s secondary as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-26 13:45:45', '2021-05-26 13:47:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068933003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563343', 'Amy Simon', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Zion and cancel in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-26 13:25:42', '2021-05-26 13:25:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068932008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563343', 'Amy Simon', NULL, 'Amy called requesting a cancellation as of May 31, 2021. I sent the cancellation link via email and BCC''d Jeff Kanter, her rep. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-26 12:52:43', '2021-05-26 12:52:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068904008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889096', 'Samantha Wilson', NULL, 'member called to clarify that she wants to be cancelled effective July 1 as that is when her new insurance starts.  I told her that I would let Patti know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-26 12:46:47', '2021-05-26 12:46:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068932003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'Hailey, members daughter, called asking for a list of Urgent Care facilities in her area (Jackson, MI). I sent her a list via email. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-26 12:39:01', '2021-05-26 12:39:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068898023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423014', 'Asya Bangiyeva', NULL, 'I got this members husband after he spoke with Zion who referred him back to us.  He was very rude and repeatedly referred to this as "insurance"  and clearly did not understand the concept of an IUA.  He took his wife to the ER after a fall and was charged $2000.  He did not know Zions name and thought this was a scam.   I told him he needed to be in contact with Jane so she could explain it better to him.   Debbie made Joan aware of this member''s spouse.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-26 11:46:08', '2021-05-26 11:46:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068898018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020063', 'Mitchell Bloom', NULL, '5-26-21 Mitchell called to ask some questions about making the switch. He will discuss with Amy and let me know. Their daughter Alieah (sp?) has depression through covid and talked with psychiatrist less than 10x last year. So, I told him about Virtual Healthcare App and Life Care where pre-x doesn''t matter. He''s psyched to save $106 a month!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-26 11:44:13', '2021-05-26 11:44:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068898013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087146', 'Emily Donahue', NULL, '5-26-21 Emily is living in Costa Rica and is choosing to simply self-pay for everything since it''s affordable and she''s young and healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-26 11:24:57', '2021-05-26 11:24:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068898008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823005', 'Angie Ward', NULL, '5-26-21 Angie is starting a new job at St. Mary''s in Grand Junction. So, she''s all set and thankful for my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-26 11:23:35', '2021-05-26 11:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068904003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705055', 'Douglas Whitney', NULL, 'Douglas called to ask about finding a doctor in network- I told him that I would send him the preventative care link and instructions- and the two preventative care email templates.  I also told him that I noticed he didn''t have a welcome call yet, and suggested one.  I sent him a scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-26 11:16:41', '2021-05-26 11:16:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068898003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002887157', 'Trevor Mickelson', NULL, 'Member requested thru Wendy a change to the Conn Wkst DPC plan effective 6/1.  I changed plan in Admin 123 notified Zion and changed billing.  Members intention is to change payment method I will charge when I received updated Pmt info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-26 11:11:18', '2021-05-26 11:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068877022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-26 11:00:25', '2021-05-26 11:00:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068812013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083146', 'Paul Goin', NULL, 'Paul called to let me know that after KellyAnne gave him the how to submit a need to Zion link, he did all that this morning and Zion responded back stating that they do not have him as a member in their system but it is showing he has Planstin as his preventative care. Paul stated that this exact problem happened a few months ago and it is getting really frustrating. He said we need to get to the bottom of this because he has been a member for years and has been paying his monthly amount yet every single time he needs to get help with something Zion says he is not a member. I took his phone number down and told him I will look into this and give him a call back today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-26 10:42:38', '2021-05-26 10:42:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068877017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065580074', 'Carrie Todd', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-26 10:34:06', '2021-05-26 10:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068877003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423014', 'Asya Bangiyeva', NULL, '5/26/21 Member''s husband called.  He first asked about his wife''s bills.  I tried my best to help him by answering his questions.  He had very many of them so I decided to look to see if they got a welcome call.  I found out that no welcome call as of today was schduled.  I tried to tell him how to plan one and the benefits of one.  He started yelling at me and acusing me of talking over him.  " I want no education on anything."  " I do not want a welcome call" " I want you to do it all" I tried again to educated him an tell him the benefits of one.  He was very rude and hung up on me.  DP  We would need a waiver signed to speak to him.    Is a membership he purchased for the wife', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-05-26 10:20:29', '2021-05-26 10:24:24'),
