  ('zcrm_1579374000068846013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020063', 'Mitchell Bloom', NULL, '5-25-21 Spoke with Amy and discussed option to move to DIRECT membership to put family back together as one membership instead of split due to Sedera''s age banding. They are paying $741 now plus Dr. Lee with Harmony Health at $1500 IUA. They could lower the IUA to $1000 and pay $635 a month for entire family with DPC. We will just need to find a local DPC for daughter whose going to Emerson College in Boston which is near Brighton, MA. No pre-x other than colds, etc. She shocked that the masks are working. I told her I''m skeptical since nobody has contact with anyone, anyhow. She was cool and non-judgemental. She wants synopsis of what I told her, so will send DIRECT information and additional notes now. Open to June or July 1st date depending on what''s possible.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-25 17:05:38', '2021-05-25 17:05:38'),
