  ('zcrm_1579374000068761039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'I spoke to this member who told me that he was being charged for the 40-49 age band and he had turned 50 back in 2019.  This was prior to the time that Sedera changed their policy to have members charged the higher rate in the month that they age up.  I advised the member of his new rate and advised him that starting with the 6/22 that is what he will be charged going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-25 09:21:56', '2021-05-25 09:22:14'),
