  ('zcrm_1579374000068730023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564382', 'Gregg Wurtz', NULL, '5-24-21 Gregg is deciding between adding himself to Holly Hill''s SECURE membership for $500 total per month at $1000 IUA or Anthem for $461.79 for Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 7000 for HSA. Double check this is the exact plan he had directly through Anthem now for $819. With income of Holly''s at $60K will get a $380 APTC. He just needs to be confident he won''t have any more eye issues from long ago cataract surgery and recent eye appt, or any back issues that he was afraid of before. Now, he feels confident he''s in the clear. But, he''s going to ponder and he knows the deadline for each. He''ll let me know his decision. He completely understands pre-ex clause.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-24 17:27:51', '2021-05-24 17:27:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068716018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808040', 'Thomas DeAngelis', NULL, 'sent Thom information about the MAP program per his email request. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-24 16:51:30', '2021-05-24 16:51:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068730018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '5-24-21 I spoke with Tom at C4 and he said her account looks good and all set with the new APTC. I don''t have to choose a new plan or go through any of that. Super easy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-24 15:40:14', '2021-05-24 15:40:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068730013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '5-24-21 ARP new APTC $258 so her cost is $60.65. She did not have to do anything other than sign the declarations page due to no changes on her end. New amount with same plan is showing in enrollments and on home page! I told her to keep an eye out on her next bill for the new premium amount. She will give it a few days to check.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-24 15:14:32', '2021-05-24 15:14:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068730008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054986001', 'Ken Trombley', NULL, '5-24-21 Ken''s cost will got from $670 ish to $189.88! Gave him instructions to do the Streamlined re-enrollment to gain APTC. Wants Kaiser still.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-24 15:04:38', '2021-05-24 15:04:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068730003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010760035', 'Amanda McCracken', NULL, '5-24-21 Choosing to remain unmarried until Dave finds a new job with full benefits. She will go through C4 Streamlined app process to gain the new APTC and let me know if run into any problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-24 15:03:13', '2021-05-24 15:03:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068681008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', NULL, 'Lynn called in a couple hours ago and just wanted to get the link and info about Zion''s Network for providers. She told me that Andrea Hinman, who is her Agent, called her to let her know about the switchover from Sedera to Zion that is going to be happening due to Sedera not allowing people to have their plan with a MEC. So in the near future people that have the plan Lynn has, Sedera & APEX/RCI are going to have to switch over to Zion with Planstin as the MEC. So I assume Lynn wants to make sure the providers that she goes to currently are on Zion''s network. I let Lynn know that the network that Zion and Planstin have are the exact same of RCI which is PHCS Network. The only difference is that Zion''s and Planstin''s are actually more broader than the current PHCS through RCI. She was very very happy to hear it is the same and also that Zion''s pricing is a lot cheaper than Sedera right now. Sedera has raised their prices a lot and will be as well if anyone stays with Sedera during the change over. Lynn is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-24 13:26:39', '2021-05-24 13:26:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068707013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153641', 'Garner Sorrell', NULL, 'We were notified via email that member needed to update address &amp; pmt info.  Kelly F sent out links and I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-24 12:34:20', '2021-05-24 12:34:20'),
