  ('zcrm_1579374000068716008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063198002', 'Rosana Bowman', NULL, 'Rosana called to set up a welcome call- I sent her a scheduler.  She was also having issues with her portal she said that Alessa had helped her in the past with it so I transferred the line to Alessa. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-24 11:56:04', '2021-05-24 11:56:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068716003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083146', 'Paul Goin', NULL, 'Paul called to let me know that he is speaking to Charles at HCBB, he also wanted to be reminded of his IUA and asked that the Zion needs submission link be sent to him again.  He said that he is pretty certain that he has submitted all of his bills to Zion he just wanted to make sure with them.  I thanked him for calling and updating me. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-24 10:57:57', '2021-05-24 10:57:57'),
