  ('zcrm_1579374000068552019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, 'Wendy says that this member might convert but it won''t be till at least 7/1 so I will inform Sedera of the correct DOB for member.  I have set up billing to reflect 50-59 age band.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-21 14:35:40', '2021-05-21 14:35:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068552011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, 'Per Wendy this member''s  DOB was incorrect.  Wendy went in and updated if from 12/15/73 to the correct 6/21/1971.  This means she will be aging up to the 50 age band.  Wendy advises that she might not be a good fit for Zion.   Since billing will run this evening I have to change the pricing because once Sedera is informed they will charge the higher price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-21 14:17:09', '2021-05-21 14:17:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068585029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063858002', 'David Roush', NULL, 'member called to be reminded on how to present themselves as a self pay patient. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-21 13:21:26', '2021-05-21 14:00:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068585024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063157021', 'Roger Webb', NULL, 'answered some IUA questions via email for this member. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-21 13:02:34', '2021-05-21 13:02:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068572008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921682', 'Terry Prindiville', NULL, 'Lisa called in regarding an emergent visit for her son when he gets back from Costa Rica. I sent Lisa/Terry Provider Search Instructions, Wellness visit instructions, and a welcome call scheduler. Lisa is all set. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-21 12:59:51', '2021-05-21 12:59:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068585019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'Helped Robin with knee MRI info off of HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-21 11:36:15', '2021-05-21 11:36:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068585014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356758', 'Joan Tekula', NULL, 'Joan called for us to tell her that her screening colonoscopy would be covered 100%  - I told her that a screening colonoscopy is only covered at a 100% if it is coded as preventative- and we cannot promise anything because there are other factors that could come into play that make colonoscopy''s fall into the diagnostic category- a conversation that she has with the doctor-or something abnormal  that is found during the actual colonoscopy itself.  I told her that Planstin will cover this procedure as long as it is coded as preventative and the providers are in network.  She understood and thanked me for my time!', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-21 11:35:35', '2021-05-21 11:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068585003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073115', 'Mailan Boris', NULL, 'spoke to Mailan about her screening colonoscopy, and did some network lookups for her. I sent a question to RCI concerning the colonoscopy prep  and tagged Mailan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-21 11:01:04', '2021-05-21 11:01:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068578008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063804100', 'Roger Gaudreau', NULL, 'Email verification sent for registration for Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-21 10:22:55', '2021-05-21 10:22:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068578003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066223013', 'Ashley Gillispie', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-21 10:19:26', '2021-05-21 10:19:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068572003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401191', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, 'Nathan called in and was confused as to why his dermatologist appointment was not covered by his plan. I explained to Nathan that dermatologist appointments are usually not covered unless there is something diagnostic. I emailed Nathan the ACA list of preventative care services. - JATS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-21 10:00:29', '2021-05-21 10:00:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068560003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731070', 'Carolyn Whitus', NULL, 'Savannah called in and said that she needed help with finding a therapist and what is covered. I explained to her about the MAP program and sent the email with details on how to start with MAP. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-21 09:44:17', '2021-05-21 09:44:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068552003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to reflect name change from Healy to Woodward.  I will change in CRM, Admin 123, FTNI &amp; Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-21 09:31:24', '2021-05-21 09:31:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068542008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104048', 'Lori Goldman', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address I will update in CRM &amp; Admin 123 &amp; w/Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-21 09:12:39', '2021-05-21 09:12:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068542003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068540001', 'Ameila Mader', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-21 07:41:48', '2021-05-21 07:41:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068514038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504066', 'Deborah Madsen', NULL, 'I called Deborah, the member told me that she went to get the MRI''s she mentioned sending me the bill....she also asked me about the 2nd MD process- I told her that she needs to send her bills to Sedera- not us, and that she needs to speak to Sedera about the 2nd MD process.  She told me that someone at Sedera had already helped her open up a need.  I offered to transfer her to Sedera so that they could go over the 2nd MD process but she declined.  Deborah thanked me for helping her today. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-20 17:14:29', '2021-05-21 11:08:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068514033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104048', 'Lori Goldman', NULL, 'member called to update her address with us- I sent her the online member update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-20 16:59:20', '2021-05-20 16:59:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068514028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351197', 'Frank Sorrentino', NULL, 'Sarah called because she was having issues with her preventative care billing through Planstin- I explained that we do not get involved with billing here due to HIPPA privacy laws and transferred her call to Planstin. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-20 15:00:25', '2021-05-20 15:00:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068477094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476177', 'Patrick Hemphill', NULL, 'Member On;y $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-20 14:55:39', '2021-05-20 14:55:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068514023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James called to ask about the process involved in seeing a doctor about an "Issue" I went over the cash pay process with him and reminded him of him of his IUA.  He then asked about his preventative care services- I sent him the preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-20 14:38:04', '2021-05-20 14:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068477089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-20 13:57:37', '2021-05-20 13:57:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068514018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'Robin called to let me know that her husband now needs to have a knee MRI done- but they are now out of pocket over $700 and the MRI will got over their IUA- I told Robin that Zion will tell her to now use her Planstin card.  She asked if she could speak to Zion about their process so I transferred the line.  I told her to call me back afterwards if she needed any further help.  I reached out on Slack to Eric to let him know that Robin still hadn''t received her digital cards and asked him to confirm her member ID number that she gave me that is on the hard copy of the Planstin card she DOES have. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-20 13:31:37', '2021-05-20 13:31:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068477084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476126', 'Robin Korosec', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-20 13:01:45', '2021-05-20 13:01:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068514013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504066', 'Deborah Madsen', NULL, 'I ran a HCBB search for this member because she is fed up with Redirect.  I sent her fair price graphs for Spine MRI''s as well as the best facility''s to go to so that she can get the fair price.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-20 12:33:11', '2021-05-20 12:33:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068516003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, '5-20-21 Mike is 55 and wife 53 turning 54 - Sept, 12, 1967. Has 3 kids but 1 is getting married in Aug. Other two are 23 and 19. Mike''s self-employed. He''s had Golden Rule for past 15 years and price is going up too much every year paying $3000-$3500 per quarter. Family is healthy, no meds, no tobacco.  Never go to the doctor. But, son had hip surgery and wife on high blood pressure meds that they already took her off. Son may need PT but they know to pay cash and not reimbursed for that since pre-x. Son aso had rib removed. Looking to see if son''s knee surgery was prior to 24 months. Dr. Kierein and Dr. Pinto at Avista are both in network. He used to travel to Africa when working for non-profit so happy that he''s protected. Mike had colonoscopy at the end of last year and doesn''t need one again for another 10 years.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-20 12:30:17', '2021-05-20 12:30:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068477079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162541', 'Harry Shaffer', NULL, 'I followed up with member as he had not submitted cancellation as he is turning 65.  I told him he needs to fill out cancellation form.  He said that his wife was not 65.  Told him that she would be cancelled as well since whole plan will cancel.  We do not want to place anyone with Sedera because of changes so I left VM with Analisa to contact member to discss options with Zion for spouse.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-20 12:22:36', '2021-05-20 12:22:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068514008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056904243', 'Samantha Camerino', NULL, 'Helped Daniel with a list of dermatologist''s off of HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-20 11:50:08', '2021-05-20 11:50:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068514003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530219', 'Eva Hogan', NULL, 'Eva called to ask if we had received her cancellation form- I confirmed with Patti that we had.  However she hadn''t processed the cancellation yet because Eva wants to cancel by July 1.  I told Eva that once Patti processes the cancellation she will send her an email to confirm her cancellation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-20 11:20:48', '2021-05-20 11:20:48'),
