  ('zcrm_1579374000068477071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, 'Member called in as she was looking for an Urgent Care.  1st place she went wanted to bill her $199 cash price.  They did not recognize the RCI card.  I did a search and gave her a neam of banner Urgent care told her to make sure they were still in Network at check-in', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-20 10:42:54', '2021-05-20 10:42:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068506008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, 'Janet called in and is having a difficult time at the urgent care that she is at which she said she called to make sure this facility was in the network and they are trying to charge her over $100 for her visit. She has the Co-Pay plan and stated that the last time she only had to pay $50 which is correct with her Co-Pay and is stuck and doesn''t know what to do. I was confused and not understanding what she was talking about and Patti helped me out. We looked up Urgent Care''s in Janet''s area and told her to always always confirm with the facility they are in PHCS Network before just going, and to make sure she hands them her RCI card and they are to bill RCI directly. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-20 10:29:32', '2021-05-20 10:29:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068506003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191499', 'Christopher Nolder', NULL, 'Christopher called to let us know that he updated his payment online due to the payment decline that was sent to him. I will let Patti know, all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-20 10:25:24', '2021-05-20 10:25:24'),
