  ('zcrm_1579374000068438038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961236', 'Shannon Leibfried', NULL, 'Shannon Leibfried called to get her husband all set with CirrusMD- however it looks like there is a pretty big mix up with her account.  She didn''t sign up for services- she signed up for her husband Chad.  I checked admin123 to confirm this....she signed up as member only.  I explained to her that I wouldn''t be able to send him an invitation to CirrusMD because they don''t even have him down as a member.  I told her that I would reach out to home office and that they would call her tomorrow to fix this account error with her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-19 17:16:06', '2021-05-19 17:16:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068438033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959250', 'Brigitte Fleeman', NULL, 'Brigitte reached out via email to ask about logging into the MPB portal- I replied to explain that she does not have access, but sent her a link to our member updates page so she can perform the same functions if needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-19 15:12:46', '2021-05-19 15:12:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068423012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401191', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, 'Nathan called in regarding a dermatologist appointment he recently had. He received a voicemail from the dermatologists office but could not understand what they were asking him to do and thought that we would know what they wanted. He is calling the dermatologist office back so that he can gather more information. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-19 13:03:05', '2021-05-19 13:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068438028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491714', 'Douglas Bush', NULL, 'Doug was is having issues with his preventative care billing.  So I sent him Jennifer Chasteen''s contact information. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-19 13:02:44', '2021-05-19 13:02:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068438023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-19 12:27:28', '2021-05-19 12:27:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068438018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530449', 'Emily Jaynes', NULL, 'Emily had been told by RCI that some of her diagnostic claims had been denied, and Jane and told Emily to call us to ask RCI if we could convince them to approve them.  I told her that if RCI is denying certain claims that they have the final say and reminded Emily that she has her medical cost sharing with Sedera.  I went over the self pay process as well as her IUA.  She also mentioned that her husband has a very expensive blood pressure medicine that is still so expensive when using online coupon sites.  I sent her a form and told her that we would send the quote request out to Reid to see how he could help and then relay the information back to her.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-19 11:27:18', '2021-05-19 11:27:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068438013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'emailed Robin to let her know that her membership cards had been resent from Planstin''s management team. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-19 11:14:16', '2021-05-19 11:14:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068441008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165396', 'Fabio (Gus) Pernetz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-19 11:03:09', '2021-05-19 11:08:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068441003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461488', 'James White', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-19 11:00:29', '2021-05-19 11:00:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068428013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '5-19-21 Julie called bc the list of doctors in PHCS network has changed. The doctors in Glenwood no longer accept PHCS which is a big bummer. She may have to go to Eagle which is 2 hrs away. Or, find doctor and ask if they will accept PHCS network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-19 10:31:38', '2021-05-19 10:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068438008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Jayne called to ask if a surgery center was showing in network for her colonoscopy....I found that it was.  I told her to confirm with the facility that they are currently participating in the PHCS network. She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-19 10:30:28', '2021-05-19 10:30:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068395043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087146', 'Emily Donahue', NULL, 'Cancellation Request submittedI will cancel RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; Billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-19 10:29:01', '2021-05-19 10:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068438003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'I spoke to Robin- she just had questions about presenting herself as a cash pay patient- I went over the process again.  I let her know that I still hadn''t heard back from Planstin about her membership card- but once I do I will email her.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-19 10:09:10', '2021-05-19 10:09:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068395038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087146', 'Emily Donahue', NULL, 'What seemed to be Emily''s mom called in and asked how to cancel membership I explained that I would send link out and fill it out and get it back to me today ahead of billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-19 09:45:54', '2021-05-19 09:45:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068428008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, '5-19-21 Cancelled bc "Our company just signed up for a group insurance plan. Thus far things have been great. The switch from Sedera to MPB was a little confusing though." Willing to refer new clients which they already did for an employee that wasn''t offered the group plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-19 09:41:47', '2021-05-19 09:41:47'),
