  ('zcrm_1579374000068395023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-19 09:13:36', '2021-05-19 09:13:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068423003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'Robin called in this morning but her call was missed so Jennifer called back and left a voicemail. Phone rang again at 11:05 AM, Jennifer answered and the phone call ended. Jennifer did attempt to call Robin back to verify that she did not have any questions or concerns but there was no answer. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-19 09:08:08', '2021-05-19 09:12:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068422003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, '05.19.21:  Enrolled Janet (John''s wife) as primary member, as she is older.  They decided to take the CARE PLUS plan.  Didn''t feel they needed SECURE.  Sent them a Thank You email.
John''s Cell:  979-561-6850  His email:  o7o@gmx.com', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-05-19 09:04:36', '2021-05-19 09:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068395018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', 'New Plan eff 6/1/21', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA 50-64 CareZ Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-19 08:19:27', '2021-05-19 08:19:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068395013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove dependents from Plan I will let Zion know and change billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-19 08:16:56', '2021-05-19 08:16:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068395008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request. I will cancel w/Zion and billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-19 08:02:37', '2021-05-19 08:02:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068395003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029420050', 'Jason Liddell', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel w/ Planstin &amp; Billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-19 07:52:44', '2021-05-19 07:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068310029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577015', 'Evelyn Gavino', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  Advisor previously signed member up fro 2 mos on the Secure plan as a Short Term option.  Said member would be continuing on the Care program.  Member now cancelling 18 days into the plan.  I have cancelled the Care product.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-19 07:49:56', '2021-05-19 07:49:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068330045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, '05.18.21:  Called John to remind him about enrolling.  He was happy I called - he forgot until today.  Scheduled a call to enroll for tomorrow at 10 a.m. (9 a.m. - TX).', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-05-19 06:15:01', '2021-05-19 06:15:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068330034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, 'NOTE:  Diana is interested in DPC.  When we develop our OPD program in their area (WA) let her know.  They may want to switch to the OPD plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-05-19 06:10:23', '2021-05-19 06:11:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068330023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'Robin called me back and I spoke with her, I apologized for the confusion surrounding her plans today.  I told her that home office got it all straightened out and assured her that she has a Zion plan with a MEC through Planstin.  I recommended a Welcome Call and sent a scheduler.  I went over the self pay process that her husband needs to go through because he just hurt his knee.  I told her to call us back if he is recommended for surgery.  She told me that this just happened- not pre x.  I am also confirming with Zion Planstin management that her member ID on her Planstin card is correct. I thanked the member for being so understanding. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-18 16:50:08', '2021-05-18 16:50:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068330018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'called to apologize for plan mix up per John- called and left a message,  I told Robin that if I didn''t hear back from her by end of day that I would email her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-18 16:09:38', '2021-05-18 16:09:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068328037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028448053', 'Jonathan Brumbaugh', NULL, '5-18-21 Hi Wendy — Thanks so much for your help with insurance needs with MPowering. I really appreciate all you did for me. I was able to get set up via Covered California fairly quickly, so I think I''m all set for now. Thanks again!

Jonathan', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-18 14:41:11', '2021-05-18 14:41:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068368015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '05.18.21:  Ray &amp; Diana called with more questions.  Decided to enroll today.  Scheduled our call or 7  p.m. EST tonight (4 p.m. in WA).
Enrolled Dianna, Ray &amp; family tonight in SECURE w/$1000 IUA.  Explained the on-boarding process.  Sent email to thank them.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-05-18 14:39:25', '2021-05-19 06:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068368003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353091', 'Tammy Cranford', NULL, '05.18.21:  Enrolled Brad.  Said his wife will be added to his plan in a few months, after her follow-up medical visits for her bone spur Sx last March.  Emailed Brad to thank him for his membership.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-05-18 14:34:00', '2021-05-18 14:35:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068328032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389187', 'Kenna Crampton', NULL, '5-18-21 Patti forwarded an email Sedera showing they are trying to enroll her from an old link of ours. But, she''s on traditional insurance now bc of possible pregnancy and doesn''t want to wait the waiting period either. So, I left a vm for Kenna to make sure she hasn''t made any changes on her end.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-18 14:31:01', '2021-05-18 14:31:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057051028', 'Donald Fain', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 13:58:44', '2021-05-18 13:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005073', 'Kenny Yang', NULL, 'Member called back in and wanted to clarify what we spoke about previously.  Said he has a need open with Sedera and wanted to know when things would be changing.  I told him that we did not have a date as yet and that if he has a present need with Sedera he needs to stay where he is because if he made the change to Zion anything would be considered PreEx.  Told him he would be able to remain with Sedera if he chooses.  Told him to pay attention to his email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 13:51:56', '2021-05-18 13:51:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353091', 'Tammy Cranford', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 13:32:55', '2021-05-18 14:34:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353075', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 13:25:57', '2021-05-18 13:25:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request to move from Sedera to Zion.  I will cancel w/Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 13:08:53', '2021-05-18 13:08:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068330013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583032', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, 'called to ask the process on getting her covered screening mammogram through Zion- I told her that she will have to wait for this covered service a little longer.  To schedule for sometime after June 1st.  I told her that she could go anywhere she''d like and either pay out of pocket OR have the facility call Zion and they will pay. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-18 13:01:31', '2021-05-18 13:01:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125098', 'Vaughn Stevens', NULL, 'This member called in very confused was asking about an account that he could up to take care of related other medical.  I told him that he was probably referring to an HSA.  Member very confused.  I advised that he contact Jeff to clarify what he was speaking about.  Member is Ind Contractor so he would qualify.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 12:59:32', '2021-05-18 12:59:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052815104', 'Alisa Shepherd', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel w/ Sedera and billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 12:49:45', '2021-05-18 12:49:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052815104', 'Alisa Shepherd', NULL, 'Member was transferred to me, member is getting some sort of subsidy until September and wanted to cancel membership for just that time.  I advised that she could cancel however we would not be able to put her back on the Sedera option due to transition that will be happening at Sedera.  Told her that we now market Zion Health and she will research and be in touch with Sally', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 12:48:40', '2021-05-18 12:48:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068361003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'this was a Sedera Select Member who had originally converted to Zion for 8/1/20.  The member had and open need with Sedera, so we switched them back for 9/1.  When the need was completed, they switched to Zion for 11/1.  The info in Zoho was not updated to reflect the changes.  All is correct in the CRM and Admin123.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2021-05-18 12:44:20', '2021-05-18 12:44:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068328024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '5-18-21 Moving to SECURE to gain back MEC and keep price down since aging into 60-64 age category. Want colonoscopies for both of them. She researched if the doctors would code as wellness for the 5 year colonoscopy and they told her they will only code it as diagnostic not wellness.  They will only code every 10 years as wellness. She knows they will have to pay the first $1000 IUA for this. Chose SECURE $1000/$500 starting June 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-18 12:28:40', '2021-05-18 12:32:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', 'Redirect Term (Jackson) eff 6/1/21', 'Tracking #11597617
Sent by Patti Baron on 5/18/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 11:50:24', '2021-05-18 11:50:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, 'Member submitted a Change from to remove son Jackson, he now has his own coverage.  I will notify Redirect &amp; Sedera &amp; adjust pricing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 11:49:33', '2021-05-18 11:49:33');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000068330008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'Quentin called because he wanted ASI''s contact information.  He is still having issues with his bill and lost his card.  I emailed him Nancy Ly''s contact information. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-18 11:39:24', '2021-05-18 11:39:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068328019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '5-18-21 Talked with Eric. Sounds like Stephanie was pissed bc she had an appt scheduled for many months for a women''s issue and procedure to be done. They weren''t sure if it would be considered pre-x which it will be.  She cancelled the appt in case it would be considered pre-x by moving. I told him to stay put until she''s done with the procedure and all set with no complications. He agreed. He will let me know when they are through that bc they do want to move to the SECURE membership. They are definitely removing Jackson from their account which he already submitted the paperwork for. I''ll let Patti know now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-18 11:30:26', '2021-05-18 11:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068328014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '5-18-21 Stephanie had some questions and I just called her back. She said she already cancelled her appt and is all set. I don''t know what appt she''s talking about. I then asked her if she had further thoughts about moving to the new membership option and she said to take it up with Eric and she doesn''t really care. So, I will call Eric. I''ve never worked with her as far as I can remember. So, Eric is the point person!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-18 11:21:11', '2021-05-18 11:21:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068334003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052815104', 'Alisa Shepherd', NULL, 'Wanted to cancel, bu only for a little bit. Put her through to Patti to deal with. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-18 10:50:20', '2021-05-18 10:50:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068328009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033451023', 'Scott Ballard', NULL, '5-18-21 Lost some income and can''t afford their membership. Might be getting big APTC from gov now.  Live in OR.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-18 10:41:07', '2021-05-18 10:41:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052815104', 'Alisa Shepherd', NULL, 'Member requested cancellation form.  I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 10:38:46', '2021-05-18 10:38:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068330003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059474061', 'James Pendleton', NULL, 'called to go over the process of getting his preventative care benefits- I went over all instructions and sent both preventative care templates.  He also hadn''t received a hard copy of his Planstin card so I reached out to their management team to request them on his behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-18 10:14:08', '2021-05-18 10:14:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068310024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461488', 'James White', NULL, 'Already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-18 09:41:40', '2021-05-18 09:41:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068310019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366121', 'Brian Trebus', NULL, 'Brian called in regarding using his plan for dental work that he recently had done. I did relay to Brian that there is not a dental or a vision plan involved. He stated he thought that there was not, but just wanted to double check. Brian will be calling back with information regarding an upcoming colonoscopy. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-18 09:39:09', '2021-05-18 09:39:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068310014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-18 09:39:02', '2021-05-18 09:39:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068310009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'Spoke with Robin regarding her husband possibly re-injuring his leg. Sent Robin a list of HCBB orthopedists and fair pricing for a new patient visit 30 minutes. Will be reaching back out to Robin regarding new cards since she was in the conversion plan. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-18 09:34:49', '2021-05-18 09:34:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467293', 'Mehedi Hassan', NULL, 'Member called in requesting "Proof of Insurance" for daughter Ivy.  I advised that he received a receipt every month.  He was able to find them.  I will write letter that I will attach below.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 09:26:31', '2021-05-18 09:26:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068311055', 'Lynne Sandstrom', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 08:42:54', '2021-05-18 08:42:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068317003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028448053', 'Jonathan Brumbaugh', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel in Admin 123 &amp; Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-18 08:34:06', '2021-05-18 08:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068233038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577015', 'Evelyn Gavino', NULL, 'called to cancel- asked if she could come back to it if she needs it. I told her that she could. I didn''t tag Steve as it sounded like she was pretty sure about her decision.    She didn''t see the value.  And she doesn''t need any help with medication pricing.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-17 16:47:17', '2021-05-17 16:47:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068249003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'I have tried to send cancellation email to this member 2 times and now she has given me a new email to send this to.  I have sent to alt email: mmhernandez2706@gmail.com', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-17 16:21:30', '2021-05-17 16:21:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068233033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'I spent 1/2 an hour on the phone with Jaime, she is not happy with the fact that Sedera is making her pay for 50% of an er xray and the fact that she has two bills that are still being worked on.  I told her that MPB.Health can only do so much here- that we don''t get in the middle of these cases for HIPPA privacy reasons, she understood, just wanted to vent about her lack of service by Sedera.  At first she was thinking of cancelling and then asked if we offered any other medicial cost sharing groups.  I told her yes, Zion- I told her that she could speak to Charles about it.  I emailed her his contact information.  She thanked me for taking the time to listen to her complaints and knows that this isn''t on our end- that she is dissatisfied with Sedera.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-17 15:14:26', '2021-05-17 15:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068233028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461475', 'William (Randy) Wheeler', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Sent Margo a CirrusMD invite- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-17 14:20:37', '2021-05-17 14:20:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068233023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461475', 'William (Randy) Wheeler', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-17 14:18:33', '2021-05-17 14:18:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068245033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068243106', 'Kimberly Bohler', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-17 14:11:54', '2021-05-17 14:11:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068245028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068243093', 'Dan Naderer', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-17 13:46:22', '2021-05-17 13:46:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068245023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068243080', 'Erik Allen', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-17 13:34:45', '2021-05-17 13:34:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068171018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, '5/17/21 Member called very upset with the fact that Sedera refuses to pay her invoices she submitted.  Everything is in collections.  She spoke to Jennifer and Kelly and they are going to call Sedera on her behalf.    DP  I told her we would do that for her and we will get back to her.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-05-17 13:31:51', '2021-05-17 13:32:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068245018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068243067', 'Teresa Howitt', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-17 13:15:13', '2021-05-17 13:15:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068245013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348118', 'Teresa Howitt', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation and will be re-enrolling in the MPB Direct Plan w/ Zion.  I will cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-17 13:05:46', '2021-05-17 13:05:46'),
