  ('zcrm_1579374000068233013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'spoke to Rose Mary about Zion Health''s IUA discount program and sent her Zion Health''s link that goes over it.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-17 11:00:55', '2021-05-17 11:00:55'),
