  ('zcrm_1579374000068233003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'Jaime called to see if a skin growth removal procedure can be done on her daughters hands-I told her that she needed to speak to Sedera about it...she told me that she didn''t want to because she was upset at them.  I finally called the member down enough so that she would agreed to be transferred to them. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-17 10:44:42', '2021-05-17 10:44:42'),
