  ('zcrm_1579374000068171008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869315', 'Desiree Domo', NULL, '5/17/21 Member called wanting prescriptions.   I sent the prescription quote form to her.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-05-17 08:32:34', '2021-05-17 08:32:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068171003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, 'Dhai called in and said that she needs to find a foot doctor in network for an issue she has been having. I explained to her this is something that is not covered and would be an out of pocket cost up to her IUA of $2500. She has never had a welcome call and did not know about the difference between preventative and not. I told her she needs to have a welcome call and she highly agreed. I sent her the scheduler, how to submit to Zion, and the list of preventative items that are covered. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-17 07:58:04', '2021-05-17 07:58:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068056021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'See ticket that is now closed. She is all set for now. Very very rude to Debbie. This member is not fit for medical cost sharing and does not believe that she needs to pay for anything ever. This has been an on going issue every time she calls and something is going on. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-17 07:34:11', '2021-05-17 07:34:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068056013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, '5/17/21 Member called from a doctor''s office...she claims she is there with an emergency. Asked what card to submit.   I told her it was an out of pocket expence, Get a receipt. Told her her IUA 1000. out of pocket expense.  Then if needed we can open  a Needs to Zion .  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-05-17 07:31:56', '2021-05-17 07:32:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068046008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'Received Teams msg from Kelly C earlier this evening.  See note below.  Per my note of 5/6/21 I was notified by Sedera that this member wanted to "pause" her membership.  I reached out to Analisa whom I asked  to contact the member and explain that she could not pause her membership and to explain the upcoming changes that Sedera will be making.   Analisa never contacted the member so I contacted member I told her that she could not pause her membership and that after her 2 months out of the country her present membership would be changing due to Sedera''s upcoming Emmanus platform rollout.  I advised her that she could re-enroll in another Medical Cost Sharing vendor at any time as opposed to being limited to Open Enrollment.  She will think about this, I sent out the cancellation Link if that''s what she decides.  Once again Analisa did not do what she was asked.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-14 20:04:24', '2021-05-14 20:04:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068111033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'Maria called to ask if she could put her membership on hold- I explained that I couldn''t answer that question for her, only Patti Baron could and she wouldn''t be able to answer her until Monday as it was after hours.  I told Maria that I would reach out to Patti and ask her to call her back on Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-14 16:19:40', '2021-05-14 16:19:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068111028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362044', 'Therese Antonino', NULL, 'called to ask if Helicopter Emergency service would be a covered expense through her plan, I transferred her to Zion Health. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-14 15:52:11', '2021-05-14 15:52:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068111023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'called to ask if she had vision benefits through her plan.  I explained that she didn''t.  Then she said that she got an abnormal pap smear back and will need more testing she asking me if that would be sharable with Sedera- I told her yes, if the amount goes over her $5000 she can submit her bills to Sedera for sharing.  I sent her instructions on how to open up a need if she needs it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-14 15:34:05', '2021-05-14 15:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068111018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423027', 'Danny Lewallen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-14 14:17:58', '2021-05-14 14:17:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068103028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033237', 'Isaac Perington', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Zion and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-14 13:56:13', '2021-05-14 13:56:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068103023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974202', 'Sarah Mandell', NULL, 'Member emailed in to the Concierge giving us her Tax ID.  I told her that we would need a document uploaded that had the Tax ID on it.  She said that she didn''t have anything like that.  I told her that all she would have to do would be to upload a document that gave us the Company name &amp; Tax ID.  She said that she did not have a scanner.  She will ask her CPA for a Doc like that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-14 13:24:22', '2021-05-14 13:24:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068056008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, 'Mariah called and the first thing she says is "Is this KellyAnne?" I said no but I am also part of the concierge department, is there something I can help with? She then proceeds to say "Well can you just put me through to her? I mentioned that KellyAnne was currently on her lunch break and that I can help help her. She said that the issue is Wendy told her to ONLY speak with KellyAnne about getting a reimbursement and asked if that was something I can help with or should they just wait for KellyAnne. I told her that no KellyAnne is not the person to speak to about reimbursement''s and that would actually be the billing department. Mariah then began to explain that this was for a telehealth appointment she has and came to realize that she should not have just gone ahead and done that without approval first from her "Insurance". She said she doesn''t know how this all works. I told her that she has Redirect and EVERYTHING is supposed to go through them first. I said the ONLY type of reimbursement that we would handle would be something to do with her monthly premium that she pays every month. Other than that she needs to get in contact with Redirect and they will be the ones to help her. I explained who we are and what we do and she was a lot less confused. She had Redirect''s phone number from her card and is calling them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-14 13:23:29', '2021-05-14 13:23:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068111013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, 'Rachel cancelled her welcome call because she says she understands the plan much better now.  I told her that was fine and that I would send her the post welcome call email so that she has all of the information about the plan.  I told her to reach back out to me for any further questions! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-14 11:43:05', '2021-05-14 11:43:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068111008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779429', 'Elizabeth Charter', NULL, 'Elizabeth just called to ask what to do for her preventative care visit coming up- I told her to just confirm with the provider that they are still participating in the PHCS network and to hand them her Planstin card at the time of service.  I asked if she had found the doctor in the network and she said that she had already. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-14 11:36:17', '2021-05-14 11:36:17'),
