  ('zcrm_1579374000068098008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '05.14.21:  Called Ray.  Wants membership for wife and 2 children.  Has an HSA w/United Health.  Wants to have an HSA but can''t access the one w/UH because he''s dropping it because it went from $700 to $1300/mo.  Told him he can get an HSA w/SECURE.  His wife is an independent contractor w/her company.  Said he was about to join Zion June1st. Zion told him to call us.  Explained SECURE plan - told him I would send him HSA Bank info. link and brochure as well as my click funnel link.  Said he''s interested in enrolling.  told him we have to do it by the 19th for a 6/1 start date.
Emailed Ray & Diana HSA links and click funnel link.
Ray emailed asking me to compare what the Zion plan offers vs. the MPB plan.  Responded w/features and benefits of both.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-05-14 08:24:14', '2022-09-07 06:46:05'),
