  ('zcrm_1579374000068063013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Deb called back- the facility is checking to see whether or not they are participating in the PHCS network.  Deb asked if she just presented herself as self pay and submitted the bills and forgot about the network entirely if this would be a covered expense. I told her no, not if they are not in network.  She requested the link and instructions to search within the PHCS network and I sent them. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-13 15:37:50', '2021-05-13 15:37:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068063008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  I also got Jacqueline a list of Dermatologist''s off of HCBB as well as a fair cost graph for a visit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-13 15:27:02', '2021-05-13 15:40:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000068063003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Deb called for help in making sure her gastroenterologist and facility were in network for her colonoscopy coming up.  I could find her gastroenterologist, just not the facility.  She did tell me that this was for a screening colonoscopy.  I told her to call and confirm that they are participating in the PHCS network- she will call me back if she needs. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-13 15:22:24', '2021-05-13 15:22:24'),
