  ('zcrm_1579374000068025003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022032', 'Emily Clark', NULL, '5-13-21 Emily and Doug just enrolled with their 21 year old daughter Amanda Hennen. Emily had shoulder surgery this past year and 100% healed. I told her about the pre-x for that and Doug has high blood pressure. I told him the exemption for that. Daughter has nothing. They joined SECURE for $2500/$575 and June 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-13 10:28:15', '2021-05-13 10:28:15'),
