  ('zcrm_1579374000067953018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'It came to my attention to me today that I had given Tess the wrong welcome call on accident on March 10th- I went over a Zion plan WITH a MEC- when as it turns out, she doesn''t have a MEC.  I told Wendy, sent this member an apology and explained that all of the information would be the same minus the preventative care info I went over.  I told her to disregard all emails that I had sent her on March 10th and then I sent her the Correct information.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-12 16:33:15', '2021-05-12 16:33:15'),
