  ('zcrm_1579374000067899038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033451023', 'Scott Ballard', NULL, 'Orlena called in and asked if they could put their membership "on hold" for a couple of months.  I told her no that we didn''t do that.  I also told her that the plan that she was on was no longer available and that there was another option.  She told me that she would be talking this over with her husband and asked if I could have Wendy call her to discuss.  Left Wendy a VM about this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-12 13:47:37', '2021-05-12 13:47:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067932018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, 'Heidi called regarding getting a COVID-19 test, I explained to Heidi that COVID-19 testing is not a covered expense. I offered to find a fee free facility for testing but she had to have the test done ASAP so she said she will pay out of pocket for this test and get reimbursed from her employer. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-12 13:46:19', '2021-05-12 13:46:19'),
