  ('zcrm_1579374000067840023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297409', 'Lauri Wakefield', NULL, '05.11.21:  I was informed that Lauri cancelled their plan.  Called her - she said they couldn''t afford this or any plan at this time since they both had income issues with their jobs and they have to pay taxes.  Lauri said she wants a few months to regroup and will act on this again when financially feasible.  I told her I would look into DPC providers in her area (Pinellas County - Palm Harbor) with our OPD plan.  Lauri likes her current DPC, Dr. Vishnupriya Nair, M.D. ( pricing:  18-64 = $100/mo.) but her husband wants a male Primary Care doctor.  Told her I would keep in touch and let her know our progress with the OPD program in her area.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-05-11 12:58:15', '2021-05-11 12:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067847008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, 'Samantha called to express concern over the fact that the MSEAP program only offers 4 visits at a time with a 2 month break in between.  She told me that MSEAP was only able to find one doctor in network and they are out of town.  She asked if she could just pay for therapy on her own and submit it as a need.  I told her that she could with Sedera- and I transferred her to Sedera so that they could confirm these benefits with her.  I reached out to Cheryl at MSEAP about Samantha''s complaint- Cheryl explained that that a 2 month break gives the members a chance to apply what they have learned in therapy.  She told me that she would call Samantha with this explanation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-11 12:54:10', '2021-05-11 12:54:10'),
