  ('zcrm_1579374000067724026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067828010', 'Luke Seamans', NULL, '5-11-21 Luke is turning 26 on May 24th - 5/24/21. He''s earning $2946 a month which is $35,352 giving him a $249 APTC. Plans are $145 - $211 for Silver with high ded still and higher mop with very little benefit. I explained CARE+ and they were thrilled. Luke''s mom Eileen Seeley joined the call. They were referred by both the Glah''s and Kristen Lassalette. I''m not sure which one he chose to put on the app. Luke is healthy, just dealing with anxiety and taking 2 meds for that, generic of Lexapro 10 mg and Alprazolam .5 tablets. They seemed thrilled to learn of the Life Care benefit! Wants to keep Dr. Kimball Spence which he can. Knows he will have to pay for wellness visit on his own and not get reimbursed. 
