  ('zcrm_1579374000067726058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066760027', 'Perry Jones', NULL, 'spoke to Perry about his wife''s possible surgery- she was recently diagnosed with diverticulitis.    I told him that Zion Health would be the entity that makes the final determination on whether this will be pre-ex or not- I told him that if it is pre-ex Zion Health will not share in any of the bills....and if it is...and they go through the HCBB process he will only be responsible for his IUA- and if he follows through with HCBB he can get $500 off of of that.  He is going to call me back once his wife is scheduled to see a gastroenterologist that her primary has referred her too....but Perry doesn''t know the name of the doctor yet.  So he is going to call me back with all of the information when he has it in a few days so that I can hand it over to HCBB and they can start their process with him. He thanked me for giving him a better understanding as to what to expect.  VERY VERY nice member! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-11 10:16:34', '2021-05-11 10:16:34'),
