  ('zcrm_1579374000067726018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461462', 'Joyce Bailey', NULL, 'Joyce called to ask if her doctor was in network- I explained that her plan doesn''t have a network.  I explained the self pay process.  I also recommended a welcome call and sent her a scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-10 12:23:09', '2021-05-10 12:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067726013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-10 12:17:09', '2021-05-10 12:17:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067727003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516085', 'Harold Workman', NULL, 'Harold called in and said that he wanted to make sure that Lab Corp where is right now, participates in the PHCS Network because the list he got from Jennifer here said Lab Tech and he mistook it for saying Lab Corp. I told him to 100% know and make sure is to actually ask the facility themselves if they participate in the PHCS Network. I told him that most of the time all lab corp''s do but to ask them themselves. He said he did and they said yes. The lab work that he is getting done is for Hepatitis B. I read him straight from RCI''s guidelines for his exact plan he has, and he should be all set for it to be covered by RCI. I explained to him what to do at the front desk and make sure they code the bill as preventative and give them his RCI card and make sure they bill RCI directly. I told him that is the for sure way to know if it will be covered or not. He will get an EOB from RCI letting him know in the near future. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-10 12:14:45', '2021-05-10 12:14:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067726008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165396', 'Fabio (Gus) Pernetz', NULL, 'sent welcome call scheduler per Wendy.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-10 11:47:49', '2021-05-10 11:47:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067725008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165396', 'Fabio (Gus) Pernetz', NULL, '5-10-21 Gus totally forgot how all of this works. He was expecting another card but he''s on the Connected Worksite conversion plan. So, he won''t get a card but he needs help with how to get his annual wellness visit done.  He never set up CirrusMD bc he was living in Mexico for 6 months. He needs a full refresher. He also did a covid antibody test for $125 which he gave them his old ins card. I told him to call Lab Corps and tell them that was an old plan and to ask for their best cash price. I asked KC to send him a Welcome Call email to get him totally dialed in again.  He will do that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-10 11:43:16', '2021-05-10 11:43:16'),
