  ('zcrm_1579374000067726003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647085', 'Christopher Lopez', NULL, 'I explained to Amber that it was our mistake that we had her IUA at $1000 instead of $5000.  She is going to be calling Analisa about the accident coverage they purchased separately from her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-10 10:59:28', '2021-05-10 10:59:28'),
