  ('zcrm_1579374000067651008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-07 10:09:41', '2021-05-07 10:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067651003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713145', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-07 10:01:02', '2021-05-07 10:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067647008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091058', 'Clayton Coulter', NULL, 'Allison Coulter had scheduled a welcome call today- but her plan has been pushed back to 7/1 so I just emailed her telling her that she will need to reschedule- also that she is not even listed on the plan- so she will need to fill out the Cognito form "Permission to speak about membership" form- I sent her the link.  I told her that if she has any questions about the membership in the meantime she will need to reach out to Wendy- I supplied her with that phone number as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-07 09:56:35', '2021-05-07 09:56:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067647003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808030', 'Mathieu Shields', NULL, 'Mathieu Shields called in because he wanted to know how to submit bills from an ER visit his son just had.  I told him that I would send him the Zion needs submission list.  He THEN asked how he can cancel his membership because he is going to be receiving benefits through his employer- he asked who he needed to talk about that first with- I told him that he needs to talk to Wendy first because I wasn''t sure if this new large open needs case would put a "monkey wrench" in his plans for cancelling at the moment.  I told him that I wasn''t sure but that Wendy would let him know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-07 09:29:22', '2021-05-07 09:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067644003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '5/7/21 Member called wanting a list of primary care physicians in his zip code.  I emailed member all primary care physicians in his area.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-05-07 09:09:00', '2021-05-07 09:09:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067605003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731120', 'Rosendo Mendoza', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-07 07:50:43', '2021-05-07 07:50:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366121', 'Brian Trebus', NULL, 'Brian called because he was having trouble explaining his preventative care benefits to the different providers he was calling- he said that they have never heard of MPB.Health or Planstin.  I told him that he needs to use the script that I had already sent him- that will guide him in how to present his card.  I resent the wellness visit instructions to him.  He was happy for the help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-06 16:38:47', '2021-05-06 16:38:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063373030', 'Heather Masuen', NULL, 'Heather is cancelling due to the "hassle" that the MAP program caused her.  I sent her a cancellation form.  John Troutman did have Lindsay call Heather earlier today....and although Heather said that Heather was helpful the 2 phone numbers for counselors were no longer in network.  Heather said that she was tired of being referred to counselor''s that were not participating in the program.  She had already spoken to Leah Garcia.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-06 16:25:29', '2021-05-06 16:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122121', 'Adam Grochowsky', NULL, 'Adam called in asking about the process of going to seek care at an urgent care.  I went over the self pay process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-06 15:47:24', '2021-05-06 15:47:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530219', 'Eva Hogan', NULL, '5-6-21 Left vm for Eva to help her cancel her membership due to aging into Medicare in July.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-06 15:29:46', '2021-05-06 15:29:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '5-6-21 Left vm for Eric to give him some new options to bring down cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-06 15:25:21', '2021-05-06 15:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067551018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516085', 'Harold Workman', NULL, 'Harold called regarding in-network laboratories. I sent him a list via email. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-06 14:55:47', '2021-05-06 14:55:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067551013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590004', 'Isabel Graefin Von Rittberg', NULL, 'Isabel called and asked what the process is for cancelling and when the period ends for billing etc.. I explained and she asked for me to send her the cancellation form just so she can have. So I don''t believe she is cancelling for right now but for the future. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-06 14:37:33', '2021-05-06 14:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'Caterina called to be reassured about how her preventative care benefits work.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-06 14:30:31', '2021-05-06 14:30:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '5-6-21 Mitchell wanted to share his experience filling 3 prescriptions. Apparently he called many, many places to fill all 3. Nobody carried all 3, so he wound up going to 3 different locations to get the best price and to find all of them. Nobody could tell him who might have all 3 in stock. He worked with Kelly Anne and was pleased with her help. He called first and didn''t reach anyone, so he completed the online request form. Then she responded within the hour. He was just venting about how crazy the prescription drug world is. The coupon Kelly Anne gave him didn''t work at Safeway bc they didn''t have the medication. Then he used the code elsewhere and got an even better price than what he was quoted. So, that was lucky. I never knew you could use the codes at multiple places that it wasn''t intended to be used. You never know! He''s happy and feeling relieved today with his child doing much better!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-06 14:11:16', '2021-05-06 14:11:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062997012', 'Franklin Rzucek', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in saying that in addition to the payment on the 20th we took an additional $600 from the Credit Card.  I advised that we only took the one payment then member got on the phone and told her that the charge was from someone else.  The spuse also asked if she could call in a payment every month on that day, I advised no either bank account or CC.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 13:42:09', '2021-05-06 13:42:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066128371', 'Mukundkumar Patel', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  It went really well! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-06 13:14:23', '2021-05-06 13:14:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763225', 'David Lung', NULL, '5-6-21 Dave is 59 and turning 60 this year and wife is 53. They are good friends with Eric and Mindy Grabau. Dave has worked in the aerospace and defense industry for his career and now runs his own consulting biz with a few people working for him. Wife is the account controller. They are currently set up with an old UHC/Golden Rule plan that has been grandfathered for years. Pay $4000 per quarter, ie. $1333 per month, but going up to $5500 per quarter, therefore, $1833 per month for the two of them! They are paying $20K-$25K per year and they don''t use it. They like the idea of self-pay for the small stuff. They have an HSA funded to $40K as well and can use that. They have no pre-x, no tobacco, and only meds are bc for wife which she''s phasing off of due to age. Wife is due for colonoscopy soon. SECURE is best option for them $1000/$500. 
Also, son and wife live in Windsor and have been bouncing around with healthcare plans for son. Wife still on parents plan but shouldn''t be since she''s married. She''s also turning 26 soon. He will encourage them to get it sorted out and to contact me. They are both in their 20''s.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-06 12:57:56', '2021-05-06 12:57:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713177', 'Phil Shannon', NULL, 'Setev email me to ask how member can add spouse for a 6/1 start.  I emailed him the link for the change form w/instructions on how to fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 12:53:16', '2021-05-06 12:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423014', 'Asya Bangiyeva', NULL, 'Asya''s husband called in because she fell and needed to see the doctor- he thought she needed her insurance card.  I explained that she doesn''t need a card- I went over the self pay process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-06 12:34:28', '2021-05-06 12:34:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063373030', 'Heather Masuen', NULL, 'Heather called threatening to cancel her membership because no one from the MAP program has called her back.  I reached out to John Troutman about this and asked that someone from the team give her a call directly so that they can walk her through the process. I told Heather to expect call from MAP. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-06 11:43:15', '2021-05-06 11:43:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'Spoke to Analisa about this member wanting to "pause" her insurance since she was going out of the country.  I told her that Sedera would not do that and that the change with Sedera would be coming soon and that she might not be able to re-enroll when she gets back.  Analisa will contact her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 11:17:43', '2021-05-06 11:17:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819078', 'Malia Monaco', NULL, 'Kevin to speak to this member about her questions around her switching to a DPC .  I let Kevin know that we can''t change plans mid year w/Sedera and that the changeover w/Sedera should be sometime in the summer.  Kevin advised me that they are not good candidates for Zion due to a Pre-Ex issue, so they can make that change at that time.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 11:09:05', '2021-05-06 11:09:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731070', 'Carolyn Whitus', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-06 10:50:07', '2021-05-06 10:50:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691178', 'Christine Paretta', NULL, 'Christine called to ask what insurance information she should give when getting her Covid Vaccine.  I told her that her plan did not cover it as it is not yet a service mandated by the ACA.  I told her to present herself as uninsured. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-06 10:49:42', '2021-05-06 10:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, 'Andrea emailed me to ask what the pricing would be if they retained Belinda on the Conversion plan and moved Guy &amp; their children over to the Secure no age banded plan.  I asked Rod about this and per him we could not move anyone at this time, we could only move whole family at renewal.  (8/1).  I responded to Andrea to let her know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 10:37:13', '2021-05-06 10:37:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067551008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032206031', 'Bryan Tew', NULL, 'Spoke with Bryan regarding his Provider nomination form he has filed 3 times. Directed Bryan to call the PHCS network and provided the phone #. - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-06 09:47:26', '2021-05-06 09:47:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731070', 'Carolyn Whitus', NULL, 'Email verification sent to register with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-06 09:26:17', '2021-05-06 09:26:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067551003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731120', 'Rosendo Mendoza', NULL, 'H08D8 QR Life code for 3rd child. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-06 09:24:57', '2021-05-06 09:24:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731120', 'Rosendo Mendoza', NULL, 'Spoke to Kelly F to send out QR Life code cards for member, spouse and 3 of the children. Email verification sent to register with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-06 09:16:58', '2021-05-06 09:18:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-06 09:10:17', '2021-05-06 09:10:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540138', 'Leslie Frazier', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 09:05:52', '2021-05-06 09:05:52');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001589002', 'John Tamblyn', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel him and refund him for month of Dec.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 08:36:30', '2021-05-06 08:36:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540021', 'Paulena Shapiro', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 Worksite Bridge 50-64', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 08:27:31', '2021-05-06 08:27:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540021', 'Paulena Shapiro', NULL, 'This member was retained when spouse Gary Shapiro aged into Medicare.  She will be sent over via file to Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 08:26:59', '2021-05-06 08:26:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630149', 'Gary Shapiro', NULL, 'Spoke w/Gary and verified email &amp; Pmt info for Paulena''s new account,  It will be sent over via file to Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 08:19:30', '2021-05-06 08:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067541003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630149', 'Gary Shapiro', NULL, 'Gary contacted me and said that they would like to retain Paulena on the plan I told him that I would be in contact w/Zion to arrange.  I will contact him to verify email for Paulena and verify Pmt info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-06 08:10:53', '2021-05-06 08:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067537003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066223040', 'Michael Schreiber', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-06 08:00:03', '2021-05-06 08:00:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993297', 'Dorrie Baker', NULL, 'Dorrie called because her husband is at his annual wellness visit- the providers are trying to confirm his benefits.  Dorrie gave her husband her card.  I told Dorrie that the providers office should call RCI directly to confirm Robert''s benefits.  Dorrie, however wanted to confirm them herself- I explained that she would need to speak to RCI- I gave her their number and transferred the line to them as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 17:17:30', '2021-05-05 17:17:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'completed a script quote request for this member. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 16:59:21', '2021-05-05 16:59:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, 'helped Samantha login to the MAP portal. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 16:31:21', '2021-05-05 16:31:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578349', 'Marie Burns', NULL, 'answered some preventative care questions via email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 16:27:18', '2021-05-05 16:27:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904552', 'Mariah Ahumada', NULL, 'Mariah called to ask if her services could be used outside of her state.  I told her that they could be absolutely- with Redirect and Sedera- I even mentioned how she could submit bills from another country as long as they were in English.   I gave her Redirect Health''s phone number and reminded her that she needs to call them BEFORE her doctor''s appointment. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 16:24:17', '2021-05-05 16:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477453', 'Yuphin Buaphan', NULL, 'Yuphin''s husband Gerry gave a call asking how he can schedule her welcome appointment, I emailed him a welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 16:22:13', '2021-05-05 16:22:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '5-5-21 Michele has a $2500 IUA but not showing correctly in the notes. Derek is aging up in June to 60-64. I can''t find the new price yet. Asking Patti. Derek just did a knee replacement in Nov. 2020. He had his last visit on March 8th of 2021. Michele says she not really worried about there being any problems now with his knee. If he has to do the other one he can wait until Medicare in 5 years or at least until sharing is significant enough. No plans of doing so though. Michele is paid 1099, so SECURE would be good for them. She likes the MEC to give them HSA compliance again. Doesn''t see why they wouldn''t make the change to SECURE but wants to read it over and likely to move for July 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-05 15:38:24', '2021-05-05 15:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297505', 'Daniel Birkhead', NULL, 'Daniel called because he told me that Zach Masters asked him too by 5:00pm today or his account would be cancelled due to non payment.  I told Daniel that he would need to speak to Patti Baron about this and she was out of the office for the day.  I told him that I would send her a direct message asking that she gives him a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 15:35:39', '2021-05-05 15:35:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067483001', 'Haley Westmoreland', NULL, '5-5-21 Michele Westmoreland''s daughter is Haley who''s 23. She just quit her job  April 30th and is working for Blue Sky Resort for one month and possibly going to Chicago for June, back to CO in July and looking for work as of the fall. Putting income at $33,495 or so. Giving her an APTC of $155.41. She has Cobra option to hold her over for May is has a problem. Michele was nervous to put Haley onto MCS in case she dabbles in any illegal activity. She doesn''t believe she does, but you never know at that age.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-05 14:36:47', '2021-05-05 14:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677099', 'Marcelee Cognito', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 14:28:28', '2021-05-05 14:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067362018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670178', 'Bruce Ballet', NULL, 'Laura called regarding the self-pay process. I explained the process to her and she had a better understanding. - JATS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-05-05 13:47:19', '2021-05-05 13:47:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067421074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, 'Member called in to ask about taking son off the plan and I sent him out the link to the Change form.  He then asked what lower "deductable" options were available now that it will be just him and his wife.  I advised that we were not marketing any Sedera plans and that I would have Wendy be in contact with him to discuss.  Left Wendy VM &amp; email about this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-05 12:35:50', '2021-05-05 12:35:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, 'Nathan called to ask how to submit his physical therapy bills, and to be reminded of the self pay process.  I sent him the Zion needs submission link.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 11:08:32', '2021-05-05 11:08:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005915163', 'Robin Hewes', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-05 10:59:09', '2021-05-05 10:59:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067323071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206032', 'Cari Aman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-05 10:53:27', '2021-05-05 10:53:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067367062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001589002', 'John Tamblyn', NULL, 'Called to cancel, did not know he had to cancel with us separate from Liberty. He cancelled with Liberty a month ago. Did not even know who we were or what services were offered. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-05 10:27:27', '2021-05-05 10:27:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067421069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522001', 'Michael Higgins', 'Redirect Term:', 'Tracking #11544805
Sent by Patti Baron on 5/5/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-05 10:18:35', '2021-05-05 10:18:35'),
