  ('zcrm_1579374000067421059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630149', 'Gary Shapiro', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove him off the policy since he will be turning 65 6/21.  I tried to contact him to ask if he wanted to retain spouse on membership or what.  I left a VM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-05 10:11:37', '2021-05-05 10:11:37'),
