  ('zcrm_1579374000067365128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', 'New Plan eff 6/1/21', 'Member &amp; Fam CareZ Wkst $1000 50-64', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-04 13:32:46', '2021-05-04 13:32:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067368018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Mary called in and said that part of her wellness visit she just had the doctor ordered lab work as usual and she said she got a bill in the mail from the facility she went to stating that they are not in the network. So she asked if I could look up the lab and check. i did and the lab DID come up as IN the network. She also did confirm that she did give the lab her Planstin card but it seems the lab didn''t bill Planstin directly and sent it to Mary. So I gave Mary Planstin''s phone number and told her to give them a call so she can submit the bills to them. Was very thankful. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-04 13:31:13', '2021-05-04 13:31:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067368013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, 'Carrie called and said that she got an invoice from us at MPB.Health stating that she owes $550 and wants to take care of that and set up automatic payments. I did not know that she was a list bill group so when I found that out I told her that Michele is the one that needs to take care of it and I left the message with Michele to call Carrie back. Michele is doing so in a few minutes. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-04 13:30:04', '2021-05-04 13:30:04'),
