  ('zcrm_1579374000067365118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, 'Member will be aging up to the 50-64 age band I sent out email to him informing of new pricing.  I have also changed billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-04 12:41:17', '2021-05-04 12:41:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067382028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064231002', 'Alexandra Goldburt', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Member is VERY UNHAPPY!  Charles promised her that we could help her negotiate down her dental surgery bills! I will speak with home office about this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-04 12:39:08', '2021-05-04 12:39:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067366028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763142', 'Leanne Wagner', NULL, '5-4-21 Leanne contacted the Women''s Imaging Center and they are telling her they accept PHCS/Multiplan. Apex Family Medicine is also thinking they accept it but trying to put it back on me to verify. I see Mia Scott DO at 300 Jackson St, Denver 80209 showing in search at this point.  She''s ready to enroll. She also just did her colonoscopy recently and sounds like it checked  out fine. Discuss with her recent client challenge with getting colonoscopy outside of typicaly schedule for every 5 or 10 years or younger than 50 not paying for.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-05-04 12:22:51', '2021-05-04 12:29:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067366023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, 'No response. Not able to leave a message. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-04 11:52:34', '2021-05-04 11:52:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067365113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  I will change.  Also Kelly forwarded an email that she received from Martha wanting to know if there were any other charges that she should expect.  I advised that the only thing that she would incur form MPB other than the Monthly Share Amount would be the $25 Yearly Renewal Fee.  I explained when it would be drafted.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-04 11:49:30', '2021-05-04 11:49:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067382023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, 'Tamra called in for support setting up her family''s CirrusMD accounts again.  I told her that she will have to wait on John Kach and the CirrusMD tech support team to help her with this.  I apologized that this was taking so long.    She wound up taking her son to the ER- and now wanted to know how to submit her medical bills to Zion Health. I sent her the link to do so. I told her that I would mention to John that she called.  I sent him another Teams message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-04 11:38:03', '2021-05-04 11:38:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067368008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, 'Tamra called in and said that her and her son did end up going to the ER last night and she did everything correctly by presenting herself and she said the bill she was told is a few thousand. So she made the full payment of her IUA $1000 upfront on her CC and they gave her the rest of the bill. She is submitting everything into Zion now and she is still waiting on a response from CirrusMD. She was thrilled that I called her back, she said that never happens with most places, so she is very very happy with all the help and how smooth everything is. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-04 11:20:51', '2021-05-04 11:20:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067382018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, 'Samantha called to ask if her chiropractic bills would be sharable with Sedera- she has a medical plan from the Chiropractor totaling $900.  I told her that Sedera could tell her whether or not it will be sharable.  I told her to ask for pre approval through her Sedera member portal.  I sent the Sedera Needs template for the link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-04 11:19:27', '2021-05-04 11:19:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067382013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836013', 'James Brignall', NULL, 'James called because he said he never got the HCBB information that I sent him last month.  I found that I did send him the information, and that it was showing as "opened" in the CRM.  He asked that I resend it to him.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-04 11:07:18', '2021-05-04 11:07:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067382008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045976082', 'Stacey Garrett', NULL, 'called for help understanding Sedera''s needs process and getting a $7000 diagnostic  colonoscopy done.  I transferred her to Sedera so that they could go over their back end process- she had many questions regarding payment.  I   also sent her the Sedera needs submission template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-05-04 11:06:03', '2021-05-04 11:06:03'),
