  ('zcrm_1579374000067366018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062878001', 'Jeffrey Kelley', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-04 08:18:44', '2021-05-04 08:18:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067368003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in and there was a big mix up. She had her own personal account with us through Redirect and it was cancelled as of Jan 2019. So when she calls and says her last name that is what comes up. Come to find out she is on this account with her husband with a different last name. So I explained to her that she needs to say she is under her husbands name so we can pull up the correct account. She is on her way to an appointment that is Diagnostic, she may have some genetic disorder. She knew what to do with her IUA and I explained in further detail and told her to call Zion asap. Sent her the email on how to submit to Zion and for the Discounted Labs template we have because she asked about it. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-04 08:09:06', '2021-05-04 08:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067366013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477509', 'Stephanie Cwirn', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-05-04 08:01:57', '2021-05-04 08:01:57'),
