  ('zcrm_1579374000067282013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206276', 'Carol Hyjek', NULL, 'Carol called in and has a couple questions about the preventative part of her plan and what the actual list is of what is covered. She was looking at the Zion website guidelines and she was looking at a completely different plan. I gave her the website to healthcare.gov which she was ever so grateful for. She is such a sweet lady and is so thankful for us and said everyone here and who she spoke to at Zion are so nice and wonderful. She has her Welcome Call tomorrow at 4pm with KellyAnne and is excited for that. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-03 09:59:50', '2021-05-03 09:59:50'),
