  ('zcrm_1579374000067282003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, 'Bill, Yadira''s husband with her on the line, called in and said that Yadira really really needs to get her prescription''s now before they can have the welcome call. So I went over how the prescription program works and sent her the prescription quote form to her while on the phone. She is going to fill it out and submit it back to me and I will work on it asap. They said they are going to schedule the welcome call for Wed 5/5/21 because that is the earliest her husband can be on the call with her. He said he is going to be the one that will be helping her with the plan while she is on it. He asked me if there is something he needs to sign for him to be able to be the one controlling everything. I said I was not 100% sure but that is something they can go over while on the Welcome Call. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-05-03 08:12:37', '2021-05-03 08:12:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067267008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'Member emailed Jennie looking for the form to update her payment info I emailed her back the link and let her know to be in touch with me for any further questions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-03 07:50:54', '2021-05-03 07:50:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067267003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024321', 'Christopher Wright', NULL, 'Member submitted address change I update in CRM &amp; Admin 123.  I will also notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-05-03 07:16:47', '2021-05-03 07:16:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Rose Mary called just as clueless about the plan as from when Patti had spoken to her earlier.  She wanted to know how much she would get for her pre x surgery.  I told her $25,000 per the plan that she was on.  She had her preventative care benefits mixed up from illness/injury benefits through Zion.  She was also very disappointed that all of her specialists were not in the PHCS network.  I tried to explain the difference in care- I spent 30 minutes on the phone with her explaining how things work PLUS looking up countless doctors.  I HOPE she has a better understanding.  I also brought up HCBB''s process and "twisted her arm" into agreeing that they take over the case just to TRY to get the bills negotiated down.  Rose Mary made it VERY clear that she doesn''t want to change her doctor or facility...she even has a sx date for June 16th!  I typed up a report and handed the case over to HCBB tonight, I told Rose Mary to expect a call from them sometime next week. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-30 17:50:37', '2021-04-30 17:50:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067209013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'Discussed options.  Curr pre-existing cond.  May reconsider to begin Care+ (or maybe Secure) in 2/2022.  (see attachments)', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-04-30 17:35:54', '2021-05-07 11:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, 'sent preventative care templates as further education and reinforcement from Kelly''s conversation with the member yesterday.  This member had reached out to Wendy to state that she couldn''t get a hold of anyone yesterday when she called. But Kelly did call her back.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-30 15:56:04', '2021-04-30 15:56:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '4-30-21 Called Richard to discuss moving Rhyan to CARE+ and then we determined it''s best to move rest of family to SECURE. They are both self-employed and super healthy. Son had appendix out in Aug. 2020. No ongoing repercussions that they are worried about. Wife had bee allergy 8 years ago but they did bee venom shots and she''s been stung 3x since and no problem. She still brings epi pen just in case but not worried about it either. She''s also on synthyroid for thyroid issue.  They are all super into health. Total cost $685 + $215 = $900 instead of $1034 paying now. They weren''t psyched about Redirect since they didn''t get good help when tried to use Redirect. So, he''s happy to be done with them. I warned him of the small PHCS network in Aspen for the wellness part and he expected that and wasn''t worried. He also agrees his daughter doesn''t need MEC since super healthy and won''t even take an antibiotic unless absolutely necessary. Calling on Tuesday to complete enrollment and cancellation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-30 15:38:16', '2021-04-30 15:38:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067209008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294135', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'LM.  Re: price increase.  Plez call to discuss options.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-04-30 15:32:04', '2021-04-30 15:32:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570104', 'Douglas Lynne', NULL, 'Douglas called to request the member ID number for his portal.  I gave it to him, he then told me that he was going to use it to fill in the insurance information on his eye exam sheet.  I told him that he needed to either write that he was a self pay patient OR that he was a member of a medical cost sharing group.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-30 15:31:43', '2021-04-30 15:31:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, 'John Troutman told me that he was having someone from MSEAP call Brian and his wife back.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-30 15:20:46', '2021-04-30 15:20:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, 'Brian''s wife called Kelly F earlier (she forgot to write a note here) and told Kelly that she was having a hard time getting through to anyone over at MSEAP...that the calls kept dropping.  Brian then called ME to complain about this.  I told him that I was sorry to hear that he was having such a difficult time, and that I would reach out to their management team and ask them to give them a call.  I reached out to John Troutman- and he is working very hard on trying to get the phone system up and running, he will give me updates on these members as well as the status of their phone system. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-30 15:08:35', '2021-04-30 15:08:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067209003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'LM.  Re: Price inccrease [age band].  Would like to go over new option.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-04-30 14:54:25', '2021-04-30 14:54:25'),
