  ('zcrm_1579374000067150014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608488', 'Christian Kline', NULL, 'Member contacted Sedera to cancel.  I called him and let him know that cancellations needed to go through MPB.  I will send link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-30 13:22:13', '2021-04-30 13:22:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067150009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Rosemary called in and was clueless about whole plan.  She 1st told me that she is now finally going to have the eyelid surgery that has been going on since 2018.  I told her that she needs to contact Zion immediately about this.  She also told me that she had gone to a wellness visit yesterday and had them bill her.  I asked if she showed them her Planstin card, she had no idea what I was talking about. I also asked if she made sure the provider was in Network.  Again no idea.  I explained the IUA to her and the fact that this surgery was going to fall in to PreEx Category.  I then recommended that she have another Welcome call and sent her the scheduler.    From reading the notes below member has the Planstin cards or at least did back in Aug.  However if it was one of her diabetes checks it wont be shared.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-30 13:16:46', '2021-04-30 13:16:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061594028', 'Aftan Murphy', NULL, 'Aftan called to reschedule her welcome call....sent another online scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-30 12:19:31', '2021-04-30 12:19:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366108', 'Elizabeth Meyer', NULL, 'Elizabeth called to ask how she could describe her "Health Care Coverage" in her will that she is typing out.  I told her to explain that she is part of a medical cost sharing community- and that community is Zion Health.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-30 11:25:13', '2021-04-30 11:25:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006446065', 'wendy wassom', NULL, '4-30-21 I talked with Wendy and her husband is getting ins through work and they are paying for all of his ins and then she will pay for hers, but it''s cheaper than both on our membership. I let it go since she''s in the market for a knee replacement still which she hasn''t dared do yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-30 10:33:26', '2021-04-30 10:33:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067166003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006446065', 'wendy wassom', NULL, 'member called to cancel, sent cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-30 10:27:49', '2021-04-30 10:27:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067124016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937187', 'Kathy Young', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request. I will let Zion know and cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-30 09:30:32', '2021-04-30 09:30:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067124011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869119', 'Amy Dixon', NULL, 'Member called in to say that she had cancelled w/Liberty back in Jan and was not informed that she neededto cancel us. I offered to credit her for 2 mos.  she ok w/that', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-30 08:24:19', '2021-04-30 08:24:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067124003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, 'Lisa called and said that she is going in to get her 2nd ultrasound done and she asked the facility to send her an invoice so she can send it to US and WE will pay for it. She then said that the facility told her NO they will not do it that way and said she needs to pay for it upfront, so she asked if we will reimburse her for everything. I told her that no it is Zion that she needs to get in contact with because they are the ones taking care of her case and paying for this, not us. I asked if she has Zion''s phone number and she said No. Gave her their phone number and she is calling them now. So the fact that she did not have Zion''s phone number and thought that WE are the ones paying for everything tells me that she still has not contacted Zion before and opened up her Need with them. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-30 07:37:28', '2021-04-30 07:42:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067087043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949042', 'Aeja Dik', NULL, 'sent Aeja an email explaining why her account was charged and explained when she can expect her refund. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-29 17:51:53', '2021-04-29 17:51:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067087038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949042', 'Aeja Dik', NULL, 'Aeja called because her account was being charged again even after Patti had cancelled her.  I reached out to Patti and asked that she call Aeja tomorrow with a refund. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-29 17:38:06', '2021-04-29 17:38:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067087033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, 'Brian called to ask how the MAP program works for his wife- I went over the process, gave him their number and then direct transferred him upon his request. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-29 15:43:01', '2021-04-29 15:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067121003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, 'Called about Preventative portion of her plan and did not know what is covered, who covers it, and what to do. Went over everything with her and she is all set! Very nice and was so so so happy I called back and helped her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-29 15:14:16', '2021-04-29 15:14:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067087028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731070', 'Carolyn Whitus', NULL, 'called this member to clarify what she had gone over via email with Kelly Frederickson.  As it turns out...her appointment wasn''t preventative in nature...so she will keep her appointment.  She thinks she may have kidney stones! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-29 15:05:30', '2021-04-29 15:05:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067087023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064050010', 'Nicole Jenkins', NULL, 'Nicole called in for help finding the best prices for a medication she needed right away- I took down the information and started running a search for her but she already found a better price off of singlecare.com  for much less than I could find.  I told her to just use the coupon she found....I told her that if the medication wasn''t an emergency I could probably get a better price @WorldMeds...I explained to her that process.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-29 15:03:55', '2021-04-29 15:03:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067088013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, 'Per a request for a 1095 for Jan-Aug 2020, I went went in and did some research this member was on the MEC Basic w/RCI for that time period.  She was a part of that small group of DPC members that elected to keep the MEC.  Due to the issues we had with getting them to process the 1095''s correctly, I do not want to request any  changes or additions from RCI.  There is no Ind Mandate anyway so member does not need this for any tax obligation.   I informed Wendy of this and we agreed that we would leave this alone.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-29 13:16:25', '2021-04-29 13:17:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067087018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024321', 'Christopher Wright', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-29 12:20:41', '2021-04-29 12:20:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067088008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217067', 'Skylir Bryant', NULL, 'Per inquiry from Jane &amp; Skylir''s employer they wanted to know  why they were still being charged for her membership.  I had not heard anything from Sedera so I followed up with them.  From Natalie &amp; Elizabeth we can cancel this membership and they will credit us back for the months of March &amp; April.  We have not sent in May as yet.  I will refund employer for those 3 months', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-29 12:14:59', '2021-04-29 12:14:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067038016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067089037', 'Doug Durgee', NULL, '4-29-21 Doug is 41 and wife is 43 and child is 6. Just moved back to US from Japan. Lived there for 15 years to utilize his degree in Japanese. Interested in DPC with Dr. Lee or Dr. Stanley Jack. Income is about $68K plus some deductions for self-employment tax which will be higher than when in Japan. $3K of income is from real estate income.  APTC is around $450 and full price is $792.54. His cost is about $330 plus DPC cost around $160. Chose Bronze Bright Health 6850 HSA. They are all healthy, no tobacco. He was referred to me from Dr. Lee. He''s still planning to join a DPC for the small stuff. He was interested in dental and anything else to fill the gaps. I told his about HMA which will be better than any dental insurance or gap ins. They live in Adams County. Wife has an old SS# under her maiden name and is working on a visa with her new married name, from what I understand. He plugged in her maiden name and temp visa # or SS, I''m not sure.  System accepted it.  His payment didn''t work bc he has out of state addresses on his bank accounts. He will fix that right away. He will call Bright Health tomorrow afternoon to see if he can pay and make sure May 1st start date. He may stop using Capital One Bank after serious heads with them. I recommended Elevations Credit Union which he will check out.  All set moving forward!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-29 11:53:22', '2021-04-29 12:34:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067087013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000907023', 'Melinda Niemczyk', NULL, 'called to ask how to get a colonoscopy through Sedera- I explained to her the process and asked if she would like to be transferred to Sedera so that they could go over the process.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-29 11:41:55', '2021-04-29 11:41:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067087008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, 'John called us accidentally-he meant to call Redirect.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-29 10:50:55', '2021-04-29 10:50:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067088003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366311', 'Nive Pandumrongpun', NULL, 'I left advisor Karen a VM asking about the status of this member.  She told me he was going to cancel and I have not received Cognito form or payment as yet.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-29 10:48:43', '2021-04-29 10:48:43'),
