  ('zcrm_1579374000067080003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, '4/29/21 member called wanting a lab in network...DP   for a  colonoscopy', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-29 08:21:03', '2021-04-29 08:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067037023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'Steven called in wanting to know if he could submit chiropractic bills for a back injury to Sedera for sharing...I told him of course!  I sent him the Sedera needs submission template and he thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-28 16:05:42', '2021-04-28 16:05:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067037018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, 'Suzanne called in because she needed some extra support from Zion- I reached out to Zion and asked that someone call her asap as she needs someone to help her coordinate her care. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-28 14:23:40', '2021-04-28 14:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067054003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043354114', 'Eric Charapata', NULL, 'Member called in and requested to cancel.  I sent her out the cancellation request and will process cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-28 13:05:44', '2021-04-28 13:05:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067037013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004774176', 'Teresa Rice', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-28 12:51:39', '2021-04-28 12:51:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067046003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779429', 'Elizabeth Charter', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in and needed help with getting a coupon for her prescription. I helped her out on the phone right there and she was so shocked at how much lower I found her medication than what she normally pays at a different pharmacy. She is going to just stick with where she normally goes and where the medication is already called into, also because the pharmacies that have the lower priced coupons are too far away from her to drive. But she did say now that she knows how much lower the prices are at the different pharmacies she is going to get the lower options and make the drive for next time. It is worth the drive she said. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-28 12:24:56', '2021-04-28 12:24:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067040011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041829001', 'Kruti Patel', 'Past Due Invoices in Quickbooks', 'Left message with Tara Frix (who is also on the Group Plan) regarding  Jan-April Invoices being past due and to see if the "Total Healthcare" is still active with the plan. (MR)', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2021-04-28 11:45:23', '2021-04-28 11:45:23'),
