  ('zcrm_1579374000066969033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091381', 'Jason Levinson', NULL, 'the Levinson''s were told that they would get a call from Zion about this yesterday on 4/26  - but they never heard anything.  Now they are both livid and contacting Charles- and he in turn is contacting me.  I reached out to Dr. Lee to let him know that they were upset, he apologized and told me that he will carve out some time on 4/28 to call them.   I relayed that message to both members and Charles. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-27 17:34:44', '2021-04-27 17:34:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067000019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '4-27-21 Liz''s email is not one she checks often. She prefers calls or texts if there''s an issue with her account in the future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-27 17:21:28', '2021-04-27 17:21:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067000008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '4-27-21 Bobbi just enrolled in Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 Rx Copay Gold/EPO Full price $1881.78 and APTC is $170.12. She changed bc she has a health issue and the doctors she wanted weren''t in network and said no PT in Boulder in network. Able to change bc of ARP.  Instructed her to cancel Bright Health now and set up payment with Cigna in 48 hours bc it didn''t work on C4 just now. She''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-27 17:02:38', '2021-04-27 17:02:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000067000003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067291089', 'Heidi Beachley', NULL, '4-27-21 Heidi is 44 and lives in the Boulder area. She''s a yoga instructor, super healthy. She has exerise induced asthma but it hasn''t been much of a problem since 14. She takes two puffs before hiking Sanitas and uses 1 inhaler every 3 months. She''s interested in CARE+ for $215/$1000. SECURE is too much for her cost wise. She earns $40K-$50K. She''s peri-menopausal and takes sleeping pills. She was paying $330 last year which was way too costly for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-27 16:44:22', '2021-04-27 16:44:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066969028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024321', 'Christopher Wright', NULL, 'called in wanting to know how to get into the MPB portal- I explained that he doesn''t have access to it...and that if he DOES need to change his billing or address he can call us to change those things.  He told me that he was trying to get in there to find information regarding his plan- I then suggested a welcome call and sent him a scheduler.  He told me that this sounded like a good plan.  I asked him if he had any pressing questions and he said no, but that he was excited about the welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-27 16:37:23', '2021-04-27 16:37:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066969023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, 'called to cancel because he has other coverage through his employer now.  Sent online form and tagged Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-27 15:39:29', '2021-04-27 15:39:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066969018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516085', 'Harold Workman', NULL, 'Harold called to make sure that he was handling all of his preventative care benefits the way he is supposed to. I reassured him that he was doing everything right. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-27 14:36:16', '2021-04-27 14:36:16'),
