  ('zcrm_1579374000066909033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893179', 'Brian Cosner', NULL, 'I requested a hard copy of a Zion card for Brion from Zion Health- he also has an injury pos related to a pre x surgery- he has no clue if this will be sharable or not and wanted to get an MRI for this pre approved through Zion- I sent him Zion''s needs submission form so that he could ask for this pre approval. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-26 15:27:10', '2021-04-26 15:27:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066909028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893122', 'Phillip Haddad', NULL, 'Phillip called in wanting some help with understanding a preventative care bill- it sounds to me like his wife didn''t confirm that the doctor was in network- but I did transfer him to Planstin so that he could discuss the bill with them.  He also wanted me to explain "the waiting period" I told him that the only waiting period that his plan had was for pre-ex.  It also sounds to me like his wife has pre x back issues....I went over the entire pre x clause with him.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-26 15:04:02', '2021-04-26 15:04:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066909023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104104', 'Lisa Potter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-26 14:39:48', '2021-04-26 14:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878165', 'Donavin Roberts', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 14:39:09', '2021-04-26 14:39:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066877016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, '4/26/21 Member called wanting to make an appointment with an Urologist.  I gave him the number of Re-direct.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-26 14:31:01', '2021-04-26 14:31:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878152', 'Adina Serot Mendlovic', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 14:11:29', '2021-04-26 14:11:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878139', 'Jennifer MacDonald', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 13:50:28', '2021-04-26 13:50:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066899013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, 'SECURE Member Only $1000 IUA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-26 13:47:48', '2021-04-26 13:47:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066899008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650001', 'Brian Brtan', NULL, 'SECURE Member Only, $1000 IUA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-26 13:45:26', '2021-04-26 13:45:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066798041', 'Mark Lundell', NULL, 'After thinking about this, enrollee decided to cancel his enrollment for 6/1/21.  I will refund him the $125 and let Zion know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 13:11:30', '2021-04-26 13:13:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066909018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974154', 'Erica Rysberg', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-26 12:58:48', '2021-04-26 12:58:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066911003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '4-26-21 Bobbi wants to use Dr. Karowe with GI of the Rockies and keep Dr. Grodberg. Daughters Dr. Susnow shows in network as well as Dr. Potini. Told her to verify directly with the drs as well. Cigna Gold Connect Flex 900 Gold Co-Pay RX for about $1881 full price. She''s going to check her household income with accountant. Definitely more than $100K and not sure about $203K max for subsidy. They have some investments in Ohio it sounds like which she doesn''t know what that looks like on their taxes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-26 12:37:21', '2021-04-26 12:37:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007278037', 'Richard Wrightsman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Zion and refund him the payment that was already made for 5/21', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 12:04:16', '2021-04-26 12:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066885063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, 'Member was charge twice for the same premium due to a system error. $284 has been refunded to Andre.  Pricing for the member''s product has been fixed so that the member will not be charged two premiums in one month again.', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', '2021-04-26 11:39:12', '2021-04-26 11:39:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066909013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, 'did a script quote for Microbid- she needed to pick it up asap so she gave me the information over the phone. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-26 11:27:58', '2021-04-26 11:27:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974138', 'Anthony Davis', NULL, 'Vanessa called me and let me know that there was another child that was not enrolled.  Member submitted change form and I will let Zion know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 11:27:35', '2021-04-26 11:27:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066909008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, 'Lisa called having issues with getting into her CirrusMD account- I have sent a request to CirrusMD''s support team for help.  She also was having a hard time getting to see someone at an urgent care because she handed them her Planstin card and they are not in the PHCS network.  I told her that she needed to tell them to forget about the network- that she needed to present herself as a self pay patient and ask for the best cash discount.  I told her not to worry about presenting that card for anything beyond preventative care. I also sent a prescription medication quote form for any medicines she may need after her visit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-26 10:31:55', '2021-04-26 10:31:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066909003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767127', 'Timothy Smith', NULL, 'helped Joan understand her preventative care benefits- sent preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-26 10:28:52', '2021-04-26 10:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066885058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006239', 'Kim Lucey', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail as a follow-up if all her questions were answered. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-26 10:23:52', '2021-04-26 10:23:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066885045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974138', 'Anthony Davis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Referred member back to Jane Kassel member stated he added a 4th child. Spoke to Patti as well and she will be calling member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-26 10:11:02', '2021-04-26 10:18:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066885038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246029', 'Martha Johnson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-26 09:44:38', '2021-04-26 09:44:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165513', 'Christine Pietras', NULL, 'Member called back I explained that I was having issues with drafting her bank account.  I will send her a payment update form to change back to a Credit card', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 09:35:31', '2021-04-26 09:35:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066899003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'H09DH Is the 5th QR Life Code for the 3rd child Sydney. There is no space for more than 4 QR Life Codes. Per Vanessa with assigning new QR Life Codes. Sending out in the mail today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-26 08:51:55', '2021-04-26 08:51:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049898034', 'Evan Lyszczyk', NULL, 'Member emailed about the $25 enrollment. I explained', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 08:49:22', '2021-04-26 08:49:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066877011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, '4/26/21 member just called wanting information on her mamogram that she has to book.   I gave her info.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-26 08:44:21', '2021-04-26 08:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066885008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'Members requested 2nd time to send out QR Life Code Cards for family. Put in request to Kelly F. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-26 08:01:09', '2021-04-26 08:01:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066885003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974138', 'Anthony Davis', NULL, 'Email verification sent to register for Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-26 07:55:14', '2021-04-26 07:55:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066880003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055156108', 'Zhou Qian', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel in Admin 123 and notify Zion. I emailed member to supply me with a bank account  so I could refund the May monthly share amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-26 07:29:22', '2021-04-26 08:00:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066877003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006239', 'Kim Lucey', NULL, '4/24/21 Member called asking questions about the following....primary care physicians in network....labs....mamograms etc.   I emailed her a list of network providers in her area so she would have them.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-26 07:27:18', '2021-04-26 07:27:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066831003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '4-23-21 Figge called to learn more about the mental health counseling that''s been added to his membership. He''s seeing an MD it sounds like now plus meds. I told him to call MPB Concierge to have them help him set up his account with MAP. This will be a huge benefit to him. He can use this in addition to what he''s doing already. He sounds pretty desperate for help. I told him Concierge is available for 1 more hour today. He''s very appreciative. Also his partner Anna Thexton told him about my email I sent in regards to the program but he hadn''t read it yet. I told him it would be helpful including the brochure attached.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-23 17:03:28', '2021-04-23 17:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066762030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091381', 'Jason Levinson', NULL, 'Dr. Jeff Lee from Zion is stating that Heidi''s surgery will not be sharable as it is a pre-existing condition.   Charles Frohman reached out to me asking how Heidi can appeal this decision- I reached out to Dr. Jeff on Slack- he told me that he had already received an email from Heidi stating that she would like to appeal- Dr. Jeff says that is all the information that he needs from her now, and if Zion has further questions for her they will reach out.  I emailed Heidi and her husband that info and tagged Charles. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-23 16:34:16', '2021-04-23 16:34:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066762025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008680045', 'Josh Rowland', NULL, 'Virginia called requesting copies of Josh''s 1095''s be emailed to her email address- I Slacked Patti this request.  I told Virginia not to expect this until sometime on Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-23 15:29:03', '2021-04-23 15:29:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808001', 'Glen Markham', NULL, 'Stephanie needed to reschedule her welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-23 14:07:26', '2021-04-23 14:07:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066825008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, 'Jason called in and said that he just got a bill from his provider for $400 saying Out patient visit amount from his yearly preventative wellness visit. He said he choose someone from the PHCS Network and called to confirm they were in fact in the PHCS Network and he gave his Planstin Card upon arrival. So he did everything correctly on his end. I told him to call Planstin Directly and tell them what he told me and that that bill should be 100% covered by Planstin. If they have any questions about his account I told Jason Planstin can call us with any questions. He is all set for now, calling Planstin now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-23 13:57:18', '2021-04-23 13:57:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297480', 'Kimberly Honeycutt', NULL, 'a provider called to verify benefits- they wanted the Planstin ID number- I explained that I didn''t have that for them and transferred the call to Planstin. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-23 13:33:17', '2021-04-23 13:33:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063373030', 'Heather Masuen', NULL, 'answered some preventative care questions...she didn''t need a full welcome call.  Preventative care templates resent per members request. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-23 12:47:09', '2021-04-23 12:47:09');
