  ('zcrm_1579374000066786052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366311', 'Nive Pandumrongpun', NULL, 'Karen emailed me and told me that this member wants to cancel.  I will send him the link to cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-23 11:46:50', '2021-04-23 11:46:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066786047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066798041', 'Mark Lundell', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-23 11:40:19', '2021-04-23 11:40:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066820024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-23 10:47:54', '2021-04-23 10:47:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066820019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-23 10:25:25', '2021-04-23 10:25:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066825003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063826008', 'Dwight McKinney', NULL, 'Lauren called in and wanted to make sure of what to put down for getting a Covid test. I told her what to do and she is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-23 09:11:35', '2021-04-23 09:11:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066786027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577036', 'John Malloy', NULL, 'I have been in contact with Elizabeth about both her Enrollment fee and 1st month being declined by her bank. She has verified Acct# &amp; RT as correct. I did a look up of Rt # and came up with an entirely different #. Her bank has no explanation of why no charges have come through. She has suggested Bill Pay Option. 1st I will try alternate Rt # 1st. Original RT# - 107002448', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-23 09:07:32', '2021-04-23 09:07:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066820008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060475077', 'James Brown', NULL, 'Spoke to James has to reschedule his welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-23 08:43:29', '2021-04-23 08:49:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066786013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578069', 'Karla Degginger', NULL, '5/21 pmt declined for insufficient funds 4/23-1st notice sent 2nd Notice sent-4/27 Final notice sent 4/30 5/1- member submitted Update for w/same acct info.  She is just wanting to defer pmt.  This is an every month thing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-23 08:24:43', '2021-05-01 10:22:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066820003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153641', 'Garner Sorrell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-23 08:23:35', '2021-04-23 08:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066786005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577036', 'John Malloy', NULL, 'This members Enrollment Fee &amp; 1st month payments have declined I will send out initial email and Call member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-23 07:29:38', '2021-04-23 07:29:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'called to add his daughter back onto the plan, I have asked Patti to reach out to him if there will be any change to the monthly price, and sent him a member change form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 17:16:40', '2021-04-22 17:16:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462261', 'Brian Tilley', NULL, 'Brian called because he hadn''t seen his refunded payment yet- while I was on the phone the refund went through....he did have another question for Patti however and he will be emailing her directly with it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 17:07:06', '2021-04-22 17:07:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767127', 'Timothy Smith', NULL, 'Tim called to state that he wouldn''t be able to do a welcome call unless it was in the evening- I told him that this wasn''t possible because I am the only concierge member on staff from 5:00 on.  He understood- I told him that I would send him the post welcome call email so at least he can have all of the information he needs about how his plan works.  He was THRILLED with that!  I told him to call us with any questions that come up after reading! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 16:04:45', '2021-04-22 16:04:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'Kim reached out via email today and asked if a Dexa Scan is a covered expense by her plan. I told her not in her case because she is under 60 yrs old (ACA guidelines) and sent her a fair price for a Dexa Scan in her area. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 15:44:21', '2021-04-22 15:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061051', 'Brett Combs', NULL, 'Brett reached out to me via email with questions about his preventative care benefits- answered all questions and sent preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 15:42:23', '2021-04-22 15:42:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104104', 'Lisa Potter', NULL, 'rescheduled welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 14:29:59', '2021-04-22 14:29:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066791018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050370005', 'Arian Shirakhoon', NULL, '4-22-21 Arian called bc she took a new job that starts May 1st. She''s doubtful she''ll keep the job for more than a few weeks.  She accepted their insurance but doesn''t trust them or the insurance right now. I told her she needs to update her C4 account with her Life Change Event. She''d rather pay a penalty later bc she''s scared to cancel Cigna in case there''s a gap in ins assuming she will quit the new job right away. She''s hoping to find another job with benefits soon. She completely understands she''s running the risk of penalties and negative repercussions from keeping both but she''d rather do that than cancel Cigna right now. She''s been warned and knows the consequences and is totally fine with them.  She''s also asking if we can send another check for the referral of Denise Schulz. She misplaced the check she thinks. I''m asking Michele to check on it and to make sure it hasn''t been cashed. She''s hoping we can tell on our end for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-22 14:10:20', '2021-04-22 14:10:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974154', 'Erica Rysberg', NULL, 'helped this member with CirrusMD registration.   confirmed her welcome call as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 14:10:06', '2021-04-22 14:10:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130264', 'Mark Sewell', NULL, 'Mark called in and said that he got a bill from his preventative colonoscopy and he called and made sure he was doing everything correctly with staying in the network and handing the correct card. I told him to get in contact with RCI and send them the bill he has. He then asked about telehealth for some congestion issues he is having and I sent him the email about CirrusMD.  All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-22 13:58:33', '2021-04-22 13:58:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066764046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678052', 'Dennis Bakken', NULL, 'Kelly asked me to update this members email.  He submitted during open enrollment so was probably missed.  I update in Admin 123 &amp; FTNI and emailed Sedera.  I let Kelly know that his "old" email will still be his user name for the portal.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-22 13:40:14', '2021-04-22 13:43:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, 'helped Nathan with HCBB info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 13:38:18', '2021-04-22 13:38:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064070001', 'Luis Romero', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 13:04:36', '2021-04-22 13:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066791013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '4-22-21 Mariah called me yesterday and I just called her back now. She still hasn''t used her membership and doesn''t know how to do so. I told her I''m available next week and potentially we can talk Mon afternoon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-22 13:01:43', '2021-04-22 13:01:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066764041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521236', 'Laura Chasko', NULL, 'At members request I sent out 1095 for Jan thru July of 2020.  Member elected No Mec for remainder of the year.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-22 12:15:16', '2021-04-22 12:15:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066791008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, '4-22-21 Tom was looking at C4 to lower price since now paying $333 a month. He found plan with subsidy for $250 with Anthem and $6-$7K ded. I explained CARE+ to him for $215 and that helps. But, he did want his annual wellness visit and he was told by someone that he had to go to Frisco to do so. He thought it went through Sedera and didn''t know that Redirect gives him that service. I had him submit a request on Redirect Extra Help site to get immediate assistance with setting up an annual wellness visit. He doesn''t care where he goes locally. He''s not tied to any doctor. He just wants to be told where to go and he''ll go. We will keep me posted if this works. Then he might switch to CARE+ to save a bunch of money. He has not been to a doctor for the past 24 months, so no pre-x to his knowledge.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-22 12:09:56', '2021-04-22 12:09:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678052', 'Dennis Bakken', NULL, 'he called to state that his old email address has been getting FTNI billing information.  That doesn''t work for him because he doesn''t work at that company anymore.  He would like the FTNI billing info to go to the email address that is in the CRM.  I have reached out to Patti about this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-22 12:09:42', '2021-04-22 12:09:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066792003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061880001', 'David Hinz', NULL, 'Danna David''s wife called in and said that him and her daughter who is on the plan with David recently found Tumors on her Thyroid and wanted to know if I could find them a price for getting a Fine Needle Aspiration Biopsy done at a facility. I went on HCBB and found a fair price for that exact type of procedure they needed and Danna said the Fair Price I found was a lot lot cheaper than anything they have found. So I sent all the HCBB info over to her and told her to get in touch with Zion as well to let them know what is going on as this could lead to more being done. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-22 11:51:46', '2021-04-22 11:51:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066791003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061880001', 'David Hinz', NULL, '4-22-21 See all notes under Danna Hinz. Looks like they actually started with Zion on 8-1-21. Shayna Hinz now has a weird issue going on. She had a lump on her head and she saw Dr. Flanagan and he said to watch it. It then grew into her neck over the weekend. Now got an ultrasound they see tumors on her thyroid and he recommends a fine need aspiration. Danna didn''t know where to start. I told her to talk with Kelly Anne as well as Dr. Flanagan who usually has partnerships with docs for many needs. If not, Kelly Anne can help. Told her to present at self-pay. She couldn''t remember if they were with Zion or Sedera and told her Zion. All emails are going to David so she''s not getting the information anymore. She will talk with David as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-22 11:48:12', '2021-04-22 11:48:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066764036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990301', 'Sheri Razee Karner', NULL, 'Member called in to let me know spouse will be aging into Medicare eff 6/1.  I sent out Change link and told her it would be processed early part of May.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-22 11:35:05', '2021-04-22 11:35:05'),
