  ('zcrm_1579374000066764003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924017', 'Rodger Paxton', NULL, 'Charlie emailed me and asked about the possibility of these members raising their IUA due to financial issues.  I replied that we were not making any changes to plans with Sedera given the future with them.  I gave him pricing for the Zion options and told him to take into account their PreEx situation and Eligibility for the Secure product.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-22 07:35:33', '2021-04-22 07:35:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066707018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160567001', 'Kevin Van Liere', NULL, '4-21-21 Kevin is 49 and self-employed working on own business. He has Kaiser now at $400 but he''s only earning very little now. Only paid himself $4K so far this year. Has an $8K ded. He qualifies for Medicaid. I helped him enroll through C4. When his income increases, he''s very interested in SECURE or CARE+. I described them both to him and he qualifies for SECURE. He''s healthy, no meds, no tobacco, just gluten allergy. Hoping to make $40K-$50K this year. I''m logged as his agent on C4 at the very least. Took 1 hour of my time already. Ugh.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-21 16:15:18', '2021-04-21 16:15:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066740033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924017', 'Rodger Paxton', NULL, 'I relayed to Charles today that Jennifer from RCI told him that an initial office exam and follow up exam will be a covered as long as the exams are coded as preventative for these members. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-21 15:28:59', '2021-04-21 15:28:59'),
