  ('zcrm_1579374000066740018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, 'called to ask advice on what to do because he twisted his knee last night. I told him to start with CirrusMD- then if he is referred to a specialist I suggested that he use HCBB- I sent him the link and instructions on how to login. He also wanted to know how his wife could merge her QR codes- she had one previously with another plan.  I emailed CJ and tagged the member so that CJ could walk her through all of this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-21 13:17:59', '2021-04-21 13:17:59'),
