  ('zcrm_1579374000066740008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita called in stating that she was underwhelmed with the answer that she got from Planstin earlier when she called them asking for a list of covered expenses.  I explained that this is an ACA compliant plan and sent her the government list of services. I reached out to Eric at Planstin and asked him to call Rita back to help answer the question that his staff member couldn''t - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-21 12:43:44', '2021-04-21 12:43:44'),
