  ('zcrm_1579374000066707013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '4-21-21 Bobbi is having troubles with her liver and levels. She may have diverticulitis. Dr. Grodberg wants her to go to UCH and see Dr. Amanda Wieland. Dr. Wieland isn''t showing up to be covered under any plan. Told her to call UCH and ask who they will accept for individual C4 plans or if they will work with Bright Health. She needs to see a specialist in pathology. She will keep me posted.  She has an $8K ded. But, she paid $750 for an ER visit already and co-pays for dr. visits and labs. Hasn''t tapped into her ded too much yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-21 11:38:04', '2021-04-21 11:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066689058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028390001', 'Chyla Walsh', NULL, 'Spoke to Jacob Cranman, Chyla''s fiance about putting other 2 children on the plan.  I shared what was the future of Sedera and let him know that it would be a better move to re-enroll fiance &amp; kids in Zion.  He assured me there were no PreEx considerations.  I advised him of eligibility requirements and she does have her own business.  I told him we could do this for 6/1/21.  He will be getting back with me on this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-21 11:30:29', '2021-04-21 11:30:29'),
