  ('zcrm_1579374000066707008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '4-20-21 Kerek is starting a new job and they are offering him health insurance. He''s not sure if he needs a May 1st or June 1st end date. But, he was super happy with our service and membership! He was very thankful. I gave him instructions to cancel when he''s ready. He still has to go through drug testing and all that fun stuff. His start date is Monday, May April 26th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-20 17:09:12', '2021-04-20 17:09:12'),
