  ('zcrm_1579374000066708003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063373030', 'Heather Masuen', NULL, '4/20/21 Member called wanting information on some of her services.  I explained what she has and how to use if needed.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-20 14:18:38', '2021-04-20 14:18:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066702023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924017', 'Rodger Paxton', NULL, 'Charles reached out to me stating that these members were upset with us because we had given them a doctor''s list and one of the doctor''s doesn''t except any form of insurance.  So I wrote back to Charles explaining that the last time we even spoke to these members about preventative care was back in Feb 2019- and the emails that I sent didn''t contain a doctor''s list.  I told him that even if we DID send a list it is the members responsibility to call the doctor''s offices and confirm that they are in network. I resent updated preventative care templates to this member and tagged Charles. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-20 13:33:03', '2021-04-20 13:33:03'),
