  ('zcrm_1579374000066657013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246134', 'David Rubine', NULL, '4-19-21 Left vm to chat with David. I suspect he''s forgotten his pre-x are protected with DPC membership. So, I''m want to verify with him before he cancels  his membership. He''s getting far more benefit with this vs his Anthem plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-19 16:29:46', '2021-04-19 16:29:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066657008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410541', 'Lori Streim', NULL, '4-19-21 Left vm for Ilyse to find out what she learned from her doctor records to warrant cancelling.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-19 16:28:11', '2021-04-19 16:28:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066657003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763142', 'Leanne Wagner', NULL, '4-19-21 Leanne is healthy, non-smoker, works out, does pilates, yoga, etc. and owns spa type biz that she started herself 11 years ago.  Melissa Parenti owes 30% of the biz. Currently has Freedom Health and doesn''t like it. She had to pay for colonoscopy $1600 herself bc they wouldn''t pay for it. Coded as wellness and doctor believes it was 100% wellness. But, since they removed a pimple sized polyp, Freedom Health won''t pay for it.  She''s worried about a visit 1 year ago related to possible allergies, so she wants to gather her medical records to see what''s on file. Otherwise, no issues.  She goes to Apex Family Medicine. I find  Mia Scott DO in the network. She also goes to Women''s Imaging Center for mammograms. I can''t find those 3 doctors in the PHCS network. She''s going to call them tomorrow to see if she can keep going there. She will also ask if they accept PHCS or Multi-Plan.  She''s not rushing for May 1st start date. She wants to make sure this is a good choice first. But, she may call me tomorrow. Also, father had colon cancer years ago and she wants colonoscopy every 3 years. She asked me if she can do that. I told her it has to be recommended by a doctor and coded as preventative/wellness. She believes she''ll have no problem having her doctor recommend it sooner.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-19 16:20:26', '2021-05-04 12:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066649038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423014', 'Asya Bangiyeva', NULL, 'called to his new updated monthly payment- also is requesting a new financial summary after the first "round" of payment was incorrect.  I forwarded Patti his email request. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-19 15:49:34', '2021-04-19 15:49:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066649033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083146', 'Paul Goin', NULL, 'HCBB team informed me that they have been trying to get in contact with Paul but to no avail.  I have just emailed him- and tagged Wendy asking for some sort of an update. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-19 15:34:13', '2021-04-19 15:34:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066649028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786067', 'Karen Neice', NULL, 'I spoke with Karen- apparently the ortho doctor does not take the copay plan so they told Karen she would need to go to another provider.  I told Karen that she should tell the doctor''s office that she is a self pay patient and to forget about the copay card.  I also stressed the importance of her speaking with Sedera and warm transferred her to them when I had her on the line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-19 15:23:24', '2021-04-19 15:23:24'),
