  ('zcrm_1579374000066649003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939155', 'Shawn Bisaillon', NULL, 'Anna called to ask what information she should write down on her son''s scouting information- or rather, insurance for accident or illness- I explained that she should write that she is a self pay patient.  She also had many questions relating to preventative care- she was in the dark with that as well as what happens in an ER- I spent 20 minutes with her and explained the reason why she had so many questions and felt so lost was the fact that she never had a welcome call with her new plan from last Aug- I went over the importance of a welcome call and sent her a scheduler as well as other important email templates.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-19 10:53:52', '2021-04-19 10:53:52'),
