  ('zcrm_1579374000066462031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '4-14-21 Sandra called to find out her member ID# for the ACA portion of her membership from 2020 bc she''s still fighting to get some labs paid for. She misses MPB now that she had to switch to regular ins for this year in case of pre-x causing a problem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-14 14:49:40', '2021-04-14 14:49:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066462023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066507053', 'Christian Knapp', NULL, '4-14-21 Christian is completing app now after he grabs SS#''s for each family member. We completed entire app together except for SS#''s. I explained everything and made sure they understand pre-x clause with Julie''s thyroid partially removed Feb. 2020. They chose SECURE $1000/$685 for wellness visits and HSA. He knows they must go in network for wellness. They are all set for May 1st start date. They are doing contract work now. The job opp he thought he was going to get fell through. So, working on own now, both of them. Cobra was going to cost them $2600 at full price as of May 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-14 13:52:04', '2021-04-14 13:52:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066462018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066466001', 'Cathy Gumbiner', NULL, '4-14-21 Cathy is the owner of Hall of Fame Financial and has life and health licenses. She has been focused on life and annuities and educating clients about finances solutions. She focuses on athletes such as former NFL players. Rookies earn on avg $480K starting and often have lost all their money 5 years after retirement from playing! Currently Cathy makes her money on overrides in the life ins and annuity biz.  Hall of Fame financial focuses on educating clients on how to preserve wealth, works with focus groups, etc.  Also teaches clients how to have additional sources of revenue.  Her athletes might be great clients for MPB and they can earn $100 referral fee to give them another referral source!
She wants to connect me with a networking group in CO called 1BC. They are mostly small businesses and they are doing meetings virtually and in person. Head guy is Greg Petey (Petty?). She also set up a meeting with the Founder of Kennected.org which is a lead generator tool. Has different levels to choose from $60, $80 and $115 per month plus discounted start up rate of $997 down from $1500 retail price by connected directly with Founder. We can target areas, markets, demographics, etc. They can send us a demo as well. 15,000 people are currently using the software already and grew from 5 Founders to 127 employees.
Finally her son is 26 and may also be a good candidate for SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-14 13:34:13', '2021-04-14 15:07:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066468003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126041', 'Steven Strehlow', NULL, '4/14/21 Member called looking for a mamogram in network.  I emailed her the results.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-14 13:26:11', '2021-04-14 13:26:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844042', 'Roland Doucette', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel in Admin and w/Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 13:18:37', '2021-04-14 13:18:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705066', 'Elizabeth Claude', NULL, 'Received Cancellation Request I will cancel w/Zion &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 13:04:40', '2021-04-14 13:04:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066465028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, 'I am trying to explain to Felicia (over email) that she does not have to ensure that her diagnostic radiologist is in network because this is now outside of her preventative care benefits. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-14 13:03:10', '2021-04-14 13:03:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 12:08:42', '2021-04-14 12:08:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461501', 'Lisa Reis', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 12:05:38', '2021-04-14 12:05:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066465023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita reached back out to me and told me that Crystal in Planstin got everything sorted out for her! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-14 11:57:37', '2021-04-14 11:57:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066465018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091256', 'Cynthia Shiko', NULL, '04.14.21:   Found out today, through HCBB, that Cynthia had her surgery on March 3rd.  Post surgical fees are being worked out by BBCC for Zion to approve and pay.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-04-14 11:57:34', '2021-04-14 11:57:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461488', 'James White', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 11:56:27', '2021-04-14 11:56:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066465013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583361', 'Renee Rowe', NULL, 'gave Renee a phone call per Kelly F. , left a vm and waiting to hear back . - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-14 11:53:06', '2021-04-14 11:53:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461475', 'William (Randy) Wheeler', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 11:50:41', '2021-04-14 11:50:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461462', 'Joyce Bailey', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 11:42:35', '2021-04-14 11:42:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066465008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita emailed, and then called me about her difficulty finding a doctor that is showing in network and then them CONFIRMING that they are in network. She said that she called 10 doctors and that this is making her blood pressure rise.  I told her that I would transfer her to someone at Planstin and that she could speak to them about this issue.  I told her that it is pretty common for a member to run across at least one or two doctor''s office''s that don''t understand the plan.  But never this much bad luck.   I will follow up with her a bit later. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-14 11:35:21', '2021-04-14 11:35:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066456026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064060001', 'Brandi Casimir', NULL, 'Brandi called saying she just had a virtual appointment with a doctor and he suggests that she makes an appointment to get blood work done and see an actual doctor in person due to her having red bumps that keep coming up on her arm and the telehealth provider thinks it is something internal. So I told her what to do with being a cash paying patient and Zion. She also asked about what falls under preventative that is 100% covered. I told her I will send her the email that has the link to the page with the list of preventative services. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-14 11:27:47', '2021-04-14 11:27:47');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000066456018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508059', 'Marla Ratcliff', NULL, 'Marla called in and said that she has been dealing with an issue with her toenail, possibly fungus, and she has been going back and forth with her doctor about this. They have prescribed her a specific toenail fungus medication and it has not been doing much of anything for her. Plus it is well over $600, even with looking it up on my end while I was on the phone with her. She knew all this already but wanted to double check because her doctor asked her to. She is very frustrated with all of this because in the middle of this going on she moved to MI and the issue is the medication is only $60 where she used to live but what she has found on GoodRX and with my searching it is in the $660 range. So she wants to be prescribed something else that is cheaper and will work. I offered to contact Reid over at worldmeds and she said no because regardless this medication isn''t working and is just too expensive anywhere. Even with Reid it will still be a couple hundred bucks and it''s not worth it she said. She will let me know what she finds out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-14 10:55:23', '2021-04-14 10:56:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066444018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064054002', 'Mark Dunkley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-14 10:50:24', '2021-04-14 10:50:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066462013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, '4-14-21 Left vm for Willow to help her if she has more questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-14 10:49:37', '2021-04-14 10:49:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003354001', 'Tanner Hunsaker', NULL, 'Members''s CC had decline for the 4/21 pmt .  I realized that the CC is expired.  I sent out template and included that card had expired. 4/27-2nd notice sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 10:43:47', '2021-04-27 09:08:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066465003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, 'Willow emailed me because she called earlier to speak with someone- they told her that they couldn''t answer her questions and transferred her to a vm- I helped her get into her MPB.Health portal and the MAP portal. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-14 10:27:06', '2021-04-14 10:27:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066444013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767127', 'Timothy Smith', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-14 10:26:53', '2021-04-14 10:26:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004366477', 'Trina Johnson', NULL, 'Member has not paid in 2 months.  I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 10:25:19', '2021-04-14 10:25:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066462008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, '4-14-21 Jeff called me back and we are enrolling him now. He doesn''t have a computer readily available so we are using his phone to walk him through the enrollment. His business partner is interested in possibly joining as well. Selected SECURE $1000/$275. He can use his phone for other tools needed in the process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-14 10:25:16', '2021-04-14 10:25:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006420057', 'Stacy Belanger', NULL, 'Member declined for 2nd month in a row.  I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 10:23:45', '2021-04-14 10:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066462003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, '4-14-21 Jeff''s vm is not set up on purpose. He doesn''t use vm but he does text. He just missed our appt right now so I sent him a text to connect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-14 10:02:47', '2021-04-14 10:02:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118136', 'Lisa Reis', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request and will be cancelling Sedera and re-enrolling w/Zion.  I will process cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 09:41:07', '2021-04-14 09:41:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366069', 'Natasha Pledger', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change Form to update her address that Kelly had already changed in the CRM.  I followed up w/Zach to confirm IUA Change which turned out to be wrong.  I will take no action.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 09:20:53', '2021-04-14 09:20:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202106', 'James White', NULL, 'Member cancelling and going over to Zion.  I will cancel w/Sedera &amp; RCI  &amp; billing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 09:11:27', '2021-04-14 09:30:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066459003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705066', 'Elizabeth Claude', NULL, 'This member does not have any 1099 income so therefore not eligible for the Secure plan.  I clarified this with member. Karen sent her the Member Change form when she would have to fill out the Cancellation form.  I will send that out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-14 09:04:33', '2021-04-14 09:04:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066456013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, '4/14/21 Jayne called wanting some labs in network for zip code 90740.  I emailed her the list I came up with.   DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-14 08:44:33', '2021-04-14 08:44:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066456008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583361', 'Renee Rowe', NULL, 'Renee called in and asked for KellyAnne and I let her know she does not start until 12pm EST. I told her I can certainly help her out in the meantime. She asked for her member portal login info which I gave her. She asked what is on there and what not which I told her. She then asked about the cologaurd that her doctor ordered her and I let her know that is not something that is a covered expense because it is not as accurate as a regular colonoscopy. She understood that and still wants to stay with doing that because the colonoscopy is too expensive for her. It wouldn''t have been covered anyway because she does not have the MEC. She then asked about Whole Health Living Choices and thought it was something through Zion. I told her it is not and that it is a new service that is completely separate from Zion and explained to her what it is. I told her she can access that through the member portal as well. That is all she needed but still wants to talk with KellyAnne when she comes on at 12pm and will call back then. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-14 08:35:18', '2021-04-14 08:35:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066424028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974125', 'Gerard McHugh', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-14 08:23:44', '2021-04-14 08:23:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066424023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153641', 'Garner Sorrell', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-14 08:14:27', '2021-04-14 08:14:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066456003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297454', 'Kristen Featsent', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-14 08:04:40', '2021-04-14 08:04:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066444008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064054002', 'Mark Dunkley', NULL, 'Member already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-14 06:41:58', '2021-04-14 06:41:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066446040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '4-13-21 Hi Wendy

I received the referral check yesterday for James Young and Lady Fuller.

Best, Val', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-13 18:41:01', '2021-04-13 18:41:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066442008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Boy oh boy. So Teresa called in and had a bunch of questions. Her first question was about the new MAP Program that we now have. She was looking at the flyer that was sent out to her along with her new QR Life Cards. She asked what the MAP program is and how to use it. Went over everything and she was creating an account over the phone. She also after that was setting up her new QR Card on the phone as well and was able to get in and set up. Next she told me that her and her husband just had their annual wellness visits and she said a lady told her to tell the provider she does not have insurance and pays for it all and blood work. She already paid for their visits not the blood work yet as they have not had that done yet. I stopped her and I told her they never ever pay for anything Preventative out of pocket and their MEC with Planstin is in fact the only part of her plan that IS insurance. I asked who she spoke to and she said she does not know but she knows for a fact it was not this number she called and talked to someone. I think it was Zion. Anyway I told her that she needs to make sure the provider they went to are in the PHCS Network and while on the phone showed her where to look that up on Planstin''s website and she got to the page with ease. She was looking up the facility for her blood work and found it. I told her to make sure she hands her Planstin card and that they bill Planstin directly and she is to NOT pay anything out of pocket. Lastly I told her to call Planstin ASAP to figure out about hopefully getting reimbursed for her and her husbands physical. She is looking first to make sure the provider they saw is in the network and will call. I let her know if the provider is not in the PHCS Network it will not be covered. She understood everything and knows now to always call into here before she does anything to make sure she does everything correctly. She was thrilled with all the CORRECT info I gave her and she feels much better about everything. All set now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-13 14:09:15', '2021-04-13 14:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066446003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243184', 'Mark Capsalors', NULL, 'Jan Capodi called.  This member was in the original MPB Group Select plan.  He converted to Care Plus CV and stayed with Sedera because he had a medical issue that he developed and wanted to stay with them.  Issue was with his vision.  Member had multiple visits/injections with  a few thousand dollar bill.  Member never opened a need.  Past the 6 mo. deadline..... Sedera is not sharing.  Asked Jan to get the DOS and amounts for each bill.  I will attempt to get them to budge on the deadline due to covid....etc.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2021-04-13 13:55:54', '2021-04-13 13:55:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066444003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Jayne called wondering about lab work that would be diagnostic for her daughter.   I told her I would find a lab in network but it would be an out of pocket expense.   Dp', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-13 13:38:56', '2021-04-13 13:38:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066424018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423040', 'Jacob Mouchet', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-13 13:34:47', '2021-04-13 13:34:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066442003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, 'Tracey called to ask some questions about the PHCS netowork- I helped her run a few searches.  She also wondered if 3D mammogram was covered- I explained yes, through Zion- but that she would have to request this first from Zion- That she would like a 3D mammogram in lew of a screening mammogram that is a covered service through the ACA. I sent her a link where she can submit that request for pre-approval. She''s doing really great job getting her hands into the plan and figuring everything out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-13 13:26:22', '2021-04-13 13:26:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066424013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822273', 'Daniel DuBois', NULL, 'Member''s mother called in asking for information about setting up an HSA.  I sent out link with informational pieces.  When verifying email address said that email also changed.  I will send out Member change link to do that as well.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-13 12:11:39', '2021-04-13 12:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066430003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796049', 'Andrew Sutton', NULL, 'Sedera reached out to us asking us to reach out to this family and help them understand how Sedera works.  But when I called Ashley, she only had Sedera related questions so I warm transferred the line to Chris at Sedera to help answer her questions.  I recommended a welcome call but Ashley declined stating that she had one before and that the Sedera based questions were the only ones that she had about her plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-13 12:02:24', '2021-04-13 12:02:24'),
