  ('zcrm_1579374000066333008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064088009', 'Evelyn Gavino', NULL, 'Member emailed into the concierge to cancel her membership.   I sent out the Cancellation request and advised her of the deadline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-13 07:19:54', '2021-04-13 07:19:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066333003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'I was notified by Analisa on 3/28 that Brad &amp; Denise were getting divorced and had to be effective 4/1 I removed Denise and obtained permission from Zion.  Sent separate enrollment  for denise via Admin123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-12 17:00:20', '2021-04-12 17:00:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066321033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'called to ask if Planstin was correct in telling him that the Covid vaccine wasn''t a covered expense.  I told him that they gave him the correct information.  That it wasn''t listed yet on the ACA mandated list. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-12 16:35:24', '2021-04-12 16:35:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066321028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, 'called to update her payment.  sent online payment update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-12 16:00:54', '2021-04-12 16:00:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066321023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, 'Linda reached out via email- I helped her understand the self pay process- and refreshed her memory about HCBB as a tool.  I also sent her Zion''s needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-12 15:33:41', '2021-04-12 15:33:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066330003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, '4-12-21 Jeff is 51, self-employed with his own construction biz and 1 partner. Makes about $45K after expenses. He hasn''t been to a Dr. in 10 years. He''s in his 50''s now and feels like it would be smart to get an annual physical. Hasn''t had ins for 10 years either. Only known health issue is terrible anxiety, he says. So, he needs people to help him and to be patient with him, or he just gives up. No tobacco and he quit drinking a few months ago. With C4 he''d get a $345 APTC but he prefers MCS with all the benefits and good price. Also the mental health is a great benefit for him. He sees a counselor on occasion and I told him she can possibly join the network if she wishes. He has a dog to help with anxiety and no meds. Looking at SECURE $275/$1000. Talking on Wed to possibly enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-12 14:50:33', '2021-04-12 14:51:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066291018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705066', 'Elizabeth Claude', NULL, 'Member called asking what to put on the Member change form if she wants to change to the Secure plan.  I told her what the requirements were and she told me that she would get with Karen to work that out.  Told her not to re-enroll!!!', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-12 14:49:30', '2021-04-12 14:49:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066321018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132196', 'Laura Lee Pier', NULL, 'Laura had thought that she would use her Planstin card for a CT scan and ultrasound because they were recommended during her annual exam.  I explained that this wasn''t the case- I went over the self pay protocol- I ran searches for her off of HCBB and sent her all of the screenshots as well as reminded her of the link and login information if she wanted to try it on her own.  I also sent her a link to Zion''s needs submission page.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-12 14:48:26', '2021-04-12 14:48:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066291013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040097091', 'Ken Zarn', NULL, 'This member was picked up as never cancelled.  I will notify Sedera that they need to be cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-12 14:39:42', '2021-04-12 14:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066321013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091381', 'Jason Levinson', NULL, 'Heidi may have to have reconstructive surgery due to chronic bladder infections.  She is going to see her OBGYN soon but called to know all of the steps that she needs to take.  I grabbed a fair price for an office visit off of HCBB and sent that as well as a link and instructions on how to utilize HCBB on her own.  I also sent her Zion''s needs submission link and phone number.  I told her to call me if the doctor does choose to schedule her for surgery so that I can put her in touch with HCBB''s Care Connect Team- I went over that process as well.  I am not so sure that this won''t be a pre-x condition- she told me that 10 years ago this doctor told her that her condition COULD come to this.....but she assures me that she hasn''t had any issues for the last 2 years- but obviously this will be Zion''s call.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-12 13:44:18', '2021-04-12 13:44:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066291008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786067', 'Karen Neice', NULL, '04.12.21:  Karen called.  Went to doctor, got steriod shot - needs three more, costing $1000.  She has already paid out $300+.  Wants to know how to manage this with Sedera.  I told her KellyAnne will call her and explain what she needs to do in terms of submitting this need to Sedera (see KellyAnnes''s note below).', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-04-12 12:09:39', '2021-04-12 12:09:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066324003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522143', 'Steve Remmel', 'TEAMS Set up', 'Video Chat with Steve to set up TEAMS for the OPD Program.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-04-12 11:47:25', '2021-04-12 11:47:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066321008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786067', 'Karen Neice', NULL, 'called Karen to let her know that she needs to call Sedera about her latest need. I also sent the Sedera template and highlighted Sedera''s phone number for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-12 11:04:26', '2021-04-19 11:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066321003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297319', 'Kathie Norman', NULL, 'Kathie called to ask if we had received her cancellation form.  I told her that we had. She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-12 10:51:47', '2021-04-12 10:51:47'),
