  ('zcrm_1579374000066291003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, 'Received email from member 1st wanting her 1095B''s , then 2nd email wanting to know how much she can claim on her taxes.  I will advise her that since she switched to Zion she has no "insurance" portion so cannot claim anything.  Only what she had when she was with ASi.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-12 07:13:46', '2021-04-12 07:13:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066276008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, '4-9-21 Talked with Roseann and let her know her payment was found and there''s nothing more for her to do on her end. Her correct membership began on April 1st with the MEC and at the correct  $1000 IUA. All set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-09 16:47:25', '2021-04-09 16:47:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066276003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, '4-9-21 See all other notes in Arnold Rasker''s account.
Talked with John and they were able to find the payment of $259 per month from the Rasker''s. Wires got crossed and the payment was not being attributed to her. However, the price was for the $2500 IUA 50-64 age group. So, in essence she got a discounted rate from $344 to $259 per month. Or you can look at it that they got a discount for the couple from $344+$259 instead of $636 for the ES. Either way it was cheaper than the correct cost. So, she has already joined the SECURE to have the correct membership closest to what they wanted to begin with. Arn will be aging out at the end of the month, so there was no sense in putting her on his membership. She has her own that will continue onward. They both told me she doesn''t have any pre-x to worry about. I told them the reason for the price at $275 vs $344 bc of the extra pre-x benefit for the higher priced membership. They are fine without the protection. 
Per John, if they don''t refer anybody this year, he will send them $100 as a referral fee to be properly part of SECURE. She does help Arn with his biz, but not officially. It''s possible they could have real estate property (ie. an LLC) since he''s a realtor. The didn''t offer that up though.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-09 16:46:26', '2021-04-09 16:47:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066268013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656209', 'Bonnie Kleinhans', NULL, 'called and left Bonnie a very detailed message explaining that she can just open up a medical need with Zion even if she doesn''t have any bills left.  I never got a response to her question off of Zion''s Slack, so it was Wendy''s suggestion that I reach out to her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-09 16:12:01', '2021-04-09 16:12:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066268008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104048', 'Lori Goldman', NULL, 'called Lori for her welcome call- no answer- she called me back and asked if she could reschedule- sent rescheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-09 14:49:33', '2021-04-09 14:49:33'),
