  ('zcrm_1579374000066210043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691226', 'Dolores Pope', NULL, 'Dolores reached out via Sales IQ saying that she needed to speak with someone....that she was going through a very difficult time with anxiety and depression....I told her about CirrusMD- the MAP program therapy- then our chat dropped.  So I gave her a call....I went over all of her mental health benefits through us...I stayed on the line with her while she set up her CirrusMD account- I told her that she could speak to a counselor and possibly get some meds to help her get over this hump.  I then went over the MAP program.....I emailed her their information and told her to give them a phone call tomorrow.  She was so grateful that I called her and stayed on the phone with her.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-08 18:10:21', '2021-04-08 18:10:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066210038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, 'Dr. Jeff Lee responded to Willow''s question that I posted on Slack...he said that insomnia is not necessarily a mental health condition and that she should fill out an alternative medicine request form to find out whether or not her CBTI treatment would be a sharable expense. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-08 16:42:46', '2021-04-08 16:42:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066210033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893179', 'Brian Cosner', NULL, 'called to ask how to be seen for a doctor visit he was at...I went over the self pay process and then recommended a welcome call.  I sent him a scheduler and he thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-08 16:32:00', '2021-04-08 16:32:00'),
