  ('zcrm_1579374000066210023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039567010', 'Adam Pollock', NULL, 'Adam called wanting to put his 85 year old mother in law on the plan- I told him that this was not an option.  He then asked if I could put him in touch with a broker that can help navigate all of the options available to him.   I said that I would reach out to Wendy and let her know the situation....ask if she could help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-08 15:19:40', '2021-04-08 15:19:40'),
