  ('zcrm_1579374000066176048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521312', 'Cheryl Schack', NULL, 'Member called in and then submitted change form to remove spouse who will be aging into Medicare.  She also updated her email as well.  I will let Zion know and update billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-08 13:28:36', '2021-04-08 13:28:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066210013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471317', 'John Kline', NULL, 'John just got his 2nd Covid vaccine yesterday...then he went for a bike ride, he had a bit of a fall and then seizured for 2 minutes.  He then was fine and rode back home.  He was wondering about how the plan works because this would be considered his first medical need.  He has an appointment with his primary today and he is getting a referral to a specialist.  I went over the self pay process and sent the Sedera needs template.  He was also trying to find more information about his plan online but couldn''t find anything so I sent him a post welcome call script (updated) so that he can get a better idea of what his plan offers him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-08 13:06:51', '2021-04-08 13:06:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066210008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Willow does not want to register with CirrusMD because she is afraid that the information will be shared on social media.   So I want to speak to Wendy about that.  Also, she was disheartened to learn that mental health wasn''t a covered expense because she has extreme insomnia and would like to have some "CBTI" treatment.  I told her that I would ask Zion if that treatment is sharable or not. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-08 12:53:57', '2021-04-08 12:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066176043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881700', 'Thomas (Tom) Traxler', NULL, 'Tom sent in Cancellation form as he will be aging into Medicare.  Spouse Dena needs to be retained on the plan.  I have let Zion know this and will have John send in file at the end of the month', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-08 12:50:48', '2021-04-08 12:50:48'),
