  ('zcrm_1579374000066178008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691226', 'Dolores Pope', NULL, 'Dolores called in and she said she spoke with Zach and she is having some mental health issues and she wants to see a counselor. I explained to her the new MAP program and that this would be something great for her. I told her I will be sending her an email that will explain everything in detail that she will need to do to get with the MAP program. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-08 09:57:48', '2021-04-08 09:57:48'),
