  ('zcrm_1579374000066178003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'Jillian called in to let me know that her Son got into an accident on April 1st and wanted to know the process of what she needs to do. I explained everything to her with her IUA and submitting the bills into Zion. She has the emails with all Zion''s info on there and will call them to let them know what is going on. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-08 08:48:38', '2021-04-08 08:48:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066176003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, 'Payments that were run on 4/5 both declined.  I left VM for this member and gave her til today to get me alternate method of payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-08 08:35:35', '2021-04-08 08:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066175003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571414', 'Donald Henig', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Went over multiple times.  Already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-08 08:34:00', '2021-04-08 09:01:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066155033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'called wanting to speak with a doctor- I recommended CirrusMD- she wasn''t sure if she had registered or not...so I tried sending her an invite.   I couldn''t find her info so I reached out to CirrusMD''s tech support for some help.  She then asked about the self pay process- I went over that with her.  She said that her doctor will probably want to do an ultrasound because she has had non stop vaginal bleeding for over 3 weeks, I sent her some fair price graphs for ultrasounds in her area. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-07 14:53:10', '2021-04-07 14:53:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066152018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, 'Rachel called and just wanted to make sure that she is going about getting a colonoscopy done the correct way by staying in the PHCS Network. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-07 14:29:49', '2021-04-07 14:29:49'),
