  ('zcrm_1579374000066127198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045976082', 'Stacey Garrett', NULL, 'Member submitted member change form to update her name and address as they have moved.  I will let Sedera &amp; Redirect know. Sedera notified via Outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-07 13:02:54', '2021-04-07 13:08:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066152013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176375', 'Mont Parrish', NULL, 'Called to cancel because he cancelled with Liberty and did not know he needed to cancel here as well. Sent him cancellation email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-07 13:01:53', '2021-04-07 13:01:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066155018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Frances called with A LOT of questions, she was pretty confused with how her plan works.   She was wondering if she could get a thermography instead of a mammogram.........I told her YES BUT she would actually need an in network doctor to give her a referral to have a mammogram done...and then she would have to ask Zion for preapproval to have a thermograph in leu of a mammogram.  Then I spent a lot of time on preventative care- I ran a few searches for her....sent the templates.  I also sent her the Zion needs link so that she could fill out that pre approval form for a full body thermography- I wrote some very detailed notes as well.   I helped to reassure her that there IS a learning curve but that we are here for her to hold her hand, every step of the way. She also asked about if we had a referral program.  I said that yes, we do....I went over it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-07 12:56:57', '2021-04-07 12:56:57'),
