  ('zcrm_1579374000066155013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028390001', 'Chyla Walsh', NULL, 'Chyla''s husband called and wanted to know his monthly premium, as well as what the plan offers.  I went over all of the information with him, got the monthly premium from Patti, $456, and sent him a post welcome call email as well as the two preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-07 11:53:00', '2021-04-07 11:53:00'),
