  ('zcrm_1579374000066076068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, 'called to ask if platelet therapy was sharable, he also wanted to know how to open up a need with Zion.  I told him that I didn''t know the answer to his first question, but that I would direct transfer him to somebody over at Zion Health.  I also told him that I would send him the link to Zion''s needs submission form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 17:09:33', '2021-04-05 17:09:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066076063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752138', 'Michelle Nault', NULL, 'Michelle called for help in setting up her CirrusMD account- I tried sending her an invite-but I wasn''t able to find her info in their system so I reached out to their tech support team and tagged her in the thread. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 16:48:15', '2021-04-05 16:48:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066076058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Ryan called to request his 1095 forms from 2018-2000, he understands that the reason he never received these forms from us was because he didn''t update his address with us.  His tax person is asking for these forms now.  I reached out to Patti to request these. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 16:01:03', '2021-04-05 16:01:03'),
