  ('zcrm_1579374000066076048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583361', 'Renee Rowe', NULL, 'Renee called to ask how she can get a colonoscopy....I began to go over HCBB  with her.   She then told me that she was confused because Sally and Vanessa told her that this and screening mammogram were covered under the plan that she has.  I apologized for the misinformation- I told her that I would reach out to the powers that be.  Renee is pretty upset about this- I called Sally to tell her what happened...she is going to give Renee a call.  I told Sally that Wendy suggested that she just move Renee over to the Secure plan. I let Patti know about this member as well.  right now, her membership is up in the air. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 15:07:04', '2021-04-05 15:07:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066067101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574023', 'Matthew Lindstrom', NULL, 'Received call from Matt he and spouse are going through a divorce and does not communicate with him.  I sent him the payment update form and member change form to update email.  Will rerun pmt tomorrow.  I told him that when divorce was final that wife needed to sign up with new options , that we were not selling Sedera anymore.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-05 14:39:41', '2021-04-05 14:39:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066085003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '4/5/21 Member called wanting to open up a needs. I gave them the number of Zion.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-05 14:08:15', '2021-04-05 14:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066080032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048661001', 'Todd Rader', NULL, 'Todd called and said that he needs to cancel as his work insurance already started and he thought it wasn''t supposed to start until May 1st but it started April 1st. Sent him cancellation email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-05 14:05:39', '2021-04-05 14:05:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066076043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297078', 'Nicholas Olinger', NULL, 'Rachel called to ask if the Covid vax was a covered expense with her plan.  I explained why it is not and recommended she call her local health department. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 13:55:18', '2021-04-05 13:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066064118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574023', 'Matthew Lindstrom', NULL, '4-5-21 Sammi Bessert is good friends with the Lindstroms. She will call them now. They don''t check email and they are going through a divorce. Sounds like they have the money but just don''t know it''s late. I told her it''s 5 days past due and will be canceled. She''s on it ASAP!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-05 13:48:15', '2021-04-05 13:48:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066064113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, '4-5-21 Roseanne is enrolling in SECURE to deal with her missing enrollment. Still sorting out $259 a month she''s been paying to MPB. She helps Arn with his real estate biz. Choosing $275.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-05 13:35:43', '2021-04-05 13:35:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066067096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004774116', 'Joel Hill', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 5/1/2021.  I will cancel billing and set task to cancel after commissions go out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-05 13:01:01', '2021-04-05 13:01:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066076038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297375', 'Kathleen Gramzay', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 12:53:28', '2021-04-05 12:53:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066064108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091058', 'Clayton Coulter', NULL, '4-5-21 Allison signed up her husband Coulter today and she will join later. They are all set for May 1st start date. SECURE $1000/$275.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-05 12:46:06', '2021-04-05 12:46:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066067091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574023', 'Matthew Lindstrom', NULL, 'I tried to call the member to let them know that I had to cancel them for non pmt, however mailbox was full.  Will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-05 12:39:36', '2021-04-05 12:39:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066067083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'I tried to contact member to let them know I had to decline them for non payment.  None of the emails have been opened and when I tried to call I got a busy signal.  I will cancel.  I spoke to Charles and asked if he could contact her.  He to let me know. I will give her til 4/6.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-05 12:28:09', '2021-04-05 12:31:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066067078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, 'I left a voice mail for the member letting her know that I was cancelling her because on Non Pmt.  She then called me back prior to me sending in to Zion.  I ran both pmts and will monitor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-05 12:14:20', '2021-04-05 12:14:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066067073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899160', 'Rosemary Veilleux', NULL, 'Member called back and had a charge ($134.95)on her account that she did not recognize and asked me if was connected to us.  I did not recognize it as anything of ours.  Member will do further research with her bank.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-05 12:00:56', '2021-04-05 12:00:56'),
