  ('zcrm_1579374000066076028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, 'Kyle called to ask how to get started with the MAP program therapy.  He told me that he was on the site- I told him to call the main number that was on the web site.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 11:18:55', '2021-04-05 11:18:55'),
