  ('zcrm_1579374000066076023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786067', 'Karen Neice', NULL, 'Helped Karen get set up with CirrusMD- she is going to give me a phone call back after her doctor consult.  She is having knee issues. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 10:58:47', '2021-04-05 10:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066064093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640041', 'Allison Adams', NULL, '4-5-21 Allison thought she wanted to cancel after her mini welcome call. She now thought she was only paying for wellness visits to remain ACA compliant. She no longer understood she was protected for all large health issues as well. I refreshed her mind and she was thankful and wants to keep her membership now. She''s also doing well in spite of covid and everything. She has 2 daughters that are doing well also. Always super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-05 10:55:56', '2021-04-05 10:55:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066076018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, 'Leo had questions about his lab work....if the bill could be reduced or shared somehow.  I explained that only if it was diagnostic in nature and went over his $500 IUA amount with Sedera.  I was going to suggest to him that he use a service like directlabs.com (or others like it) but it seems like this service is unavailable to those residing in his state.   - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-05 10:34:28', '2021-04-05 10:34:28'),
