  ('zcrm_1579374000065994060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049932121', 'Natividad Buros', NULL, 'Member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-05 07:40:11', '2021-04-05 07:40:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065994055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467421', 'Kirsti Burgess', NULL, 'Member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-05 07:38:43', '2021-04-05 07:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065999084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063157021', 'Roger Webb', NULL, 'Roger called in tonight needing some help because he injured his hand, he started with CirrusMD - they told him to find an orthopedic dr in his area.  For some reason or another he couldn''t login to HCBB....I could login just fine for him.  So I ran the searches for him and sent him the information. I also reached out to HCBB''s tech support and asked them to assist Roger in helping him access his account on his own. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-02 17:33:20', '2021-04-02 17:33:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066025021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, '4-2-21 Just left vm for Arn and Roseann to enroll Roseann into SECURE for April 1st. Admin is looking into Billing issue but we need Roseann protected immediately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-02 15:53:55', '2021-04-02 15:53:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066025013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206032', 'Cari Aman', NULL, '4-2-21 Cari is 52, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Has ins now as indiv on Healthcare.gov for $550! She''s unemployed now but looking to possibly work with Andrea Lowery or one other option. She may be 1099 or W2, she''s not sure yet. She likes to do her annual wellness visits but doesn''t always do it.  She will contact me once she knows her employment status. Likely May 1st start date is ideal.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-02 15:25:47', '2021-04-02 15:27:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065999079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297375', 'Kathleen Gramzay', NULL, 'called to state that she rescheduled her welcome call for Monday, and also wanted to know what information she needed to set up an HSA account- I told her that she would need her Planstin card- and went over when she could expect her digital copy and the hard copy of that card. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-02 15:05:05', '2021-04-02 15:05:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065999074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, 'Lisa called and asked how to submit her maternity need to Zion.  I told her that I would reach out to Joan Phelps about this and that SOMEONE would be giving her a phone call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-02 15:00:04', '2021-04-02 15:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065999069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297375', 'Kathleen Gramzay', NULL, 'missed welcome call- left a detailed message and sent rescheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-02 14:13:19', '2021-04-02 14:13:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066025008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, '4-2-21 Ricki received the bill for $1329 for colonoscopy sent to her. I told her to contact hospital and ask them to submit the bill to RCI/Apex and make sure to code as preventative not diagnostic. It sounds like it had diagnostic written on bill. She will call and do both things.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-04-02 13:09:31', '2021-04-02 13:09:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065999037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297131', 'Linda Bergstrom', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-02 12:56:44', '2021-04-02 12:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065999029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066023017', 'Christopher Aird', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-02 12:24:09', '2021-04-02 12:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065999013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, 'Member called inot Kelly C w/questions around pricing for just Tim on the plan and how they would go about making the change.  I explained and gave her my contact info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-02 11:22:19', '2021-04-02 11:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066025003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065203150', 'Karen Weinberg', NULL, '4/2/21 Member called wanting to know how to speak to a physician with Cirrus MiD. I went through the steps to register her so she would be able to do that DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-04-02 10:49:10', '2021-04-02 10:49:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066024003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725001', 'Kathleen Malone', NULL, 'Kathleen called in and said that when she was still a member with us she had her Preventative Annual Wellness Visit, she did make sure the provider was in the PHCS Network and she did hand them her Planstin card but she was sent the bill. I told her that she just needs to call Planstin and tell them this and they are the ones to pay. She will most likely just need to send them the bill she has and Planstin will pay for it. She is not to pay anything for that bill. Gave her Planstin''s number. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-04-02 10:44:55', '2021-04-02 10:44:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065999008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, 'Samantha called for help in figuring out if the ARA imaging center she was sent to was in network.  I couldn''t find the location that she was at was in network...but I did find 3 other ARA imaging centers in her area that WERE showing as in network.  I told her that I would send her the list, and that she should call the phone numbers to tell them that she found their facility in network- and that they should confirm with her if they are participating in the PHCS network.  She thanked me for my help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-02 10:30:24', '2021-04-02 10:30:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000066011033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061045091', 'Yilin Zhang', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-04-02 10:20:58', '2021-04-02 10:20:58'),
