  ('zcrm_1579374000065968003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Last date paid showed as 8/1/2020, however the member is still getting billed out of FTNI.  Total commission cycles missed excluding 2/1/2021: 5. Amount owed to agents: Jill Clark $100, Wendy S. $25', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', '2021-04-02 08:47:40', '2021-04-02 08:47:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065954018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, 'At members direction I reran payment at members direction on 3/31, payment returned again 4/2.  I called and left VM for member that I needed alternate method of pmt ASAP.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-02 08:19:26', '2021-04-02 08:19:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065954013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004774176', 'Teresa Rice', NULL, 'Member declined again for both Enrollment fee &amp; MCS.  I left VM for member and will send out pmt update from again.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-02 08:12:38', '2021-04-02 08:12:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065954008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299015', 'Brittany Perrotto', NULL, 'I called member and left VM letting her know that for newborns there is an exception made for SS#''s.  That we could get the baby on.  I sent her the Plan change form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-02 08:03:25', '2021-04-02 08:03:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065954003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104168', 'Elizabeth Dempsey', NULL, 'Member called in asking some questions about weather I received her tax docs and the set up of the HSA.  I told her about HSA Bank and will send her the email with the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-02 07:39:46', '2021-04-02 07:39:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065928003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601171', 'Susan Bradley', NULL, 'Susan called for some help figuring out her daughters coverage.  She needs to buy her daughter insurance through her new college, but the college doesn''t provide coverage for a full year....only during when school is in session.  Then there are 3 months that she would be without coverage.  She doesn''t want  to pay for double coverage, but she is looking for some advice on what she needs to do next.  I told her that I didn''t know how to direct her, but that I would reach out to home office and ask, and get back to her about it tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-01 17:37:25', '2021-04-01 17:37:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065908008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'Jillian called to let us know that her son was in a "bad accident" and was in the ER- she wanted to know if she needed a member ID number- I told her that she didn''t.  I went over her IUA- the self-pay process.  I told her that I was going to send her a link to where she can upload the bills, and also asked her to call Zion in a few days (the number was in the email) and let them know what is going on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-01 17:32:44', '2021-04-01 17:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065908003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415275', 'David Williams', NULL, 'David called in to speak to someone in billing....I explained that it was after business hours for that department, and I asked if I could leave a message.  David declined and said that he would just call back tomorrow, he explained that he needed to update his billing, I offered to send him a payment update form but he declined and said that he would just call tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-01 15:29:29', '2021-04-01 15:29:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065882028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299015', 'Brittany Perrotto', NULL, 'Brittany called to let us know that her new baby is a month old now but that she still didn''t have a social security number yet.  She wondered if this would be a "problem", I told her that I didn''t know, but that Patti would.  Brittany asked that I leave a message with Patti letting her know this and to ask for a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-01 15:15:26', '2021-04-01 15:15:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065882023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656209', 'Bonnie Kleinhans', NULL, 'Bonnie called because she had to go to the ER recently for appendicitis, she presented her Planstin card but never heard back from anybody, and she hasn''t received any bills either.  She hasn''t opened up a need.  I told her that I would reach out to Zion''s management team and ask that they give her a phone call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-01 15:03:05', '2021-04-01 15:03:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065882018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836013', 'James Brignall', NULL, 'James called to get some clarification on how to go about seeing his dermatologist- I explained that he can see the dermatologist that he has Dr Halmi- I grabbed the fair price graph for an established patient visit and sent it to James, I told him that he could use this price when negotiating the best cash price.  I told him that if the doctor wanted to remove anything or suggested any treatment that would put James'' bill over his $1000 IUA then he could submit those bills for sharing anything after that amount.  I also sent him Zion''s needs request link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-01 14:47:57', '2021-04-01 14:47:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065891013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514273', 'Fang Xue', NULL, 'Member called in and requested a Exemption Certificate number.  This was request early in week by Leah Garcia.  I responded to Leah letting her know that this is something that is issued by the exchange not us, as permission waiving the requirement for Health Insurance .  I sent out copy of her 1095 as she moved.  Told her that was all I could do.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-01 14:00:39', '2021-04-01 14:00:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065891008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064098001', 'Nikki Stone', NULL, 'Member supplied Bank Acct I processed refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-04-01 13:56:18', '2021-04-01 13:56:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065882013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051098033', 'Scott Wiatric', NULL, 'called wanting to know how to open up a need with Sedera because his son needed to go to the ER last night.  I told him that I would send him an email that goes over the needs process...he had further questions as to how Sedera''s process works so I transferred the line to Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-04-01 12:01:57', '2021-04-01 12:01:57'),
