  ('zcrm_1579374000065849003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, '3-31-21 Arnold Rasker converted to MPB Carez Bridge with his wife Roseann. They removed their son Anders to have his own membership due to his age. I see both Arnold and Anders with their separate memberships. However, someone erroneously removed Roseann. You can see they selected the correct payment amount below, perhaps off by $1 according to my records it should be $636 for the two of them. Unfortunately, they''ve only been billed $344 since around Aug or Sept when Patti updated the billing. Arnold thought Roseann was on her own account and paying separately, but he can''t find that payment anywhere and I can''t find her in the CRM other than showing as removed. This is not the fault of the client. Please help up fix this!  Fortunately, she doesn''t have any health issues, but he''s aging out as of May 1st. 

Also Arn had his colonoscopy and endoscopy at once at Avista Hospital that was billed at $16K and lowered to $11K with Planstin. He made sure to stay in network with approval from Planstin. The billing rates are insane. However the member portion is showing as $1965 which he owes $1000 and Zion will share the rest. He received approval already for the remainder to be shared and he just needs to upload the docs and bills and he will pay the $1000. He''d like to stay with Zion as long as possible since he doesn''t have Medicare set up yet. I''m connecting him with Andrea. 

His son Anders is successfully on his own membership for $269 as he requested back in Aug. 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-31 17:59:28', '2021-03-31 17:59:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065824028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768209', 'Patrick Smith', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent online cancellation form.  Changing over to a "Biden government plan". - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-31 17:28:02', '2021-03-31 17:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065824023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita called for a third time for more help navigating the network for preventative care. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-31 17:09:38', '2021-03-31 17:09:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065824018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita called back for help with a multi-plan search.  I sent her a list of providers to help her out as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-31 16:43:04', '2021-03-31 16:43:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065824013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104032', 'Clove Berger', NULL, 'Clove has a preventative care appointment scheduled for tomorrow...she called to request the information from her Planstin card.  I told her that I would request this from Planstin''s management team but that I couldn''t make her any promises.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-31 15:42:27', '2021-03-31 15:42:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065824008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161176', 'Lisa Ryerson', NULL, 'James called to ask if his alternative "preventative" care would be considered shareable, he says he has a stack of bills.  I told him that Zion health does like for the members to fill out an alternative medicine request form first before any guarantee that these will bills will be shared.  He told me because he didn''t do that first he is just going to submit the bills and see what they say. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-31 13:20:22', '2021-03-31 13:20:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065824003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita called for a preventative care refresher.  She''s all set! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-31 12:59:13', '2021-03-31 12:59:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065810003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, 'Updated member''s email address per email to admin email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-31 11:46:24', '2021-03-31 11:46:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065795011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064060001', 'Brandi Casimir', NULL, '3/31/21 Member called wanting to know how get intouch with Cirrus MD.  I explained how.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-03-31 09:22:29', '2021-03-31 09:22:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065787008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, 'Per Debbie member has moved and does not have any RCI card.  I received the Address update from him and update his address w/Sedera &amp; RCI and in FTNI.  I also sent him out PDF cop of his RCI ID.  Will order new cards for him tomorrow when updated in RCI system.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-31 08:01:44', '2021-03-31 08:01:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065795003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, '3/30/21 Kevin called wanting to change his address.  He also claimed because he moved he did not receive his cards.  I emailed a change of address form and told Kelly  so she can send new cards out.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-03-31 07:41:11', '2021-03-31 07:57:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065789003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570152', 'Pamela Nichols', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Already registered with CirrusMD.  Sent over request to Kelly F to send out another QR Life Code Card to member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-31 07:30:23', '2021-03-31 07:59:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065787003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'Payment info updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-31 07:27:29', '2021-03-31 07:27:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065767008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, '03.30.21:  Recvd. the following email from John:  Hi Joan,  Thanks for the flyer!  This is all looking good. I may have current insurance through May and it could be a few weeks before I enroll in a plan. I''ll continue to study and let you know if I have any further questions.  I emailed John that I understand the situation and will circle back to check on his progress for any further questions or concerns he may have.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-30 17:22:57', '2021-03-30 17:22:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065767003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066645104', 'Geoffrey Booker', NULL, '03.30.21:  Recvd. an email from Geoffrey asking about dental coverage.  I responded that we are presently researching dental and vision to offer, however our WHLC program offers dental discount plans.  I offered to further explain WHLC.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-30 17:18:26', '2021-03-30 17:18:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065758031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578349', 'Marie Burns', NULL, 'Marie called in confused as to how to get into the MPB portal- so I walked her through and stayed on the line while she was updating her password. She thought that there would be information on how to get started with preventative care in her portal- I explained that there was not, but that I could send her the two preventative care templates that we have.  I went over them in detail. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-30 15:52:08', '2021-03-30 15:52:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065758026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, 'Felicia is getting different information from different people at Zion and Planstin about her blood work and mammogram (plus additional mammogram and ultrasound) bills.  So, I reached out to Eric at Planstin and asked him to give her a phone call to help straighten all of this confusion out for her.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-30 15:47:25', '2021-03-30 15:47:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065758021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'called to update her payment- sent payment update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-30 15:29:52', '2021-03-30 15:29:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065758013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521660', 'Teresa Robertson', NULL, 'Teresa called in very confused....Kelly F had been emailing her back and forth trying to answer her questions about some bills that she had, but Teresa decided to call in for an actual conversation- Kelly F was unavailable.    She went to see her naturopath for GI issues, and she THOUGHT that she could get the exam covered by her Planstin card, but she didn''t even check to see if this doctor was in network or not.  I tried to explain that this would be considered a medical need- that she should try opening one up as soon as this need goes over $1000 with Zion.  I tried to explain the differences between preventative care and everything that falls outside of it...and how each is handled very differently, but she kept "melting down" and saying how hard the plan was to understand.   She kept thanking me for my patience.  I explained and helped as much as I could, I went through as thorough of an explanation of preventative care that I could- I explained the importance of her taking a look at the 64+ services.  I sent both preventative care templates- a welcome call scheduler, and a Zion needs request form.  For some reason wasn''t able to send emails out of the crm...so if you don''t see most of those sent from here it is because I had to send them through outlook so that she could receive them.  I added the same email address to the secondary email slot and THAT seemed to have done the trick and it allowed me to send out another email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-30 15:18:12', '2021-03-30 15:18:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065732050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731120', 'Rosendo Mendoza', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-30 13:40:02', '2021-03-30 13:40:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065732045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731107', 'Tia Bowen', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure + Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-30 13:29:37', '2021-03-30 13:29:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065758008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057125429', 'John Smieszek', NULL, 'Kat called in for help finding an ENT in her area for her daughter...I sent her a list off of HCBB, as well as the fair price graph for an office visit.  I also sent her instructions on how to access HCBB on her own.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-30 12:58:21', '2021-03-30 12:58:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065760003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830286', 'Maureen Gannon (Hanson)', NULL, 'Maureen called in and said that April 1st she is going on Medicare. So I sent her the cancellation form to fill out for effective April 30th and she will submit that in. Offered her the Care Plan that she can still stay on for $29.95/mo but she declined very politely and said she would have no need for that but if anything changes she knows who to call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-30 12:06:43', '2021-03-30 12:06:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065749008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, '3/30/21 member called wanting to speak to John.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-03-30 12:06:36', '2021-03-30 12:06:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065732037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064098001', 'Nikki Stone', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after being on the plan for 1 month.  No commissions paid out .  I will cancel membership &amp; let member know if they want a refund they will have to supply me with a bank account.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-30 12:05:27', '2021-03-30 12:19:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065758003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, 'Kevin called wanting to know if he could find his plan information in the online portal, I explained that he didn''t have access to the online portal and I also explained that the online portal didn''t really have what he was looking for.  I explained that I would send him another post welcome call email- that this was the best run down of the plan that I could physically give him.  He asked about preventative care- I ran a few searches for him and sent the preventive care templates.  I sent him a member change form so that he could update his address as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-30 11:57:16', '2021-03-30 11:57:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065732032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255524', 'Ana Leighton', NULL, 'Member called in to ask where she could send her bills some more than 6mos old.  She said that she had been trying to find out what her issue was and finally was diagnosed with Meniere''s Disease.  This is an inner ear affliction that causes vertigo &amp; hearing loss.  Not cureable.  She has paid in excess of her $1000 IUA.  I advised her to contact Sedera for further advice.  She also has some preventative bills, I advised that she no longer has any MEC since the changeover w/Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-30 11:23:03', '2021-03-30 11:23:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065732027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830047', 'Robert Chavez', NULL, 'Previous Sedera Member 1/1/2020 - 3/1/2021', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-30 10:34:29', '2021-03-30 10:34:29'),
