  ('zcrm_1579374000065732003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767127', 'Timothy Smith', NULL, 'Member requested change to the Secure I changed product in Admin 123 &amp; billed him additional $105, also sent out request for proof of Independent Contractor status.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-30 08:17:44', '2021-03-30 08:17:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065717008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104168', 'Elizabeth Dempsey', NULL, 'New Plan: Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-30 07:50:07', '2021-03-30 07:50:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065717003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104168', 'Elizabeth Dempsey', NULL, 'Member requested to upgrade to the Secure plan I cancelled old Care + option and enrolled her in Secure, charged her additional $60 and sent out request for proof of Independent Contractor Status.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-30 07:49:42', '2021-03-30 07:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065682033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001176011', 'Shannon Rahlves', NULL, 'Shannon had just spoken to CirrusMD for vertigo symptoms, the doctor recommended that she go to the ER and get blood drawn. She doesn''t want to do that just yet, but called us wondering if there was any network involved with her plan....I told her that there wasn''t. I offered to grab a list of ugent care doctors to send to her...or look up specialist''s off of healthgrades.com.  She asked if her holistic doctor could run the labs, I told her that is something that she would have to ask her holistic doctor.  I went over the self pay patient process....sent her Zion''s link for needs submission. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-29 17:04:53', '2021-03-29 17:04:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065682028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, 'Suzanne''s surgery went well, she is however going to need more radiation treatment than she originally thought.  They found a tiny bit of cancer on a lymph node, so she is just going to need a "broader" partial breast radiation treatment, but that the Rocky Mountain Cancer center is asking for payment up front.  I have reached out to Zion''s management and asked that someone contact her about this right away. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-29 15:54:03', '2021-03-29 15:54:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065682023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767127', 'Timothy Smith', NULL, 'called to see if his member change form was ever looked at and if his plan had changed from Care Plus to Secure.  I told him that he would need to speak to Patti about this tomorrow when she was back in the office because I didn''t see that she had noted any changes yet in the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-29 15:51:48', '2021-03-29 15:51:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065682018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650083', 'Meghan Van Vleet', NULL, 'called wanting information on how to submit a medical need.  She had to go to an urgent care and ER over the weekend because of a high fever.  I went over the process and then sent her the link to a youtube video that goes over the process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-29 15:27:50', '2021-03-29 15:27:50'),
