  ('zcrm_1579374000065677013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459043', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '3-29-21 Laura is trying to decide if she should use just ChampVA that they get for free bc her husband is a disabled vet but not yet retired. However, many places don''t accept ChampVA and there''s no list for her to review, making it difficult to know where they can go. She was wanting something possibly cheaper but to keep annual wellness visits for all. She is small biz owner in real estate. She can join SECURE and save about $60 a month. $1000/$495 for her and 2 kids, no pre-x in past 24 months. She knows she has until April 20th to decide to make the change. She''s also going to call RCI and provider office to sort out 1 year old annual wellness bill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-29 14:48:33', '2021-03-29 14:48:33'),
