  ('zcrm_1579374000065657052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578069', 'Karla Degginger', NULL, '4/21 pmt declined for insufficient funds I will call member as very late in the month.  Left VM and sent payment update link.  I received no response from this member I will send out final letter - 4/1 Received updated pmt info I will rerun-4/2', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-29 12:57:57', '2021-04-02 12:27:17'),
