  ('zcrm_1579374000065679003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066645104', 'Geoffrey Booker', NULL, '03.29.21:  Recvd. quote from Geoffrey yesterday.  His plan is ending in March.  Looking for health sharing w/HSA.  Interested in SECURE.  Takes Adderall, non smoker, wants $2500 I.U.A.  Explained plan.  Sent my link, Zion guidelines and terms.  Said he will review all and text me to set up next call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-29 11:09:24', '2021-04-16 15:13:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065677003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065676004', 'Jonathan Pratt', NULL, '3-29-21 Friday Bronze X HMO/Bronze enrollment complete just now for $609.45. He will contact Friday to make ongoing payments. System isn''t showing if start date will be April 1st or May 1st. He''s not really concerned. But, I told him to let me know if it''s showing as May and he wishes for April, I can ask to bump it up.  He''s pleased and he used cc for initial payment with Friday. He knows he has to set it up ongoing directly with Friday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-29 10:17:50', '2021-03-29 10:17:50'),
