  ('zcrm_1579374000065562054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063381010', 'Rigoberto Lopez', NULL, 'Rigoberto called because he had received a declined payment email- he also wanted to know what his monthly payment was, as well as when we bill.  I went over everything with him.   I also noticed that he had not had a welcome call yet....so I went over the importance of a welcome call and sent him a scheduler.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-26 17:05:45', '2021-03-26 17:05:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065562049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670317', 'Teresa Fitzgerald', NULL, 'Teresa called to gain access into her MPB portal.....to find information about in-network doctors.  I told her that she would not find information like that in her portal....I explained that she only needs to login to her portal if she needs to change her billing or contact information.  I ALSO explained that she DOES NOT HAVE A NETWORK with the plan that she has.  I went over the cash pay process.  I also recommended that she schedule a welcome call and why and sent her an online scheduler.  She was happy for the help! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-26 16:55:05', '2021-03-26 16:55:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065566028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065676004', 'Jonathan Pratt', NULL, 'Friday Bronze X for $609 is what he''s choosing. We will finalize on Monday at 10:00.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-26 16:51:08', '2021-03-26 16:51:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065566023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '3-26-21 I called Etta about her maternity needs going to Redirect. I told her that''s not included in her Redirect membership. However, Redirect has told her they will cover 13 visits for maternity and Sedera told her those will count towards her $5000 IUA even is Redirect pays and not her!  I told her there is nothing in our contracts with Redirect indicating this is including but that I won''t get in the middle. Someone at Redirect called her today saying they will call her Obgyn and pay the 1 visit plus pre-pay the others now up front! This is incredible! I told her to keep me in the loop. She''s thrilled and now understands why nobody at MPB could help her or knew anything about maternity with Redirect. She was very cool and feeling happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-26 16:45:17', '2021-03-26 16:45:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065578103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, '03.26.21:  Patti told me John called.  Told her he''s comparing different health sharing groups.  Had some questions about ours.  Wants Terms and Conditions of "Contract".  Said all other H.S. groups had it on their websites but our doesn''t.  Said our site is rather vague.   She said he doesn''t want to speak to an agent - just wanted the information.  Called John.  He asked me to explain the SECURE plan to him and wants to see the "Contract" before he signs on.  Explained the plan.  Told him I''d send him the Terms and Conditions, as well as my click funnel and the Zion partner page link for the guidelines.  He was quite happy with that.  Since he made it a  point that he doesn''t like sales people pressuring him and he just wants to do the research himself, I told him to contact me when he has reviewed all and we can further discuss his needs.  Sent all materials to him.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-26 16:21:37', '2021-03-26 16:21:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065562044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003267049', 'Deborah Bentley', NULL, 'called to cancel....sent cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-26 16:03:26', '2021-03-26 16:03:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065562039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Etta is having a VERY tough time getting Sedera''s maternity benefits and Redirect''s to sync....also another monkey wrench....her OBGYN''s office charges a global fee.  So...I have reached out to both management teams asking that someone WITH experience with the separate entity reach out to Etta to help her with all of this confusion.  Etta was really grateful for all of this help, she is going to email Mike Bechtol on her own about this.  I have also let Wendy know the latest as well. I told Etta to give me a call on Monday if by this time (late afternoon) she still hasn''t gotten this straightened out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-26 15:08:40', '2021-03-26 15:08:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065578098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Updated member''s payment info after submission of Payment update form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-26 14:44:00', '2021-03-26 14:44:00'),
