  ('zcrm_1579374000065562034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964110', 'Jemal Lambert', NULL, 'I called and left ANOTHER message with Jemal....to get him all set with a welcome call and to clear up the confusion about what his actual phone number is.....he called the other day from 504-344-0639, so that is the number that I called back because it almost makes the number in the CRM look like a mistake.  I need to speak with him because it seems like we have sent him MANY emails and he has never opened ANY of them, so that needs to get addressed as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-26 12:23:22', '2021-03-26 12:23:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065562029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073115', 'Mailan Boris', NULL, 'helped Mailan with understanding her colonoscopy preventative care benefit.....went through the entire process....sent preventative care templates and explained the importance that she go over the information before using her preventative care services. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-26 10:25:39', '2021-03-26 10:25:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065562024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779429', 'Elizabeth Charter', NULL, 'Elizabeth called trying to find a prescription medication quote form online through her portal....I explained that isn''t the place to find it and sent her one via email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-26 10:09:56', '2021-03-26 10:09:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065578058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571380', 'Barbara Young', NULL, 'Barbara and her husband called in and said that yesterday they spoke to Debbie who was very nice, and she sent them a list of GP''s in their area for Kevin''s issue with a Hernia. Barb told me that the doctor that they need to go to is not on the list and what they needed was a Specialist specifically for Kevin''s Hernia. I told her that if the doctor that they are going to is not on the list the don''t HAVE to stay in the network and present their Zion card. They have the 2 options to either do that or go wherever they want and just present as cash pay. Regardless they are paying out of pocket up to their $2500 IUA. The difference is that Zion may or may not have a better discounted rate by staying in the network compared to the cash price discount. This doctor that they already have an appointment to already knows what is going on with Kevin and is the type of Specialist that they need. They were told by him, Dr. Mattheson(I believe), said that if they go to a GP they are going to be told what they already know and can save $400 right there by skipping that and going straight to him. I reassured them that by them not staying in the network and presenting their Zion card that if everything that goes on is more than their $2500 IUA Zion will still help out afterwards. They thought not staying in network Zion will not help at all. I made them feel so so so much better and a LOT less confused. I also let them know about HCBB Care Connect program and to please call us and let us know if they find out this surgery is going to be more than $5000. We can help them immensely with cost if this is the case. I told them when they get off the phone with me to call Zion and just  let them know what is going on so everyone is informed on Kevin''s issue and can help when needed. They are very much less stressed and are extremely happy they called me and got a much better understanding of how everything works and are calling Zion now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-26 09:26:39', '2021-03-26 09:26:39'),
