  ('zcrm_1579374000065566018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808030', 'Mathieu Shields', NULL, 'Emily called for clarification about when to submit a need to Zion health- I went over the definition of a medical need and now she has a much better understanding.  I also confirmed that her obgyn and her kids pediatrician are in network and sent her the preventative care templates.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-25 16:44:27', '2021-03-25 16:44:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065562008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389187', 'Kenna Crampton', NULL, '3-25-21 Choosing Anthem Pathway X Bronze HMO 7000 for HSA at $214.76 and APTC of $602.40 = $817.16. Will work on funding HSA to help pay for maternity if gets pregnant. Determined she''s not now. Income for Williamd $8600 and Kenna $34,000 about equaling $43K.  Payment didn''t go through. She''s going to call Anthem on Monday to make payment.  April 1st, 2021 start date for Anthem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-25 15:11:06', '2021-03-25 15:16:17'),
