  ('zcrm_1579374000065556008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904406', 'Clare Vass', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will let Sedera &amp; RCI know and cancel billing &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-25 10:01:50', '2021-03-25 10:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065562003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, 'Jerry called and let me know that his wife went to go have her hip looked at with an x-ray and they said they don''t know if it is a Torn Labrum and they want his wife to go and have PT first and if that doesn''t work than an MRI done and possible surgery. So he said he got off the phone with Infinity over of Zion and confused him a little bit about the billing and what not. I explained everything better for him and he is all set. All he needs to do is just hand the Ortho their Zion card and they will bill Zion and Zion will then negotiate the bill and send it over to Jerry with the negotiated rate because the facility is in the network through Zion for them to get the discounted rate that way instead of the cash price. What happened was Jerry''s wife handed them their old RCI card and it got denied. So Jerry realized they don''t have their Zion card and he made sure they are being sent out today when he called Zion earlier. All in all what he needs to do is call the billing dept. at the Ortho''s office and give them Zion''s info to bill them. He is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-25 09:57:53', '2021-03-25 09:57:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065556003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752138', 'Michelle Nault', NULL, 'member needed the ASi 1095 I contacted her and told her she could file without it and that I would send that out tomorrow 3/26.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-25 09:15:48', '2021-03-25 09:15:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065531003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Melissa called in and said that she is going in for her Pre exam visit for her preventative colonoscopy and asked if she just hands them her card. I told her I am not 100% sure if that portion is going to be something RCI will cover because its not the actual colonoscopy screening yet. The office she is going to that is in the PHCS Network is having her come in first for a separate appointment before the colonoscopy. I told her my advice would be to call RCI and just confirm if that appointment will be covered as well. She seemed to get frustrated and asked if the appt. will then fall into the sharing portion. I told her that how that works is with Sedera she has to meet her $500 IUA first and then Sedera will share the rest. She sighed and said well I am just going to hand them my RCI card and they can bill RCI and RCI will figure it out from there because after this I am going to switch to regular insurance because this is all just to stressful and confusing. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-25 08:12:19', '2021-03-25 08:12:19'),
