  ('zcrm_1579374000065515003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798003', 'Merret Anne Mann', NULL, '3-24-21 Merrett called bc was unsure why she switched from Sedera to Zion and I reminded her of all of the reasons. She''s bummed since she now has a pre-x hip issue that she didn''t realize was pre-x due to x-rays from 2019! She was rejected by Zion twice now for sharing of that. She''s going to be speaking with Dr. Jeff Lee to iron it out. I told her of the immediate $25K sharing and about our HCBB service. She already knows cash price for hip surgery is $50K according to her research. I''ll ask KC. She was calm. She''s going to ask about pre-approval for deep tissue massage and such. She''s already met her $1000 IUA and hasn''t submitted any of it yet. She will ask Dr. Jeff. I told her if she needs hip surgery we can explore traditional insurance during open enrollment for 2022. She agreed and thanked me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-24 13:28:27', '2021-03-24 13:28:27'),
