  ('zcrm_1579374000065485008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, 'Deborah called in and said that she has recently moved to MN and #1 Needs to change her address, #2 Asked if her daughter is still eligible to stay on her plan, and #3 She needs help finding a new DPC in her new area. I sent her the member change form email link for her address change, I let her know that yes her daughter is still eligible as she is only 23 and has until she is 26 years old, and I referred her back to her agent Wendy to help her find a new DPC. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-24 11:56:16', '2021-03-24 11:56:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065511013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, 'Called for preventative care billing question- I gave her Jennifer Chasteen''s phone number.  She also had a question regarding whether or not a breast implant rupturing would be considered a sharable need- I transferred her to Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-24 11:44:25', '2021-03-24 11:44:25'),
