  ('zcrm_1579374000065450033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509010', 'Mary Kenyon', NULL, 'spoke to Mary tonight, I did a script quote request with her.  She is having eyelid skin removal sx- and the total amount falls UNDER her IUA, that is why she did not reach out to us.  She did an AMAZING job on her own though shopping around and finding the best price for this, she passed on a place that had a price tag of $5000 on it, for a price just under $2500 - I thanked her for being such an amazing self pay patient! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-23 17:45:29', '2021-03-23 17:45:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065450028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, 'Martha called AGAIN stating that she was confused as to what to do....I told her that her confusion lied in the fact that she was trying to get a discount for she and her husbands wellness visits that they just did last month with their old plan, by using THIS new plan.  I told her that I would not tell her that this idea was going to work.  I told her to stop trying to mix the two plans in her head, and to just move forward with the plan that she has now.  Martha seemed to understand and thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-23 17:42:38', '2021-03-23 17:42:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065452016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366056', 'Jeanne Christopher', NULL, '3-23-21 Dan called to share that the enrollment platform didn''t add the $50 tobacco fee for a spouse when checked as Yes. It will only add fee when primary member shows as tobacco user. That needs to be fixed on platform. I will tell John now.  Therefore, Jeannie is NOT a smoker, but Brian is. I''m contacting Zion via Slack to let them know. UPDATE from Dan they are choosing to cancel. They were too nervous and the email receipt showed the wrong amount of $150 in the text rather than $125 plus the tobacco glitch, they are backing out. It''s for the best. They are too risky to be part of the membership with age and tobacco use for Brian. Dan was selling them a $100K supplemental plan as well, but then protected up to $150K for pre-x. Still dangerous.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-23 16:48:13', '2021-03-23 17:07:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065452008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '3-23-21 Sandra is frustrated with Friday Health. Feels like she''s working with high school people and they don''t have good grammar. She was used to MPB who answered the phones intelligently. I let her know she''s not eligible to switch her plan now with the new open enrollment. That''s only for non-insured indiv. She will ride it out and see how her annual wellness visit goes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-23 16:19:32', '2021-03-23 16:22:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065464003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810025', 'Kellie Stafford', NULL, '03.23.21:  Recvd. call from Kellie.  Interested in possibly changing plans.  Told her since she is a CA resident, she needs SECURE.  She is a business owner, thus, is qualified.  Explained this plan.  She was in a car accident and has neck issues, so she will have a pre-x with Zion.  Has been continuing to visit her chiropractor and feels great.  Told her this would be out-of-pocket (not shareable).  She will decide whether to stay with Sedera (if she is close to meeting her $7500 IUA - from the accident) or change, if she is not close.  I told her also to make sure Sedera is actually going to pay for her chiro visits.  Sent her link to site and Zion guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-23 15:56:22', '2021-03-23 15:56:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065450023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006435131', 'Kristina Tiedemann', NULL, 'Kristina called to cancel her account- I sent her the online cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-23 15:46:49', '2021-03-23 15:46:49'),
