  ('zcrm_1579374000065432077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963048', 'Drostan Baker', NULL, 'Drostan called and said that his payment has been taken out of a different account than normal and he did not authorize this. He said since the beginning payment has always come from his checking account. He would like to know why. Patti who is in the Billing Dept. will be back shortly and will give him a call back about this. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-23 13:58:48', '2021-03-23 13:58:48'),
