  ('zcrm_1579374000065432014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Greg and child Hagen have been effectively removed from membership as of today. Greg has his own separate plan as Worksite- Bridge M&amp;C. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-23 13:43:15', '2021-03-23 13:43:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065450013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356758', 'Joan Tekula', NULL, 'Joan called in a bit disgruntled over her preventative care benefits- billing all of that.  I reached out to Eric @ Planstin and asked that someone give her a call to get her on the right track and answer her questions.  She was very happy for that suggestion. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-23 13:02:04', '2021-03-23 13:02:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065450008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002003025', 'Sally Thomsen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Went over the Secure plan with Sally. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-23 12:44:11', '2021-03-23 12:44:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065452003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, '3-23-21 Michelle called a bit panicked bc she''s filling out the covid vaccine form to get vax. It''s asking for ins name and member # which she doesn''t have. I explained how it works and why. Realize she never did her Welcome Call. She''s ready to do it now. I''ve notified Kelly Anne to reach out. Michelle was also asking about maternity and waiting period which she''s well past. Explained all IUA options, birthing center and she even asked about home births. Explained that''s handled on case per case basis and likely much cheaper than the $2500 IUA. Also told her about MAP program which she''s thrilled about and she''s not set up on CirrusMD yet. She will set up call and ask any new questions that arise. Super appreciative and feels psyched about her membership again.  I also warned about vax if pregnant already. She is Not yet. All set and happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-23 12:11:50', '2021-03-23 12:11:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065450003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752138', 'Michelle Nault', NULL, 'Michele called to change her address, as well as request her 1095 for the beginning part of last year.- I sent her a member change form and requested the 1095 from Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-23 11:50:54', '2021-03-23 11:50:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065439008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491094', 'Adam Kobler', NULL, '4/21 payment declined member called in and I sent out pmt update from.  I retried', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 11:34:06', '2021-03-23 11:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065439003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364020', 'Toni Woods', NULL, '4/21 payment declined I sent out letter and member responded and said her bank told her that the exp needed to be updated tried this and reran pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 11:14:17', '2021-03-23 11:14:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065432003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, 'James called in and he was so confused because there are so many different names with this plan and it is so hard to keep up with, when I answered the phone saying MPowering Benefits all he said was Wow this is crazy with how many different names and I am so confused. I told him that if he has ANY questions about anything this is the place to call into the concierge and we can help him and direct him to who he needs to speak with if it is not us. Anyway his reason for calling was because he needs to set up a telehealth appointment for his daughter and he is using his wife''s computer and wondered if that was ok. I asked him if his wife is registered with CirrusMD and he asked me if I could check. As I was putting her info in they were ask well and they said it came up saying already registered. So I told them all she needs to do then is log in with her email and password that she created. They got in and asked what to do next. I said there should be a chat box that they can click and start typing to start a convo with a provider. I told them to say that they need help with getting their daughter who on the plan with them in for an appointment. They did and were answered right away. That is done. Next James asked me if he needs to submit all bills that he has paid for every time they go in for an appointment. They took their daughter in for a throat culture $250. I said the only time they need to submit bills if it is going to be above and beyond their $1000 IUA and starting a Need with Zion. Other than that no they don''t need to upload all bills they get unless its a need. But it is wise to always keep all receipts they get and bills just in case something does come of it and they have to go over the IUA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-23 10:46:37', '2021-03-23 10:46:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065402026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004774176', 'Teresa Rice', NULL, 'Members $125 declined and 1st payment will most likely decline as well. I will send out letter  3/25-member submitted Pmt Update form but put the incorrect Routing # I will email for the correct one', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 10:39:06', '2021-03-25 07:36:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065426003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467623', 'Christopher Bonelli', NULL, 'Chris and his wife called in and they have been going back and forth with CirrusMD I believe, they never said who, but they are trying to get Adrian the wife registered with CirrusMD and they keep getting emails for her to register but by the time she gets to them the email says it is expired and can''t get in. So I logged onto CirrusMD with Adriane''s info and it came up saying an email has been sent to complete the registration. I let them know this and they were very happy with this and said Adriane is getting on a flight back home to FL and hopefully the email won''t be expired. Chris asked how long the email will last but I couldn''t give him an exact time frame as it does not say on the website. He also said that his wife was supposed to get an email for a Welcome Call herself without him because he already had one with Vanessa and he said that she never got the email. I told him I am sending her the Welcome Call Scheduler as we speak and she can schedule one anytime she likes. They were thrilled with the help and are all set now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-23 10:31:54', '2021-03-23 10:31:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065402018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575420', 'Michael Culhane', NULL, 'Had to send the standard cancellation email to the member as link was not live', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 10:09:37', '2021-03-23 10:09:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065414004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', '**UPDATE: I took care of this and emailed Nancy back answering all of her questions below. She should be all set now. -KF**

Visit ID : 922 
Question : Hello!
1. Is there an MPB Health phone app?
2. Are Covid vaccinations covered?
3. Who can discuss issue with ASI?

Thank you. I may be reached at 651-226-1587. Have a good day.

Nancy', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-03-23 10:02:07', '2021-03-23 12:16:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065402013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870078', 'Suzanne Donner', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare in the month of April 2021.  I will send out letter explaining and letting her know I will process refund when I receive', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 09:51:24', '2021-03-23 09:51:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065402008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare in the month of April 2021 and did not submit Cancellation.  I will let Wendy know and also send out letter to member letting them know', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 09:43:37', '2021-03-23 09:43:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065402003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575420', 'Michael Culhane', NULL, 'Member will be turning 65 in April 2021 I will send him out letter and will refund him payment charged in error', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 09:36:58', '2021-03-23 09:36:58');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000065384018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request as he had very bad experiences w/ both Sedera &amp; Zion around needs.  I have processed and refunded members 4/21 payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 08:58:17', '2021-03-23 08:58:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065384013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request as she will be aging into Medicare.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 08:54:55', '2021-03-23 08:54:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065384008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008628057', 'Anthony Belisle', NULL, 'Response from Zion re: members Cataract Surgery:      Just following up on this question from 3/19:  @Timothy Hirsch I have a member of our Conversion group that just called in and was told by someone at Zion that his Cataract surgery would not be shareable as it would fall into the Pre-Ex. He is one of the member that had the 1st year waived. Can you clarify? Thanks!!!
4 replies
Timothy Hirsch  10 minutes ago
What is the members name? If they have worksite bridge they should be good up to 25K.  @Jeff Lee
Patti Baron  7 minutes ago
The members name is Anthony Belisle, and yes they do have the worksite bridge.  Can someone reach out to him? Member told me that he got an estimate of $12k for both eyes (edited) 
Timothy Hirsch  1 minute ago
We have confirmed that he is on bridge and working with him.
Patti Baron  < 1 minute ago
Thank you !!!', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 08:52:18', '2021-03-23 08:52:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065385008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008628057', 'Anthony Belisle', NULL, 'Member called on Friday 3/19/21 and stated that when he called Zion about his eye cataract surgery that it would not be covered at all due to it being a Pre-X. But he was on the Liberty conversion plan and the first year is supposed to be waved for these members, so he should have a $25K cap. I put him over to Patti to better explain this to him and she said that whomever he spoke to over at Zion gave him the wrong information and that his surgery SHOULD be shared. Zion told him it won''t be. So Patti put a Slack message over to Tim at Zion to clarify this. Patti still has not heard anything back yet and sent another message today following up. Will update here when notified. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-23 08:39:36', '2021-03-23 08:39:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065385003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549155', 'Joshua Brewer', NULL, 'Joshua called in and asked why he was charged $25. I told him that was his annual renewal coming out and his payment will be the regular $311 next month. It is only a 1 time a year charge. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-23 08:08:08', '2021-03-23 08:08:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065384003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to cancel the Planstin portion of her membership.  I will need her to refund her the $60 that she was charged in error.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-23 08:00:59', '2021-03-23 08:00:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065378003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Member will be aging out of plan I will send cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-22 18:12:54', '2021-03-22 18:12:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065369018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Kathleen is aging out of the plan so was taken aback when she received another bill from us.....I told her that I would reach out to Patti and ask that Patti give her a call in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-22 17:39:17', '2021-03-22 17:39:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065369013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659941', 'Keith Kravec', NULL, 'Sent Jenna fair price information for a pelvic ultrasound because her doctor found fibroids during  her annual exam.  I told Jenna to give me a call once the doctor gets the ultrasound results back because I might be putting her in touch with HCBB Care Connect team. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-22 15:26:25', '2021-03-22 15:26:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065369008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141539', 'Gwen Henson', NULL, 'Gwen apparently called today and no one answered.....Charles reached out to us about it.  I gave her a call....I direct transferred her to Sedera and told her to tell them about her surgery and told her that they would walk her through the 2nd MD process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-22 14:55:48', '2021-03-22 14:55:48'),
