  ('zcrm_1579374000065333023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Member declined for 4/21 - 1st notice sent 3/22 2nd notice sent - 3/24   3/29-Final Notice sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-22 10:21:20', '2021-03-29 11:29:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065333018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366001', 'Gwendolyn Archbell', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-22 10:14:32', '2021-03-22 10:14:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065369003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, 'Eric called to ask if his follow up visits for checkups after his ER visits will count towards the same medical need.  I told him that it would. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-22 10:08:56', '2021-03-22 10:08:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065367003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353091', 'Tammy Cranford', NULL, '03.20.21:  Called Brad.  Wants to further review the information I sent.  Not ready to enroll today.  Will wait for May 1 start date.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-22 10:05:20', '2021-03-22 10:05:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065333013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904406', 'Clare Vass', NULL, 'Member''s mother submitted a cancellation request for this member.  I contacted Clare and let her know that she would have to submit herself since her mother was not on the membership with her.  I will send her link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-22 09:52:30', '2021-03-22 09:52:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065353003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870078', 'Suzanne Donner', NULL, '3/22/21 member called wanting Planstin''s phone number so she can question why they have not payed for Preventative lab work.  I gave her the phone number.DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-03-22 08:35:28', '2021-03-22 08:38:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065333008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, 'Martha called in and said that she is having Mohs Surgery tomorrow and wanted to know if it was covered with her plan. I let her know that she is a cash pay patient and is responsible for $1000 out of pocket and the rest will be submitted to Zion. I asked her if she knows if the surgery will be $5000 or more because if so we have a program that she can go through with Health Care Blue Book Care Connect. She said she does not know how much it is but will call and see if she can find out. In the meantime I told her to call Zion when she gets off with me and let them know what is going on so they can help her and get the Need process going. Gave Zion''s phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-22 08:10:59', '2021-03-22 08:10:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065333003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request. I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-22 07:21:18', '2021-03-22 07:21:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065268018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353091', 'Tammy Cranford', NULL, '03.19.21:  Brad called - interested in one of our plans.  Was referred by his doctor who also is interested in our plans.  Brad wants plan for himself (age 54) and his wife, Tammy (age 62) but Tammy has an upcoming Sx for a bone spur on her foot on 3/24.  So he wants to enroll himself only for now.  After asking him questions about his needs, he decided SECURE is the best option for him.  No tobacco, no meds, no pre-x.  His wife has no thyroid and is taking Synthroid - gets 2 check-ups a year for it.  Sent Brad links to my site and Zion guidelines.  He wants a 4/1 start date.  Will review information and call me tomorrow if he wants to enroll now.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-20 07:35:41', '2021-03-20 07:37:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065292061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, '3-19-21 I updated CRM to show MEC was chosen at time of conversion. Payment amount reflects the proper membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-19 16:35:08', '2021-03-19 16:35:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065307024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583032', 'Erin Brennan', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Kelly Cheever', 'Visit ID : 921 
Question : Trying to connect to iDoc24 for online skin specialist.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-03-19 16:33:50', '2021-03-19 16:33:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, 'Suzanne''s surgery HAS BEEN paid for and approved by Zion!  Hooray!  she will be having her surgery on Monday! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-19 16:02:25', '2021-03-20 06:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065292053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, '3-19-21 Re- Patti, Just a FYI on Mary Suzanne Brauning, she was one of the members that went over to Bowtie.  So she did not have a MEC for Jan - July of last year.  Looks like she got a mammogram on 11/5/20 only 5 days after her membership was changed unbeknownst to them. Looks like they had to pay for mammogram due to the unexpected switch to Bowtie. Now, they have the MEC again thankfully! However, they were asking why their 1095-B form was only showing part of the year according to Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-19 15:36:26', '2021-03-19 16:28:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065293116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297505', 'Daniel Birkhead', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-19 14:56:42', '2021-03-19 14:56:42'),
