  ('zcrm_1579374000065272053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482076', 'Griffin Gradke', NULL, 'called to make sure that he was cancelling with us- I read Patti''s notes and saw that his account was "cancellation pending" - I told him that he didn''t have to worry- he wouldn''t be charged again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-19 13:08:17', '2021-03-19 13:08:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779416', 'Christine Heinritz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Christine has a GREAT understanding of how this plan works, Diane did a great job with her!!! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-19 12:34:24', '2021-03-19 12:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065293076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605089', 'Nicholas Paille', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-19 12:33:42', '2021-03-19 12:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065293071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768391', 'Srinivasa Reddibathuni', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Planstin and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-19 12:24:30', '2021-03-19 12:24:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065293066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, 'Member called in letting me know that she is in a dispute w/Redirect over her start date they say she started 7/20 where I have her enrolling eff 2/20.  This will effect her Chiro benefits as they will not pay.  I emailed Patti Money @ Group Resources with the tracking # hopefully she will look up.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-19 12:22:52', '2022-12-29 14:12:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, 'Melany called asking if her RCI card covered the Covid vaccine....I explained that the Covid vax is not yet listed on the ACA mandated list, and suggested that she call her local health department. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-19 11:56:17', '2021-03-19 11:56:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065292033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763104', 'Bryan Lonergan', NULL, '3-19-21 Bryan is 62 and getting divorced now. So, he doesn''t know when he will be kicked off his wife''s policy. Guessing he''ll need May or June start date, not April. He''s self-employed 1099 consultant. He just got a term life policy and rated Preferred Plus! No tobacco, takes a blood pressure med lisinopril and OTC allergy med for grass allergy. He doesn''t necessarily do his annual wellness visit and doesn''t sound like he wants or needs a colonoscopy. He will call his Dr. Jillian Horner''s office to find out cash price for wellness/physical and determine if SECURE with the HSA is worth the $720 a year for the tax benefits.  If not, will choose CARE+ for $215/$1000.  He''s thrilled to have this option! He was afraid this process was going to be terrible to find reasonable ins. He thought he wanted the highest ded and an Aflac plan to protect for ER situation. Now, he''s realizing this is better and easier. Very happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-19 11:26:38', '2021-05-10 14:14:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768391', 'Srinivasa Reddibathuni', NULL, 'emailed me and asked to cancel because he now has benefits through his job.  I sent him the online cancellation form and asked him to fill it out RIGHT AWAY as the deadline for cancellations is tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-19 11:04:03', '2021-03-19 11:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065293061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380018', 'Daniel Cardoza', NULL, 'Updating member address per member verification to Kelly C.  This is the reason member never received Planstin cards.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-19 10:59:20', '2021-03-19 10:59:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065292028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964110', 'Jemal Lambert', NULL, 'Jemal called in and said that he has gotten NOTHING from anyone about anything with his plan. No letters or cards. So I told him that I will have Zion/Planstin send out a PDF copy and Hard copy of his cards ASAP and since he has not had a Welcome Call I sent him a scheduler to set one up. I also re sent his Welcome Letter email since he never opened it along with his Fulfillment Letter, New QR Code Card Letter, MAP Flyer, and CirrusMD flyer. Even though the note from KellyAnne states that she set up CirrusMD and a QR Code with him he does not remember any of this and says he never did this or got a QR Code and does not know what that is. There is nothing in his wallet or anything. SO I re sent everything to him in the mail an hour ago. So everything is on its way to him as we speak except for his Zion/Planstin cards as I have not gotten a response on that yet but I should by the end of the day today. I can tell this member is going to need a lot of hand holding with his membership so  that is why I sent a bunch of good information to him and reassured him that everything will be sent out today and advised he have his Welcome Call BEFORE he goes and tried to set up any sort of appointment. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-19 10:40:40', '2021-03-19 10:40:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, 'requested PDF and hard copies of Planstin cards.....they need them TODAY.....I told Lewis that next time he needs something that is time sensitive, he needs to pick up the phone and call us, rather than emailing us because by the time I got to his email it was already noon....and his appointment is at 1:30 this afternoon.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-19 10:25:54', '2021-03-19 10:25:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380018', 'Daniel Cardoza', NULL, 'requested digital and hard copies of Dan''s cards to go to BOTH email addresses....and updated mailing address.  I filled out an address update on behalf of the member and submitted it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-19 10:23:50', '2021-03-19 10:23:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065292023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065281009', 'Chris Haertling', NULL, '3-19-21 Chris called and said she''s sticking with health insurance bc her broker that she''s worked with for 15 years told her that her income no longer matters in regards to the subsidy. Says she''s paying $170 and won''t tell me her income. She says it varies due to her capital gains and self-employment. I told her nobody knows what the subsidy will be changed to in 2021 yet. So, her broker can''t know what that will be. But, she''s determined that her broker knows best.  Sounds like they''re gaming the system or the broker isn''t being honest and doesn''t want to lose her as a client. So be it!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-19 10:23:49', '2021-03-19 10:23:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065268008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061045043', 'Kurt Benfield', NULL, '3/19/21 member called concerning the last spelling of her name because ce it is spelled wrong in our system. The correct spelling is Benfield.   DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-03-19 10:05:30', '2021-03-19 10:05:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065292018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, 'QR Life Code for George: H0GH2. There is no space for 5th QR code or more. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-19 10:03:57', '2021-03-19 10:03:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065293056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297144', 'Joseph Silva', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-19 09:26:42', '2021-03-19 09:26:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065293051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297131', 'Linda Bergstrom', NULL, 'Member &amp; Child $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-19 09:19:07', '2021-03-19 09:19:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065292008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963048', 'Drostan Baker', NULL, 'Debbie called me and said that she spoke to Drostan and his wife is going in for her Gynecology appointment and asked if her IUD would be covered. I told her that IUD IS on the ACA list of preventative coverage BUT only certain MEC''s cover it and it has to be done in the office. They can not have it done somewhere else or have it prescribed and picked up at a pharmacy, ONLY in office procedure is covered. SO my suggestion is to have the member call RCI and confirm everything with them since RCI is who would cover it or not. Gave Debbie both of the phone numbers for RCI that I have to give to them member to call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-19 09:00:14', '2021-03-19 09:00:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065293046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297078', 'Nicholas Olinger', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-19 08:58:03', '2021-03-19 08:58:03'),
