  ('zcrm_1579374000065272023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, 'Wife''s email is rondaltf@gmail.com, there is no space to put hers as Lewis already has 2 emails in both spaces. So if she needs anything emailed to her this is the email address she gave me. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-18 14:36:40', '2021-03-18 14:36:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, 'Wife Rhonda did call and asked me to look up a facility and provider for her in the network and neither of them came up so she just asked me to send her lists of providers. I will send the email with those attached and their mailing address needs to be changed so I will send the member change form as well. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-18 14:12:31', '2021-03-18 14:12:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, 'Lewis called in and was trying to log into his member portal to get information on his kids getting their physicals. I told him that the portal is being worked on and when it is up he will be notified with his log in info. So he asked where he is supposed to find this info. I told him to always call into here the concierge for any questions on how to do anything. I let him know that the Preventative is through Planstin and gave him their phone number as well. He said his wife is the one trying to get everything organized with the kids and will call when ready. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-18 14:03:07', '2021-03-18 14:03:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065272008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'QR Life code for Sydney: H0E8W. There is no space for a 5th QR code. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-18 13:51:24', '2021-03-18 13:51:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065292003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '3-18-21 Kristen called bc her doctor is no longer in the network. The provider thinks they stopped accepting the PHCS network in Aug. of 2020. Therefore, she can''t make use of the MEC. She doesn''t need a colonoscopy for another 4 years and isn''t super keen on mammograms. So, it''s worth it to change her to CARE+ and pay cash for her needs. She''s requesting the 1x change. She will review it all next Feb. upon her renewal to see if we have any new options at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-18 13:14:53', '2021-03-18 13:14:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065290013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297409', 'Lauri Wakefield', NULL, '03.18.21:  Lauri called - said she tried to enroll and the platform wouldn''t allow her to choose a $2500 IUA so she needs help.  We schedule a zoom call to enroll for tomorrow at 10 a.m.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-18 12:52:29', '2021-03-18 12:52:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065290008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746228', 'Tanya Hodder', NULL, '03.18.21:  Tanya called.  Said she received 2 emails so far.  Patti changed her plan to Care Plus.  I asked Tanya if she wanted to have Robert as her advisor and she said she''d rather stay with me, as she felt I would be more available to help her.  I explained the rest of the onboarding process and told her to call me w/any questions or concerns.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-18 12:25:37', '2021-03-18 12:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065287008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, 'I helped Julie understand her benefits.....she is going to go to the same OBGYN that she has been going to for some hormone bld work......I sent her some information for an online vendor by the name of Ulta Lab tests...they have a lab in her area that she can go to.  I also sent her the Fair price information for an established patient obgyn appointment that she can use when negotiating the best cash price.  I also sent her Zion''s needs submission form so she can submit a recent need - she needed to go to the ER because she accidentally cut the tip of her finger off. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-18 12:24:51', '2021-03-18 12:24:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065290003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746228', 'Tanya Hodder', NULL, '03.16.21:  Tanya called the office.  Said she hasn''t received any materials yet.  Enrolled in SECURE (on Robert''s site) but is ineligible for this plan.  I told her she needed to change to Care Plus to which she agreed.  Patti sent her the link to switch plans and made admin. changes.  Changed producer to me.  I told Tanya to call me when she has completed the form and sent it to Patti.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-18 12:21:55', '2021-03-18 12:21:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065259018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605169', 'Rahul Vadera', NULL, 'I was copied by Sedera in an email from this member requesting cancellation.  I sent him out the cancellation link and advised him of billing date.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-18 11:36:09', '2021-03-18 11:36:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065287003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, 'I reached out to Julie today to offer her some help in finding doctors in her area.  Wendy asked me to give her a call. I left a long detailed vm, offering to help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-18 11:25:43', '2021-03-18 11:25:43'),
