  ('zcrm_1579374000065207087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '3-17-21 David is choosing to be on his own membership with DIRECT since he can have Dr. Flanagan with Nextera via the DPC membership. Lori will remain on SECURE for April 1st 2021 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-17 12:32:02', '2021-03-17 12:32:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065207082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '3-15-21 David is considering moving both of them to DIRECT or just him to help deal with his tinnitus. He LOVES Dr. Clint Flanagan who was his Dr. a while back. He is calling Nextera tomorrow and will see if he can become a patient of Dr. Flanagan again. If so, he will join. He''s pondering moving Ilyse to that membership too in order to keep it consistent. Then we need to cancel his Anthem plan which he''s paying $673.87 now with $1234.33 APTC. Without Ilyse on plan for Anthem his APTC is $429 and his cost is $548.61. Therefore, doesn''t really make sense for them. So, really liking the idea of Nextera plus DIRECT $455/$1000 plus $178 = $633 a month! Win-win all around. He''ll call me tomorrow or Wed to finalize plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-17 12:31:51', '2021-03-17 12:31:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065207077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410541', 'Lori Streim', NULL, '3-17-21 David is choosing to be on his own membership with DIRECT since he can have Dr. Flanagan with Nextera via the DPC membership. Lori will remain on SECURE for April 1st 2021 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-17 12:30:39', '2021-03-17 12:30:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065232023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641030', 'Anthony Moonen', NULL, 'sent this email today-
Dear MPB.Health member, 

 

This email is to inform you that you have received a membership plan card in the mail by error in the last few weeks.  Please disregard the information in the letter that came with the card and please throw the card away.  It is a white card with green and blue lettering that says MPB.Health on it.  You should already have the RIGHT card for your plan.   It says My Academy of Health Excellence on it and has Redirect Health’s phone number on the bottom left corner 888-407-7928.  That is the phone number that you need to call before scheduling any non-emergent medical appointment.  

 

We are sorry for this mix up.  Please let us know if you have any questions! 

 

Your MPB.Health team 

