  ('zcrm_1579374000065136013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893337', 'Katarina Payne', NULL, 'emailed me to tell me that she was pregnant- I sent her Zion''s maternity pamphlet as well as Zion''s phone number- I told her to call them if she needed any maternity questions answered. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-15 10:59:53', '2021-03-15 10:59:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065132039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271228', 'Barbara Henderson', NULL, 'I was copied on a email that this member sent to Sedera for what seemed like questions about RCI.  I reached out to member and left a VM to see if I could answer any questions for her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-15 10:58:02', '2021-03-15 10:58:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065136008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060475077', 'James Brown', NULL, 'James accidentally called us rather than Zion....he opened up a new needs with them last week for his wife who is due to have shoulder surgery THIS WEEK and he hasn''t heard back from them yet.  I transferred the line to Zion. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-15 10:58:02', '2021-03-15 10:58:02'),
