  ('zcrm_1579374000065132008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447500', 'Clove Berger', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel w/Sedera (via Outlook) and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-15 09:44:19', '2021-03-15 09:49:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065132003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', NULL, 'Member emailed me and said that she hadn''t gotten reimbursed as yet for her colonoscopy.  I advised that we had given RCI what they needed and that she should follow up with Jennifer Chasteen as to where her reimbursement was in their process.  She also said that we were charging her more money, however her pricing has not changed.  I explained that her price hadn''t gone up and what her Share amount was comprised of.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-15 09:41:04', '2021-03-15 09:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065130003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009614029', 'Kathryn Tagenel', NULL, 'Kathy called in and said that for the Covid vaccine they are asking for an insurance ID number. She said she knows this isn''t "Insurance" per say but if there is something to put down. I told her not exactly because she would be a self pay for that so to put uninsured. I also let her know that the Covid Vaccine is supposed to be Free but the only reason she would have to pay anything is because the facility wherever she is going has a surcharge for them to be administering the vaccine. But there are a lot of places that don''t have a fee at all so she might want to look around first beforehand. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-15 09:30:38', '2021-03-15 09:30:38'),
