  ('zcrm_1579374000065059011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447500', 'Clove Berger', NULL, '3-12-21 Completed Need with Sedera. She understands pre-x for his injury and will pay via HSA if they have to remove plate. They also both have high cholesterol, she doesn''t need meds and he takes meds I believe.  Choosing SECURE $1000/$685 EF. Lower price from $817 to $685 for family of 4. Wants the full wellness back for family.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-12 14:41:29', '2021-03-12 14:51:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065029028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063373030', 'Heather Masuen', NULL, 'Called Heather for her welcome call but she asked to reschedule.  I told her it wasn''t a problem and sent her a new welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-12 14:34:33', '2021-03-12 14:34:33'),
