  ('zcrm_1579374000065037028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014743027', 'Jay Land', NULL, 'I received Change form from member to increase IUA to $5000.  I sent in to Zion &amp; notified Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-12 14:15:17', '2021-03-12 14:15:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065059003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, '3-12-21 She wants to make sure she can change her plan if laws change and she needs to be ACA compliant. I told her yes, if laws change she will be given the opportunity to change memberships to become compliant at that time. Not thrilled with current President/Administration. Enrolling in DIRECT $2500/$205. Also told her she can make a change upon her annual renewal. In case of hardship or other circumstance, she can change her membership1 time only outside of open enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-12 13:53:18', '2021-03-12 14:00:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065029023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084284', 'Karen Quigley', NULL, 'Karen accidentally called us rather than Sedera like I had previously suggested to her.  I gave Karen their phone number again. This is to speak to them about her skin cancer LEGIONS and whether or not they will be considered ONE medical need or all separate medical needs. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-12 13:29:01', '2021-03-12 13:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065037023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014743027', 'Jay Land', NULL, 'Member called in to ask if he could increase his IUA.  I gave him pricing and he wants to go with the $5000 to save money.  I will send out the member change form to fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-12 13:20:10', '2021-03-12 13:20:10'),
