  ('zcrm_1579374000065029013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061045043', 'Kurt Benfield', NULL, 'went over her membership cards.....also went over the prescription quote plan we have and sent her a form.  I also sent a welcome call scheduler.  I emphasized the importance of a welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-12 13:02:42', '2021-03-12 13:02:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065037018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038052', 'Brian Walsh', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-12 12:28:41', '2021-03-12 12:28:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065029008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, 'Mariah called today pretty much in tears trying to explain how frustrating this plan has been for her.  SO I did an on the spot welcome call with her because she told me that she had a horrible welcome call with Vanessa before.  I went over her plan- I explained how simple it was- however it was clear to me that she does not appreciate this "gate-keeper"  she wondered why her friend Julie Oldham (that referred her) was happier on the plan that she has.  So I went over the differences between the two plans.  She would like a call from Wendy to discuss all of this.....she told me that she has literally a stack of chiropractor bills that she paid outright because she didn''t call Redirect first (I think this is part of the frustration) .  Maybe a ZION SECURE plan would make Mariah feel like she can be her "own boss" a bit more????? - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-12 12:06:43', '2021-03-12 12:06:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065037013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-12 11:57:30', '2021-03-12 11:57:30'),
