  ('zcrm_1579374000065043003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297409', 'Lauri Wakefield', NULL, '03.12.21:  Emailed Lauri Zoom invite to enroll on 3/16/21 at 10:00 a.m.  Told her I will call her to confirm all.  Researched male DPC''s in the Palm Harbor area for her husband.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-12 11:45:51', '2021-03-12 12:16:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065037003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830324', 'Terry Thomsen', NULL, 'Member cancelling this plan and re-enrolling in the Care + option to save some money.  I will cancel billing and let Zion know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-12 11:37:04', '2021-03-12 11:37:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000065029003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, 'Linda called thinking that we had the wrong email address and she was RIGHT!  I updated the email address and sent ANOTHER welcome call scheduler to the RIGHT address! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-12 11:15:18', '2021-03-12 11:15:18'),
