  ('zcrm_1579374000064976043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974125', 'Gerard McHugh', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-11 09:53:57', '2021-03-11 09:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064993013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104128', 'Lindsay Tollefson', NULL, '03.11.21:  LIndsay called - interested in SECURE for herself.  Husband gave her HPV Virus so she has a pre-x condition, which she pays out-of-pocket for testing.  Is satisfied with the Zion guidelines for pre-x.    Explained the plan to her - she wants to enroll.  Getting divorced first week of April and wants to enroll for April 1.  Told her she should use her maiden name and future information on the enrollment form, as she will be changing it.  Sent her link to my click funnel and said I will help her enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-11 09:43:28', '2021-03-11 09:43:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064976038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271339', 'Christina KUB', 'Redirect Term', 'Tracking #11304029
Sent by Patti Baron on 3/11/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-11 09:07:25', '2021-03-11 09:07:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064976033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271339', 'Christina KUB', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as she aged into the 60 age band.  She got on the exchange.  I will cancel Sedera Redirect &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-11 09:05:24', '2021-03-11 09:05:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064993008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, 'Dorthy the daughter of Ann called in and said that she needs her mothers policy number to set up the spruce app. I let her know that all of that is going to be through Redirect. They will be the ones that will have a member number for her and to always give them a call first. I provided her with Redirect''s phone number. She then asked if it was the same thing with Sedera. I let her know that Sedera doesn''t really have a card or policy number of sorts and that what Sedera has is a member portal for when she needs to upload bills to start a Need with them. I offered to send her the email that explains how to set that up and she said no thanks that she has a contact number for someone over at Sedera herself and will call them. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-11 09:05:21', '2021-03-11 09:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064993003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165513', 'Christine Pietras', NULL, 'Christine called in and said that she needs to update her payment info and got a few emails about needing to do that. I sent her the payment update link via email. She then asked if she needs to contact Liberty separately as well or does this form update for that too. I said no she needs to contact Liberty. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-11 09:00:11', '2021-03-11 09:00:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064976028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654432', 'Sarah Mandell', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera, RCI &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-11 08:54:38', '2021-03-11 08:54:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064976023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115309', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera, RCI &amp; Billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-11 08:48:21', '2021-03-11 08:48:21');
