  ('zcrm_1579374000064944046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654432', 'Sarah Mandell', NULL, '3-10-21 Sarah enrolled in SECURE $1000/$275 to be able to get mammogram and HSA compliance. She will save about $70 a month from her current PSDHC and is quite happy to do so. Completed enrollment and cancellation form.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-10 17:38:43', '2021-03-10 17:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064944041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, '3-10-21 I spoke with Tess and let her know she has to split her membership with Greg now that they are officially divorced. She''s sending me an email requesting to do so. I don''t know her new payment amount since it''s the Bridge membership. I will verify with Patti. We will request from Zion to maintain both memberships as is, just they are now paying separately. Greg will keep their child on the membership. Tess will pay for her own. I''m having her update her payment information via the member changes page. Greg''s payment will remain the same.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-10 16:26:13', '2021-03-10 16:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064944036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115309', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '3-10-21 Jeni is enrolling now in SECURE at $275/$1000 and will cancel her PSDHC. No pre-x, just needing annual wellness visit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-10 15:44:02', '2021-03-10 15:44:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064939063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001175486', 'Katharine (Katie) Armstrong', NULL, 'Katie called to cancel......AND ask for an 18 month refund.  I sent the online cancellation form. and told her that it would be Patti''s decision about the refund. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-10 15:35:46', '2021-03-10 15:35:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064939058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001608001', 'Carlos Matamoros', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-10 14:56:09', '2021-03-10 14:56:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064945107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'Member called back in and said that he now needed all of last years reciepts.  I initially advised him that I would not be able to get those receipts to him by the end of the day.  He later called back and told me that he found all his receipts however he needed one for his Feb pmt.  I advised that he had been with Total Healthcare at that time and the we did not bill him membership was payroll deducted.  He was ok with that.  So he does not need our receipts.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-10 14:49:31', '2021-03-10 14:49:57'),
