  ('zcrm_1579374000064939048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'I spoke with Tess today.....she and her husband have been divorced for a year now.   She is interested in maternity benefits because she is with a new partner.  PLEASE BE VERY CAREFUL AS TO NOT SHARE PERSONAL INFORMATION ABOUT TESS WITH GREG OR VICE VERSA.  Wendy is going to give Tess a phone call to try to straighten this out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-10 12:23:53', '2021-03-10 12:23:53'),
