  ('zcrm_1579374000064937013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064060001', 'Brandi Casimir', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-10 10:24:17', '2021-03-10 10:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064939028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'sent preventative care templates per members request. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-10 10:11:03', '2021-03-10 10:11:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064939023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822273', 'Daniel DuBois', NULL, 'Daniel called and asked for his policy number to give for getting the Covid Vaccine. I told him there is nothing that he needs to give because this is an out of pocket expense as it is not covered and it should be Free regardless. But I guess wherever he is they are asking for a policy number. So when I said this he still said he wants it now so I referred him to contact Zion about this and gave their phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-10 09:58:09', '2021-03-10 09:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064939018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, 'Deanna called in and asked me to compare pricing that she has for 2 different procedures. One for a 3D Unilateral Mammogram and 2nd for a Breast Ultrasound Unilateral. I pulled up HCBB and both prices she has are cheaper than on HCBB. She then asked if HCBB is something that anyone can use themselves and I said yes but I will have to email her the information on how to get in once I get the answer from KellyAnne on how to do so. All Set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-10 09:43:54', '2021-03-10 09:43:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064945013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form I reset up the billing and billed for 3/21 + Reinstatement Fee.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-10 09:42:21', '2021-03-10 09:42:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064939013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359199', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, 'Kim emailed asking for the payment update form. I emailed her the link. Will let Patti in Billing know to look out for that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-10 09:26:31', '2021-03-10 09:26:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064945008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610303', 'Lauren Rathbun', NULL, 'Member aging up into 30 age band that will happen starting 5/1.  I have task to change that 4/30.  Task completed set to bill at new rate 4/20.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-10 09:02:11', '2021-03-26 08:07:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064945003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462166', 'Tammie Smith', NULL, 'Member called in to let me know that she received her 1095 fro Apex with a random persons name on it.  I explained the 1095 and told her that she did not need to submit it, however I would correct it a send it ou to her via email.  Sent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-10 09:01:12', '2021-03-10 09:01:12'),
