  ('zcrm_1579374000064879003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640041', 'Allison Adams', NULL, 'I did a "mini" welcome call with Allison,  we went over her preventative care benefits....I sent her the templates that went along with our conversation.  I also explained her 1095 forms.  Finally I stressed to her the importance of having a refresher welcome call....when she initially called in she said "help, I have had this plan for 3 years and do not know how to use it"  I sent her a welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-09 16:26:08', '2021-03-09 16:26:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064876008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, 'Guy called in and said that his wife was just diagnosed with appendicitis and was referred to a specific hospital and they asked if that needed to be verified with Planstin. I said no not in this situation. They don''t need to verify the  facility and can just go there and they are to present themselves as self pay patient and are responsible for $1000 out of pocket which is their IUA. Anything more than that they are to contact Zion and open up a Need with them. He is to keep the receipt that shows proof of paying the $1000 and ask to be billed the rest and submit all of those bills to start a Need with Zion. I suggested that he calls Zion after getting off the phone with me and provided their phone number. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-09 14:29:07', '2021-03-09 14:29:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064870028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, 'Called and left VM with Nicole letting her know that Sedera has agreed to reinstate them and that I sent out Paymant update link for them to fill out.  Also this needs to be done ASAP aslo will be charging them the $50 reinstatement fee.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-09 14:27:02', '2021-03-09 14:27:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064876003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, 'Brooke called and said that her husband has a mole and they need to go get that checked out and asked if  this is a situation where I send them a list of providers in their area that they have to go to. I said no not in this situation that is only for their Preventative care services. I said she can go anywhere of her choosing and present themselves as cash pay patients and are responsible for the first $1000 of their IUA. Anything more they will need to contact Zion, I sent the how to submit a Need into Zion email. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-09 14:21:31', '2021-03-09 14:21:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064870023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', 'Updated plan eff 4/1/2021', 'Member &amp; Family  $1000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-09 14:01:17', '2021-03-09 14:01:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064870018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, 'Member added children prior to enrollment after getting clarification for Zion as to whether they could add them', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-09 14:00:27', '2021-03-09 14:00:27'),
