  ('zcrm_1579374000064766073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063826008', 'Dwight McKinney', NULL, 'Member called in and opened a ticket asking if we had all the information we needed. I noticed that member never uploaded proof of business status. I contact via voice mail and told her that email was sent on 2/16 and that it is still outstanding.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-08 13:19:40', '2021-03-08 13:19:40'),
