  ('zcrm_1579374000064766053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767127', 'Timothy Smith', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-08 12:35:25', '2021-03-08 12:35:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064768023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046483021', 'Rochelle Kirkwood', NULL, 'Called in and needed username and password for the member portal, I provided that to her and lastly she asked if that was where she could look up providers. I told her no and what the portal was for but I could send her an email that explains how to look up providers and other general info in the email about what is covered and what''s not. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-08 12:12:04', '2021-03-08 12:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064775003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064735014', 'Lily Valentine', NULL, '3-8-21 Lily is 23 and needs own ins since she''s independent and filing own taxes. No longer dependent of parents. Living on own as well but working PT and doesn''t get ins through company. Also in school. She''s healthy, no meds, no tobacco. Earns $22.37 per hour. Expects to earn about 29 hrs on avg. per week and can''t qualify for benefits from employer. Her hours fluctuate with semesters and summer. But, with avg. of 29 hours per week, her income is $33,734 per year which gives her a $15 APTC. Bright Health is the only company that includes her Dr. Karina Gebhart. Full cost is $238.56 or her cost is $223.56. Or reviewing CARE+ for $215/$1000. She will review and let me know. Needs April 1 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-08 12:01:34', '2021-03-08 12:01:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064768018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058319043', 'jordan batchelder', NULL, 'Called and asked about 1095-B, told him he should be getting them any day now as they were sent out from us last week and everywhere else as well as the deadline was March 2nd last week. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-08 11:44:33', '2021-03-08 11:44:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064761061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064088009', 'Evelyn Gavino', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-08 10:59:27', '2021-03-08 10:59:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064766048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167692', 'Andrew (Andy) Ioele', NULL, 'We received this members 1095 mailing back and forwarding address was on envelope.  I updated it with Planstin &amp; will update in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-08 10:54:04', '2021-03-08 10:54:04'),
