  ('zcrm_1579374000064761053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001608001', 'Carlos Matamoros', NULL, 'Email verification sent to register with Cirrus MD.  Tried to reach out to Carlos for welcome call but no response. Left detailed message on voicemail. Also Kelly sent out email to book online. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-08 09:53:01', '2021-03-08 09:58:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064768013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, 'Robin called in and asked who she needs to call to submit a claim as this is her first time. She knows that she is about to go over her IUA and just needs to know where to go from there. I explained how it works and told her to give Sedera a call and provided her with their phone number and sending email as well. Lastly she asked if I could send her a list of OBGYN''s in her area for a Preventative visit. I will send both emails to her after I find a list of providers in her area. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-08 09:39:43', '2021-03-08 09:39:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064768008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001608001', 'Carlos Matamoros', NULL, 'Carlos called and said that this is his first time calling in and wanting to use his plan. He said he needs to see a doctor ASAP as his has some health concerns. I asked him if he has had his Welcome Call and he said no he hasn''t been able to do that yet as he has been very busy with work. He asked if he HAS to have that first call to be able to see a doctor. I said no he doesn''t necessarily have to have that call to start using his plan but we highly suggest that he does because the Welcome Call is very important and it goes over everything with his plan and how it works and what he needs to do to use everything included. I told him I will send him the Welcome Call scheduler right now and he will be able to have one at least sometime this week. He said if he there is nothing available ASAP than he regardless needs to see a doctor and will need help. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-08 09:04:34', '2021-03-08 09:04:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064774003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063826008', 'Dwight McKinney', NULL, '3/8/21 Member called concerning a covid testing place.  She also wanted to know what e-mail we had for her because she wants to get into her portal. I gave member all needed information so she could get in.  Member needs to set up a welcome call.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-03-08 08:48:25', '2021-03-08 10:20:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064766018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176323', 'Maribel Melendez', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I refunded her the March pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-08 07:58:06', '2021-03-08 07:58:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064761048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063270012', 'Caroline Eller', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-08 07:56:27', '2021-03-08 07:56:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064766013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549155', 'Joshua Brewer', NULL, 'Member called in at the direction of Sedera to ask about possibly adding his wife to the plan since they are contemplating a pregnancy.  I explained the waiting period and relationship between Sedera &amp; MPowering.  I also told him that we would need to know prior to the 20th of the month.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-08 07:37:24', '2021-03-08 07:37:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064768003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238233', 'Michelle McCaster', NULL, 'There was a Ticket open for Michelle. Called and wanted to make an appointment for Lab work today. I let her know that she has Redirect and anything medical and appointments are going to be through them. Gave her Redirect''s phone number. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-08 07:31:39', '2021-03-08 07:31:39'),
