  ('zcrm_1579374000064761038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176323', 'Maribel Melendez', NULL, 'I spoke with Patti....she told me where to find the cancellation form online.  I called Maribel back and guided her to the form.  She was thankful. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-05 18:08:30', '2021-03-05 18:08:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064761033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176323', 'Maribel Melendez', NULL, 'sent to Patti via TEAMS- 
    Patti, please call Maribel Melendez as soon as possible....she though you had cancelled her last month....you DID send her a cancellation form but she doesn''t have access to that email address......so I sent her two more cancellation forms to a new email address that she gave me....she was unable to receive either of them and I stayed on the phone with her for 10 minutes.  she is begging for at least one $50 refund, and she is hoping that she can cancel over the phone....she even asked if it was possible to cancel through the MPB.Health portal!  she is trying!  I told her that if she didn''t hear from you tonight or over the weekend that she would definitely hear back from you on Monday. Thanks!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-05 17:45:05', '2021-03-05 17:45:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064761028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575116', 'Rasheryl McCreary', NULL, 'called to cancel- sent cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-05 16:09:01', '2021-03-05 16:09:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064761023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'sent Sedera needs submission form after Kimberly told me that she has to go in for ANOTHER mammogram and possible ultrasound.  I explained to Kim that she should NOT present her RCI card for these new tests....that it will only hinder her needs process if it ends up going over her IUA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-05 16:06:28', '2021-03-05 16:06:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064761018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, 'called to ask if telling the government she was "uninsured" was ok in regards to getting a Covid vaccine.  I told her that it was.  She also told me that her daughter had to go to the ER twice at the tune of $400 and she was wondering if she needed to call us first so that we could negotiate down the cost.  I told her that we do not negotiate down prices on her behalf- with her current plan that is what Sedera will do for her after she has paid $500 for a medical need.   She understood....I am sending her a Sedera needs sharing template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-05 15:03:51', '2021-03-05 15:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064748013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919617', 'Heather Davies', NULL, 'Heather called and asked why she got a bill from her annual wellness visit back in November for a veinipuncture. She stated that this is something that should be covered through Planstin due to it being preventative. I told her to give Planstin a call and speak with them about this as we are not the ones that pay for anything. Gave her Planstin''s phone number and she is calling them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-05 14:31:50', '2021-03-05 14:31:50'),
