  ('zcrm_1579374000064759034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005454035', 'William Valentine', NULL, '3-5-21 Just chose to keep their Friday Health Silver X Plan moving forward at $1361.34 price for the two of them. Kids will need to join their employee insurance. She chose to keep plan in order to keep doctors and meds at no cost. Going with Bright Health or anything else may have disrupted their current scenario with Dr. Anthony Christoff, Dr. Dlugos and Dr. Andrea Lerch.  However, she hasn''t seen Dr. Lerch in a while. Also has drug oxycab... something that she''s worried will be expensive. They are getting it at no cost now, which makes me believe it''s a generic. But, she didn''t know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-05 13:42:59', '2021-03-05 13:47:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064761013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063270012', 'Caroline Eller', NULL, 'missed welcome call- left a vm and another welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-05 13:07:10', '2021-03-05 13:07:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064759026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054126', 'Santiago Mussi Tiscornia', NULL, '3-5-21 Santiago and Maggie are interested in SECURE or CARE+ to also add wife and 3 month old baby to the membership. She''s currently on Anthem plan now through work and paying $750 even with company paying 50%! They don''t do annual wellness visits but baby will need to. Open to paying for those on their own as self-pay. Dr. Carey Levin doesn''t show in network but Dr. Rebecca Percy shows up. They only have 2 drs. at practice, so likely they accept PHCS for both at Castle Valley Children''s Clinic in Carbondale.  Maggie will talk with her employer and see if they''ll put the $ towards a retirement account instead of towards health insurance. They know the March 19th deadline and will call me when they know more in order to move forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-05 12:43:01', '2021-03-05 12:43:53'),
