  ('zcrm_1579374000064759018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '3-5-21 He''s not confused, just wanted to make sure he needed to sign all of the forms and such. He''s considering taking the vaccine even though he thinks he already got covid. However, he''s clearly been reading and learning about it all and is a bit hesitant about the vaccine. Doesn''t believe he''ll need to decide until this summer and will keep an eye on it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-05 12:04:48', '2021-03-05 12:08:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064759013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '3-5-21 From KC to Me, "Charles Korb called me to tell me that his plan is too confusing and we should simplify it.  hahaha!  I assured him that he was on the most straight forward plan that we offer!  but he just wanted to let me know!  lol  he was confused that Redirect was ACTUALLY doing their job and sending him the release forms from Sedera.  I told him that HE NEEDED to fill them out.  He''s cute....he told me that I should open my own consulting business!    I told him that I would let you know his thoughts on this!" Calling him now...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-05 11:56:45', '2021-03-05 11:56:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064742042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746228', 'Tanya Hodder', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-05 11:55:17', '2021-03-05 11:55:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064742034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009474065', 'J. Vance Andersen PLC', NULL, 'Member emailed in asking for his 1095 from the 1/20-9/20 time period.  I emaile dhtat to him and advisedt hat he did not have to wait to file.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-05 11:37:07', '2021-03-05 11:37:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064759008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091058', 'Clayton Coulter', NULL, '3-5-21 Allison needs to decide if she wants to keep her current job at 30 hrs per week. She''s not sure she wants to. They are considering setting up their farm biz as a Corporation for tax purposes. She should have more answers about work in a week or so. She knows the deadline and is leaning towards the $500/$1000 SECURE option with HSA. Will let me know once she has more answers.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-05 11:10:15', '2021-03-05 11:10:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064759003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005454035', 'William Valentine', NULL, '3-5-21 Spoke with Sharon and updated income. But, learned both kids are independent and given choice of ins through employer. So, we had to remove both kids with the help of Jennika at C4. Income is $85K which is too high for APTC and removal of kids put them over threshold for subsidy. Since lost APTC system is allowing them to choose a new plan. But, they will want to keep their doctors. New cost will be $1361.34 if keep Friday Health Plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-05 11:01:45', '2021-03-05 11:01:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064742029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746209', 'James Sewell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-05 10:47:34', '2021-03-05 10:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064755008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005455075', 'Linda Doremus', NULL, '3/5/21 Member called because she has not recieved a card as of yet with Zion.  I called Zion and they said they sent it October 20th.  they will re-send a copy today digitally and also mail a copy today.  Member also wanted to research some physicians to see if they were in net-work so I gave directions on how to do that.  dP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-03-05 10:37:45', '2021-03-05 10:37:45'),
