  ('zcrm_1579374000064738008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132148', 'Rhoda Goff', 'Reconciliation Process', 'Upon reviewing the Sedera Reconciliation I found this member on their detail Invoice of I-061052.  Upon further investigation, Patti B discovered that this member signed up with Sedera on Jan 5,2021 and then also signed up with SECURE on Jan 11.

