  ('zcrm_1579374000064755003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '3/4/21 Miriah called concerning an appointment...virtual..with a physician out of network.  She received a bill of 202.00 and wanted to know who would pay it.  I asked if she went through Re-direct.   I told her to call Re-direct to discuss this particuliar issue with them.  Re-direct made this appointment for her is what she told me.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-03-05 10:01:27', '2021-03-15 13:18:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064742019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746052', 'Shirley Grigsby', NULL, 'Shirley is an existing member whose spouse has aged into Medicare.  She is now in the plan as a single  Member Only $1000 IUA MPB Conversion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-05 08:52:10', '2021-03-05 08:52:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064748008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Melissa called in and asked me to double check 2 facilities and her provider are in the PHCS Network and that she is trying to schedule a colonoscopy appointment with the first facility that both me and Michele looked up for Melissa and they are saying they have never heard of her "insurance". I asked her what name she told them and she said MPBHealth. She should have just given her RCI card info and phone number to call and verify benefits. She then told me to try and avoid all this back and forth, that her advisor Rick Willard emailed her (she was reading the email to me over the phone) stating that the MPB Concierge can help and make the appointments for her.  I told her that I am very sorry her said that but that is incorrect and I do not know why he keeps telling members this. We can not make the appointments for legal reasons. It''s not because we don''t want to help but it is a violation of HIPPA compliance. I will send her a few emails confirming facilities she gave me on in the PHCS Network and HealthGrades lookup info I will find. Will be all set after I send emails. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-05 08:35:23', '2021-03-05 08:35:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064748003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779251', 'Michael Massarelli', NULL, 'Micheal called and stated that Jan Capodi told him to call into here to help him with his bills that he has now gotten in regards to illness. He said that he knows he has to pay $1500 first but added up all the bills he has so far, and he knows there is more coming, and they are more that $1500 so far. I explained he is next to contact Sedera and open up a Need with them. Michael then said he has already done that. What I told him to do then is to call Sedera and tell them he has opened up a Need already and needs to speak to his Needs coordinator to add more bills and that with the bills he has so far will be over his IUA so he will need them to step in and share the remainder and future bills that he knows are coming. I gave Sedera''s phone number. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-05 08:17:24', '2021-03-05 08:17:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064742008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, 'Will be cancelling this member as I have not received any response from him or advisor about non payment. notified Sedera via Outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-05 08:07:02', '2021-03-05 08:18:13'),
