﻿1-800-519-2969 ext 1008', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-04 17:49:16', '2021-03-04 17:49:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064691033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062264001', 'James Sewell', NULL, 'James wanted to sign up for this plan earlier...but he could not due to other personal issues.  Now he is requesting that he be put on the plan ASAP- maybe even jump onto CirrusMD only so that he can request medications. - I have let Patti know to give him a phone call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-04 16:27:11', '2021-03-04 16:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064691028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480033', 'Christopher Walzer', NULL, 'I helped Kathy with some Fair price graphs on liver ultrasound from HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-04 16:24:50', '2021-03-04 16:24:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064691023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083146', 'Paul Goin', NULL, 'called and left a message- Zion doesn''t have him in their system and he was calling them about his upcoming shoulder surgery.  He spoke with Kelly but forgot to mention HCBB Care Connect Team.   I asked him to give me a call so I can at least let him know what is going on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-04 15:09:37', '2021-03-04 15:09:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064714008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083146', 'Paul Goin', NULL, 'Paul called and said that he tried submitting a claim for needing shoulder surgery with Zion and Zion told him his is not a member and not covered for this. They then transferred him to Planstin, which he does NOT have, and Planstin told him as well he is not a member. Paul called me and is very confused on why this was said to him when he very clearly DOES have Zion. He has the Worksite-Bridge plan which is ONLY Zion NOT Planstin at all. I called Zion and relayed the info and Brie from Zion pulled him up and said the same thing that what they have on file for him is the Planstin Preventative HSA Plan. I told her that is wrong and not what he has. In fact he does not have Planstin at all and only has Zion. She did not know what to do and neither do I. I told Brie that I will speak with John Kach here my group admin and in the dept. that deals with type of situation. Relayed to John and KellyAnne is going to take over from here for me as I am heading out for the day and she said she would need to speak to him regardless about Health Care Blue Book Care Connect Team program for his shoulder surgery because anytime a member is having any type of surgery over $5,000 they need to go through HCBB Care Connect Team anyway. KellyAnne will call him shortly, 100% today he will get a call back because he is very anxious about this and called me back twice since I have gotten off the phone with Zion. Will check in on this tomorrow morning 3/5/21. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-04 15:08:39', '2021-03-04 15:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064714003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691178', 'Christine Paretta', NULL, 'Called asking about her 1095-B form. Told her to look in her mail sometime next week as I just sent it out in the mail on Monday March 2nd. She also said she has not had her Welcome Call and will be scheduling it next week and asked if it is OK that she is doing it so late because she is so healthy and never goes to the doctor but still wants to know what to do just in case something happens. I said Ok course!! We highly recommend to do the Welcome Calls and there is no time limit on when to have it just as long as you have it before you make any appointments. She said of course she just wanted to make sure it wasn''t too late. She seems very very nice and always making sure everything is correct and doing the right thing. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-04 15:01:24', '2021-03-04 15:01:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064711003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, '3-4-21 Tam and Ken are both 53 now. Live in Louisville. They are using One Share Health and they aren''t thrilled about it. Ken has his annual physical around April 19th and recently Dr. Marcie Lavigne isn''t in network for OneShare Health. However, Dr. Marcie Lavigne shows up in the PHCS network and is at Coal Creek Family Practice here in Louisville. They are both 1099 contract workers. They have 3 kids 18, 20, 22. They are filing all of them as independents this year. They are in college or out. But, if the insurance is expensive I gave them the CARE+ price for the kids $215/$1000. One is going to school in Indiana. So, that might be affordable. Tam has thyroid issue and takes super cheap synthroid. No other health issues for either. They just joined with SECURE for $1000/$500. I will send them overview email as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-04 13:44:43', '2021-03-04 13:48:00'),
