  ('zcrm_1579374000064709003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '3.4.21:  Called Kevin.  He''s decided to change his provider and have Dr. Brooks do the Sx.  Zion said they would pay for the previous Sx bundle.  They also said they would pay up to 25,000 for the Sx.  I told  he has to find out what his new Sx bundle will be so Zion can pay it.  They sent him an email with those questions.  He forwarded it to the Scheduler at Dr. Brook''s office.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-04 12:39:08', '2021-03-04 12:39:08'),
