  ('zcrm_1579374000064691008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004737145', 'Shai Lothan', NULL, 'Shai''s wife reached out to me to ask what the $50 charge was on her account...she said that Shai had left Liberty a year ago.  She asked about a refund.  I told her that Shai would need to fill  out the cancellation form and he may request a refund, but that it will be up to Patti Baron in cancellations to determine whether or not MPB.Health will offer any sort of refund. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-04 11:15:40', '2021-03-04 11:15:40'),
