  ('zcrm_1579374000064634053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084284', 'Karen Quigley', NULL, 'explained her IUA with Sedera as well as I could...but she had further questions about her MULTIPLE skin cancer legions and whether Sedera would consider them to be collectively ONE NEED.  - I did transfer Karen to Sedera to get that question answered.  Karen was also wondering why her specialist visit wasn''t a "covered" expense by her co-pay plan.....so I sent an email to Jennifer Chasteen and tagged Karen in it to ask Jennifer to please look into this on Karen''s behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-03 16:28:31', '2021-03-03 16:28:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064634048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356101', 'Jonathan Webster', NULL, 'Maggie wanted to know the new price of Jonathan''s plan...withOUT her on it.  I told her that I would ask Patti to reach out to her first thing in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-03 16:19:44', '2021-03-03 16:19:44'),
