  ('zcrm_1579374000064631033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165373', 'Dieter Bruhn', NULL, '3-3-21 Dieter is going to Vietnam for 3 months and wants to make sure Zion will work internationally. I confirmed via vm that it does and he just needs to submit bills in English and USD. He should be all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-03 16:14:38', '2021-03-03 16:14:38'),
