  ('zcrm_1579374000064631023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064627039', 'Danny Fonseca', NULL, '3-3-21 Danny chose to go with Christian Healthshare Ministries for their EF $560 mo/$500 IUA. Told him to make sure he reads the guidelines and understands the limitations. They chose plan without a cap on sharing, but no annual wellness checks. They are happy, so that''s all I can do. Nice and appreciative of my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-03 14:08:18', '2021-03-03 14:08:18'),
