-KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-03 12:49:29', '2021-03-03 12:49:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064614027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Maurine called in asking about her 1095-B and when she will be getting that, I told her I literally just physically sent out the one from Planstin with the 3 months on it yesterday and the other one with the remainder of her coverage will be coming from RCI any day now as the deadline for being sent out was yesterday March 2nd 2021. She also had a few questions about a procedure she is going in to have of Scalp Cysts Skin Lesion Removal. She wanted to know if I have any sort of list with pricing for that because she was given a price from her doctor already and wanted to compare the price. I told her I can certainly look that up for her on HCBB. I did and the price I found was more expensive than the price she was given by her doctor by a few hundred buck too. She also wanted to know is there is anywhere for her to upload her bills if in the future something more comes of it and she needs to continue to have more appointments and will need help after paying her IUA. I told her yes and to upload her bills into Zion''s portal and sent her the email on how to do so. Lastly she asked what he username, password, and member ID is to get into her Member Portal on out website. I gave her all that info and she logged in while on the phone with me. She was extremely happy with all the help from me today and she stated I answered all of her questions with ease and she very very much enjoys this plan and all the help she gets from us always phenomenal. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-03 12:40:40', '2021-03-03 12:40:40'),
