  ('zcrm_1579374000064614022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047519198', 'Theodore Hsu', NULL, 'Rachel called in and said that her husband never got the prescription coupons that were sent by me Feb 19th. I resent the email and then she called back and said that the coupons for Kroger that I sent are way too far from her. The closest Kroger is 87 miles away. So while I was on the phone with her I went over the different pharmacies and coupon pricing for both her prescriptions and sent her, not her husband, the coupons she choose. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-03 12:15:37', '2021-03-03 12:15:37'),
