  ('zcrm_1579374000064631003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '3-3-21 Kerek called bc he''s traveling to AK and needs to complete a form on gov site asking for insurance information. He''s doesn''t have MEC so I told him to say self-pay and no ID #, etc. He thinks that will suffice. He will just have to take covid test for arrival in AK, etc. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-03 10:45:25', '2021-03-03 10:45:25'),
