  ('zcrm_1579374000064614008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', NULL, 'Marguerite called and said that back in October she had a procedure done during her preventative appointment and RCI has told her that she will get reimbursed for that but they are waiting for information from us. So she called into here to see what to do. I did not know what RCI could possibly need from us so I got Patti and she said that we just paid RCI and everything should be good to go. Patti told me to transfer Marguerite back to her so I did. As Patti was speaking with her Jennifer from RCI was calling me specifically about this situation with Marguerite. I told Jennifer that I would speak with Michele who is the current accountant and she is as we speak checking to make sure that they were in fact paid. I told Jennifer I will give her a call back. Once we figure out that RCI has been paid then Jennifer can pay Marguerite and all will be said and done. I will call all parties back when I have all the info I need. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-03 08:39:04', '2021-03-03 08:39:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064614003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046884055', 'Tracy Roye', NULL, 'Franklin called in and said that he just got off the phone with Planstin and they are saying he is not in the system with them. I pulled Franklin up here and it says he had no MEC. I put him on hold and spoke to John Kach because he is their advisor and John said that is a mistake and he DOES have a MEC it just needs to be fixed by Patti. But as for Planstin he is going to send out the bill in about an hour and contact Planstin to get it all squared away. I told Franklin this and he then said "Well what do I do now because my wife is at the doctor right now and I need my Preventative information now". I told John this and now this is going to be a problem. He should NOT have made an appointment so early in the month and we advise to  not make appointment until the middle of the month because that is how long it takes for everything to go through and for members to get cards and information for appointments. Franklin interrupted me and started screaming at me saying "NO NO NO THAT IS NOT TRUE!!! When I spoke with John a few weeks ago I told him that my wife had an appointment and he told me that was Ok!!! So don''t you dare tell me I have to wait until the middle of the month!!" He was VERY rude to me and yelling at me saying I am a liar and that is not what John told him. I said Ok no problem we are going to have to call you back because we have to call Planstin right now and figure this out. He said OK! and hung up. John called Planstin and someone at Planstin is calling Franklin right now with the info he needs. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-03 08:34:57', '2021-03-03 08:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064605013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059881171', 'Hazar Habbab', 'New Plan eff 3/1/21', 'Member Only $1000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-03 08:20:17', '2021-03-03 08:20:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064605008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191454', 'Jennifer McMahon', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel.  I sent out link and advised of time frame', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-03 08:18:56', '2021-03-03 08:18:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064605003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059881171', 'Hazar Habbab', NULL, 'Member finally submitted correct form to remove spouse from plan due to aging into Medicare.  I will notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-03 08:08:17', '2021-03-03 08:08:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064565033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, 'Sarah called in for a mini refresher on Zion/her preventative care benefits/ and a reminder on how to login to HCBB.  I went over and then sent her all of the information. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-02 17:55:54', '2021-03-02 17:55:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064565028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, 'called to get more info on setting up an HSA account- I emailed her our templates.  Also wanted more information on the dental plan info that Wendy sent her- I told her that she would need to speak to Wendy- Silvina declined a transfer to Wendy and told me that she will call Wendy directly after she looks at the information more. -- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-02 17:23:33', '2021-03-02 17:23:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064565023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'see ticket! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-02 16:38:28', '2021-03-02 16:38:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064565018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497204', 'Charles Strother', NULL, 'Charles called to cancel- I sent him the online cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-02 16:30:27', '2021-03-02 16:30:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064565013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964297', 'Brooke Bangart', NULL, 'helped brook find fair price information off of HCBB for screening mammogram and unilateral breast ultrasound.  emailed her all of the information and reminded her that she does have this service and gave her the link and login instructions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-02 14:42:47', '2021-03-02 14:42:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064565008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Ann called me today about a very large unopened needs case that her son has totaling over $16,000 for GI distress when her son was visiting the Keyes.  She told me that Michele told her to call the concierge team if she needed help....and when my advice was "you need to open up a needs case with Sedera and give Sedera a phone call" she asked what it was that we actually did here.  I explained.  I sent her the Sedera needs template, I explained that she needed to call Sedera right away.....so that they could start negotiating all of the costs down on her behalf.  Ann.....decided to TRY to do that on her own....even giving the hospital her RCI card because they were demanding payment.  Again, I told her that if this happens in the future...she doesn''t need to do any of that on her own....she just needs to call Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-02 13:09:55', '2021-03-02 13:09:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064528038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064530083', 'Jake Smithknecht', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-02 12:03:10', '2021-03-02 12:03:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064565003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, 'called and left a message because she was on our website trying to find a welcome call scheduler. I noticed that the original welcome call scheduler had bounced- so I resent the email.  This email hasn''t bounced back yet....I told Linda to call me and let me know if we have her email address wrong and I also let her know to try looking for the newly sent email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-02 11:53:13', '2021-03-02 11:53:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064528027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218052', 'Michele Collins', NULL, 'Member finally filled out the cancellation form I advised that I could give her a 4/1 cancel date.  I will notify Sedera (via Outlook) &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-02 11:46:08', '2021-03-02 11:51:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064555013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '3-2-21 Talked with Etta and she just learned that she''s pregnant! She has her first appt in a week or two at All Valley Women''s Care. She doesn''t know if there are any birthing centers nearby. I gave her Sedera''s # to call to gain assistance with the process of that. Told her they are in TX and might be delayed due to the power outages and covid. She wants to get tested for antibodies with covid. Told her to call Concierge for help with that. Also she had major challenges with Redirect for her one annual wellness visit. I suggested she download and use the Spruce app to make all of that way better! She had never used the app and will do so. I also told her about the IUA scenarios for maternity. Told her about VAERS site in regards to vaccine and pregnancy. She is Not planning to get the vaccine.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-02 11:27:28', '2021-03-02 11:27:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064538013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064050010', 'Nicole Jenkins', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-02 11:19:37', '2021-03-02 11:19:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064555008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '3-2-21 Called bc she thought I said there''s another membership that will give her access to specialists. I left her a vm and told he she had the most comprehensive membership at this time. Specialist visits will count towards the IUA if she needs to see one for a new Need. Told her to call me and I will explain further.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-02 10:37:55', '2021-03-02 10:37:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064528016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218052', 'Michele Collins', NULL, 'I received a email from this member letting me know that she is having a hard time accessing the Cancellation form.  I emailed her back the directions to get form thru the website .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-02 10:16:18', '2021-03-02 10:16:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115309', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '3-2-21 Jeni doesn''t like the Per Incident IUA, would rather everything works towards 1 AUA. However, she Loves the idea of virtual healthcare since that will likely take care of most of her issues. She usually just needs a diagnosis and then she''s on her way to naturopathic doctors and now understands self-pay. She''s W2 employee at new job and 1099 with her own biz and own clients. She''s 90% certain she will change her membership. She can lower her IUA to $1000 and lower her monthly to $275 for SECURE and she now understands value of HSA and that she doesn''t have to use up the money every year. She doesn''t have any pre-x to report. She does like to get her skin checked every year. Also wants to get her finances in order. Once she had a plan, she''s great at sticking with it. Her only debt is her mortgage. She wants to buy another house and needs a plan in place to do so. She did a juice fast for 70 days! Once she sets her mind to something she''s great at committing.  She wants suggestions for budgeting tools for our discussion in April.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-02 09:25:40', '2021-03-02 09:25:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064538008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746228', 'Tanya Hodder', NULL, '03.01.21:  Returned Tanya''s call.  Interested in possibility of one of our plans for herself.  Switching jobs and may need less expensive coverage.  Had insurance w/old company.  New company''s insurance is too expensive.  Age 59 - not pre-x conditions.  No DPC.  Explained the 3 plan options. Sent her click funnel link to review plans again before we further discuss.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-03-02 08:39:59', '2021-03-02 08:39:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064538003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062875001', 'Forrest Messenger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-02 08:19:08', '2021-03-02 08:19:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064528008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064530035', 'Karen Harris', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-02 08:18:44', '2021-03-02 08:18:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064528003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356101', 'Jonathan Webster', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove spouse from the plan I will notify Zion and change pricing in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-02 07:54:50', '2021-03-02 07:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064521003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961236', 'Shannon Leibfried', NULL, 'Member opened a ticket to make pmt over the phone.  I emailed her back and let her know that she would have to submit Payment update form.  I sent it out to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-02 07:25:16', '2021-03-02 07:25:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064050010', 'Nicole Jenkins', NULL, 'Email verification sent for Cirrus MD registration. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-02 06:39:38', '2021-03-02 06:39:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062875001', 'Forrest Messenger', NULL, 'Email verification sent for registration with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-02 06:37:23', '2021-03-02 06:37:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919617', 'Heather Davies', NULL, 'see ticket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 16:37:41', '2021-03-01 16:37:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091058', 'Clayton Coulter', NULL, '3-1-21 Allison is 28 and husband is 30. She found MPB via an online search and was comparing it to Medishare that she''d already learned about. She''s not a huge fan of the ACA and really likes the idea of a co-op. She''s self employed with their own sweet corn farm biz. They looked at ACA plans which are about $600 month with an $8500 ded. They are healthy, no smoking, no meds. Live in IL. Understands value of self-pay! Was super intrigued by the HSA compliance compared to Medishare that doesn''t have that. We will talk again on Friday after she figures out what''s happening with her current employer. She has great coverage through them right now but wants to quit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 16:25:19', '2021-03-01 16:25:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'Caterina called to confirm her Planstin benefits with us- I explained that she would need to speak with Planstin- she told me that she had their number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 16:19:18', '2021-03-01 16:19:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893285', 'Gina Hodgson', NULL, 'Gina just opened up a Zion needs request, but I recommended that she speak with Zion about her maternity benefits- I direct transferred the line to them for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 16:18:27', '2021-03-01 16:18:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291686', 'Craig Frithsen', NULL, 'called to get an explanation of the 1095 B form- explained that we are getting it out to him as fast as we can and explained that he does not have to file it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 16:04:19', '2021-03-01 16:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, 'called about her 1095 B form- told her that she will just have to wait for it and reminded her that it DOES NOT need to be filed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 16:03:18', '2021-03-01 16:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893285', 'Gina Hodgson', NULL, 'missed call when I was on a welcome call- called back and left a message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 15:58:28', '2021-03-01 15:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779506', 'Susan Weiner', NULL, 'see ticket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 15:54:19', '2021-03-01 15:54:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356101', 'Jonathan Webster', NULL, 'Maggie called to remove herself from the plan- so I sent her the online member change form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 15:39:45', '2021-03-01 15:39:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063644001', 'Carlos Galvin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  He wants to start using WHLC right away!  I will let Joan know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 15:30:39', '2021-03-01 15:30:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Looks like new price should be $625 from $550 now that he''s in 50-59 age category. Also needs to show ES not EO.  Left vm for Patti to fix CRM.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 15:06:37', '2021-03-01 15:06:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, 'Missed welcome call.....sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 14:07:04', '2021-03-01 14:07:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064456065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485451', 'Bernhard Donaubauer', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-01 14:05:37', '2021-03-01 14:05:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, 'sent Cat Zion''s contact information and needs submission form link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 14:05:27', '2021-03-01 14:05:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064456060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485435', 'Curtiss Newell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-01 14:02:50', '2021-03-01 14:02:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064627039', 'Danny Fonseca', NULL, '3-1-21 Danny is W2 employee and offered insurance for $1600 mo! Therefore, they don''t have insurance at this time. Marissa works PT as W2. They live in Utah and don''t do any crazy activities, sports, so they aren''t worried about not having insurance for the month of March. No pre-x other than one boy has ear tubes. Kids are 7, 4, 1. Marissa just takes birth control and no other meds, no tobacco, no health issues. They qualify for CARE+ membership $1000/$550. With price difference they are willing to pay for wellness visits as self-pay patients and see whoever they choose. OK with all of that! Meeting again in 2 days to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 13:19:15', '2021-03-01 15:28:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064469029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 912 
Question : can someone assist me with submitting a medical bill into my healthshare?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-03-01 13:13:08', '2021-03-01 13:13:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115309', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '3-1-21 Jennifer just moved to new age band. I sent her an email to see if she wants to explore other options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 12:32:15', '2021-03-01 12:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189229', 'Gemma Lynn Davis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Member had thought that Jeff had signed up her new infant son on the plan back in Aug of last year- transferred the line to Patti after the welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 12:31:44', '2021-03-01 12:31:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485451', 'Bernhard Donaubauer', NULL, '3-1-21 Bernhard is enrolling now for SECURE $1000/$275. Non-tobacco, healthy lifestyle. Likes the Principles of Membership.  Super nice! He was allowed to have German insurance for two periods of 10 years. But, now since he''s lived here for 20 years he can no longer access insurance through Germany. He''s all set to go and happy to be on board and appreciates my help!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 12:15:13', '2021-03-01 12:28:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '3-1-21 Sally and Pete are Almost ready to move to SECURE. She was ready to go after answering many questions. However, I encouraged her to contact Pete''s doctor to make sure there aren''t any potential for issues since Pete had his gall bladder removed in 2020. She''s also working to get her wellness visit recoded as wellness not diagnostic for $65 blood panel, $50 random fee that she can''t tell what it''s for and another pathology fee for pap screening. She''s going to talk with doctor and billing department to get that corrected. She knows of March 19th deadline to enroll in SECURE $1000/$495 and will cancel current membership. Had been having major struggles with Redirect and now understands their value to pay for wellness, PCP and chiro. So, working with them now through Spruce app. Again, will call me back when ready to make the switch. I told her I can waive $100 but not the $25.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 12:00:53', '2021-03-01 12:00:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064472008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045774028', 'Traci McCoid', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-03-01 11:34:57', '2021-03-01 11:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115309', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '3-1-21 Reviewed Nov commissions and missing payment for Jennifer in Nov. 2020 with move to Admin 123.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 11:32:50', '2021-03-01 11:32:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165428', 'Sharon Valentine', NULL, '3-1-21 Now wants to switch ins bc got FT job and had to pay back APTC for 2020! I sent her email explanation for choices or lackthereof.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 11:25:49', '2021-03-01 11:25:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064489003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'sent welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-03-01 10:39:31', '2021-03-01 10:39:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064487003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '2-16-21 I explained to Joy the MEC and DPC and why she won''t receive the 1095-B from Aug. onward. Explained that there''s no penalty and that she now has the best membership for her personal needs. Sedera was eliminating the MEC and costs were increasing for less benefits. Therefore, chose DPC to gain basic needs protection and partnered with Zion to keep costs down. She''s turning 60 in April 2021 so price would dramatically increase if stayed up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-03-01 10:24:18', '2021-03-01 10:25:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064456052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '2/16 close of business member submitted Change form to add 2 sons to plan eff 3/1/21  I emailed Planstin info.   Also will charge member additional $220 for March &amp; change plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-01 10:19:38', '2021-03-01 10:20:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064456029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768391', 'Srinivasa Reddibathuni', NULL, 'Received notice that members 3/21 Pmt declined.  I sent out final notice and tried to contact via phone unable to reach.  Also forwarded to Mike Montes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-03-01 08:45:09', '2021-03-01 08:47:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064480003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152005', 'Krista Barker', NULL, 'Krista called in and said that she really hurt her knee and asked where she should start. I told her that we always recommend to start with your primary care doctor. I explained to her what she needs to do since this is something injury/illness related. I will email her Sedera''s contact info with How To Start A Need Process as well. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-03-01 08:34:56', '2021-03-01 08:34:56');
