  ('zcrm_1579374000064385072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485451', 'Bernhard Donaubauer', NULL, '2-26-21 Talking with him on Monday at noon to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-26 14:54:42', '2021-02-26 14:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064411048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'sent multiplan nomination link per Wendy.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-26 14:47:59', '2021-02-26 14:47:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064411038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, 'Jerry called and said that his wife is having pain in her hip and they think it could possibly be a Torn Labrum. So he was on the multiplan site and was asking what to do. I explained to him that he does not need to be using that site and it is for when he needs to find providers in network for his Preventative care. I then explained everything about presenting himself or the wife presenting herself as cash pay patients OR they could use Zion''s PHCS network and get an already negotiated discounted rate that way instead of haggling the price themselves with the provider. He really was just wanting my opinion on what would be the BEST way to go about getting the best fair price. I also let him know that he has Health Care Blue Book but for the first time I will be the one using HCBB. I told him HCBB is for getting actual fair pricing for specific procedures. So once they go see a specialist and know what the next step is, like an MRI or a certain X-Ray to call me and we will look up the best fair pricing in their area. Last after I gave him Zion''s phone number to call about looking up providers in their network to get the discounted rate he said he only has gotten a digital copy of their cards and no hard copy. I let him know to ask while he is on the phone with them AND I will shoot a message over to someone on Slack to get the cards out to them ASAP because they will need them very soon for his wife''s appointment. Jerry called back a few minutes after we got off the phone and asked if they need to show any information when they go and get their COVID Vaccines because now in CO they are giving the vaccine to people 50 years old and up. I said no they do NOT show anything and it will be FREE. CO is NOT charging people for the vaccine at any stores so they are all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-26 14:24:33', '2021-02-26 14:24:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064411033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311363', 'Mindy Cominiello', NULL, 'Had 2 missed calls from Mindy or whomever has the phone number on this account that came up. I called back and the call was ignored twice, after 1 or 2 rings and then went to voicemail so my calls were ignored. I left a voicemail stating I got 2 missed calls from that number and am just returning their calls, gave my number and said to give a call back. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-26 13:55:43', '2021-02-26 13:55:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064411028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Great new members! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-26 13:28:27', '2021-02-26 13:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064385064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064401013', 'Sarah Nolan', NULL, '2-26-21 They are enrolled in Oscar Health for 1/1/21. Pregnant and due in Aug. 2021. Wanting to  understand benefits at that point.  From me to Sarah, " It''s showing me the full cost for the two of you will be $471.33 for your Oscar Silver HDHP. Right now you are paying $287.56.  I believe you have to wait until they are born. They will backdate the coverage to the official DOB."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-26 13:03:47', '2021-02-26 15:13:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064386033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '2.26.21:  Called Kevin to f/u.  He''s working on scheduling his Sx w/Dr. Axel Anderson in St. Cloud, FL.  He told me Jami told him Zion is willing to pay the fee directly to provider and Kevin just has to pay his I.U.A.   I have a call in to Jami to confirm this.  In the meantime, Kevin is sending Zion receipts for his Cxs that he paid.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-02-26 12:53:48', '2021-02-26 12:53:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064386028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '2.22.21:  Spoke w/Jami. BBCC found a green quality and price provider that would do the Sx for $3380 as a Sx bundle for cash pre-pay.  Although Kevin''s price for Sx is lower than $5000, Jami offered to assist him in getting a Cx w/this new provider and paying his fee to MDSave.  Jami wrote Dr. Lee the following:
  
Hi Dr. Lee,

I had Mr. Popps fax his medical records to me directly, as he was having some issues getting them uploaded to the Zion portal as of this morning.  I am including those in this email, as I know that time is of the essence and the patient is anxiously awaiting formal approval of his need. Please see attached.  

As a side-note, it was determined that this member would not be scheduling his procedure through the CareConnect program, as the total cost for the surgery does not meet pricing requirements for BCC (only procedures above 5K are eligible).  

Though our involvement in this case will be somewhat limited from this point on, I have offered to assist the member in scheduling a consultation with a provider that offers a cash pay bundle deal for the procedure that has been ordered. He will be moving forward with this surgery and submitting as a standard need.

Thanks!
Jami Carswell', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-02-26 12:48:25', '2021-02-26 12:48:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064385059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415357', 'Jill Leonard', NULL, '2-26-21 She has resubmitted information to Patti again and she called her bank and spent 30 min with them checking. There''s no record through US Bank. Now figuring out no communication between Admin123 and FTNI. Patti''s digging further.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-26 12:42:10', '2021-02-26 12:42:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064407041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-26 12:17:58', '2021-02-26 12:17:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064385051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '2-26-21 Jillian asked many questions and feels confident now. We looked up Matthew''s recommended Dr. for colonoscopy in Grand Junction with Dr. William Sheilds, DO, Gastroenterology and he''s showing in PHCS network. She now understands about HSA''s. We found their pediatrician in Glenwood Springs in network. However, we did not find her newer doctor who is with Aspen Valley Hospital in the network. I suggested she ask the Concierge to help her with asking her provider to accept the PHCS network. They already accept Anthem, so should accept PHCS network too.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-26 12:02:18', '2021-02-26 12:04:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064411023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064054011', 'David Williams', NULL, 'David called in and said he has not gotten anything yet from anyone and wanted to know what the deal is. I told him that members usually don''t get anything until the 1st week of their start date. He is a March 1st start date so he should be starting to get info and Welcome Packets from us and Zion shortly. We here are sending out his QR Life code and Welcome packet today 2/26/21 and KellyAnne is sending out the Welcome Email today as well. So he will have a couple of things starting today and should have everything by the 10th of the month from Zion and Planstin. Last David asked if I could look up a provider for him to make an appointment with said provider. I let him know that we do not recommend members to start making appointments until AFTER their start date when they have all their materials and know how to use the program. A.K.A. after having their Welcome Call. Very very important. I told him to please wait and hold off until he gets his Welcome Packets and has his Welcome Call. He didn''t know that he couldn''t make appointments or start using his benefits yet. It''s not even March yet... this seems like an issue. Spoke with KellyAnne about this and she let John Kach know and had John call Michael Montes about what David asked about already wanting to go see a doctor BEFORE his plan even starts. Member is all set though with everything he needed to know. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-26 11:58:11', '2021-02-26 11:58:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064407036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003748040', 'Natalie Lampert', NULL, 'Member requested copy of 1095 to be emailed to them.  I sent .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-26 11:14:08', '2021-02-26 11:14:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064411018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003748040', 'Natalie Lampert', NULL, 'Natalie called in and asked when she could get her 1095-B form for Zion/Planstin because she only got the portion from Sedera and needs the rest of her coverage to do her taxes today. Patti emailed her the 1095 via email since Natalie could not wait until it came in the mail sometime next week. She also wanted to make sure we have her correct mailing address because her billing receipt that she got yesterday had her old address on it. I repeated what is on her profile here in the CRM and that is the CORRECT address. I let Patti know about this and she said she will look into it in Admin123 and make sure going forward Natalie''s billing receipt has her new address on it. Last Natalie asked if the member portal on MPB.Health was up and running yet. I told her I would have Kelly Cheever let her know because she has more knowledge on that as of now and would email her the info she needs to log in and access the portal. All set.-KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-26 10:47:59', '2021-02-26 10:47:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064411013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636535', 'Todd Weintraub', NULL, 'Todd called in and needed to update his payment method, I sent him the payment update form via email. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-26 10:43:54', '2021-02-26 10:43:54'),
