  ('zcrm_1579374000064411003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030509001', 'Mark Murphy', NULL, 'Dyan called and she wanted to know about a list of providers for her Women''s Wellness Visit, Annual Wellness visit, and Mammogram. I let her know that I will look all those up for her and email her my lists along with a few other emails that will explain what she needs to do to make sure everything is covered. While on the phone with me I made sure that she had her RCI card and told her that that is very important to have at appointments for ONLY Preventative Care. Told Dyan about the phone number on the back of the card to verify her benefits and the address where the provider is to send the billing to, NOT us or her, to RCI Directly. All Set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-26 08:51:54', '2021-02-26 08:51:54'),
