  ('zcrm_1579374000064386018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, 'Theresa called in for help with a preventative care mammogram bill, I told her that I would email her Jennifer Chasteen''s contact information.  She also wanted me to explain to her the difference between her RCI card and the Mpowering benefits qr life code card.    I then also sent her instructions on how to set up her life code. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-25 15:46:56', '2021-02-25 15:46:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064385026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415357', 'Jill Leonard', NULL, '2-25-21 Jill''s pmt didn''t go through. I''m leaving her a vm now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-25 15:37:24', '2021-02-25 15:37:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064386013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Ryan Dunlap just called me.  He told me that he and his wife are going through a messy divorce and that it is not his responsibility to be paying for their health care anymore- it was just in the divorce decree today that it is her responsibility to pay on this account.  So.....I just got rid of one email address- and added two new ones per his instructions.  The plan is that I sent the payment update form to both Ryan and Jackie....and he is HOPING that she see''s it and "does the right thing".  I told him that I would let Patti  know what is going on....but in the end....this last months payment will have to be reversed to his account...and her payment information will have to be run for it and for future payments. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-25 15:32:24', '2021-02-25 15:32:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064385021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '2-25-21 Michelle talked with Patti or left vm to add her child. I texted and called but no way to leave vm, same for Patti. VM is full. She thanked me via text and will complete the form online. I gave her until 12:00 MST tomorrow/Friday Feb. 26th to complete for to give Patti enough time to add her before end of day.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-25 15:18:29', '2021-02-25 15:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064382016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064068018', 'Robert Coray', NULL, '4TH QR Life Code for 2nd child Jared: H0T7J. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-25 14:52:21', '2021-02-25 14:52:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064385013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '2-25-21 Joining SECURE $1000/$500 ES April 1st start date. They asked many questions and feel confident now. They came from LHS and went to Anthem. They did finally get paid all of their remaining bills after waiting 6-8 months with LHS. They are definitely wanting to keep their current doctors and both are showing in PHCS in Boulder, Dr. Jeffrey Lewis at UC Health, Dr. Heather Banks UC Health.  Only pre-x is dermatology visits and stuff burned off and hearing test for new tinnitus for David. Ilyse just has osteoporosis and bone density test that she pays for about few hundred bucks.  They understand the pre-x clause. They are also looking to join VSP A or B. They will cancel with C4 and Anthem to cover all bases for March 31st end date.  They asked about the end of life assistance and what that can be used for. I''m inquiring. I assume just burial. UPDATE - Rod says it''s a check to pay for anything.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-25 14:11:10', '2021-02-25 14:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064382008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, 'Rachel called in and asked about the missing months from her 1095-B form. Conversion members, which she is one, are missing a few months on their 1095 forms so she was wondering why that is and if it can be fixed. What we are doing about that is, I am physically going to be mailing those out hopefully starting today or at the latest tomorrow as the deadline to get them out is Tuesday of next week 3/02/21. I also let her know, as I do everyone that calls about their 1095-B, if that they do NOT need to have the form to file their taxes and that the IRS tells people they do NOT want them to file it and it is just for their personal records. She said yes BUT she has to give it to her accountant and needs proof to claim it. Not sure what "It" is but regardless she is satisfied they are being mailed out by next week. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-25 14:02:12', '2021-02-25 14:02:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064375074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042221122', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, 'Spouse called in and said that he had received my email about decline.  For some reason when I updated the new pmt when member aged up acct # got changed.  I put in acct # and reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-25 14:00:29', '2021-02-25 14:00:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064375069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220137', 'Deoni Levy', NULL, 'Was notified by Sedera that dependent will be aging out as he is turning 26.  no adjustment in pricing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-25 13:37:53', '2021-02-25 13:37:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064375061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467623', 'Christopher Bonelli', NULL, 'I submitted to Planstin the request to correct the spelling of spouses name &amp; correction of DOB.  they are correct now in contact.  This is due to Stephen Cox doing enrollment for member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-25 13:30:03', '2021-02-25 13:30:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064375056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045682035', 'Christy Curtis Buss', NULL, 'Member contacted me to let me know that her CC had fraud and that she had a new CC and wanted to give that to me over the phone.  I advised her that I would send out form to her and to get it back to me ASAP and she was very rude to me told me that she was a longtime customer and all her stresses during Covid.  I let her vent and told her to get me that info when she could. Extremely Rude!!!', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-25 13:21:27', '2021-02-25 13:21:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064375051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047519198', 'Theodore Hsu', NULL, 'Members 3/21 payment declined - 1st Notice sent 2/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-25 12:35:28', '2021-02-25 12:35:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064386008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061322074', 'Richard Weinberg', NULL, 'Richard called to ask about dental plans- I explained that he had two options.  One would be that if he waits on the WHLC website to actually work- he can get discount plans through that site for dental and vision.....OR he can give Jane a call and get a discounted insurance program for those things through her.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-25 12:32:42', '2021-02-25 12:32:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064375046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045682035', 'Christy Curtis Buss', NULL, 'Members 3/21 payment declined - 1st notice sent 2/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-25 12:31:25', '2021-02-25 12:31:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064375041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228151', 'Jennifer Wright', NULL, 'Members 3/21 payment declined - 1st notice sent 2/25  I spoke with Andrea &amp; left VM for member she has declined 6 out of the last 7 mos told Andrea we can''t keep doing this, something has to change. Jennifer called in and I explained to her that the pmt gets run on the 22nd of the month she said that I could rerun this', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-25 12:27:45', '2021-02-25 14:21:50'),
