  ('zcrm_1579374000064385008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, '2-25-21 Willow is concerned about the ACA laws and potential penalties and grandfathered plans. I told her the only membership that is compliant is SECURE and she''s not eligible for that unless she gets a side 1099 income or own biz. I explained HA does not currently have any penalties for not having ACA compliant plans now. If they bring back penalties, we will let her know and assess options at that time. She''s leaning towards DIRECT and we have enrollment meeting at 1:30 on Friday, March 12th for April 1st. She feels a bit uncertain of the ACA rules still.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-25 11:44:36', '2021-02-25 11:44:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064386003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, 'sent script quote request form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-25 11:15:15', '2021-02-25 11:15:15'),
