  ('zcrm_1579374000064382003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756008', 'Paul Sippil', NULL, 'Ticket was made requesting ANOTHER QR Life Code Card. Ticket stated Paul called 3 times now asking for one. Come to find out he actually had been calling CJ Wilson the owner of the company that makes the QR Life Code Cards. I have also sent Paul a card January 25th I believe Kelly Cheever told me that she messaged me on Teams asking for me to send one out and I 100% remember sending the new card out AND I sent one out to him back on March 10th when Vanessa asked or she did herself. SO I am assigning Paul ANOTHER Code and sending out the card right this second and it WILL be picked up today and mailed out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-25 10:53:57', '2021-03-24 09:56:26'),
