  ('zcrm_1579374000064174046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, '2-22-21 Willow lives in HA and chatted with KC for a bit. She wants to understand why DIRECT is more expensive. She also wants to make sure she remains compliant if Biden changes to rules. Sounds like she''s self-employed and can have SECURE if that makes most sense. I left her a vm after she left me one. I will try again tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-22 17:15:57', '2021-02-22 17:15:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064174041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '2-22-21 Me to KC - "Can you also send her the email to schedule a Welcome Call? She''s hasn''t completed that. She also wants help with gaining pre-approval to see an integrative medicine doctor for hormone stuff. I told her to ask you for help with that process. She also has a new ER visit Need to upload to Zion for cut finger that she paid cash for already..." KC just sent information. Maria went to ER for cut finger and paid cash price of $1200 already. Thought insurance price was about $3000. Needs to create Need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-22 17:00:06', '2021-02-22 17:00:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064166059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919812', 'Mary Beth Hassett', NULL, 'sent Zion needs submission link and instructions as well as new welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-22 16:45:43', '2021-02-22 16:45:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064166054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063157021', 'Roger Webb', NULL, 'called to ask where his welcome materials are....I told him that we send those out during the last week of the month for our following months new start members.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-22 16:44:28', '2021-02-22 16:44:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064166049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725001', 'Kathleen Malone', NULL, 'Kathleen called back livid because she thinks that she must file this form and she thinks that it is past the deadline.  She is very upset, Patti will give her a call in a bit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-22 16:37:49', '2021-02-22 16:37:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064174030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485451', 'Bernhard Donaubauer', NULL, '2-22-21 Bernhard is from Europe possibly Germany or Switzerland. Travels a lot. He does fashion photography now and used to be psychologist. Lives near Glenwood Springs. Has only choice of Anthem or Co Mtn Health (?). He''s paying $900 now with $7K ded and $8500 MOP. He''s self-employed, no tobacco, no drinking, exercises and walks dog, mentioned skiing, healthy.  After talking he says it sounds much better than his regular insurance and understands why it''s more affordable getting rid of middle man. He was surprised as first but gets it. He wants to read over information and call me tomorrow. He will also talk with Cathy Young more about her experience.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-22 16:19:48', '2021-02-22 16:33:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064166044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725001', 'Kathleen Malone', NULL, 'Kathleen Malone wants her 1095 ....yesterday, I told her that she would receive it before the deadline next month. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-22 16:18:19', '2021-02-22 16:18:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064166039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961101', 'Brad Storz', NULL, 'Brad called to be reminded of where the MAP login instructions were, I redirected him back to the email summary of his plan that I sent him after his welcome call.  He is going to give them a call now! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-22 15:48:57', '2021-02-22 15:48:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064181013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330064', 'Diane VanWeelden', NULL, '4TH QR Life code for 2nd child Alexander: H0GBZ. There is no space for a 4h QR Code so I am putting in the notes.  KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-22 14:57:27', '2021-02-22 14:57:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064181008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058204104', 'Kimberly Leach', NULL, 'Kim called in and said that she put a special needs request in. I asked what exactly happened and she said she fell and broke 2 ribs. She said she has Zion health and I let her know she is supposed to be calling them, Zion would be who she put the Need''s request in. I gave Kim Zion''s phone number to call, she is calling now. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-22 14:50:53', '2021-02-22 14:50:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064157068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, 'Member called in a 2nd time asking for Receipts for 3,4,5 6, of 2020 for his taxes.  3rd call Also after looking at receipts noticed that his address was old and needed to be changed, I sent him Change form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-22 14:49:48', '2021-02-22 14:49:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064174016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830079', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, '2-22-21 Gall bladder surgery Jan. 2019 and no issues since or otherwise. Just clean colonoscopy in past year. He''s needing to switch due to financial hardship due to covid. Understands pre-x clause and doesn''t have any issues! This will reduce his monthly cost from $344 to $275 at $1000 IUA. He''s very thankful to save money. Completed enrollment and cancellation fee.  Always super nice and appreciative! Waived $100 fee as well since just switching.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-22 14:28:32', '2021-02-22 14:35:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064181003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286300', 'Thomas Olson', NULL, 'Thomas called and wanted to know if he is supposed to save all bills or what to do with them from an orthopedist appointment that he needs to make and how his IUA comes into play. I explained he saves all bills and receipts and when he knows he is going to going over his IUA of $1500 then to contact Sedera an start a Need with them. I sent him the Sedera email that explains how to start a Need and their contact info. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-22 14:15:33', '2021-02-22 14:15:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064157063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125098', 'Vaughn Stevens', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update from. updated.  Also added Apt #.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-22 14:09:53', '2021-02-22 14:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064166034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, 'spoke to Dhai about Tivity not being available yet, she mentioned that it MIGHT be the extreme weather everyone has been dealing with.  She is very understanding, thanked me for my call back and I told her that I would let her know ASAP about when she can access this service. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-22 14:08:25', '2021-02-22 14:08:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064157058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, 'Member called in with the question why did I only get a 1095B for up until Aug?  I advised him that he will be getting an additional form fro Planstin and that he did not need that to file his taxes.  He only has to put on his form that he had coverage all year.  Form does not get filed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-22 13:58:26', '2021-02-22 13:58:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000064174011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '2-22-21 Left vm with Krista. "Krista Van Lewen would like you to call her about her IUA- she says it was dishonest that it shows $1000 IUA and not $1,000 x 3 = $500 after that.  She says that this could be a game changer.  I think she''s just frustrated....in general." Re- KC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-22 13:31:52', '2021-02-22 13:31:52'),
