  ('zcrm_1579374000064174003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833209', 'KayLynn Hanson', NULL, '2-22-21 Carl called and he was ready to go with SECURE for his wife KayLynn. However, she''s not employed and has not source of income. She volunteers for elementary school and doesn''t have any 1099.  He believes she due for a wellness visit, definitely mammogram and possibly colonoscopy. CARE+ wasn''t ideal and DIRECT will bring cost back up close to what they are paying for LHS. He likes the flexibility of LHS and is able to float the money while they wait to get reimbursed for 6+ months. He''s on Medicare himself now. He''s always super nice and very appreciative of my assistance!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-22 11:47:55', '2021-02-22 11:48:39'),
