  ('zcrm_1579374000063972034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, '2-18-21 Left vm for Lila. But, looks like she reached KC!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-18 17:15:51', '2021-02-18 17:15:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173089', 'Diane Forsberg', NULL, 'sent Diane preventative care templates and have requested a PDF copy of her Zion card from Zion''s management team- per Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 17:13:09', '2021-02-18 17:13:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, 'Lila, Donald''s girlfriend called because she was having technical issues using the PHCS specific services network search,, so I pulled the lists on my end and sent them to her, I also recommended using Healthgrades.com for reviews. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 16:56:21', '2021-02-18 16:56:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063972029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '2-18-21 I called Laura back but her vm was full. I sent an email explanation to her request instead and cc''ed KellyAnne.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-18 16:30:20', '2021-02-18 16:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779385', 'Lorrie Marchant', NULL, 'Lorrie called in for a refresher on what to use what cards for.....also a refresher on preventative care services....and lastly I have reached out to Tim at Zion to ask if her son got into a High performance go cart racing accident if it would be sharable or not....Tim replied saying that it would be shareable.  I have emailed Lorrie the answer to her question. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 16:27:01', '2021-02-18 16:27:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063972013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539053', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, '2-18-21 Daryl is turning 60 and his price is going up to $1400! He''s happy to reduce his price from $800+ to $685/$1000. He''s still interested in having his employees join. He will contact me when he''s ready for that part soon. He also cancelled his current membership for 3/1/21 and new active for the same date - SECURE $685/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-18 15:47:51', '2021-02-18 15:47:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, 'sent welcome call scheduler per Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 15:43:47', '2021-02-18 15:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, 'left a message on Kim''s phone for Kevin to let him know that he needs to open up a medical need with Zion Health and that I would be sending him instructions of how exactly to do that.  I also told them that if they have any questions they can always give me a phone call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 15:41:59', '2021-02-18 15:41:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061594028', 'Aftan Murphy', NULL, 'Steve Ramona reached out to me to state that Jeff was complaining that he never received a welcome call- when I checked the account it shows that the welcome email was sent and delivered but never opened- that is probably why they never thought that they needed to schedule a welcome call on their own.  I called Aftan and left a message stating that I would resend the original welcome email. and to call me with any questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 15:07:19', '2021-02-18 15:07:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063972008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, 'Donald''s girlfriend Leila(not sure if that is the correct spelling) called and said that Donald needs to find a provider and if she was on the correct website mpb.health. I said no that is not the correct website to find providers. I asked what type of appointment that Donald needs to make and Leila said it was for a Urologist. I told her I am asking because depending on what type of provider and what the appointment is determines if they need to stay in the network and what steps need to be done. I explained to her the difference between Zion and Planstin. Preventative and Diagnostic. I told her for Preventative he needs to stay in the PHCS Network and there is a website to find providers that are in the network. I explained what Donald needs to do for injury/illness and not going over his IUA of $1000 and getting in contact with Zion to confirm that w.e it is that is being done is shared. I told her I was sending her several emails that explain everything that I went over with her b/c it was a lot of info and so she doesn''t need to try and remember everything I just went over. I lastly suggested that it might be a good idea for Donald to have another Welcome Call and that she can certainly sit in on it but He HAS to be the one to schedule it and present and what not. She was very very thankful for all the info and said it was a huge help and all makes sense. She is looking forward to the emails I sent her with all the info and contact''s that Donald will need. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-18 14:36:42', '2021-02-18 14:36:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063947076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063952012', 'Donald Schoonover', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-18 14:14:22', '2021-02-18 14:14:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084284', 'Karen Quigley', NULL, 'sent Sedera needs submission template to Karen per Jane. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 13:59:21', '2021-02-18 13:59:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, 'SEE TICKET!!!!! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 13:37:37', '2021-02-18 13:37:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, 'Stephanie Yost called because she thinks that her ankle is fractured for the last two weeks and has been only wearing a boot- she was afraid to be seen by a doctor because she didn''t know how to use her plan.  I pulled a list of Urgent Care''s in her area as well as the Fair Price for a visit off of HCBB and the Fair Price for an ankle xray.  I told her to give me a call after the appointment and let me know how it went so I can give her further instruction.  I also sent a welcome call scheduler, as well as a template on how to upload bills to Zion Health (if needed).  I will let Wendy know! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 13:35:11', '2021-02-18 13:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063972003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009474065', 'J. Vance Andersen PLC', NULL, 'QR Life codes for Soren: H0X1Z and Christian: H0WZW. 4th and 5th QR Life codes are here b/c there is no space for a 4th or 5th code to be put in. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-18 12:45:04', '2021-02-18 12:45:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, 'Spoke to Rachel about seeing her allergist for allergy shots.  I explained that this need will be treated as pre-x and went over the pre x sharing guidelines with her.  She told me that she was first diagnosed with an issue a year ago.  I told her to use Health Care blue book for all out of pocket services to ensure that she gets the best fair price. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 12:11:18', '2021-02-18 12:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063967003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808030', 'Mathieu Shields', NULL, 'Gave Emily a mini welcome call.....sent her a copy of Mathieu''s post welcome call email summary- I told her that if she still feels she needs a welcome call to schedule at any time- I sent her a scheduler.  Also sent her the Zion Needs submission form for her son''s allergist appointment. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-18 11:32:45', '2021-02-18 11:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063947071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116150', 'Brian Abe', NULL, 'Member called in via betties and was unaware she was even a member and wanted to be cancelled.  I sent out the link and she filled it out and I will cancel her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-18 10:35:43', '2021-02-18 10:35:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063947066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740001', 'Margaret Johnson', NULL, 'Member called in asking why she only received a 1095 until August of last year.  I advised that has had made a change to Zion at that time and that she would get another 1095 and that she could go ahead and file her taxes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-18 10:27:20', '2021-02-18 10:27:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063871013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083478001', 'Kimberly McClure', NULL, '2/18/21 Member called wondering why she could not get into portal. I asked her what portal? Then continued to give instructions on what to do.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-02-18 09:43:55', '2021-02-18 09:43:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063947061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752474', 'Eric Fields', NULL, 'Member called in and questioned the fact that he only got 1095 until September.  I told him that he had changed at that time and would receive a 1095 from Planstin and that he did not need to wait to file his taxes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-18 09:39:27', '2021-02-18 09:39:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063947056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044701054', 'Scott Malz', NULL, 'Member called in and had some questions 1. about Portal access didn''t really understand what she was talking about since she never had access to it.  I advised that she will be getting access very soon via Admin 123.  She also wanted to know how much the MEC portion was to claim on her taxes.  I gave her that amount and advised her that she received reseipts every month and look in her email as they were going to her email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-18 09:29:29', '2021-02-18 09:29:29'),
