  ('zcrm_1579374000063875053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217067', 'Skylir Bryant', NULL, 'Jane called to let me know that, Kimberly, Skylir''s employer called her today to tell her that Skylir has passed away after a horrible pedestrian accident a few days ago.  I am in contact with Kim, as well as have reached out to Sedera''s Slack team and Dania for some help with the situation.  Please see TICKET!!!!!! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-17 17:21:58', '2021-02-17 17:21:58'),
