  ('zcrm_1579374000063932003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '2-17-21 Cathy called to tell me the Spruce App through Redirect is the BEST thing ever and has saved this membership. She loves it and gets answers right away and they seem to be far more accurate than by calling the Customer Service Team. She was told by Customer Service call that she couldn''t get Cologaurd cost covered. But, when she asked for permission via the Spruce App they said yes absolutely! She is thrilled and just wanted to call to tell me. Anytime anyone has a challenge just have them use the app! YAY!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-17 17:11:33', '2021-02-17 17:11:33'),
