  ('zcrm_1579374000063875003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650515', 'Ashton Harvey', NULL, 'Ashton emailed me stating that she got billed from an annual wellness visit as a cash pay patient and wanted to know what to do. I emailed her back stating what the entire process is of making sure a Preventative type of visit is covered. All the steps she needs to take with the PHCS Network, presenting her RCI card, and having the billing go directly to RCI with the info on her RCI card. If you see previous notes below she has asked about this exact situation multiple times and each time is explained what to do. She does not seem to understand or remember what she needs to do. I also let her know that she can NOT pay for that visit out of pocket because RCI will not reimburse and they will not cover or reimburse if the correct steps were not taken for it to be covered correctly, as in the provider being in the PHCS Network is most important and the visit being Strictly Preventative not Diagnostic. I also told her in the email that she can not discuss anything diagnostic as in pain she is having or any sort of issue along those lines otherwise that will fall into the realm of Diagnostic and will NOT be covered either. I gave her RCI''s phone number to call about the bill and sending it over to them to see if it can be covered. As long as she has not paid for any of it yet. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-17 09:06:04', '2021-02-17 09:06:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063873003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, 'I just received a transferred Bettie call from this member saying that she needed to make a preventative office visit.  I told her that all of these types of visits would have to be scheduled thru Redirect.  I asked her if she had that number and she said that she did.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-17 08:22:29', '2021-02-17 08:22:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063871003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '2/17./21 stephany called refusing to give me any information when I asked her so I could look her up.  She wanted me to make her appointment and told me to do my job and hung up on me.  When I looked her up I realize she has to make her own appointment.   DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-02-17 08:19:23', '2021-02-17 08:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063803038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921312', 'Martin Dempsey', NULL, 'Fiona Dempsey''s phone number 720-442-5259 and email address fiona.dempsey14@gmail.com - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-16 17:01:31', '2021-02-16 17:01:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063803033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921312', 'Martin Dempsey', NULL, 'Fiona called to ask about our MAP program as well as to see if she has any optometry benefits.  I sent Fiona the MAP info for her to get started with and told her that I would have Wendy reach out to her about the optometry benefits. Last time I checked there has been issues with our members being able to use the Tivity link on the site.  That is why I did not have her go to that link only to get frustrated.  Joan is aware. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-16 16:50:21', '2021-02-16 16:50:21'),
