  ('zcrm_1579374000063803008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919118', 'Ellen Denny', NULL, 'called in to cancel because she is aging out of the plan...she said she was so happy to have found us because she is self-employed and has always "hated" insurance.  I sent her the online cancellation form  and member comment form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-16 11:51:54', '2021-02-16 11:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063811013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056556027', 'Rikki Mor', NULL, 'Called Rikki to discuss her SalesIQ chat that she left with us about her 16 year old having pain in his right abdomen area. I told her what to do and if she has any other questions to give us a call back. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-16 11:47:17', '2021-02-16 11:47:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063828003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459043', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '2-16-21 I talked with Laura and Patti. They are both concerned that her name change may cause a problem in the RCI system. Laura will call RCI from the # on her card to be proactive to make sure they can find her in their system with her new name. Patti updated her name with them when she got her account reactivated recently. They "should" have the old and new name on file but we don''t know for sure. The Billing Dept at Laura''s doctor''s office was mean and not helpful at all! She could barely resubmit the bill and wouldn''t change the name on it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-16 11:06:47', '2021-02-16 11:06:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063809023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161060', 'Lauren Wagner', NULL, 'Member emailed me to update her pmt information I sent form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-16 10:36:50', '2021-02-16 10:36:50'),
