  ('zcrm_1579374000063811003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039780126', 'Brian Van Blaricom', NULL, 'Brian called in and said he wanted to make an appointment with a physician for some sort of issue that he deals with. I couldn''t quite catch the exact word he called his issue. Regardless it is something that is injury/illness and I explained how is going to handle that and sent him an email on how to open a Need with Sedera. He said that would be perfect and thanked me. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-16 08:20:20', '2021-02-16 08:20:20'),
