  ('zcrm_1579374000063803003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041185005', 'James Roberts', NULL, '2/16/21 Member called wanting to submit a need with Sedera pertaining to a needs that was opened when he took his heart attack.  I gave him Sedera''s phone number.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-02-16 08:06:12', '2021-02-16 08:06:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063766041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118136', 'Lisa Reis', NULL, 'Elizabeth Vargas from Sedera Slack reached out to us today about Lisa Reis reaching out to them about her preventative care benefits.  Elizabeth said that they could not reach out to her at the time due to power outages.  So I just tried to give Lisa a phone call and left her a very lengthy voicemail- I told her that I would be sending her some preventative care emails that will take her through the process in getting her screening mammogram and colonoscopy and told her to call us back during our regular business hours if she needed any additional help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-15 17:16:31', '2021-02-15 17:16:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063766033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654119', 'ANDREA LEWIS', NULL, 'Andrea had a primary care apt this morning at 8:00 am in AZ- the office first tried to call Planstin to confirm benefits....but there was no answer, that is when the primary''s office called us to confirm benefits.  I explained to Andrea that the reason why she couldn''t get a hold of anyone at Planstin this morning is because they are in Utah and they open up at 9.  ( I knew that Andrea didn''t have Planstin, but also knew that Planstin could''ve fielded her call over to Zion) I have asked Zion/Planstin management to follow up with Andrea via Slack to help clear this confusion and to make sure that she is not showing as enrolled with Planstin when she technically is not.  I have tagged Patti and Michele in the thread. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-15 16:56:50', '2021-02-15 17:06:02'),
