  ('zcrm_1579374000063674013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073021', 'Karen Throener', NULL, 'I received email from Sedera that this member needs to be cancelled end of month.  I tried to contact member after which I contacted Misty who told me she would handle it.   I received notification from Sedera that this member needed to be cancelled and I replied that I would need our internal for to start the process.  I left a VM for Misty.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-12 14:36:37', '2021-02-12 14:36:37'),
