  ('zcrm_1579374000063678030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091116', 'Gregory Vassie', NULL, 'Greg was calling in because he was confused about his list bill and the name of the company that the list bill was under.  He is going to talk to his business partner to see if there needs to be changes made to the main business name on the list bill. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-12 09:33:22', '2021-02-12 09:33:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063673008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', 'Preventative bill', 'Member reached out regarding his bill for preventative services and being so high. Over $600.  Requested that he reach out to RCI and find out if the Primary had submitted it yet.  And to reach out to Primary to see if they had coded it as preventative.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-12 09:10:12', '2021-02-12 09:10:12'),
