  ('zcrm_1579374000063673003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063621002', 'Laurie Banz', NULL, 'Received an email this morning from Laurie responding to Patti''s email that she sent out about Laurie needing to send in her 1099, W9 or business license. You can also provide your Federal Tax ID number. Laurie responded by saying this: Hello,
