  ('zcrm_1579374000063572078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165335', 'Glen Delman', NULL, '2-11-21 Glen had hernia surgery in Feb. 2020 and still waiting on reimbursement from that. One provider is waiting for reimbursement for vaccination for child/son I believe.  Discussed SECURE and total cost is $1000/$685 versus $675+25= $725 with $2250 AUA. He will discuss with Melody. I will send him link to audio as well to share with her. They likely won''t make a change until April 1st at earliest. Glen is successfully doing real estate photography during covid!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-11 16:03:13', '2021-02-11 16:05:00'),
