  ('zcrm_1579374000063572068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050370005', 'Arian Shirakhoon', NULL, '2-11-21 Arian was surprised to get a $100 referral check for referring Denise Schulz. Arian is NOT an MPB member. BUT, Denise Schulz did join MPB, so Arian was sent the check since her contact info is in the CRM. She''s THRILLED and will continue referring new members if it''s for real. :-) I left her a vm and told her it''s legit and she can continue to refer new members. Those who join MCS she will earn the referral bonus! Super happy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-11 12:43:20', '2021-02-11 12:43:20'),
