  ('zcrm_1579374000063520003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919346', 'Troy Wells', NULL, '2-9-21 Troy is enrolling in CARE+ and I had him waive the $100 Referral Fee since he''s been a member before. Gretchen was already paid for his referral the 1st time. Nobody is paid this time. He may choose to upgrade next year to add wellness and HSA. He wasn''t sure he''d fund the HSA this year and rarely does his annual wellness visit. Chose $2500/$175.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-09 11:46:18', '2021-02-09 11:51:47'),
