  ('zcrm_1579374000063492033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 40-49 age band.  Due to letter below I notified Wendy and will copy her on his letter &amp; she will reach out to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-09 10:32:26', '2021-02-09 10:32:26'),
