  ('zcrm_1579374000063507024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059752001', 'Kim McMurtry', NULL, 'helped Kim out with more understanding on how her health share works.  I gave her instructions on where to find instructions in downloading the HCBB app on her phone. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-09 10:11:12', '2021-02-09 10:11:12'),
