  ('zcrm_1579374000063507019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, 'Catherine called because she thought that we were Redirect and she still had mammogram bills.  I gave her Redirect''s phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-09 10:02:17', '2021-02-09 10:02:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063492008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061180', 'William Reyes', NULL, 'Member contacted us as he had not been billed for February/21.  I looked into it and I think since member requested IUA change billing was not initiated.  I billed member for 2/21 and made sure payments were correct.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-09 09:54:54', '2021-02-09 09:54:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063488013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', 'Clarification on HCBB', '-Stephen was under the impression that HCBB was another Network similar to PHCS network.  I explained the difference and reiterated what was previously told to him by Kelly Anne.

I also am sending an email with the PHCS and HCBB findings for his doctor.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-09 09:09:45', '2021-02-09 09:09:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063488008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', 'Prescription Coupons', 'Ticket said that she had not received her coupons yet. 

Our indicators say that the email was delivered to her email address to her on Feb 1 but it had not be opened.

Left message to check spam email and to let her know I would resend the email again.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-09 09:04:49', '2021-02-09 09:04:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063508003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380127', 'Bryan Snyder', NULL, '2/8/21 Lisa the wife called wanting information about covid testing.  I realize that their membership is pending approval. I suggested finding a place in her area that does testing for no charge(Walgreens) or pay out of pocket at this time.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-02-09 08:50:54', '2021-02-09 09:44:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063507003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356758', 'Joan Tekula', NULL, 'Joan called and I spent over 25 minutes on the phone with her.  She told me that she just tried to call John''s cell.  I told her to call the main concierge line from now on and to ask to be transferred to him during business hours.  I told her to please give him some time because there was a tragic loss in our office on Friday.   I told her that John was helping her out of the kindness of his heart and that I am a concierge staff member that has helped him answer a few questions on the side.  I told her that Concierge policy has changed- that we can only direct members to the different claims entities involved, but that we do not get involved with billing any longer.  I told her that I would send a direct message to John and that she will hear from him in due time.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-09 08:48:13', '2021-02-09 08:48:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063506003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010281023', 'Malcolm Pointon', NULL, 'Malcom called and had a few questions about going to see a doctor about abdominal pain. I explained what he needs to do and he had a few other questions about the difference between Preventative and non Preventative. I sent him an email about starting a need with Zion and one about looking up a provider in the PHCS Network along with the 64+ list of services that are covered. He also found his Planstin digital card in his email and will call Planstin to get a hard copy. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-09 08:40:56', '2021-02-09 08:40:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063504003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380127', 'Bryan Snyder', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-02-09 08:34:05', '2021-02-09 08:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063492003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, 'I left a VM for this member to let her know that I would be sending the link to update her payment information', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-09 07:54:48', '2021-02-09 07:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063488003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521100', 'Cheryl Firby', NULL, 'Saw a missed call from Cheryl.  But it looks like Deb took the call.  Reached out to Deb and she said that she did take the call and directed her to Sedera.  No note from Deb regarding this call.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-09 07:49:36', '2021-02-09 07:49:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063483003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380127', 'Bryan Snyder', NULL, 'Member already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-02-09 07:34:49', '2021-02-09 07:34:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063469003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, 'Lisa Schuster called in multiple times last night!  I don''t see a ticket in the CRM and there are no notes here.  I know that this is a sensitive case and that she is to speak with Joan only.  I have let Joan and Rod know this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-09 07:17:32', '2021-02-09 07:17:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063447003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297409', 'Lauri Wakefield', NULL, '02.08.2021:  Lauri emailed.  Wants to wait for a 4/1 start date.  Asked if we could move our mtg. date to 3/16 at 10 a.m..  Also had some questions about I.U.A. and Needs. Said she was confused w/info. on our site. Said it wasn''t specific enough.  I emailed her w/explanation of I.U.A/Needs process and told her we could re-schedule.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-02-08 16:00:19', '2021-02-08 16:00:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063445003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919346', 'Troy Wells', NULL, '2-8-21 Left vm for Troy about him enrolling in an old membership no longer offered by MPB. I will offer him SECURE or CARE+. Works for Gretchen Reeves, so likely 1099 or self-employed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-08 14:33:01', '2021-02-08 14:33:01'),
